(Source: Crunchyroll News)

Note: Lucca Comics & Games pre-screened episode 1 early on November 1, 2025, prior to the Japanese television broadcast on July 8th, 2026.', 'WHITE FOX', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-04-08', 189046, 0, NULL, '2026-03-08 23:01:34', '2026-09-03 15:42:01', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/189046-MDk2CaVuRWpb.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Psychological, Romance, Thriller', 'TV', 'SPRING', 19, 136123, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i8EjBP85cCc', '2026-09-03 15:42:01', '2026-09-03 15:32:50');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (70, 'Witch Hat Atelier', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg', 'series', '8.5', 'In a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: she wants to be a witch. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and Coco was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream to become a witch … until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious, traveling magician. After secretly seeing Qifrey perform magic in a way she’s never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody “knows” might not be the truth, and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it may seem... 

(Source: Kodansha USA) 

Note: Tongari Boushi no Atelier episode 2 was streamed a week in advance on Crunchyroll, ABEMA, and Netflix, alongside episode 1. Streaming is one week ahead of the TV broadcast.', 'BUG FILMS', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-06', 147105, 0, NULL, '2026-03-10 00:44:45', '2026-09-03 15:32:55', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/147105-fTjmRrILFixZ.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 13, 208700, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rc26AwBXlUE', '2026-07-25 15:18:38', '2026-09-03 15:32:55');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (71, 'Goodbye, Lara', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx177637-8onaQWqKW1C3.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Once upon a time, a mermaid princess named Lara fell in love with a human prince. To be with him, she used a witch’s potion to become human—but the magic came at a cost: If she failed to find true love, she would vanish into sea foam forever. Now, 200 years later, Lara awakens in Lake Biwa with one final chance at life and love.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Kinema Citrus', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-06', 177637, 0, NULL, '2026-03-10 00:44:45', '2026-09-03 15:44:14', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/177637-2Ok4Pq0SpvHp.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 29962, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gjq7xyVdv5I', '2026-09-03 15:44:14', '2026-09-03 15:32:57');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (72, 'THE GHOST IN THE SHELL', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx177699-hnzc1CS5ZSM2.png', 'series', '7.6', 'The year is 2029. In near-future Japan, where the world has become highly information-intensive, with a vast corporate network covering the planet, electrons and light pulsing through it. But the nation-state and ethnic groups still survive.  

 Motoko Kusanagi, a full-body cyborg, leads an elite combat unit, including Batou. While commanding her team, Kusanagi envisions the creation of a specialized task force to preemptively strike against emerging threats. Meanwhile, Daisuke Aramaki of the Ministry of Internal Affairs, who had been planning to establish a similar unit, recruited Kusanagi and her team. Together, they begin operations as Public Security Section 9—an offensive tactical unit known as “Shell Squad.” As they confront complex cybercrimes and international conspiracies, the existence of a mysterious, unidentified hacker known as The “Puppet Master” emerges on the horizon of their investigation. 

 What fate awaits Kusanagi? And what is the Puppet Master’s true objective? A new era of cyberpunk action begins.  

(Source:攻殻機動隊 THE GHOST IN THE SHELL Site)', 'Science SARU', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-07', 177699, 0, NULL, '2026-03-10 00:44:45', '2026-09-03 15:44:17', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/177699-5kDbvDBhtSE3.jpg', 'Action, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 10, 50420, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b_v0-RWLo18', '2026-09-03 15:44:17', '2026-09-03 15:33:00');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (73, 'The Apothecary Diaries Season 3', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx195516-MJpUZlOberqH.jpg', 'coming', '0.0', 'The third season of Kusuriya no Hitorigoto.

In the aftermath of the Shi Clan’s rebellion, things have finally settled down, and Maomao has returned to her old life as a pharmacist in the pleasure district.

One day, triggered by a breakfast served at the Verdigris House, Maomao senses an anomaly and begins investigating its true nature.

Meanwhile, Jinshi, who has revealed his true identity as the Imperial brother and begun to face his heavy responsibilities, is deeply troubled by the final message left by Loulan: a warning of an impending "disaster that will strike the nation."

To make matters worse, rumors of a mysterious shrine maiden who deceives the people begin to spread, casting a dark shadow over the country of Li once again.

From the depths of the inner court to the city streets, and across foreign borders—the world grows wider, and the stakes even higher for Maomao and Jinshi.

(Source: Crunchyroll News)', 'OLM', '2026', 'series', 'upcoming', '2026-10-02', 195516, 0, NULL, '2026-03-10 00:44:45', '2026-09-03 15:49:21', NULL, 'Drama, Mystery', 'TV', 'FALL', NULL, 65250, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9rProUQlD-I', '2026-09-03 15:49:21', '2026-09-03 15:33:02');
