Now a couple, Amane and Mahiru navigate school life and overcome their pasts in this sweet love story.

(Source: Crunchyroll News)

Note: Crunchyroll has labeled the English title under the name "The Angel Next Door Spoils Me Rotten2", so while it seems erroneous for the title not to have a space between the name and 2, it is what the series is officially labeled as.', 'project No.9', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-03', 170019, 0, NULL, '2026-05-16 16:07:52', '2026-09-03 15:33:38', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/170019-A0w3tt6rat1N.jpg', 'Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 73300, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Gtb1uhjPKs', '2026-07-25 15:18:31', '2026-09-03 15:33:38');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (93, 'Akane-banashi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196935-RnLWBsEvNp8M.jpg', 'series', '7.9', '"With only your voice and body—master the art."

Akane Ousaki, captivated since childhood by the magical performances of her father, Shinta Arakawa, witnesses a shocking incident during his decisive performance for promotion to shin’uchi (master rank).

Six years later, now a high school student, she sets her sights on becoming a shin’uchi herself—pushing forward in the highly competitive world of rakugo.

A passionate and authentic rakugo drama begins now!

(Source: TV Asahi, edited)', 'ZEXCS', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-04', 196935, 0, NULL, '2026-05-16 19:34:02', '2026-09-03 15:33:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196935-tl3sNMXDMfaQ.jpg', 'Drama', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 35419, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PZJAOQ-7iJ8', '2026-07-25 15:18:47', '2026-09-03 15:33:40');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (94, 'Agents of the Four Seasons: Dance of Spring', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx190143-IqqbkMAF0GOo.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'When the Agent of Spring, Hinagiku Kayo, is abducted, spring itself vanishes—plunging the world into unending winter. Refusing to give up, her devoted guard, Sakura Himedaka, searches for her for years. When Hinagiku suddenly returns, the two set out to restore the lost season, face the past that tore them apart, and reclaim the warmth they refuse to lose again.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'WIT STUDIO', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-03-29', 190143, 0, NULL, '2026-05-16 19:34:02', '2026-09-03 15:33:42', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/190143-0Ffw9Tb9Sjdo.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 14, 41890, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3NdlPDtfZU4', '2026-07-25 15:18:40', '2026-09-03 15:33:42');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (96, 'Weathering With You', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx106286-5COcpd0J9VbL.png', 'movies', '8.1', 'High school student Hodaka leaves his home on an isolated island and moves to Tokyo, but he immediately becomes broke. He lives his days in isolation, but finally finds a job as a writer for a shady occult magazine. After he starts his job, the weather has been rainy day after day. In a corner of the crowded and busy city, Hodaka meets a young woman named Hina. Due to certain circumstances, Hina and her younger brother live together, but have a cheerful and sturdy life. Hina also has a certain power: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'CoMix Wave', '2019', 'movie', 'released', '2019-07-19', 106286, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:32', '2026-09-03 15:33:45', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106286-3oKwiwjd7Wkm.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 343350, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6iK6DjV_iE', '2026-07-25 15:15:06', '2026-09-03 15:33:45');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (97, 'My Neighbor Totoro', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx523-fErBvxOHP7IX.jpg', 'movies', '8.1', 'Follow the adventures of Satsuki and her four-year-old sister Mei when they move into a new home in the countryside. To their delight they discover that their new neighbor is a mysterious forest spirit called Totoro who can be seen only through the eyes of a child. Totoro introduces them to extraordinary characters, including a cat that doubles as a bus, takes them on a journey through the wonders of nature. 

(Source: Disney)', 'Studio Ghibli', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-04-16', 523, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:32', '2026-09-03 15:33:47', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/523-rl12Q0av1fCr.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 275997, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=92a7Hj0ijLs', '2026-07-25 15:15:03', '2026-09-03 15:33:47');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (98, 'Neon Genesis Evangelion: The End of Evangelion', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx32-5JYsv0wc122I.jpg', 'movies', '8.5', 'NERV faces a brutal attack from SEELE, but with Asuka in a coma, and Shinji in a nervous breakdown, things soon turn into the surreal. This movie provides a concurrent ending to the final two episodes of the show Neon Genesis Evangelion.

(Source: IMDb)', 'Gainax', '1997', 'movie', 'released', '1997-07-19', 32, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n32-BH9yHJBQqeOa.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 248282, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v1pWyWIu8x4', '2026-07-25 15:15:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (99, '5 Centimeters per Second', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1689-rJKhjLEjQHSy.jpg', 'movies', '7.2', 'Tohno Takaki and Shinohara Akari, two very close friends and classmates, are torn apart when Akari''s family is transferred to another region of Japan due to her family''s job. Despite separation, they continue to keep in touch through mail. When Takaki finds out that his family is also moving, he decides to meet with Akari one last time.

As years pass by, they continue down their own paths, their distance slowly growing wider and their contact with one another fades. Yet, they keep remembering one another and the times they have shared together, wondering if they will have the chance to meet once again.', 'CoMix Wave', '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-02-11', 1689, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1689.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 3, 246384, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iPsu_sk-e7Q', '2026-07-25 15:14:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (100, 'The Garden of Words', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx16782-qpFGk18UqaHn.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', 'Some people revel and play in the rain; others dread it and hide at the first drop. For high school student Takao, a summer shower is a source of artistic inspiration… but when he skips school in order to sketch in a rainy garden, Takao finds an even greater muse in Yukino, an older woman who seems adrift in the world. Despite the difference in their ages and lives, they strike up a comfortable relationship that slowly evolves as they randomly meet in the same garden whenever it rains. But with the rainy season coming to a close, Takao wonders if there''s enough time left to put his feelings into actions and words.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'CoMix Wave', '2013', 'movie', 'released', '2013-05-31', 16782, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16782.jpg', 'Drama, Psychological, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 241468, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udDIkl6z8X0', '2026-07-25 15:15:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (101, 'KONOSUBA -God''s blessing on this wonderful world!- Legend of Crimson', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx102976-2Yi5icRbjukO.png', 'movies', '8.2', 'A video game-loving shut-in, Satou Kazuma''s life should''ve ended when he was hit by a truck, but through a twist of fate, he ends up reincarnating in another world--and dragging the troublemaking goddess, Aqua, the wildly dorky mage, Megumin, and the unrelentingly delusional lady knight, Darkness, with him.

Now, the Crimson Demon village that Megumin and Yunyun are from is facing a threat that could mean its ending. Kazuma and his gang follow Yunyun, who returns to the Crimson Demon village intent on saving it... when they are faced with their greatest threat yet! What will become of the unremarkable adventurer Kazuma''s life in another world?!

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2019', 'movie', 'released', '2019-08-30', 102976, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-03 15:33:49', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/102976-xv7fCzBwQ7GU.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Ecchi, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 231163, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5h4rQY9bpgE', '2026-07-25 15:15:10', '2026-09-03 15:33:49');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (102, 'No Game, No Life Zero', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21875-ybSgx75MgRMM.png', 'movies', '8.0', 'A movie adaptation of the sixth volume of the light novel series announced at the MF Bunko J Summer School Festival 2016 event.

Six thousand years before Sora and Shiro were even a blink in the history of Disboard, war consumed the land, tearing apart the heavens, destroying stars, and even threatening to wipe out the human race. Amid the chaos and destruction, a young man named Riku leads humanity toward the tomorrow his heart believes in. One day, in the ruins of an Elf city, he meets Schwi, a female exiled "Ex Machina" android who asks him to teach her what it means to have a human heart.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'MADHOUSE', '2017', 'movie', 'released', '2017-07-15', 21875, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-03 15:33:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21875-WWkiWSnNcdbt.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 224606, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0i1AxFdlu0M', '2026-07-25 15:15:13', '2026-09-03 15:33:50');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (103, 'Akira', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx47-4CR68arv452h.jpg', 'movies', '7.9', 'It''s the year 2019, thirty-one years have passed since the start of World War III. A top-secret child with amazing powers of the mind breaks free from custody and accidentally gets a motorcycle gang involved in the project. This incident triggers psychic powers within one of the gang members, Tetsuo, and he is taken by the army to be experimented on. His mind has been altered and is now on the path of war, seeking revenge on the society that once called him weak. 

(Source: FUNimation)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-07-16', 47, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-03 15:33:52', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/47-fof8HqtNDtvx.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Psychological, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 227001, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SyM8JyyUTjc', '2026-07-25 15:15:15', '2026-09-03 15:33:52');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (104, 'My Hero Academia: Two Heroes', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100723-7f5e1BCTCDoB.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'The first installment in the Boku no Hero Academia movie franchise.

The climactic finals are over, and U.A. is getting ready for the summer training camp. Deku and All Might receive an invitation from a certain person to go overseas to a giant artificial moving city called I-Island. This island, a kind of “science Hollywood” that gathers the knowledge of scientists from around the world, is holding an exhibition called I-Expo showcasing the results of Quirk and hero item research. In the midst of all this, Deku meets a Quirkless girl named Melissa and remembers his own Quirkless past. Out of the blue, the impregnable security system the island boasts is hacked by villains, and all the people on the island are taken as hostages! Now, a plan that could shake hero society has been put into motion! The man who holds the key to it all is the number one hero and Symbol of Peace, All Might.

(Source: Funimation)', 'bones', '2018', 'movie', 'released', '2018-08-03', 100723, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-03 15:33:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100723-B3tiFsddYmfF.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 216693, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=70W0u35wa48', '2026-07-25 15:15:17', '2026-09-03 15:33:54');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (105, 'Grave of the Fireflies', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx578-vU6XcOlb1XFU.jpg', 'movies', '8.3', 'In the aftermath of a World War II bombing, two orphaned children struggle to survive in the Japanese countryside. To Seita and his four-year-old sister, the helplessness and indifference of their countrymen is even more painful than the enemy raids. Through desperation, hunger and grief, these children''s lives are as heartbreakingly fragile as their spirit and love is inspiring.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Studio Ghibli', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-04-15', 578, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-03 15:33:56', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/578.jpg', 'Drama', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 198649, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4vPeTSRd580', '2026-07-25 15:14:35', '2026-09-03 15:33:56');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (106, 'Into the Forest of Fireflies'' Light', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10408-PlKJ6DAyvMk2.png', 'movies', '8.0', 'The story of Hotarubi no Mori e centers around Hotaru, a little girl who gets lost in an enchanted forest where apparitions reside. A young boy, Gin, appears before Hotaru, but she cannot touch him for fear of making him disappear.', 'Brain''s Base', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-09-17', 10408, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-03 15:33:58', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10408-kZhXe0uVrAd2.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 192889, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qXLSRH31Yao', '2026-07-25 15:15:20', '2026-09-03 15:33:58');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (107, 'Wolf Children', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12355-wNsvhEsXEgrH.png', 'movies', '8.3', 'The theme of the film is the love between parents and children. The story covers 13 years and begins with a 19-year-old college student named Hana who encounters and falls in "fairy tale-like" love with a "wolf man." After marrying the wolf man, Hana gives birth and raises two wolf children&mdash;an older sister named Yuki who was born on a snowy day, and a younger brother named Ame who was born on a rainy day. The four quietly lived in a corner of a city to conceal the existence of the "wolf children," but when the wolf man suddenly dies, Hana decides to move to a rural town far removed from the city.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '2012', 'movie', 'released', '2012-06-25', 12355, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12355.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 191663, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8xLji7WsW0w', '2026-07-25 15:15:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (108, 'Sword Art Online the Movie: Ordinal Scale', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21403-k8DZhZ3x1BCO.png', 'movies', '7.4', 'In 2022, the world of virtual reality was upended by the arrival of a new invention from a genius programmer, Akihiko Kayaba. Called NerveGear, it was the first full-dive system and with it, came endless possibilities to VRMMORPGs.

In 2026, a new machine called the Augma is developed to compete against the NerveGear and its successor, the Amusphere. A next-gen wearable device, the Augma doesn''t have a full-dive function like its predecessors. Instead, it uses Augmented Reality to get players into the game. It is safe, user-friendly and lets users play while they are conscious, making it an instant hit on the market. The most popular game on the system is “Ordinal Scale” (aka: OS), an ARMMORPG developed exclusively for the Augma.

Asuna and the gang have already been playing OS for a while, by the time Kirito decides to join them. They’re about to find out that Ordinal Scale isn’t all fun and games…

(Source: Official website)', 'A-1 Pictures', '2017', 'movie', 'released', '2017-02-18', 21403, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 15:52:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21403-3CvHjmnIays3.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 189783, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=32FLqOWjUfI', '2026-07-25 15:15:24', NULL);
