(Source: Crunchyroll)

Note: Episodes 1-6 had an early release by ABEMA and Crunchyroll on June 3rd, 2026 in a mini-episode batch format that splits 6 episodes into 12, ahead of the TV broadcast which started on July 10th, 2026.', 'Asahi Production', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-10', 196187, 0, NULL, '2026-05-18 16:05:08', '2026-09-03 15:44:44', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196187-Z9dV6uotmKjM.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 112688, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aOOwNK6Ul6E', '2026-09-03 15:44:44', NULL);
