Note: World premiere of Episode 1 before the Japanese television premiere occurred at ANIMONIUM in Bangkok February 8, 2026', 'Zero-G', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-06', 197824, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/197824-rS7XjJQ0CZs2.jpg', 'Fantasy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 48584, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8LPyvgi9hOM', '2026-07-25 15:19:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (135, 'NIPPON SANGOKU: The Three Nations of the Crimson Sun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx206914-SHKX08LarRzB.jpg', 'series', '8.4', 'A revolution sparked by nuclear war, natural disaster, and misrule leads to the collapse of Japanese society. The country splits into three nations vying for hegemony, and the Sangoku era begins. Aoteru Misumi, a former agricultural officer, vows to reunify Japan. He rises through the ranks with only his knowledge and eloquence. Witness the legend of the man later hailed as a genius strategist.

(Source: Amazon Prime Video)', 'Studio Kafka', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-05', 206914, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/206914-owssGq2CGhRZ.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 12, 53111, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PvjwzkcaT2Y', '2026-07-25 15:19:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (136, 'The Klutzy Class Monitor and the Girl with the Short Skirt', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx189987-CkTDPfD7vu2Y.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Sakuradaimon is the school''s prefect. A prefect is a student who is authorized to enforce discipline. As a prefect, he''s supposed to be a role model to other students, but unfortunately he''s not perfect. Kohinata is one of the people who Sakuradaimon has tried to discipline into wearing appropriate school attire, but she has thusfar been disobedient.

And so this is a story of the two interacting with one another.', 'Zero-G', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-06', 189987, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/189987-0UGf5F7zWNvv.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 31852, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jrWzZGBwWBQ', '2026-07-25 15:19:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (137, 'Bleach', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx269-d2GmRkJbMopq.png', 'series', '7.9', 'Ichigo Kurosaki is a rather normal high school student apart from the fact he has the ability to see ghosts. This ability never impacted his life in a major way until the day he encounters the Shinigami Kuchiki Rukia, who saves him and his family''s lives from a Hollow, a corrupt spirit that devours human souls. 

Wounded during the fight against the Hollow, Rukia chooses the only option available to defeat the monster and passes her Shinigami powers to Ichigo. Now forced to act as a substitute until Rukia recovers, Ichigo hunts down the Hollows that plague his town.', 'Studio Pierrot', '2004', 'series', 'released', '2004-10-05', 269, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/269-08ar2HJOUAuL.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 366, 504436, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0c4IoCA5fY0', '2026-07-25 15:13:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (138, 'Even a Replica Can Fall in Love', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx186744-nFH4y2slUrO4.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'When she doesn’t feel well, when there’s a test, when she doesn’t want to go to school... I take her place. I’m her replica. I’m not meant for anything else. But that changed when I fell in love. I wear my hair up so the boy I fell for knows it’s me. We skip school and promise to meet again tomorrow, and every day after. I’m her replica. Everything about me is borrowed and empty, but my heart is mine.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Voil', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-07', 186744, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 13, 15532, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WsT7OO91jXo', '2026-07-25 15:19:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (139, 'My Ribdiculous Reincarnation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx206951-qiHcrw7pwzuq.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'My reincarnation destination is... “the rib of a harem-loving, happy-ending, overpowered hero”!? An isekai reincarnation anime that defies animation conventions is born!

Beyond traditional animation, this series delivers an exhilarating isekai reincarnation tale through unconventional techniques like stop-motion, puppet theater, and live-action—featuring the aloof “Goddess” in charge of isekai reincarnations and the protagonist “Me,” who endures one absurd reincarnation after another!

(Source: YouTube Channel, translated)', 'Qzil.la', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-08', 206951, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/206951-P1BNNpbqN4zG.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 18591, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=suKjfBsH3UM', '2026-07-25 15:19:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (140, 'Classroom of the Elite 4th Season: Second Year, First Semester', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx180745-OEZaBeEdWozn.png', 'series', '7.8', 'The fourth season of Youkoso Jitsuryoku Shijou Shugi no Kyoushitsu e.

As Ayanokouji and his classmates begin their second year at the Advanced Nurturing High School, they’re greeted by a fresh gauntlet of exams and a fresh batch of rather unique first-year students. They’ll have to get to know each other quickly, because the first special exam pairs the first-years with the second-years on a written test—with only the second-years facing expulsion if their team performs poorly! Worse yet? It seems one of the new first-years is also from the White Room. Can Ayanokouji avoid expulsion while sussing out the identity of this hidden foe?

(Source: Seven Seas)', 'Lerche', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-01', 180745, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/180745-Iicz1F6Kuj4e.jpg', 'Drama, Psychological', 'TV', 'SPRING', 16, 110973, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kAncxuwCPZg', '2026-07-25 15:19:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (141, 'Pardon the Intrusion, I''m Home!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx202985-lyp5TYpTnqSg.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'So is this what it means to have roommates now?! Office worker Rinko, 24, lives alone and is secretly an otaku. One day, her apartment gets connected to the two neighboring rooms through a "hole" in the wall. In the room on the left is a fresh-faced yet mysterious guy who is overly-sweet to Rinko. The room on the right is occupied by a guy with violent tendences who is similarly mysterious... But wait! "I... I think I know him!" Rinko''s only source of solitude, her apartment, has been turned upside down. Now, every day is full of heart-pounding surprises! 

(Source: Manga Plaza)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-08', 202985, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/202985-CJxaDe1kJTyp.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 9761, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UE1NvURy0-E', '2026-07-25 15:18:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (142, 'Frieren: Beyond Journey’s End Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182255-butzrqd4I0aC.jpg', 'series', '8.8', 'Following the First-Class Mage Exam, the trio—elven mage Frieren, warrior Stark, and first-class mage Fern—gains access to the dangerous Northern Plateau. As the party presses onward toward Aureole, formidable adversaries force Stark to confront his insecurities, solidifying his resolve and his role as the party''s frontliner. Meanwhile, Fern continues to cherish the gifts she has been blessed with throughout her life, each a reminder of those she holds dear.

Frieren—still honoring her vow to understand humanity—revisits memories of her journey with the Hero''s party and her fleeting encounter with a legendary figure. As she reflects on the passage of time, the elven mage quietly questions whether she has truly changed, yet in the small, almost subtle choices that she makes, there are signs that she might have become more human than she realizes.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Toho', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-01-16', 182255, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-03 15:29:27', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182255-wyHvp6zJbWsO.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 10, 222365, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RH-FcW94z00', '2026-07-25 15:13:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (143, 'Black Clover', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx97940-fyh8o7gNbha0.png', 'series', '7.9', 'In a world where magic is everything, Asta and Yuno are both found abandoned at a church on the same day. While Yuno is gifted with exceptional magical powers, Asta is the only one in this world without any. At the age of fifteen, both receive grimoires, magic books that amplify their holder’s magic. Asta’s is a rare Grimoire of Anti-Magic that negates and repels his opponent’s spells. Being opposite but good rivals, Yuno and Asta are ready for the hardest of challenges to achieve their common dream: to be the Wizard King. Giving up is never an option!

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Studio Pierrot', '2017', 'series', 'released', '2017-10-03', 97940, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:13:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/97940-1URQdQ4U1a0b.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 170, 570582, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vUjAxk1qYzQ', '2026-07-25 15:14:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (144, 'Detective Conan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx235-MyYT7K3chBdO.jpg', 'series', '8.1', 'Kudo Shinichi is a seventeen year-old high school detective whom people call the "Modern Sherlock Holmes." However, one night after a date with his childhood sweetheart, Ran, Shinichi witnessed an illegal trade and, caught off his guard, was knocked unconscious and fed a drug that was supposed to kill him... but he woke up and found himself shrunken to a seven year-old. In order to track down the men who did this to him, Shinichi hid his identity and lived with Ran, whose father happened to be a hopeless detective, and with that came a series of murders and mysteries that he must solve. 

(Source: Anime News Network)

Note:

- Includes Keisatsu Gakkou-hen - Wild Police Story in episodes 1029, 1038, 1042, 1061

- Episodes 11, 52, 76, 118, 162, 184, 208, 342, 356, 449, 452, 487, 488, 489, 490, 515, 516, 521, 522, 651, 734, 804, 805, 927, 928, 1187 aired with a runtime of ~50 minutes as opposed to the standard 25 minute long episode.

- Episodes 96, 129, 174, 219, 263, 304, 383, 479 aired with a runtime of ~90 minutes as opposed to the standard 25 minute long episode.

- Episode 345, 425 aired with a runtime of ~115 minutes as opposed to the standard 25 minute long episode.', 'TMS Entertainment', '1996', 'series', 'airing', '1996-01-08', 235, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:20:17', '2026-09-03 15:43:03', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/235-MTmiz0uB0fMd.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Psychological', 'TV', 'WINTER', NULL, 79523, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:43:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (145, 'Gals Can''t Be Kind to Otaku!?', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx199588-M2vtWicvqNbU.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Meet Takuya Seo, an otaku who sits behind the popular gals in class, Ijichi and Amane. Since they''re people from different "castes," you wouldn''t expect them to have much in common. But when their worlds collide over a borrowed eraser, Takuya slips up about his favorite anime, and Amane...is rather quick to correct him. She says she''s not a fan, but her familiarity with the series suggests otherwise. Could she be...a fellow geek?!

(Source: Yen Press)', 'TMS Entertainment', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-08', 199588, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:20:17', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/199588-I4HoR4YjnpqD.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 64437, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pdWQUnshA4M', '2026-07-25 15:19:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (146, 'The Ramparts of Ice', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx186497-uwPrNPphXvjP.jpg', 'series', '8.2', 'Socially inept, Higawa Koyuki maintains a wall between herself and other people. She spends her time in high school alone, until she meets Amamiya Minato, a boy who keeps trying to close the distance between them for some reason?!

The loner Koyuki, the popular Miki, the boundary-less Minato, and the kind basketball player Youta. This is the story about four complicated and confused young people and their mixed up lives!

(Source: Margaret, translated)', 'Studio KAI', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-02', 186497, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:20:17', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/186497-naXtQFMHJaR1.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 14, 67456, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a7ah5by0Ffw', '2026-07-25 15:19:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (147, 'The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182483-La7chs6htDWr.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Serafina, the West’s fiercest knight, expected torture when captured by barbarians. Instead, she got a marriage proposal! Marrying her sworn enemy is a hard no! But after seeing her wedding captor’s culture and very pretty face, she may be tempted to swap her sword for a wedding veil. Get ready for the ultimate enemies-to-maybe-lovers arc.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Jumondou', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-04-09', 182483, 0, NULL, '2026-05-19 19:20:17', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182483-Nzix9ntq3CVj.jpg', 'Comedy, Ecchi, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 46578, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oGSDv7XSZA4', '2026-07-25 15:19:31', NULL);
