• Karada no Mawari wo Suzushiku Suru Mahou (体のまわりを涼しくする魔法), released Aug 6, 2025. 

• Tokui Waza wo Fuujiru Mahou (得意技を封じる魔法), released Sep 3, 2025.', 'TOHO animation STUDIO', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-04-02', 189513, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:02', '2026-09-03 15:29:27', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/189513-HjE2qNupgfEe.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 6, 4483, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VNGnINmsrF8', '2026-08-02 15:30:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (469, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood OVA Collection', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6421.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'Amazing secrets and startling facts are exposed for the first time in the Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood OVA Collection, a new assortment of stories set in never-before-seen corners of the FMA universe. Join Ed and Al as they chase rumors of successful human transmutation into a web of shocking family drama and lies. Sneak a glance at hidden sides of Winry and Hawkeye''s personalities. Survive the frigid north with a young Izumi Curtis as she fights to gain a deeper understanding of alchemy. Explore the legendary friendship shared by Mustang and Hughes and watch them grow from military school rivals into hardened brothers transformed by the horrors of the Ishvalan War. You thought you knew the whole story. You thought all the tales were told. The Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood OVA Collection offers proof: You were wrong.

(Source: FUNimation)

1. The Blind Alchemist (盲目の錬金術師, Moumoku no Renkinjutsushi)

Based on a side story of the Fullmetal Alchemist manga published in the Fullmetal Alchemist Perfect Guidebook (2003). It''s about a blind alchemist named Jude, who serves the Humbergang family. He once violated the taboo of Alchemy.

2. Simple People (シンプルな人々, Simple na Hitobito)

A story about Riza (why she let her hair grow longer) and Winry (why she had her ears pierced and how she got her earrings).

3. The Tale of Teacher (師匠物語, Sensei Monogatari)

Based on a side story of the Fullmetal Alchemist manga, the third OVA is about Edward and Alphonse''s teacher, Izumi Curtis. The story is compiled of two parts. The first part shows how Izumi survived in Mt. Briggs to become an apprentice of a renowned alchemist. The second part shows how Izumi and Sig met and their love at first sight.

4. Yet Another Man''s Battlefield (それもまた彼の戦場, Sore mo mata Kare no Senjou)

The story centres around Roy, aged 18, in a military boot camp, how he met an Ishbalan recruit named Heathcliffe Arbor, how he became a friendly rival to Hughes.', 'bones', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-08-26', 6421, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:04', '2026-09-03 15:29:29', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6421-yqShxVmGNtd0.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 4, 29447, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (470, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: The Sacred Star of Milos', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9135-nPvbvO7QCx7L.jpg', 'movies', '6.9', 'A fugitive alchemist with mysterious abilities leads the Elric brothers to a distant valley of slums inhabited by the Milos, a proud people struggling against bureaucratic exploitation. Ed and Al quickly find themselves in the middle of a rising rebellion, as the exiled Milos lash out against their oppressors. At the heart of the conflict is Julia, a young alchemist befriended by Alphonse. She''ll stop at nothing to restore the Milos to their former glory – even if that means harnessing the awful power of the mythical Philosopher''s Stone. 


(Source: FUNimation)', 'bones', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-07-02', 9135, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:04', '2026-09-03 15:29:29', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9135-Ffg7j7Rd641G.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 39407, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9iJpoSNoAv4', '2026-08-02 15:31:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (471, 'Fullmetal Alchemist', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx121-zjmixZ428Mwv.png', 'series', '7.9', 'The rules of alchemy state that to gain something, one must lose something of equal value. Alchemy is the process of taking apart and reconstructing an object into a different entity, with the rules of alchemy to govern this procedure. However, there exists an object that can bring any alchemist above these rules, the object known as the Philosopher''s Stone. The young Edward Elric is a particularly talented alchemist who through an accident years back lost his younger brother Alphonse and one of his legs. Sacrificing one of his arms as well, he used alchemy to bind his brother''s soul to a suit of armor. This lead to the beginning of their journey to restore their bodies, in search for the legendary Philosopher''s Stone.

Note: Episodes 11, 12 and 37 were adapted from the light novel "Fullmetal Alchemist: The Land of Sand."', 'bones', '2003', 'series', 'released', '2003-10-04', 121, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:04', '2026-09-03 15:29:29', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/121-t5K7c8WRuPWl.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 265373, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=35cs5zFr2h8', '2026-08-02 15:30:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (472, 'Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood: 4-Koma Theater', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/7902.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Short specials from the DVDs/BDs.', 'Funimation', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-08-26', 7902, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:04', '2026-09-03 15:29:29', NULL, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 16, 11969, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (473, 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure (2000)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx665-216kNqSxrQhN.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Kujo Jotaro is a normal, popular Japanese high-schooler, until he thinks that he is possessed by a spirit, and locks himself in prison. After seeing his grandfather, Joseph Joestar, and fighting Joseph''s friend Muhammad Abdul, Jotaro learns that the "Spirit" is actually Star Platinum, his Stand, or fighting energy given a semi-solid form. Later, his mother gains a Stand, and becomes sick. Jotaro learns that it is because the vampire Dio Brando has been revived 100 years after his defeat to Jonathan Joestar, Jotaro''s great-great-grandfather. Jotaro decides to join Joseph and Abdul in a trip to Egypt to defeat Dio once and for all.', 'APPP', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-05-25', 665, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:06', '2026-09-03 15:29:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/665-wdqJrmtsM4Mb.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Horror, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 7, 26734, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (474, 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Stardust Crusaders', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20474-xuqem5GBlBtb.jpg', 'series', '7.9', 'In a Japanese jail sits 17-year-old Jotaro Kujo: punk, fighter, delinquent...and possessed by a force beyond his control! Around the world, evil spirits are awakening: "Stands," monstrous invisible creatures which give their bearers incredible powers. To save his mother''s life, Jotaro must tame his dark forces and travel around the world to Cairo, Egypt, where a hundred-year-old vampire thirsts for the blood of his family. But the road is long, and an army of evil Stand Users waits to kill JoJo and his friends...

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'david production', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-04-05', 20474, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:06', '2026-09-03 15:29:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20474-peBLuUVAzNC3.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 343314, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (475, 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Stardust Crusaders - Battle in Egypt', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20799-S1eyqBDlx51E.jpg', 'series', '8.3', 'After 30 days of travel across the world, plagued with countless battles, Jotaro and his companions have finally arrived in Egypt! Now only the strongest "Stand" users remain to rebuff our heroes'' final march on Cairo: The Nine Egyptian Gods, Dio''s most zealous servants. Will the Joestar line fall to the monstrous vampire, or can Jotaro defeat Dio and save his mother''s life?

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'david production', '2015', 'series', 'released', '2015-01-11', 20799, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:06', '2026-09-03 15:29:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20799-Fc9I1XG4TWtJ.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Supernatural', 'TV', 'WINTER', 24, 290190, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kaSio11XVhM', '2026-08-02 15:31:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (476, 'HAIKYU!! 2nd Season', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20992-aHgNbcalVEqk.png', 'series', '8.6', 'Following their participation at the Inter-High, the Karasuno High School volleyball team attempts to refocus their efforts, aiming to conquer the Spring tournament instead.

When they receive an invitation from long-standing rival Nekoma High, Karasuno agrees to take part in a large training camp alongside many notable volleyball teams in Tokyo and even some national level players. By playing with some of the toughest teams in Japan, they hope not only to sharpen their skills, but also come up with new attacks that would strengthen them. Moreover, Hinata and Kageyama attempt to devise a more powerful weapon, one that could possibly break the sturdiest of blocks.

Facing what may be their last chance at victory before the senior players graduate, the members of Karasuno''s volleyball team must learn to settle their differences and train harder than ever if they hope to overcome formidable opponents old and new—including their archrival Aoba Jousai and its world-class setter Tooru Oikawa.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'Production I.G', '2015', 'series', 'released', '2015-10-04', 20992, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:08', '2026-09-03 15:29:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20992-QMdqxEjAIAit.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 397633, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qK_ASmBoiz0', '2026-08-08 14:14:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (477, 'Haikyuu!! Ningyou Anime', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx115217-5Q8RImxnZc9a.png', 'series', '6.5', 'A stop-motion anime that will bundle with the 42nd compiled book volume of Haruichi Furudate''s Haikyu!! manga. Anime will have 10 short episodes featuring the Karasuno team as puppets.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-03-04', 115217, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:08', '2026-09-03 15:29:33', NULL, 'Sports', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 10, 4984, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=whnRAFwUdEM', '2026-08-02 15:31:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (478, 'HAIKYU!!: Lev Appears!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20884-5U9SNWxDJBeT.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'The event anime will tell an original story that reveals "a surprising side of a popular player."
</br>

Lev Haiba is determined to become Nekoma High''s ace volleyball player, but can barely hit the ball. The team''s coach orders Kenma Kozume to help out Lev with his practice, much to the former''s annoyance. However, as they continue to work together, Kenma realizes that Lev''s height might actually be able to help in games if his skills are honed in the right way.

</br>
(Source: Anime News Network, edited)

Note: The OVA was screened at Jump Festa 2014 on November 9, 2014. It was later bundled with the 15th volume of the manga.', 'Production I.G', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-11-09', 20884, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:08', '2026-09-03 15:29:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20884-Zg7MCFhTQx2I.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 39038, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zRgiVJK9BXk', '2026-08-02 15:31:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (479, 'Haikyuu!! Quest Picture Drama', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx107263-oF8OnpCOHFXd.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Picture Drama episodes from the special contents DVD bundled with the Haikyuu!! 3DS game.', 'Production I.G', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-09-25', 107263, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:08', '2026-09-03 15:29:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n107263-P32TXltkPVwY.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Sports', 'OVA', NULL, 3, 10081, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (480, 'My Hero Academia Season 5', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx117193-E75BlZmDh1aB.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'The rivalry between Class 1-A and Class 1-B heats up in a joint training battle. Eager to be a part of the hero course, brainwashing buff Shinso is tasked with competing on both sides.

But as each team faces their own weaknesses and discovers new strengths, this showdown might just become a toss-up.

(Source: Funimation)', 'bones', '2021', 'series', 'released', '2021-03-27', 117193, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:11', '2026-09-03 15:29:37', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/117193-37OySoeOMN0z.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 413383, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5AkQ0GxQTQM', '2026-08-02 15:31:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (481, 'My Hero Academia UA BATTLE HEROES', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b169402-w2PQESC7VAY3.png', 'series', '6.8', 'The stage this time is the UA dormitory just before season 5''s Endeavor Internship arc! In the middle of winter, a hot and blustery cold battle is unfolding at Heights Alliance!

Third-year Mirio Togata appears suddenly as the first-year students in Class A are bored during their ban from going outside. He brings with him the card game "Yuuei Heroes Battle," created by the support class. As each student picks cards and joins the fierce battle, there seems to be more to the game than meets the eye. At the end, who will emerge victorious?

(Source: Anime News Network) 

Note: The anime had a world premiere at tne New York Comic Con event on October 13 in English dub before the Japanese release in theaters.', 'bones', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-10-20', 169402, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:11', '2026-09-03 15:29:37', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 14210, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (482, 'One Piece: Defeat the Pirate Ganzack!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx466-bVP54I7dCB2F.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'While Luffy and his crew of Zoro and Nami are starving on their small boat, they are attacked by a large monster. Nami is taken away, while Luffy and Zoro wash up on shore. There they meet a young girl, Medaka, and learn of the sad history of the island. The evil Pirate Ganzack has taken away all the men in the village and enslaved them, including Medaka''s father. Now Luffy, Zoro, and Medaka must infiltrate Ganzack''s base in order to rescue the villagers and Nami. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Production I.G', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-07-26', 466, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/466-uS8J4XwJ35Ws.png', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 13442, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (483, 'One Piece: Umi no Heso no Daibouken-hen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1094-H3YFJ1TR0ZZi.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'The Straw Hats encounter a city in the middle of a whirlpool, called the Ocean''s Navel, that is being destroyed by giant monsters. These monsters supposedly protect a treasure capable of granting wishes, but in the process of defeating these guardians, the crew ends up releasing another evil.  (aired after Episode 53)', 'Toei Animation', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-12-20', 1094, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1094-IAIqiFbLBsig.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 10186, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:32:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (484, 'One Piece Special: Open Upon the Great Sea! A Father''s Huge, HUGE Dream!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1237.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'The story opens on Pirate Zap''s ship, where two of his crew, Bonnie and Max, are tired and want to escape, but unfortunately they have no money. Three children were being held captive on the ship overhear them. The eldest, Amanda, who''s father was a pro treasure hunter, knows the whereabouts of a great treasure, and offers them a deal. If they help them make a clean escape, they could take all the treasure they wanted. They agree, and the five of them barely escape and make it onto a small island where they meet Luffy and his crew. Unfortunately they were pursued and Luffy and Amanda are captured and brought back to their boss, the head of the Bayan Pirates, who is also after the treasure. Now Luffy and the others must battle the Bayan pirates and find the treasure that Amanda''s father had left for his children. Amanda, who has always resented adventure and treasure because her father was constantly gone in search for it, finally understands his feelings. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2003', 'series', 'released', '2003-04-06', 1237, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1237-hHWuRsuVsVpr.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 7857, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (485, 'One Piece Special: Protect! The Last Great Performance', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1238-Rf2wqBrCwgvO.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'For many years, Ex-Marine Lieutenant Randolph and his troupe have put on a play aboard his ship. Having lost his family to pirates, Randolph wishes to put on plays that will give courage to those who have also lost their loved ones to pirates. Unfortunately, Randolph must retire soon, and he is now giving his last performance. Luffy and his crew come to see the play, and somehow manage to take part in it themselves. But from Randolph''s past comes a vengeful subordinate with a diabolical plan who has finally become commander in order to capture Randolph. Luffy and his nakama now must prove to the people that not all pirates are scum, and protect Randolph''s final farewell performance from the bitter commander. (aired after Episode 174)

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2003', 'series', 'released', '2003-12-14', 1238, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1238-HdBlNr5vwNau.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 1, 8490, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (486, 'One Piece Special: The Detective Memoirs of Chief Straw Hat Luffy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2020.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Unlike the other specials, this story takes place in an alternate reality version of 19th century Japan, in "The Grand Jipangu", an alternate version of The Grand Line as opposed to simply being hour-long filler episodes.The story is divided into two halves: in the first, Buggy the Clown makes trouble in the town where Detective Luffy is stationed, and in the second a mysterious girl named Vivi appears. These stories feature cameos from several minor characters in the normal series. Surprisingly the "Oyabun" (Boss) specials did not stop there as five more specials were made following the first one, mostly as Christmas and New Years specials as well as fillers once in awhile.', 'Toei Animation', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-12-18', 2020, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2020-k3lHutyP9i06.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 7607, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (487, 'ONE PIECE: Yume no Soccer Ou!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2386-NQQkq1taHJ08.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Luffy and his crew take on the Villain All-Stars in a game of soccer in order to become the Dream Soccer King. The game comes down to a pk tie-breaker shoot-out with Coby as goalie and Helmeppo refereeing.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2002', 'series', 'released', '2002-03-02', 2386, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2386-jtduFM8raO2z.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Sports', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 12418, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (488, 'ONE PIECE: Mezase! Kaizoku Yakyuu Ou', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2490-AL4WmnCJ5zvE.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Luffy and crew takes on Arlong''s crew in baseball. Announced by Bon Clay and Buggy.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2004', 'series', 'released', '2004-03-06', 2490, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:13', '2026-09-03 15:29:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2490-wlPYONPyTibY.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Sports', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 8769, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:31:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (489, 'ONE PIECE 3D: Gekisou! Trap Coaster', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx12001-XX0NNNfaKZ3e.jpg', 'movies', '6.1', 'Toei Animation released a new 3D anime short at events starting December 1, 2011. The short run about 12 minutes long and played at stereoscopic 3D theaters at Aichi Prefecture''s Lagunasia theme park, Nagasaki Prefecture''s Huis Ten Bosch theme park, Kanagawa Prefecture''s Yokohama Landmark Tower, and Hiroshima Prefecture''s NTT CRED Hall.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-12-01', 12001, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n12001-IljdXqN8CTU7.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 6336, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (490, 'One Piece: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island Adventure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b16239-XzoVjd7JK8xJ.png', 'series', '7.2', 'The story of the Hand Island no Bouken special is set a little before the events of One Piece Film Z and depicts a major "Hand Island" incident during the New World storyline. The story is set at "Cannon Town" where a parent and a child work as craftspeople. The incident revolves around them and a commodore of a marine base. The special will also have a flashback scene to the story in the first chapter of the manga, but with new animation. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-12-15', 16239, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16239-pov53U1T1dRm.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 12445, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (491, 'ONE PIECE FILM: Z - GLORIOUS ISLAND', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b16468-pMKFwfY8lYZX.png', 'series', '6.9', 'An exclusive anime prologue to One Piece Film Z with an original story penned by manga creator Eiichiro Oda. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-12-23', 16468, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n16468-yOxhsBHFICtu.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 2, 11325, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (492, 'One Piece 3D2Y: Overcome Ace’s Death! Luffy’s Vow to his Friends', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20835-QVV6LpJlqe1A.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'This new TV special tells the two years of Luffy''s training with Silvers Rayleigh in Rusukaina Island after the Battle of Marineford, which has never been told in the manga or TV anime. It also features a new villain named Burndy World who is known as "The Destroyer of the World" and has the power of the MoaMoa Fruit (its ability is still unknown). Luffy has to protect Boa Hancock from the new enemy who escaped from the level 6 of Impel Down. He is newly designed by the original creator of the manga, Eiichiro Oda.



(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Toei Animation', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-08-30', 20835, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20835-aR8CuXvtzqND.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 23862, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (493, 'One Piece: Adventure of Nebulandia', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/21485-KR1sv4rYSe6V.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'The Davy Back Fight Arc competitors journey to New World with new crew members Dojaku, Kansho and tactical genius Komei for a meeting that will take place on a foggy island that makes devil fruit users unable to use to their abilities.', 'Toei Animation', '2015', 'series', 'released', '2015-12-19', 21485, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21485-lPFbmxGrFsBX.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 12625, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:32:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (494, 'One Piece: Heart of Gold', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21831-qj5IKYiPOupF.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'The Straw Hat Pirates meet Olga, a girl who has escaped the island Alchemi. Alchemi was known for its metal production, and for the creation of the extremely valuable Pure Gold, but the island disappeared two hundred years ago. Olga is now being pursued by Marines, interested in Pure Gold. Gildo Tesoro, who controls the Navy HQ and black market, hears of Olga and hires treasure hunter Mad Treasure to track her down. The Straw Hats join forces with Olga in search of the Pure Gold, while she plots to takes advantage of them and use the treasure to become rich herself.', 'Toei Animation', '2016', 'series', 'released', '2016-07-16', 21831, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21831-Xl4r2uBaaKU4.png', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 23410, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (495, 'ONE PIECE: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx459-Ivw65mUXackh.png', 'movies', '6.8', 'There once was a pirate known as the Great Gold Pirate Woonan, who obtained almost 1/3 of the world''s gold. Over the course of a few years, the pirate''s existence faded, and a legend grew that he disappeared with his gold to a remote island, an island pirates continue to search for. Aboard the Going Merry, Luffy and his crew, starved and reckless, are robbed of their treasure. In an attempt to get it back, they wreck the getaway ship, guided by a young boy named Tabio, who''s a captured part of El Drago''s pirate crew. El Drago''s love for gold has driven him to look for Woonan''s island, and thanks to Woonan''s treasure map, he finds it. During this time, Luffy''s crew have been split up, and despite their own circumstances, they must find a way to stop El Drago from obtaining Woonan''s gold. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2000', 'movie', 'released', '2000-03-04', 459, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/459-JqlCjcwxxFrr.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 35263, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:32:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (496, 'One Piece: Clockwork Island Adventure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx460-p9HObfGUhWn0.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'Informed by the Thief Brothers his ship has been stolen by the Trump Kyoudai (Trump Siblings) who have set up base on Clockwork Island. Monkey D. Luffy, Captain of the Going Merry and aspiring Pirate King works with his crew - Ussop, Zoro, Sanji and Nami to battle their way up Clockwork Island to reclaim their ship.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2001', 'movie', 'released', '2001-03-03', 460, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/460-mWAlHAJ5MuBg.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 26750, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:32:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (497, 'One Piece: Chopper’s Kingdom on the Island of Strange Animals', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx461-DC9fMDl3AaK1.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'The crew comes upon Crown Island where the animals can talk and they makes Chopper their new king. But there are human hunters there also looking for the legendary horns that will give the person who consumes it immense power. Luffy and friends must stop them from destroying this animal kingdom.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2002', 'movie', 'released', '2002-03-02', 461, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/461-0pvcIaXC0p70.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 22836, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:32:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (498, 'One Piece The Movie: The Dead End Adventure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx462-Ig8zfdsFWcql.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'Luffy and crew arrive at the harbour of Anabaru. The local casino is holding a competition in which the winner will obtain a huge monetary reward if he reaches the finishing line first. Nami is elated and decides to participate in the competition. However, there is a conspiracy going behind the competition and the mastermind is an ex-military commander, Gasparde. His plan is to lure all the pirates to the military base and send them to their deaths. Luffy and gang have to overcome the numerous tests and tribulations along the way to complete this dead-end adventure. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2003', 'movie', 'released', '2003-03-01', 462, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/462-Z074owEvilUu.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 25349, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (499, 'One Piece: The Curse of the Sacred Sword', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx463-QDnETPoHp9oD.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'Luffy and crew go to an island searching for a legendary sword, said to be the most expensive in the world. Soon attacking marines and beautiful maidens split the crew. Zoro betrays the crew to help an old friend, Luffy and Usopp wander through a cave, and the rest help a village fight marines. When Zoro defeats Sanji he takes the sacred pearls that are the only defense against the evil sword that will plunge the world into darkness. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2004', 'movie', 'released', '2004-03-06', 463, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/463-zgU5XjUCR7Kv.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 21338, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (500, 'One Piece: Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx464-g4wcZPjbhY5j.png', 'movies', '7.8', 'The Straw Hat crew obtain an advertisement for a recreational island on the Grand Line run by the Baron Omatsuri. Luffy decides to take this opportunity to kick back and relax. Unfortunately, when they arrive at the island, they are asked to compete in contests through unity for access to relaxation. However, there seems to be a mysterious air on the island, as the Straw Hat Pirates begin to fight amongst themselves, while Robin, Chopper, and Luffy individually search for the secret behind Baron Omatsuri''s island.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2005', 'movie', 'released', '2005-03-05', 464, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/464-wmQoE1Ywxghs.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 33658, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (501, 'One Piece: Mega Mecha Soldier of Karakuri Castle', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx465-qSRr0MKYhS0I.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'The crew salvages a treasure chest from a sinking wreck, but inside turns out to be an old lady hiding. To get the Straw Hat Pirates to take her home, she promises them the treasure of a golden crown on her island, Mecha Island. When they arrive, their ship is first attacked by the lord of the island. But later he decides to use the pirates to help him solve the riddle of the Golden Crown.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2006', 'movie', 'released', '2006-03-04', 465, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/465-dYMZ6SHNeOkL.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 19703, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (502, 'One Piece Film: Strong World', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4155-P5TDf6t6qFwX.png', 'movies', '7.7', 'The story begins somewhere between the Thriller Bark arc and the Sabaody Archipelago arc. The main villain''s name is "Golden Lion" Shiki. 20 years ago he lost a battle against Monkey D. Garp and Sengoku and was imprisoned in Impel Down, but managed to escape. After that he starts to collect his crew and steals Nami to make her his navigator. Luffy tries to get to Shiki''s hideout to free his friend.', 'Toei Animation', '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-12-12', 4155, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4155-2PkLjTHddz2s.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 55460, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3n58UPvcD7I', '2026-08-02 15:33:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (503, 'One Piece 3D: Mugiwara Chase', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9999-2icUDMDtpH2L.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'The entire Straw Hat crew began to search for Luffy''s important straw hat after he woke up finding it missing.', 'Toei Animation', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-03-19', 9999, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9999-T5jCX3o3cxeN.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 14414, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:32:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (504, 'One Piece Film: Gold', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg', 'movies', '7.7', 'In One Piece Film Gold, The Straw Hats are at it again in an all-new high-flying adventure! A gripping tale unfolds in the spectacular city of Gran Tesoro, where Luffy and his crew are drawn by dreams of hitting the jackpot. With so much luck, Luffy''s winning streak can''t possibly end. But behind the gilded curtains lies a powerful king whose deep pockets and deeper ambitions spell disaster for all.

(Source: FUNimation)', 'Toei Animation', '2016', 'movie', 'released', '2016-07-23', 21335, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21335-ps20iVSGUXbD.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 57835, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_shEgcWHC2U', '2026-08-02 15:32:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (505, 'ONE PIECE FILM: STRONG WORLD - EPISODE:0', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b8740-oZajT3brPn7b.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Set over 20 years prior to the main One Piece story, this limited release OVA chronicles the confrontation between Gold Lion Shiki and Gold Roger as well as other events around the world around the time of the Pirate King''s execution.', 'Toei Animation', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-16', 8740, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8740-MlFelJndh6Yr.png', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 18712, NULL, '2026-08-08 14:38:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (506, 'ONE PIECE: Cry heart', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/n107110-pF0sMxDe3aLi.png', 'series', '5.8', 'Three five-minute stop-motion animated shorts by Banpresto that recreate the famous scenes from Eiichiro Oda''s manga and anime One Piece.

Unlike most figures, Banpresto''s "Cry heart" figures are deliberately designed to encourage people to create their own stop-motion shorts.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-01-19', 107110, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:17:14', '2026-09-03 15:29:40', NULL, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 3, 2847, NULL, '2026-08-02 15:33:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (507, 'One Piece: Django''s Dance Carnival', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2385-06iBj9aNIadt.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Luffy and his crew are on Mirror Ball Island during a dance carnival. They are spotted by Marines just as Jango the hypnotist is running from them. Luffy and the others are caught up in the dance carnival as Jango, in his desperate attempt to escape, hypnotizes the entire island to dance the night away.

