Note: Originally screened at the P.A. Works 25th anniversary Lantern Festival on October 19, 2025. The video was later uploaded to their YouTube channel on October 22, 2025.', 'P.A.WORKS', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-10-19', 207886, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:43:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, '', 'SPECIAL', NULL, 1, 2233, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1iLnz2ZuJNE', '2026-08-02 15:45:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (711, 'Violet Evergarden', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21827-ubzq619ZA2E9.png', 'series', '8.5', 'A certain point in time, in the continent of Telesis. The great war which divided the continent into North and South has ended after four years, and the people are welcoming a new generation. Violet Evergarden, a young girl formerly known as “the weapon”, has left the battlefield to start a new life at CH Postal Service. There, she is deeply moved by the work of “Auto Memories Dolls”, who carry people''s thoughts and convert them into words. Violet begins her journey as an Auto Memories Doll, and comes face to face with various people''s emotions and differing shapes of love. There are words Violet heard on the battlefield, which she cannot forget. These words were given to her by someone she holds dear, more than anyone else. She does not yet know their meaning but she searches to find it.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Kyoto Animation', '2018', 'series', 'released', '2018-01-11', 21827, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:43:17', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21827-ROucgYiiiSpR.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 538085, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_grmduuECm4', '2026-08-02 15:45:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (712, 'Boku no Hero Academia THE MOVIE: Heroes:Rising - Epilogue Plus: Yume wo Genjitsu ni', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx126661-61SI7n5njMNM.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'A picture drama epilogue to the film Boku no Hero Academia the Movie 2: Heroes:Rising, bundled with the BD/DVD release.', 'bones', '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-07-15', 126661, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:43:40', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/126661-lcob1XIAA2TF.jpg', 'Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 21354, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iaMLBWj6HjI', '2026-08-02 15:45:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (713, 'EVANGELION:3.0 (-46h)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx155399-q78rIZMxNqm0.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Prequel that takes place before the events of Evangelion: 3.0 You Can (Not) Redo: The story of Midori Kitakami.

Note: This is new footage from a bonus disc included with the EVANGELION:3.0+1.11 THRICE UPON A TIME Blu-ray/DVD. The release will mark the second anniversary of the initial theatrical release of Shin Evangelion Movie:||', 'Studio Khara', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-03-08', 155399, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:43:49', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/155399-yjzWrEjxiHzx.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 10573, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hE0vry1s9pw', '2026-08-02 15:45:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (714, 'Steins;Gate: Egoistic Poriomania', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10863-V6oW2kN8bBYf.png', 'series', '8.1', 'Special episode included in the last of the nine Blu-ray/DVD volumes. 

The story is set a few months after the last scene of the television series. On a calm day in Akihabara, Okabe and the other laboratory members are invited by Feyris to go to America. Mayuri and the rest are planning to reunite with Kurisu, who had come back to an American laboratory. A few days later, Okabe''s mad scientist persona Hououin Kyouma arrives alone at the airport in Los Angeles, where he may be taking the first step to leading the world into chaos.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'WHITE FOX', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-02-22', 10863, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:43:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10863-paT73FyJgPi3.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 114382, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uMYhjVwp0Fk', '2026-08-08 14:32:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (715, 'Fate/stay night', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx356-mTpMvtillumS.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Raised by a mysterious sorcerer after the death of his parents in a catastrophic fire, Shirou Emiya has only just begun to learn small tidbits of magic. When he is caught in a battle between two powerful Magi, however, he ends up performing a spell above his expected ability, accidentally summoning a beautiful woman knight to protect him.

Shirou is thus unwillingly thrust into the competition known as the Holy Grail War where Seven Magi called Masters, together with their spirit partners called Servants, fight to acquire a powerful artifact said to grant every wish.

Note: Based on the first route from TYPE-MOON''s visual novel of the same name, while incorporating elements of both the second and third routes.', 'Studio DEEN', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-01-07', 356, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:01', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/356-0VzS7BcObayT.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'WINTER', 24, 188400, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aFyxNcwl3U0', '2026-08-29 14:39:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (716, 'Fate/Zero Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx11741-oEy1fJHYm2zJ.jpg', 'series', '8.4', 'As the Fourth Holy Grail War rages on with no clear victor in sight, the remaining Servants and their Masters are called upon by Church supervisor Risei Kotomine, in order to band together and confront an impending threat that could unravel the Grail War and bring about the destruction of Fuyuki City. The uneasy truce soon collapses as Masters demonstrate that they will do anything in their power, no matter how despicable, to win.

Seeds of doubt are sown between Kiritsugu Emiya and Saber, his Servant, as their conflicting ideologies on heroism and chivalry clash. Meanwhile, an ominous bond forms between Kirei Kotomine, who still seeks to find his purpose in life, and one of the remaining Servants. As the countdown to the end of the war reaches zero, the cost of winning begins to blur the line between victory and defeat.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'ufotable', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-04-08', 11741, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11741-TWwZCgsK5aXh.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 239711, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A8D2db4PFN0', '2026-08-08 14:32:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (717, 'Fate/stay night: Unlimited Blade Works (Movie)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx6922-g3hsIYOWGXL8.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'This is the adaptation of the 2nd route of the popular visual novel: Fate/Stay Night. In this route, Tohsaka Rin will be the major female character. Revelations about Shirou and his destiny will be made.


(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Studio DEEN', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-01-23', 6922, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6922-md365Zwl4Y06.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 54343, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=scaa8EDoy_E', '2026-08-02 15:46:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (718, 'Fate/stay night: Unlimited Blade Works', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx19603-ycT0pyEgDVQu.jpg', 'series', '8.0', 'Fuyuki City - a city surrounded by the sea and mountains becomes the setting for an ancient ritual. Seven masters are given control of heroic spirits in order to realize the mythical Holy Grail, which is said to grant its owner any wish. These heroic spirits or servants represent legendary heroes of various classes: "Saber," "Lancer," "Archer," "Rider," "Caster," "Assassin," and "Berserker." Each master will enter into a contract with their chosen servant and battle the others to the death until only one pair remains... This is the "Holy Grail War."

The young and capable mage, Rin Tohsaka, prepares for her long-awaited Fifth Holy Grail War to begin... With her servant Archer, Rin enters the Holy Grail War as the sole heir to the prestigious Tohsaka family after her father''s death. But when Shirou Emiya, a boy from Rin''s school, unwittingly becomes a Master and is fatally wounded in battle, she has no choice but to save him. With Shirou and his servant Saber, Rin sets out to strike down the conspiracies surrounding the Holy Grail War. Will the Holy Grail bless Rin and Shirou''s path toward victory or will they be cursed with defeat?

(Source: Aniplex of America)

Notes:

- Includes Prologue.

- The first, second and last episodes aired with a runtime of ~48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.', 'ufotable', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-10-05', 19603, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19603.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 261356, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=61RuoLIlCUM', '2026-08-02 15:46:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (719, 'Fate/Apocrypha', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98035-rdkjeqUUsG2j.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'There was once a Holy Grail War waged by Mages and Heroic Spirits in a town of Fuyuki. However, one Mage took advantage of the chaos of World War II to steal a Holy Grail. Several decades have passed, and the Yggdmillennia family, who took upon the Holy Grail as its symbol, defected from the Mages'' Association. Furious, the Association sent forces to deal with the Yggdmillennia, but were defeated. With the Holy Grail system changed, war at an unprecedented scale breaks out.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'A-1 Pictures', '2017', 'series', 'released', '2017-07-02', 98035, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98035-hbrEf8ulDnAe.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 25, 130575, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2r3sF9vAGs', '2026-08-02 15:46:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (720, 'Fate/EXTRA Last Encore', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21717-2gU0L4IvrUVC.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'Waking up in a strange virtual world with no recollection of the past, Hakuno finds himself forced to fight for survival in a war he does not understand for a prize beyond value; the opportunity to have one''s wish granted. With only an enigmatic "Servant" by his side, Hakuno Kishinami will have to face both friends and foes in battles to the death in order to not only gain possession of a mysterious object known as the "Holy Grail," but also to find the answer to the most important question of all: "Who am I?"

Notes: 

- Includes episodes 11-13, Illustrias Geocentric Theory. 

- The last episode aired with a runtime of 48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24.', 'Shaft', '2018', 'series', 'released', '2018-01-28', 21717, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21717-5IX8Mc32IBG1.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Psychological', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 61857, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PdXv5a5YMi4', '2026-08-02 15:46:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (721, 'Fate/Prototype', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12565-paVJhzp4BrF0.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Fate/Prototype is a digest version of Nasu''s original concept for Fate/stay night.', 'Lerche', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-12-31', 12565, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12565-7WWfYQ3rzTpv.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Romance', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 33323, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D3ZU1CqKIdM', '2026-08-02 15:46:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (722, 'Fate/Grand Order: First Order', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx97815-NnWheNnaKCmS.png', 'series', '6.5', 'The story is set in the year 2015, during the final era over which magic still held sway. The humanity survival and security organization Chaldea was established to observe the world that can only be seen by magic and the world that can only be measured by science — as well as to prevent the final extinction of mankind.

Thanks to the efforts of many researchers, the path of human history has been ensured for 100 years into the future. However, without warning, the realm of the future that was under constant observation by Chaldea vanished. The extinction of humanity in 2017 was observed — no, confirmed.

The apparent cause of the extinction was in the Japanese city of Fuyuki in 2004. In that city, there was an "unobservable realm" which had never existed until now.

Chaldea issued the Grand Order for a "Holy Grail Expedition," to investigate, uncover, and possibly destroy the singularity that apparently will cause the extinction of humanity.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Lay-duce', '2016', 'series', 'released', '2016-12-31', 97815, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/97815-SV1vR4GlLRIq.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 70552, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gd1gYH8g2Vg', '2026-08-02 15:46:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (723, 'Nekomonogatari Black', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx15689-UtRUbaZhV7f9.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'First season of the Monogatari Series, part 6/6. Contains the arc Tsubasa Family from the Nekomonogatari Black light novel.

On his way to the bookstore, Koyomi Araragi encounters Tsubasa Hanekawa whose face is covered with a bandage. The incident allows Koyomi to learn what has been happening in the Hanekawa household, but Tsubasa begs him not to tell anyone about it, saying she’ll do anything to keep him quiet. Without revealing her family’s circumstances, Koyomi tells of the day’s incident - he and Tsubasa buried a “cat” that had been hit by a car- to Meme Oshino. Meme tells Koyomi that he must immediately go to confirm Hanekawa’s safety. He heads to her house, only to find...

So begins the nightmarish nine days of Golden Week.

(Source: Aniplex)', 'Shaft', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-12-31', 15689, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:03', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/15689-OkvbPqAXnJd5.jpg', 'Drama, Mystery, Psychological, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 4, 148912, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHef90RByXI', '2026-08-02 15:46:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (724, 'Ghost in the Shell 2: Innocence', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx468-rfiX1uY8bsPp.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', 'The year is 2032. With the advancement of medical technology humanity has grown into a more technologically driven creature, creating a breed of cyborg citizen. Along with the development of cybernetics the world has seen rapid development in the field of artificial intelligence, making androids a commercially viable venture.

A recent string of murders perpetrated by a prototype female android has drawn the attention of Section 9, a unit specializing in counter cyber-terrorism. With none of the victims'' families pressing charges, suspicions arise regarding the nature of the androids and their production.

Months have passed since the end of the Puppet Master incident, and with the Major still missing investigative duties fall to her cyborg commando partner Batou and his newly recruited biological partner, Togusa. Can the two overcome their differences and discover the truth behind this string of murders?

(Source: Bandai Entertainment)', 'Production I.G', '2004', 'movie', 'released', '2004-03-06', 468, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:07', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/468-V8L7r2QZaNeS.jpg', 'Action, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 40479, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0XkATpPvqEA', '2026-08-02 15:46:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (725, 'Ghost in the Shell 2.0', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4672-NFXxVPGXSZQB.png', 'movies', '7.6', 'In the year 2029, the world is made borderless by the net; augmented humans live in virtual environments, watched over by law enforcement that is able to download themselves into super-powered, crime busting mecha. The ultimate secret agent of the future is not human, has no physical body, and can freely travel the information highways of the world, hacking and manipulating whatever and whenever required.

Note: Ghost in the Shell 2.0 is a renewed version of the 1995 film produced as part of celebration for the release of The Sky Crawlers in 2008. For the Version 2.0, all the animation was re-produced using the latest technology such as 3D-CGI, and the soundtrack was also remastered. All the voices were re-recorded. Notably, the voice actor of the "Puppet Master" was changed from Kayumi Iemasa to that of Sakakibara Yoshiko, and some dialogues were changed from the original. Kawai Kenji remixed the music with 6.1 channel surround, and Randy Thom of Skywalker Sound joined as Sound Designer to improve the sound.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Production I.G', '2008', 'movie', 'released', '2008-07-12', 4672, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:44:07', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4672-sBjtUTvKDovt.jpg', 'Action, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 20947, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bw6WHbdHxRY', '2026-08-02 15:46:31', NULL);
