Note: The series is streaming a week in advance on Netflix Japan starting with episode 2 released alongside episode 1.', 'TMS Entertainment', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-07-15', 184237, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:47:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/184237-SBj6UJvIWAOg.jpg', 'Action, Comedy', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 11, 99287, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZCHwvfQlQ4M', '2026-08-02 15:53:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (817, 'The Detective Is Already Dead', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx128712-AlVwHbrugvj6.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'Thwarting a hijacking with the beautiful, silver-haired detective, Siesta, transforms Kimihiko’s young life. Their success kicks off years of crime-solving and confronting syndicates around the world—until Siesta dies. Left with questions, Kimihiko moves on. But now, a new case may open healed wounds as it connects to an assassin, a world conspiracy, and his dead partner!

(Source: Funimation)

Note: The first episode aired with a runtime of ~46 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.', 'ENGI', '2021', 'series', 'released', '2021-07-04', 128712, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:47:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/128712-ten1GvlORgaw.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 126628, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MghFONe--0Q', '2026-08-02 15:53:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (818, 'Clevatess', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx178869-qiEz0gQD8H5N.png', 'series', '7.7', 'The story centers on the titular Clevatess, the lord of Dark Beasts, who wields both uncanny intellect and destructive power. Frustrated by the 13 heroes tasked to destroy him, he has decided to be rid of humanity once and for all. However, he has been charged with one nuisance: he revived a hero he personally slayed and adopts an orphaned humanoid baby—the last hope to save a dying world. The world stands upon the brink of Armageddon, with the obligation of raising one child holding it all back. Now bound together, what fate awaits this unlikely trio?

(Source: Anime News Network, Crunchyroll, edited)

Note: The first episode aired with a runtime of ~46 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.', 'Lay-duce', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-07-02', 178869, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:47:59', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/178869-ZFn0hKphaLtk.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 83368, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sX4o5OODMqQ', '2026-08-02 15:53:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (819, 'Tokyo Revengers Season 2 Part 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx163329-lGJRnYV9dcjc.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'Adaptation of the Tenjiku Arc.

With a future where Toman has been destroyed by Mikey''s twisted ideas and Takemichi returning to the past, he decides to become stronger in order to stop Kisaki''s plans. On one side, a mysterious gang from Yokohama known as Tenjiku begins to overthrow all the Toman divisions, deciding to destroy all the gangs in Japan, becoming the most powerful and unique.

Kisaki has been planning something for his purposes against Toman, now that he is banned.', 'LIDENFILMS', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-10-04', 163329, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:48:01', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163329-SLDIMqtukB7B.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 83660, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OTlNyYfkM1s', '2026-08-02 15:53:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (820, 'Douwa Revengers', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx178084-uy9FudPATgPM.jpg', 'series', '5.2', 'Mini anime of Tokyo Revengers characters in renditions of various fairy tales.', NULL, '2024', 'series', 'released', '2024-10-27', 178084, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:48:01', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Fantasy', 'ONA', 'FALL', 18, 840, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fwyc8XhXVSA', '2026-08-02 15:53:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (821, 'SK8 the Infinity', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124153-uEBI764OSavB.png', 'series', '8.0', 'Reki, a high school sophomore and skater, is addicted to “S,” a highly secret and dangerous downhill skateboarding race that takes place in an abandoned mine. The skaters are especially wild about the “beefs,” or heated battles that erupt in the races.

Reki takes Langa, a transfer student returning to Japan after studying abroad, to the mine where the races are held. Langa, who has no skateboarding experience, finds himself pulled into the world of “S”...

(Source: Aniplex of America)

Note: On March 13, 2021 a recap episode (9.5) went on air, postponing the broadcast of the regular episodes by one week.', 'bones', '2021', 'series', 'released', '2021-01-10', 124153, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:48:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/124153-tEEm1Zaoqa58.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 232379, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=guStf5P4Js0', '2026-08-02 15:53:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (822, 'Skeleton Knight in Another World', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx132474-J2ECHSPkfb9g.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'One day, a gamer played video games until he fell asleep…and when he woke up, he found himself in the game world–as a skeleton! Equipped with the powerful weapons and armor of his avatar but stuck with its frightening skeletal appearance, Arc has to find a place for himself in this new, fantastical land. All his hopes for a quiet life are dashed when he crosses paths with a beautiful elven warrior, setting him on a journey full of conflict and adventure.

(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)', 'Studio KAI', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-04-07', 132474, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:48:04', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/132474-tRgSDa9ltt0m.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 115230, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8XkdWCVUusA', '2026-08-02 15:53:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (823, 'Skip and Loafer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx141911-o6Jwav7hRPPM.jpg', 'series', '8.1', 'This country girl is ready for the big city! Well, at least she thought she was. Mitsumi’s dream is to attend a prestigious school and make the world a better place. But when she finally gets to Tokyo, it turns out she isn’t exactly prepared for city life. Luckily, she runs into Shima, a sweet and handsome classmate who becomes her first friend! Can she make it in Tokyo with Shima by her side?

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'P.A.WORKS', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-04-04', 141911, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:48:12', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/141911-XqAZO540hFXw.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 129784, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GcfUnbrsCJk', '2026-08-02 15:53:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (824, 'Grand Blue Dreaming Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182309-IfrR8sgHIczv.jpg', 'series', '8.4', 'The second season of Grand Blue.

University is back in session for Iori, and so are the booze-fueled parties! Between diving club shenanigans, a surprise from his sister, and wild tests of courage, normal college life is anything but. Dive back into the madness with Iori and his beloved crew of lively splash artists.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Zero-G', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-07-08', 182309, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:48:14', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182309-kvcHexJjshIV.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 65021, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IuKxqWZg5q4', '2026-08-02 16:02:53', NULL);
