Creators are Akira Amemiya, Shin Itagaki, Hirokazu Kojima, SUEZEN, Ryouji Masuyama, Hiroyuki Yamaga, Yoh Yoshinari, and Keisuke Watanabe', 'Gainax', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-06-16', 4705, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, '', 'SPECIAL', NULL, 8, 8063, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rAQylCHv8Cw', '2026-08-08 14:10:43', NULL);
