Creators are Gekidan Inu Curry, Akemi Hayashi, Sushio, Shouko Nishigaki, Satoru Yamaguchi, Shouji Saeki & Shingo Abe and Ayumu Kotake.', NULL, '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-05-26', 8348, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Mecha', 'SPECIAL', NULL, 7, 6229, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RxTbO7rHaCc', '2026-08-08 14:10:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (959, 'Tengen Toppa Gurren Lagann Movie: Lagann-hen Special - Viral no Amai Yume', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5947.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Viral tries to get some sleep, but keeps on having terrifying nightmares.  Can''t anyone save him from his plight?', NULL, '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-01-16', 5947, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:48', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 1, 6256, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Bcerp45m6s', '2026-08-08 14:10:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (960, 'Beyblade', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b288-QLBdXz8n34yP.png', 'series', '6.5', 'Thirteen-year-old Tyson Granger (Takao Kinomiya), along with his fellow teammates, Kai Hiwatari, Max Tate (Max Mizuhura), and Ray Kon (Rei Kon), strive to become the greatest Beybladers in the world. With the technical help of the team''s resident genius, Kenny (Kyouju), and with the powerful strength of their BitBeasts, the Bladebreakers armed with their tops (AKA: Blades) attempt to reach their goal.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '2001', 'series', 'released', '2001-01-08', 288, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:50', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/288-vt6IVT62fuk5.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 51, 26812, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IeEv0quko8o', '2026-08-08 14:10:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (961, 'Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx603-sTv5PVWt8FGi.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Nagisa Misumi and Honoka Yukishiro couldn''t be more different. Nagisa is sporty and Honoka bookish, and while they attend the same school, they have very little in common - until one day, a shower of shooting stars brings two very unlikely visitors into their lives: Mipple and Mepple, refugees from the Garden of Light, which has been conquered by Darkness. Endowed with new and startling powers, Nagisa and Honoka become Cure Black and Cure White, magical defenders of the light - together, they are Pretty Cure. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2004', 'series', 'released', '2004-02-01', 603, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n603-FPlAxroSkLw5.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 21514, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0qS4NcBvSVo', '2026-08-08 14:11:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (962, 'PreCure Splash Star', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1534-mbnVgJrquBQt.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'During the summer festival five years ago, two girls met at a mysterious tree and saw two glowing spheres. Now, these two girls--Saki Hyuuga, ace pitcher on the school softball team; and Mai Mishou, who prefers sketching over stargazing--are chosen by the spirits of flowers (Flappy) and birds (Choppy) to restore the Seven Fountains and save their worlds from Dark Autumn. Together, they are the NEW Pretty Cure.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-02-05', 1534, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1534-muVFeBIJVxYP.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 5734, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTthQXgEYzU', '2026-08-08 14:10:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (963, 'Yes! Precure 5', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1932-gcO8umGwWn33.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Yumehara Nozomi, a regular student, finds a magical book called the Dream Collet in the library and meets Coco and Nuts, two creatures from the Palmier Kingdom. They plead with Nozomi to restore their world, which has been destroyed by an organization called the Nightmares, by completing the Dream Collet and finding the 55 Pinkies to make any wish come true. Meanwhile, the Nightmares are moving into the real world. Once Nozomi agrees to help, Coco and Nuts transform her into the magical girl Cure Dream and turn four fellow students into her Pretty Cure team.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-02-04', 1932, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1932-ptmkySyU0JNM.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 7117, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W_YCeY8GO8g', '2026-08-08 14:11:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (964, 'Fresh Precure!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5684-jrSyAbr10ALo.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Love Momozono is a 14-year-old student at Yotsuba Junior Highschool that tends to care more for others than for herself. One day she visits a show of the famous dance unit "Trinity" and decides to become a dancer, too. On the same event, subordinates of the Labyrinth Kingdom show up who want to collect the unhappiness of the audience. Love gets the power to change into Cure Peach and fights them. Soon after, she is joined by her good friends Miki, who is Cure Berry, and Inori, who becomes Cure Pine.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-02-01', 5684, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5684-zcd4LAzM7fiZ.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 7223, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sTosE3Dsv3Y', '2026-08-08 14:11:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (965, 'Heartcatch Precure!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx7645-edk6l2U5ms7z.png', 'series', '7.9', '2nd year middle school student Tsubomi Hanasaki has just moved with her family to the town of Kibougahana to live with her grandma. She is shy and introverted, but is determined to start off her new school life at Myoudou Academy as confidently as possible.

Lately she has been having the same mysterious dream again and again, of Cure Moonlight''s defeat at the Great Heart Tree. She wonders what it all means. Then suddenly, two fairies from the dream appear to her, and before she knows it, she is transformed into the legendary Pretty Cure, Cure Blossom!

Later joined by her high energy classmate and new friend Erika Kurumi as Cure Marine, the two girls vow work hard to protect everyone''s Heart Flowers from the evil gang, The Desert Messengers.', 'Toei Animation', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-02-07', 7645, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7645-VzqxaDZ6D3vz.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 14125, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9C_2qayqFU', '2026-08-08 14:11:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (966, 'Suite Precure♪', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9893-vqhj2M6aR3Bv.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Kanon Town is filled with music. Hibiki Houjou and Kanade Minamino have grown up in this town and have known each other since they were children. However, they no longer get along.

One day the fairy Hummy from the land of music, Major Land, appears before them. The evil king Mephisto of Minor Land is planning to turn the legendary Melody of Happiness into the Melody of Misfortune. To prevent this from happening, Hibiki and Kanade transform themselves into Pretty Cure.

Kanade and Hibiki have to learn to work together to collect the scattered notes of the Melody of Happiness in order to recreate the score!', 'Toei Animation', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-02-06', 9893, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9893-FNmPQ8lKRDSI.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Music', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 6257, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17skfLFS71Q', '2026-08-08 14:11:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (967, 'Glitter Force', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12191-nWmjNC2appDV.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Once upon a time, there was a kingdom of fairy tales called "M&auml;rchenland", where many fairy tale characters live together in joy. Suddenly, the evil emperor Pierrot made an invasion on M&auml;rchenland, sealing its Queen in the process. To revive the Queen, the symbol of happiness called Cure Decor, "the Queen''s scattered power of light of happiness", is required. To collect the Cure Decor, a fairy named Candy searches for the Pretty Cures on Earth. There, Candy meets a girl, who decides to collect the Cure Decor. Now, will the world earn a "happy ending"?', 'Toei Animation', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-02-05', 12191, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12191-oUUT4xY215ad.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 18045, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V_vCktQgcdY', '2026-08-08 14:11:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (968, 'Glitter Force Doki Doki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx16419-rWEwkEDnKYQ0.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Aida Mana is a girl who is always eager to do things for the sake of others.


One day, when she was visiting the Clover Tower during her school''s orientation program, an enemy who called themselves "Selfish" appeared suddenly, and tried to manipulate her inner heart! To fight this enemy, she borrowed power from a magical fairy Sharuru to transform into Pretty Cure!


To protect the peace of the world, other legendary Pretty Cure soon joined her in battle! A mysterious baby also appears, making each day a "Heartthrob" experience! The 4 Cures, always holding "love" in their hearts, are battling for the world''s fate!


(Source: Asahi TV)', 'Toei Animation', '2013', 'series', 'released', '2013-02-03', 16419, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16419-NNZOw7hmuSsc.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 10508, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UoHCS1zi0FE', '2026-08-08 14:31:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (969, 'HappinessCharge Precure!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20577-6MqRE2P5ZBuD.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'All around the world, Pretty Cures have been fighting against the invasion of an enemy known as Saiark. Shirayuki Hime, the princess of Blue Sky Kingdom, is a Pretty Cure; but unable to defeat the enemy alone, she falls behind the others, and ends up in a bad situation.

On her quest to find a partner, she meets Aino Megumi (Cure Lovely), and the two join forces to battle the enemy together. They learn that by assembling all PreCards, you can get any one wish fulfilled, and they team up with the fairy Ribbon to protect world peace, transform, and dress up as they fight!

A new Pretty Cure story with a dress-up theme begins!', 'Toei Animation', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-02-02', 20577, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20577-uZk06JhGSEWI.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 5545, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KR9ScFOiyC4', '2026-08-08 14:31:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (970, 'Go! Princess Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21001-49nYJTr7Wnsu.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'Haruka Haruno is a first-year student at Noble Academy who dreams of becoming a princess, just like the one from her favorite picture book. Long ago, she made a promise with a boy named Kanata to never give up the dream, and he gifted her a dress-shaped key. On her first day at the academy, Haruka runs into the fairies Pafu and Aroma who came from the mystical Hope Kingdom in search of the Princess Precures to save their world from the dark witch Dyspear. Now, with the help of Princess Perfume and the Dress Up Key from Hope Kingdom''s Prince Kanata, Haruka transforms into Cure Flora to protect everyone''s dreams from being locked away by Dys Dark''s minions.

With her friends Cure Mermaid and Cure Twinkle by her side, the three princesses join forces in battle to protect dreams, collect the 12 Dress Up Keys, and stop Dyspear''s plot to turn everyone to despair.', 'Toei Animation', '2015', 'series', 'released', '2015-02-01', 21001, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21001-y1ZQ5xaZugKH.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 8599, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fa26uE6WgbY', '2026-08-08 14:31:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (971, 'Witchy Precure!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21506-hcLdwWKY4uyt.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Mirai Asahina, a 13-year-old girl who''s going into her second year of middle school, witnesses a mysterious object fall in to the park. Excitedly, she brings her stuffed bear Mofurun with her to see what it was. When she gets there she sees a girl named Riko flying on a broom. Mirai has a lot of questions, and Riko explains that she''s searching for something. The two of them are wearing similar pendants. Then Batti, an ally of the dark magic user Dokurokushi, appears before them and demands the "Link Stone Emerald." Batti creates a monster called a "Yokubaru" and drives them into a corner. Mirai, Riko, and Mofurun join hands and speak the magic words "Cure-Up Rapapa," their pendants glow, and they become the legendary Precure.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '2016', 'series', 'released', '2016-02-07', 21506, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21506-Dp3CCH9rP9ue.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 7616, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P8DwvlGU2gM', '2026-08-08 14:11:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (972, 'KIRA KIRA☆PRECURE A LA MODE', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98059-n1fWRel1JlO7.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Ichika Usami is a second-year middle school student who loves sweets, but struggles to bake. One day, she encounters a fairy named Pekorin, who is able to detect "Kirakiraru", an element residing in sweets. However, an evil fairy starts to steal the Kirakiraru for themselves, leaving the sweets black and lifeless. Determined to protect the sweets, Ichika gains the power of the Legendary Patisserie and transforms into the Pretty Cure, Cure Whip, to protect the Kirakiraru.

(Source: Wikipedia, edited)', 'Toei Animation', '2017', 'series', 'released', '2017-02-05', 98059, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98059-rhfvEwucJvPq.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 6858, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rNbhD48fyVM', '2026-08-08 14:11:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (973, 'HUGtto! Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100661-XT2NWXKklV5T.png', 'series', '7.8', 'Nono Hana is an 8th grade student who wants to be a stylish and mature big sister like figure. She always puts on a lovely smile and loves to search for exciting things. One day, Hana meets a baby named Hug-tan and her guardian fairy named Harry who had fallen from the sky. At that exact moment, an evil organization called Dark Tomorrow suddenly appeared! They''re trying to forcefully take Hug-tan''s Mirai Crystal! In order to protect Hug-tan, Hana wishes to do something to help her, and her wish is granted, as she gains a Mirai Crystal and transforms into Cure Yell. The world is overflowed with Tomorrow Powerer, which is the power to create a brilliant tomorrow, which is crystallized into the Mirai Crystals. If it''s stolen, everyone''s future will not exist. To protect Hug-tan and everyone''s future, Cure Yell will do her best!

(Source: Pretty Cure Wiki)', 'Toei Animation', '2018', 'series', 'released', '2018-02-04', 100661, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100661-U0cd3dR28mK9.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 9187, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=My1u0ka_xck', '2026-08-08 14:11:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (974, 'Star☆Twinkle Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx105857-02ruhcNiPGga.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'The story begins when the protagonist Hikaru meets aliens Lala, Prunce, and Fuwa while watching the night sky. She learns of the "Star Palace," where the 12 Star Princesses of the constellations kept the balance of the universe until they were attacked. Lala is searching for the legendary Precure warriors to help find the 12 scattered "Princess Star Color Pens" and revive the princesses. When Fuwa is captured by an enemy, Hikaru wishes to save Fuwa, and a Star Color Pendent and a Star Color Pen appear to allow her to transform into Cure Star. From then on she works to collect the pens and raise Fuwa, who is the key to reviving the princesses.', 'Toei Animation', '2019', 'series', 'released', '2019-02-03', 105857, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105857-D1S4lCsrKFMT.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 7270, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VRHMhMU1S6Q', '2026-08-08 14:11:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (975, 'Healin'' Good Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx112748-UU9yEob7meZj.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Deep inside the Earth lies a magical place called the "Healing Garden", which cared for the planet for centuries and is been protected by animal-like fairies named "Healing Animals". However, the garden was attacked by the antagonistic group called Bjögens whose goal is to infect the garden and slowly poison the planet. In order to save the Healing Garden, Latte escaped to the human world alongside three "medical trainee" Healing Animals, on a mission to find three people who can partner with them. After they meet Nodoka, Chiyu and Hinata, Latte pleaded them to fight for the Healing Garden as they became Pretty Cures in order to fight against the threat of the Bjögens and protect all life on Earth and the Healing Garden. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Toei Animation', '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-02-02', 112748, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/112748-dT6g0pgTY5u1.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 45, 6747, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XGJTaiHFgqs', '2026-08-08 14:11:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (976, 'Tropical-Rouge! Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx126905-dWGjQMt2DUp0.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Manatsu Natsuumi is a first-year junior high school student born and raised on a small island. On the day she moves from the island, She meets Laura, a mermaid girl who has come to the earth alone in search of the legendary warrior, PreCure. Laura''s hometown, Grand Ocean, is attacked by a witch who lives in the dark depths of the ocean, and all of their motivational power is taken away. It is said that if the motivational power of humans is also taken away, the world will be in deep trouble. Laura is captured by the witch''s servant, and Manatsu transforms into Cure Summer to save her.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Toei Animation', '2021', 'series', 'released', '2021-02-28', 126905, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/126905-R4IsdMuUTlyr.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 46, 7749, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EYmyfzHjaHI', '2026-08-08 14:11:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (977, 'Delicious Party Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx142080-YQEmfiA8D0Fy.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'The mysterious, delicious world of CooKingdom, which rules over all the cuisine in this world. CooKingdom has closely guarded the Recipe-Bon, in which it''s written how to prepare any dish. But, oh no! One day, it gets stolen by the Bundoru Gang! The Bundoru Gang plans to monopolize everything for themselves, and their next target is the Cuisine Fairy Recipeppi... The Energy Fairies have come to Oishi-Na Town in the human world in search of the Recipe-Bon. With their help, an unexpected turn of events leads to three ordinary girls transforming into Pretty Cures!

</br>
(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Toei Animation', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-02-06', 142080, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/142080-GMSelgwWq15N.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 45, 6015, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hez_UB6ay5Y', '2026-08-08 14:11:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (978, 'Soaring Sky! Precure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx157883-ib9fXLLjUy5m.png', 'series', '7.4', 'A major incident has occurred in the peaceful Sky Land!? The young Princess Eru has been kidnapped by the monsters of Underg Empire! A brave young girl, Sora, follows the princess through a mysterious hole. "TV"? "Cars"? Are those some kind of magic tools!?!?

But there''s no time to be surprised! She has to get the princess back to the castle...! Flying between two worlds! The adventure with the Pretty Cure begins now!

It''s hero time!', 'Toei Animation', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-02-05', 157883, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/157883-u3gE5LKKXwb3.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 7277, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j0DUgBhsg_A', '2026-08-08 14:11:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (979, 'Wonderful Precure!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx171030-U7zjkqv8pQFq.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'The 21st installment in the Precure series. 

Animal Town is a town where animals and people live together. Iroha loves animals and is good friends with her dog, Komugi! One day, a mysterious creature, Garugaru, wreaks havoc in the town! However, in order to protect Iroha, Komugi transformed into human form and became a Precure...! I have to save the child animal whose heart is being garugaru-ed...! Let''s join forces and return the animals to Niko Garden!

(Source: Crunchyroll News)', 'Toei Animation', '2024', 'series', 'released', '2024-02-04', 171030, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/171030-kMlg6k9tGVKJ.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 5600, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BPRbvtFnkYs', '2026-08-08 14:11:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (980, 'You and Idol Precure ♪', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx185073-m4QzzXcEqmvb.png', 'series', '6.6', 'The main character, Sakura Uta, is a second-year middle school student who loves to sing. One day, she meets the fairy Purirun that has come to search for the Legendary Protectors, Idol Precure! Purirun''s hometown, KirakiLand has been plunged into total darkness by Darkine, the boss of the Chokkiri Gang. Meanwhile, the sparkles of the townspeople are being stolen by the Chokkiri Gang... it''s a huge pinch!

"I want to make it sparkle sparkly! Here is my song!" - With this determination, Uta transforms into the Legendary Protector, Cure Idol! She sings, dances, and gives fan service, making it sparkle no matter how pitch-black it is!', 'Toei Animation', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-02-02', 185073, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 16:52:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185073-gKyL8oVOqMX1.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Music', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 4785, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JK8GE-6pU8U', '2026-08-08 14:11:43', NULL);
