Join Irisviel as she helps Disciple No. Zero understand more details and history relating to the Holy Grail War.', 'ufotable', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-03-07', 13263, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:14:52', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 6, 10765, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=an9vI-d1W3w', '2026-08-08 14:22:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1173, 'Lord El-Melloi II''s Case Files {Rail Zeppelin} Grace note', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx106918-4T0AdnCg8d64.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Ten years after facing defeat in the Fourth Holy Grail War, Waver Velvet, now Lord El Melloi II, teaches classes at the Clock Tower—the center of education for mages. However, his new status as "Lord" comes with a caveat: obey the orders of Reines, the younger sister of the deceased Kayneth El Melloi, until she is old enough to rule the House of El Melloi.

Waver, along with his mysterious apprentice Gray, takes on a series of cases assigned by Reines and the Mages Association. With each case proving to be more complex than the last, could there be more to the Clock Tower than meets the eye, and what secrets does Reines hide?', 'TROYCA', '2019', 'series', 'released', '2019-07-07', 106918, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:14:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106918-rfoPP8HknWAM.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 53738, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E3w2accrWoU', '2026-08-08 14:22:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1174, 'Bakemonogatari', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5081-9GocceQ5Z865.jpg', 'series', '8.2', 'First season of the Monogatari Series, part 1/6. Contains the arcs Hitagi Crab, Mayoi Snail, Suruga Monkey, Nadeko Snake, and Tsubasa Cat from the Bakemonogatari light novels.

Thanks to Meme Oshino, Koyomi Araragi, a high school student, is able to remain a human after coming across a female vampire... However, since the incident, Koyomi seems to meet girls who have an apparition-related issue. Hitagi Senjougahara doesn’t weigh anything, Suruga Kanbaru’s right arm becomes like that of a monkey’s, and a young girl, Mayoi, cannot find her way home no matter how many times she tries. Koyomi, a Mr. Nice Guy, ends up helping each and every girl solve her problem with the help of Meme Oshino.

(Source: Aniplex)

Note: Only the first 12 episodes were broadcast on television; the remaining three episodes were distributed on the anime''s website between November 3, 2009, and June 25, 2010.', 'Shaft', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-07-03', 5081, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:14:54', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n5081-0Zcn5GOFYHMc.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Psychological, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 15, 340665, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X63_YYZjKxA', '2026-08-29 14:50:53', NULL);
