Episode 0 happens three years prior to the TV series when the Nase siblings meet Akihito for the first time in a mission for Hiroomi. Mitsuki follows her brother on this mission and their goal is to subjugate Akihito.', 'Kyoto Animation', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-07-02', 20779, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:23:00', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n20779-XVIkrhIa1mAY.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 37745, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OUI29slIx10', '2026-08-08 14:29:27', NULL);
