As the members of the Service Club band together to host a school prom, Hachiman, Yukino and Yui will have to put their feelings into words and truly learn to understand each other at long last… if the Service Club can even stay afloat, that is!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'feel.', '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-07-10', 108489, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108489-z4DheppQdxo4.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 220363, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M0CsMI-qqmI', '2026-08-08 14:29:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1323, 'Beyblade V-Force', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b1669-BivChts2kGsj.png', 'series', '6.4', 'The Bladebreakers have to join forces once again because a mysterious group under the lead of Oozuma has defeated them, but the real enemy is not Oozuma. The real threath is formed by a group of people who use cyber-BitBeasts to capture the original ones from the Bladebreakers.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'd-rights', '2002', 'series', 'released', '2002-01-07', 1669, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1669-ACAcvmtvUkdR.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 51, 14039, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RHZvbdMxIns', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1324, 'Beyblade: Metal Fusion', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b5962-MhsmIFdv4J59.png', 'series', '6.8', 'A new cast of characters take on the continued battle between good and evil. Ginga, our hero, and his group of loyal friends take on a dangerous group called the Dark Nebula. The Dark Nebula&rsquo;s sole mission is to take over the world and unleash their evil upon it; but before they can do so, they must destroy Ginga as he is the only person that&rsquo;s strong enough to stand in their way. The plot thickens as friends become enemies and enemies become allies. Everything starts and ends with Ginga as he struggles to find the strength to defend his world and the honor of Beyblade.

(Source: Beyblade.com)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-05', 5962, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 51, 28977, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DpfsJjin2kU', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1325, 'BeyWheelz: Powered by Beyblade', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b136668-VZgOHmlPWZ8l.jpg', 'series', '5.0', 'A Beyblade spin-off originally commissioned by Nelvana to make up for Beyblade: Metal Fury''s shortened season.', 'Nelvana', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-08-11', 136668, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 13, 942, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-ETXkXH-FTg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1326, 'Beyblade: Shogun Steel', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx13231-l2tS23CDbinP.jpg', 'series', '5.7', 'Seven years after the Nemesis Crisis, much of the world has been devastated and ruined after the tragic fighting. As a result, most people lost faith and interest in Beyblading. Tsubasa Ootori, who became leader of the WBBA, made it his life goal to ensure humanity could restore itself, as well as restore the popularity of Beyblading. Together with the mechanic Madoka Amano, he created the Zero-G battling style as a result, and hopes a new generation of bladers will rise up to accept the sport once again. One of these is a teenager named Zero Kurogane, who aims to become the top blader after having a destined encounter with the hero of the Nemesis Crisis, Ginga Hagane.', 'Tatsunoko Production', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-04-08', 13231, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Sports', 'TV_SHORT', 'SPRING', 38, 5287, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k-V6M9MW_rg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1327, 'Beyblade Burst', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21236-8B4fORbuUp6v.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'This is the story of a group of passionate Bladers who follow their dreams on an unforgettable journey to the top.

 Valt Aoi is crazy about Beyblade. Valt''s best friend since childhood, Shu Kurenai, is hailed as a Beyblade prodigy and has already been named as one of the National Beyblade Tournament''s Final Four. Inspired by Shu''s accomplishments, Valt sets his sights on reaching this year''s national tournament. But to get to the big leagues, he must first emerge victorious from the district tournament – no easy feat, given the tough opponents standing in his way. Determined to win, Valt aims to make it to the championship, where he hopes to battle Shu and move on to the national tournament. As he battles, Valt broadens his circle of friends and reaches new heights. Without even realizing it, he has begun to dream of becoming the best Blader in the world.

(Source: Beyblade US site)', 'OLM', '2016', 'series', 'released', '2016-04-04', 21236, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21236-MOfj4yGKUvQR.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 51, 11688, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VipMWO76P40', '2026-08-08 14:29:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1328, 'Beyblade Burst Turbo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101115-D0LrlWZtbOeX.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Aiger Akabane is a wild child, who grew up surrounded by nature. Inspired by a chance Bey battle with Valt Aoi, Aiger sets his sights on becoming an invincible Blader with the help of his Turbo Bey, Z Achilles.

Battling powerful opponents and seeking strength; Aiger sets out to defeat Valt and claim the title of World Champion. Here begins Aiger''s tale of epic adventures and fierce battles on his way to the top.

(Source: d-rights)', 'OLM', '2018', 'series', 'released', '2018-04-02', 101115, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101115-4FLEBjhD8FSJ.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 51, 6172, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b7hLdDu43U0', '2026-08-08 14:29:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1329, 'Beyblade Burst Rise', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx108853-ebznx715AJ9x.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'Legendary Blader Valt Aoi has been training the next generation of elite Bladers at Spain''s BC Sol. One day, rookie Bladers Dante Koryu and Delta Zakuro witness Valt unleashing his newly-evolved Gamma Bey, Sword Valtryek. To their surprise, Valtryek radiates a golden light as it rockets around the stadium. Inspired by the limitless possibilities of this “Hyper-Flux” state, both Dante and Delta seek the same bond with their Beys.

Dante and his partner, Ace Dragon, set off for Japan, the birthplace of Beyblade. But the path to glory won''t be easy; plenty of tough competitors and Gamma Beys stand in their way, among them some of the best to ever let it rip. Dante soon realizes he''ll have to do whatever it takes to deepen his bond with Dragon.

Do Dante and Dragon have what it takes to overcome these challenges? And will they ever achieve Hyper-Flux? Here begins the story of Dante and Dragon''s rise to the peak of the Blading world.

(Source: Total Licensing)', 'OLM', '2019', 'series', 'released', '2019-04-05', 108853, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 52, 4160, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b7hLdDu43U0', '2026-08-08 14:30:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1330, 'Beyblade Burst Surge', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx116786-ZIUM2E11AK0y.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'One year after the events of Beyblade Burst Rise, brothers Hikaru, and Hyuga witness the power of superking/sparking evolutions of Valtryek, Roktavor, and Satomb. The three beys radiate a power that was not even dreamable, due to their bladers pulling off a sparking launch. Hyuga and Hikaru get inspired to make their own sparking beys, Hyperion and Helios, and compete with the legendary bladers, training to best the top ranked bladers to ever touch the stadium.

Prepared to do whatever it takes to become the best, they head across the globe to challenge the best to ever let it rip, in an effort to become stronger, and battle all of the top bladers that were able to make their mark in the stadium.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'OLM', '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-04-03', 116786, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116786-pFUeB9WaAtJs.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 52, 3537, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NY7iAAOTV18', '2026-08-08 14:30:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1331, 'Beyblade Burst QuadDrive', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx130253-xGqNj5lKnuwN.png', 'series', '6.1', 'The story centers on Bell Daikokuten, the leader of the Bey graveyard "Makai no Mon." Bell, who holds Dynamite Belial, declares war on Bladers across the world.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'OLM', '2021', 'series', 'released', '2021-04-02', 130253, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 52, 2480, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U5DPahbvneg', '2026-08-08 14:30:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1332, 'Beyblade Burst QuadStrike', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b166062-TMMGelSGcWJu.jpg', 'series', '5.6', 'The stage is set for a masquerade tournament, but the Dark Prince isn’t the only belle at this ball! Enter: the masked Blader known as ‘Quadra’. Wielding her elemental Bey, Lightning Pandora, Quadra has defeated every foe to come her way. Meanwhile, Quadra’s brother, Pax, is busy studying the elemental powers radiating from a series of mysterious ruins nearby. Bel might be the Dark Prince, but this adventure is full of even darker secrets!

(Source: BEYBLADE BURST Official on YouTube)', 'OLM', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-04-04', 166062, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:21', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 26, 904, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xjFQsmXbed0', '2026-08-08 14:30:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1333, 'Futari wa Precure: Splash☆Star - Tick Tack Kiki Ippatsu!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/4124.jpg', 'movies', '6.5', 'On their way to a singing contest, Mai and Saki meet a mysterious man looking for the oldest clock in town. It turns out that this clock is a portal to the World of Clocks, and the mysterious man is a servant of Dark Fall who wants to stop time to destroy the world. With the help of the clock spirits, Pretty Cure must fight to escape his perfect maze and start time flowing again. Takes place during the second half of Futari wa Precure Splash&#9734;Star.', 'Toei Animation', '2006', 'movie', 'released', '2006-12-09', 4124, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2516, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTthQXgEYzU', '2026-08-08 14:30:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1334, 'Futari wa Precure: Splash☆Star - Maji★Doki♥3D Theater', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b104436-08ESfVlngQ4R.jpg', 'movies', '5.5', 'A seed of hope descends from the sky, landing atop Flappy''s head and sprouting between his ears. Gooyaan is sent after the seed of hope and uses a seed of despair to transform an Uzaina, causing big trouble for the Precure!', 'Toei Animation', '2006', 'movie', 'released', '2006-07-01', 104436, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/104436-Cg2SIj6mbi6k.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1350, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aTi9p0Bq8_o', '2026-08-08 14:30:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1335, 'Power of Hope ~Precure Full Bloom~', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx162720-bVrHEs2nUlBo.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'One of the anime projects to commemorate the 20th anniversary of the Precure franchise, this sequel will show characters from Yes! Precure 5, Yes! Precure 5 GoGo! and Futari wa Precure: Splash☆Star as grown-ups.

Nozomi Yumehara was an ordinary middle school student until she met the mysterious fairy Coco. She became the Precure of Hope, Cure Dream, and fought alongside her friends. Years later, Nozomi and her friends are now adults, busy with work, friends, family, and the stress that adult life brings. As the mysterious Shadows appear and attack humans, Nozomi and her friends embark on a new saga.

(Source: Anime News Network, Crunchyroll, edited)', 'Toei Animation', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-10-07', 162720, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/162720-i38ZoiqJKQRn.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 4276, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N5ASW-7-m-4', '2026-08-08 14:30:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1336, 'Yes! Precure 5 GoGo!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3692-hNjdstSK2qMF.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'A direct continuation of the former season, this series again follows the story of Nozomi Yumehara and her friends from Precure 5. The girls who had formerly lost their powers and bade farewell to their friends Coco and Nuts from Palmier Kingdom are resurrected as Pretty Cure by the mysterious woman Flora who also wants them to find her in a place called Cure Rosegarden. To go there, they need the magic Rose Pact and the powers of the four kings of countries surrounding Palmier. But a dark organization called Eternal is also striving to get to Cure Rosegarden by stealing the Rose Pact. Luckily, Precure get helped by new allies: the delivery-boy Syrup who can change into a giant bird and fly them anywhere they want and the mysterious and beautiful fighter Milky Rose stand alongside Pretty Cure to protect what is really valuable.', 'Toei Animation', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-02-03', 3692, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3692-ElIdWnzgkum6.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 4725, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W_YCeY8GO8g', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1337, 'Yes! Precure 5: Kagami no Kuni no Miracle Daibouken!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b3051-OWrA0ybwgNgV.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'The five girls plus Coco, Nuts, and Milk all go to visit a castle-themed theme park, where they dress up as princes and princesses and go off to have a fun-filled day. However, Coco and Nuts end up kidnapped! The girls have to save them with the help of two inhabitants of the Mirror Country, Hidarin and Migirin,  by battling Shadow, an evil clown, and five girls who are also from the Mirror Country that look very familiar...', 'Toei Animation', '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-11-10', 3051, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3051-aYWgOPrTii6B.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2791, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tWxCaRc_-I8', '2026-08-08 14:30:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1338, 'Fresh Precure! Omocha no Kuni wa Himitsu ga Ippai!?', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6527-hBc86bVzJHaX.png', 'movies', '6.6', 'After resolving the problems in the Labyrinth Kingdom, Love Momozono and her friends live a happy life and continue their dance training. Suddenly, the town children''s toys start to go missing and the girls agree to help find them. Love Momozono''s stuffed rabbit then comes to life and tells the Cures that the Toymajin is responsible. The Fresh Pretty Cure cast then travel to the Kingdom of Toys to save the day!

(Source: bakabt)', NULL, '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-10-31', 6527, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:28', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2569, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7iDdl87XAM', '2026-08-08 14:30:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1339, 'PreCure Max Heart', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1929-W4HJGwZKl1aM.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Shortly after the fall of the Wicked King, the Queen of the Garden of Light lost her memory and came to Earth, in the form of a 12-year-old girl named Hikari Kujou. Now, she - with the help of Nagisa and Honoka, endowed with new costumes and powers - must find the 12 Heartiels, which hold the key to restoring the Queen''s lost memories. For together once again, they are Pretty Cure. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-02-06', 1929, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:30', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1929-pMrveqatIf8k.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 47, 7457, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FbL896cQMI', '2026-08-08 14:30:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1340, 'Heartcatch Precure! Hana no Miyako de Fashion Show... Desu ka!?', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9288-KBl1SCRhk7Xn.jpg', 'movies', '7.6', 'Sakura Kurumi, Erika''s mother, is preparing for a fashion show in Paris. The girls of the school''s fashion club are going to model there, including some high school students. While in Paris, they meet a mysterious boy named Oliver. However, Baron Salamander of the Desert Apostles appears, and the girls transform into Pretty Cures to defend Paris.', NULL, '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-10-30', 9288, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:32', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9288-vgeiab6yJAoz.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 4034, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9C_2qayqFU', '2026-08-08 14:41:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1341, 'Suite Precure♪: Torimodose! Kokoro ga Tsunagu Kiseki no Melody♪', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10821-0RO2tkriIgoh.png', 'movies', '6.7', 'After Cure Muse''s mission of restoring her father''s kind heart was accomplished, Ako and Mephisto decided to return to Major Land together. Suddenly, a howling noise rang through the city, and when it died down, all music was gone. Ako and Mephisto tried to establish contact with Major Land, but could not get a response.

Full of worry, Hibiki and the others headed to Major Land, where there was no sign of the former land of overflowing music. The world was desolate without sound, its people devoid of emotion like stone, continuing to play their soundless instruments. The only one left was Ako''s friend Suzu, who explained how Aphrodite suddenly changed and took away all music from the land. Ako and Mephisto, unbelieving and determined to find out the truth, headed to the palace where Aphrodite was. Hibiki, Kanade and Ellen decided to chase after Suzu, who had run away after Ako refused to believe her story.

While chasing after Suzu, the girls met with 3 men eager to steal the Healing Chest. And as the truth slowly came to light, the Pretty Cure had to face up to the real enemy.', 'Toei Animation', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-10-29', 10821, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:35', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10821-titJAcMD0NqS.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2514, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17skfLFS71Q', '2026-08-08 14:31:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1342, 'Smile Precure! Ehon no Naka wa Minna Chiguhagu!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx15307-AAPnXXw5FZqB.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'The movie transports the Precure into a world inside a picture book, where they are guided by Nico, a mysterious inhabitant of the picture book world.', 'Toei Animation', '2012', 'movie', 'released', '2012-10-27', 15307, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:37', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/15307-Pf5JIlUwz7aM.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2913, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h1ctoxGgPb0', '2026-08-08 14:31:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1343, 'Dokidoki! Precure: Mana Kekkon!!? Mirai ni Tsunagu Kibou no Dress', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx17357-psOCHOOkScfh.png', 'movies', '6.6', 'Mana is given a wedding dress which was worn by her mother and grandmother.

All of sudden a mysterious man named Matthew appears and takes her to the past world.

Mana is so glad to meet her grandmother and her beloved dog Maro that she had a long time ago, but she can''t find two of her best friends Rikka and Alice. It looks her precious memories have been changed somehow.

If things continue as is, the future will be ruined, too.

The Precure girls have to fight to protect their memories and future!!


(Source: Crunchyroll)', NULL, '2013', 'movie', 'released', '2013-10-26', 17357, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:39', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/17357-rWXBB3kEzfzQ.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2469, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zLOR7ZIyNkc', '2026-08-08 14:31:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1344, 'HappinessCharge Precure! Ningyou no Kuni no Ballerina', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b21121-KDUScEYQAmFj.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'The film’s story is set in the Doll Kingdom where dolls dwell. In the story, the Pretty Cures are watching a doll play about to start, when the dolls suddenly start talking. “Please rescue our kingdom!” the ballerina named Tsumugi says, and she leads the Pretty Cures to the Doll Kingdom. There, the Pretty Cures thought they would be surrounded by cute stuffed animals, but instead they find a mysterious man named Black Fang who is attacking the kingdom, and he captures Tsumugi. The country normally filled with happiness is hiding a sad secret, and the Pretty Cures must help save the day.

(Source: Pretty Cure Wiki)', 'Toei Animation', '2014', 'movie', 'released', '2014-10-11', 21121, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:42', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21121-kA3rH5dpLqw3.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2221, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMe7LVB0SQU', '2026-08-08 14:31:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1345, 'Go! Princess Precure: Go! Go!! Gouka 3-bon Date!!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21323-CrUKk4Cg7d1V.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'Part 1, Pumpkin Oukoku no Takaramono, will feature the four Precure girls from Go! Princess Precure trying to rescue a princess who is held captive.

Part 2, Precure to Refi no Wonder Night!, is set in the Night Kingdom lost its daytime, the Precure team fight to take the daytime back alongside the princess Refi.

Part 3, Cure Flora to Itazura Kagami, will be a dialogue-less story featuring Cure Flora and a mischievous ghost in a mirror.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Toei Animation', '2015', 'movie', 'released', '2015-10-31', 21323, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:44', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21323-yISRgeoKOXEw.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2168, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hitV-05mPAM', '2026-08-08 14:31:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1346, 'Mahoutsukai Precure! Kiseki no Henshin! Cure Mofurun!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98746-FIqCqF5dlkNd.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'Mirai and friends go to the Magical World to celebrate the Wishing Stone Festival, a once a century gathering where the titular stone grants one lucky customer''s wish. When Mirai and Mofurun are seperated by a mysterious bear wizard, Mofurun''s wish is granted and hijinks ensue.', 'Toei Animation', '2016', 'movie', 'released', '2016-10-29', 98746, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:46', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98746-ZOLmgL7ST9B6.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2484, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E_tHa4bIlwc', '2026-08-08 14:31:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1347, 'Witchy Precure!! ~MIRAI DAYS~', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx162722-w30E3QgBvG7H.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'One of the anime projects to commemorate the 20th anniversary of the Precure franchise, this will be a direct sequel of Mahoutsukai Precure! aimed at grown-up fans of the anime. 

Mirai Asahina, a very curious 13-year-old girl with a love for mysterious things, met a young witch named Liko during spring break.
Led by miracles and magic, Mirai and Liko both transformed into the Legendary Witch "Precures"! 
Working together with Mirai''s treasured teddy bear Mofurun and Ha-chan, a fairy born from the "Linkle Smartbook", they tried to repel the chaos that was encroaching upon the "Magic World" and "Magicless World (Human World)". However, that involved the separation of everyone.

After being miraculously reunited a few years later, Mirai and the others begin to take steps towards their futures in their respective worlds. Mirai is a college student in the Magicless World. Liko, who returned to the Magic World, is a teacher at the Magic School. Mofurun, as always, is at Mirai''s side. Ha-chan exists far away, watching over the world.

However, a new disaster threatening the Magic and Magicless worlds has appeared...

Due to signs of the coming disaster, Mirai and Liko reunite for the first time in months. While attempting to resist this mysterious enemy, they both come face to face with not only their past, but their future. With the magical words "Cure Up RaPaPa!", their exciting tale is once again set into motion!

(Source: Anime News Network, Crunchyroll, edited)', 'Toei Animation', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-01-12', 162722, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:47', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/162722-x8FkO0OyAq2p.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 3091, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mdr0WF5pPgI', '2026-08-08 14:31:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1348, 'Kirakira☆Precure a la Mode: Paris to! Omoide no Mille-Feuille!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98891-XN5Gf8tLuBMY.png', 'movies', '6.7', 'The Precure members go to France as part of a cooking competition. While in France, Ciel is suddenly unable to change into her Precure form, and her sweets making is going badly as well. During the competition, suddenly the streets of Paris turn to sweets.

(Source: Anime News Network)

Notes: The runtime does not account for the <a href="https://anilist.co/anime/117403/PetitDream-Stars-Lets-La-Cooking-Showtime/">5-minute short that</a> screened alongside the movie', 'Toei Animation', '2017', 'movie', 'released', '2017-10-28', 98891, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:49', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98891-sdSV0qY9ofQz.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 1992, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4JmQTsEkTeQ', '2026-08-08 14:31:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1349, 'Star☆Twinkle Precure: Hoshi no Uta ni Omoi wo Komete', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx109737-mtFA67AolBUL.png', 'movies', '7.9', 'A mysterious creature named UMA (Unidentified Mysterious Animal) appears in Lala''s gummy case and then uses a power to whisk the Pretty Cures to a faraway place. Though they can''t communicate with words, song seems to work just fine. UMA is so precious to the universe, but alien hunters are after UMA! The whole universe is in danger if they catch UMA. UMA must be protected and the hunters defeated!', 'Toei Animation', '2019', 'movie', 'released', '2019-10-19', 109737, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/109737-jSwXFOHUf4fR.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2852, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-TgdU8Fjb-E', '2026-08-29 14:45:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1350, 'Healin'' Good♥Precure: Yume no Machi de Kyun! Tto GoGo! Dai Henshin!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx121026-IdeSxOsJ84HB.png', 'movies', '7.0', 'The members of Healin'' Good arrive in the city of Tokyo. In Tokyo, the "YumeR" experience that can project the people''s inner dreams with the "dream pendant" that Nodoka and her friends wear has become very popular. Nodoka meets the princess of YumeR with magical power, Kaguya, at the dream town where everyone''s dreams are overflowing. Then, mysterious enemies who are after everyone''s dreams appear...! Can the Healin'' Good and 5GoGo! teams protect everyone''s dreams?

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Toei Animation', '2021', 'movie', 'released', '2021-03-20', 121026, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:56', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/121026-e3mHDFnLcQoj.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 1932, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PSyIWg4NET8', '2026-08-29 14:45:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1351, 'Tropical-Rouge! Precure: Yuki no Princess to Kiseki no Yubiwa!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx135864-pdE2Ur3cb6gn.jpg', 'movies', '6.9', NULL, 'Toei Animation', '2021', 'movie', 'released', '2021-10-23', 135864, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:24:58', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/135864-BEhZRFVIbmgB.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2194, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BBcK7f0fRl8', '2026-08-29 14:45:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1352, 'Delicious Party♡Precure: Yumemiru♡Okosama Lunch!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx144687-b2piUr5WSdYb.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'In Oishiina Town where the girls live, a theme park for Children''s Lunch has suddenly appeared! It seems Kome-Kome and the other fairies were treated to a Children''s Lunch by the park director, Cait Sith. Everyone was having fun playing together, but suddenly, Rosemary was turned into a stuffed toy! Is there a secret to "Dreamia"? Just like the Children''s Lunch, if eveyone''s feelings become one, Kome-Kome will create a miracle.', 'Toei Animation', '2022', 'movie', 'released', '2022-09-23', 144687, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:25:00', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/144687-hJRgDUEQy0QZ.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1784, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3B8BtzGnoi0', '2026-08-29 14:45:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1353, 'Watashi dake no Okosama Lunch', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx154678-6gEnTuqLrNLF.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Anime short that will accompany screenings of the Delicious Party♡Precure: Yumemiru♡Okosama Lunch!  film. The short will star characters from three previous Precure series — Tropical-Rouge! Precure, Healin'' Good Precure, and Star☆Twinkle Precure — alongside the characters from the current Delicious Party♡Precure series. 

(Source: Anime News Network, edited)', 'Toei Animation', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-09-23', 154678, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:25:00', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/154678-5GKnAIhN9mg3.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 814, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ogzoSX6DYQc', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1354, 'Wonderful Precure! The Movie! Dokidoki♡Game no Sekai de Daibouken!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx169403-5cgj0sZFRF1n.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'Komugi, Iroha, Yuki, Mayu, Daifuku and Satoru all got together to play the super popular game "Dokidoki♡TanuKingdom!"

But, as everyone was about to start enjoying the game, a suspicious tanuki somehow dragged them into the world of the game...

Then there''s an even bigger problem! Komugi gets separated from Iroha and all the others...?!

"I aaalways want to stay by Iroha''s side-wan!"

In order to reunite with her beloved Iroha, Komugi takes on all kinds of games and challenges!

Why in the world did it end up like this...? Just what kind of secret is the game world hiding...?

The clues are held by the girl who made the game, Natsuki.

Hirogaru Sky! Precure and Mahoutsukai Precure! also makes an appearance!

When everyone''s feelings become one, a miracle happens?!

(Source: Official website, translated)', 'Toei Animation', '2024', 'movie', 'released', '2024-09-13', 169403, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:25:05', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/169403-ew25CQtZdV98.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1600, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qj54m_RWVhE', '2026-08-29 14:45:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1355, 'Kimi to Idol Precure♪ Omatase! Kimi ni Todokeru KirakkiLive!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx183414-YQT1XNrqnwGX.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'One day, Uta and her friends find themselves invited to perform at the "Super Miracle Idol Festival," the universe''s greatest idol festival held on the mysterious Aiai Island, by the coral fairy Tot. Suddenly, a mysterious monster appears, plunging the island and the world into a major crisis, and Uta and her friends are sent flying back in time. The key to overcoming this crisis lay hidden with the island''s legendary goddess and with Tera, a mysterious idol-hating girl they meet on the island.

Last but not least, the Hirogaru Sky! Precure and the Wonderful Precure also make their appearance!

As they sing, dance and deliver fan-service, a kirakilala live for YOU begins!

(Source: Official Website, translated)', NULL, '2025', 'movie', 'released', '2025-09-12', 183414, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:25:07', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Mahou Shoujo, Music', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 1182, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axbbAxWU9qQ', '2026-08-29 14:45:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1356, 'Yu-Gi-Oh!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx481-Qpqy1TQBOxZO.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters centers around the journey of the spirit of an ancient Egyptian pharaoh who is trying to re-discover who he was many years ago, since he has lost his memories. With the help of a boy, Yugi Mutou, the one who awakened the spirit, and his friends, he battles many villains and adversaries. Many of the villains have been linked to the Nameless Pharaoh''s past, due to the Millennium Puzzle he holds and many try to take the puzzle and his power away from him.

The series focuses on the card game aspect of it and the main theme represented throughout the series is friendship.', 'Studio Gallop', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-04-18', 481, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:25:12', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/481-Myzi3sutiRyp.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 224, 84649, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FlZsX0nz1r4', NULL, NULL);
