Released as part of a new cut for the movie''s TV showing on "Premium Saturday".', 'Toei Animation', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-08-20', 106572, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:31:44', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n106572-kY1X9fF5zJZz.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 5431, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7xwxXAk-Kwg', NULL, NULL);
