Note: Initially shown off at the Ito Oogure''s "Oh! Great Exhibition" in 2021.', 'Shaft', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-02-17', 143663, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:39:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/143663-5zG1fa8i2JIx.jpg', 'Mystery, Romance, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', NULL, 1, 4984, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMHtiWvDQxA', '2026-08-29 14:50:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1509, 'Mirai', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100749-7Tptl7EAMAWH.jpg', 'movies', '7.2', 'One day, Kun’s mother brings home a new family member. For the four-year-old boy, joy quickly turns to disappointment when the little sister replaces her brother as the center of attention.  The boy can’t bring himself to accept her as his sister.  But things turn magical when, with a mysterious garden as his gateway, the boy encounters his mother as a little girl and his great-grandfather as a young man, and has a series of surprising adventures with his older sister from the future. These experiences change how he sees the world and help him grow into the big brother he was meant to be.

(Source: GKIDS)', 'Studio Chizu', '2018', 'movie', 'released', '2018-07-20', 100749, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:39:19', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100749-rKmJwrHQj6dC.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 50691, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6d-lsJZgmJs', '2026-08-29 14:51:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1510, 'Magia Record: Puella Magi Madoka Magica Side Story Season 2 -The Eve of Awakening-', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx117002-lpw0Vhtr8f2Q.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'After a daring escape from the Memory Museum, Sayaka Miki returns to Mitakihara City with unsettling news. Troubled by what she has learned, Sayaka reveals to Madoka Kaname and Homura Akemi the whereabouts of Mami Tomoe—but more importantly—the disturbing truth behind the existence of magical girls. Despite knowing the cruel fate that awaits them, the three quickly resolve to work together and save Mami once and for all.

Meanwhile in Kamihama City, Yachiyo Nanami hunts various "rumors" in search of Hotel Fendt Hope, the headquarters for the Wings of Magius. The magical girl organization is Yachiyo''s only lead in finding Iroha Tamaki, whose disappearance remains shrouded in uncertainty. Determined to reunite Team Mikazuki Villa, Yachiyo swears to destroy the Wings of Magius and put a stop to their insidious plans.

Amid the turbulent situations, a calamitous threat approaches, presenting a dire conflict set to jeopardize the entire world.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Shaft', '2021', 'series', 'released', '2021-08-01', 117002, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:39:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/117002-PKPhPRICAxVr.jpg', 'Drama, Mahou Shoujo, Mystery, Psychological, Thriller', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 8, 24468, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rmaanbXKUeA', '2026-08-29 14:51:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1511, 'Free! -Iwatobi Swim Club-', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx18507-RajfCYPpBfT3.png', 'series', '7.2', 'The story revolves around Haruka Nanase, a boy who has always loved to be immersed in water, and to swim in it. Before graduating from elementary school, he participated in a swimming tournament along with his fellow swimming club members, Makoto Tachibana, Nagisa Hazuki, and Rin Matsuoka. After achieving victory, each of the boys went their separate ways.

Time passed, and in the middle of their uneventful high school lives Rin appears and challenges Haruka to a match, showing Haruka his overwhelming power. Not wanting it to end like this, Haruka, gathers together Makoto and Nagisa once again and brings a new member named Rei Ryugazaki to create the Iwatobi High School Swimming Club in order to defeat Rin.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Kyoto Animation', '2013', 'series', 'released', '2013-06-26', 18507, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:39:27', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/18507-2Qs2vdJwjEiP.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 181577, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TuLQDwtBDgc', '2026-08-29 14:51:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1512, 'Rent-a-Girlfriend Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx124410-iScdHzzEqdmk.png', 'series', '6.5', 'A hopeless college student, Kazuya Kinoshita, meets a graceful rental girlfriend, Chizuru Ichinose, and ends up introducing her as 
his girlfriend to his family and friends. Time goes on with Kazuya unable to tell the truth, as he''s surrounded by devilish ex-girlfriend Mami Nanami, who keeps coming back to tempt him for some reason, hyper-aggressive provisional girlfriend Ruka Sarashina, who doesn''t know how to take no for an answer, and super shy but diligent and hardworking younger rental girlfriend, Sumi Sakurasawa… beautiful girlfriends of all types! The pub, the beach, hot springs, Christmas, and New Year’s… Having gone through these challenging events, Kazuya''s feelings for Chizuru keep growing stronger. But she reveals a shocking truth that threatens to shake their "relationship" to the very core!

(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)', 'TMS Entertainment', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-07-02', 124410, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 17:39:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/124410-mo2jQSOaJIeL.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 136516, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q0KAQ7_YNEk', '2026-08-29 14:51:30', NULL);
