Möbius ring

It''s about two psychics, Shizune Seo and Mitsuru Kamekura, who can foresee the future. Shizune was sick of her predictable boring life and Meruka became a professional bomber taking advantage of his supernatural power. When Shizune met Mikiya and when Meruka met Shiki, their immutable future started to change.

Möbius link

Taking place ten years after the events of Kara no Kyoukai, Ryougi Mana, Shiki''s daughter, spends the day with Mitsuru Kamekura.', 'ufotable', '2013', 'movie', 'released', '2013-09-16', 14807, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:34:58', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14807-akf1tV84ANqN.jpg', 'Drama, Mystery, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 35140, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MeCOHBY4WV4', '2026-08-29 14:54:39', NULL);
