Episode 0: Ritsu and Takano used to date back in high school, but broke up due to a misunderstanding. This is that story. 

Episode 12.5: Hatori and Chiaki go to visit the latter''s family. It''s really awkward in many, many ways.', NULL, '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-03-22', 8063, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:04', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Romance', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 2, 9171, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7bqHLU8Ex4E', '2026-08-08 14:32:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1689, 'Sekai Ichi Hatsukoi - The World''s Greatest First Love Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx11123-USoFLDMkQXT2.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Second season of Sekaiichi Hatsukoi.', 'Studio DEEN', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-10-08', 11123, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11123-UfFgH6Cc1nVj.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 21928, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MuH9bZgKEeo', '2026-08-08 14:35:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1690, 'Broken Blade 6', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10092-1uJE0mCGBgNe.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Sixth and final Break Blade movie.', 'Production I.G', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-03-26', 10092, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mecha', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 9861, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTo1qSYN_kw', '2026-08-08 14:35:52', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1691, 'No.6', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10161-iJAey1M4zFrX.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'In a near future world, after the last great war, most of mankind lives in a handful of city states. There, for the privileged elite, life should be perfect. But for young Shion, the only thing perfect has been the nightmare his life has become since letting a strange boy called Rat spend the night in his apartment.

Banished to the outskirts of the city and stripped of all privileges for helping the mysterious stranger who has since disappeared, Shion now finds himself in even worse danger as his inquiry into a new series of mysterious deaths results in his being arrested on suspicion of murder! 

But even as Shion is being sent to the city''s Correctional Institute, the long-missing Rat reappears to rescue him! Now on the run, the two young men have only one chance at survival: uncover the mysterious secrets that lie at the sinister heart of No. 6!

(Source: RightStuf)', 'bones', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-07-08', 10161, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10161-GbnVZzkRxwU2.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 11, 102412, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AmLW04cAjcQ', '2026-08-08 14:35:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1692, 'Tsuritama', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx12883-AjuWBGy1xd4e.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'You can''t catch fish if you don''t go fishing, and you can''t make friends if you don''t at least try.

Which is how relationship-challenged student Yuki finds himself on a fishing trip to a tiny island with three other boys he barely knows. Well, two other boys and Haru, who claims that he''s an alien. Not that constantly stewing Natsuki or mysterious Akira are any more likely as prospects for good companionship. 

But there''s something about fishing that makes it unlike any other pastime, and maybe that quiet sense of companionship and hopeful expectation is just what Yuki needs to start charting the unfamiliar waters of personal connections.  Or maybe it will turn out that Haru''s right and they''re going to have to save the entire planet. 

There are lots of different kinds of fish stories, from the "ones that got away" to the "best catches ever," but whichever way the currents of life take them, for four young men, this trip may turn out to be the biggest whopper ever! 

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'A-1 Pictures', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-04-13', 12883, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12883-EWrrMyoL9Bju.jpg', 'Comedy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 38574, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQBw_XrZWkw', '2026-08-08 14:35:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1693, 'Squid Girl 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10378-hBXI8fXMLBOg.png', 'series', '7.3', 'The nefarious Squid Girl is back to continue her self-appointed mission to invade the surface world. Or that''s what she would do, if she could just stop getting distracted by squidding movies, reading squidly manga, and making friends as only a squid could make them. Squid Girl must overcome not only danger found at every turn, but her own squidly good nature as well.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'TV Tokyo', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-09-27', 10378, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10378-oXjrypPxJZ65.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 24437, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sb9IxIqmKqA', '2026-08-08 14:36:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1694, 'A Letter to Momo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10389-NMYFKRxI1WwJ.png', 'movies', '7.3', 'Momo is a young girl who grew up in a big city. However, following the premature loss of her father, she has to move with her mother to the old family house on a remote island. Here, time seems to have stopped: old wooden buildings, holy shrines surrounded by trees, fields painstakingly carved out from steep hills... and no shopping mall. 

Needless to say, Momo is not too overenthusiastic about this new environment. Most of all, her heart is still feeling uneasy about an unfinished letter left by her father. A letter that contained only two words: "Dear Momo..." 

What was dad going to say? 

One day, exploring the attic of her new big house, Momo finds a dusty and worn out book. And from that moment, something really unexpected starts happening around her... 

(Source: Production I.G Official Website)', 'Production I.G', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-09-10', 10389, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10389-kHDDhvOUNsXm.jpg', 'Drama, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 21743, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p93ArHyvzLw', '2026-08-08 14:35:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1695, 'The Princess and the Pilot', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9000-pjbZ6oEtUACO.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'The war between the Levamme Empire and the Amatsukami Imperium has been raging for years. In the midst of this struggle, the prince of the Levamme Empire declares his love for Juana del Moral and vows to end the war in one year, as part of his marriage proposal. When the Amatsukami catch wind of this, they assault the del Moral residence, targeting Juana''s life. As a last ditch effort to bring the prince his bride, the San Maltilia Airforce hires a mercenary of mixed blood—a bestado—to fly Juana to the Levamme capital in secret. The pilot, Charles, accepts the mission...but traversing an ocean alone, into enemy territory, proves a much more dangerous ordeal than anyone could have anticipated.


(Source: NIS America)', 'MADHOUSE', '2011', 'movie', 'released', '2011-10-01', 9000, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 18794, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SgZ8TB1k0AE', '2026-08-08 14:35:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1696, 'Joshiraku', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12679-b7caRVFG2qkk.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Marii, Kigurumi, Tetora, Gankyou, and Kukuru deserve a round of applause for keeping the art of Rakugo alive! What’s their secret? Witty, absurd banter of course! These five friends always have something to talk about, no matter how silly the topic.

(Source: VRV)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-07-06', 12679, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12679-cXrmdF0XMJC9.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 59513, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DMmKWTZeho4', '2026-08-08 14:35:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1697, 'Carnival Phantasm EX Season', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12187-OBPQmrTNC6eY.png', 'series', '7.3', 'A DVD-only episode bundled with the special edition Take Moon volume. 

Caren Ortensia attempts to control the world using money with varying degrees of success, Phantas-Moon receives a movie adaption of her T.V. show, and Shiki is involved in a love plot that spans years.   

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Lerche', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-11-26', 12187, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 14528, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jMoyJZaZFe4', '2026-08-08 14:35:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1698, 'Nura: Rise of the Yokai Clan OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/15959.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'The story begins at about 100 years after the disappearance of Otome Yamabuki, Rihan Nura''s first wife. Rihan has finally pulled himself together and his life returns to normal. As the head of the Nura Clan, he''s busy working on building a harmonious world for humans and youkais. One day, he sees Setsura being upset so he decides to cheer her up by taking the clan to go enjoy the hot spring where Setsura makes up her mind to tell Rihan that she met Otome once after she left him about 100 years ago. She tells him the message that Otome left for him and the truth is...? 

(Source: Mangahere.com)', 'Studio DEEN', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-12-04', 15959, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 2, 5384, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hq4JHF8Ix6o', '2026-08-08 14:35:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1699, 'Blue Exorcist: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx11737-49ya7CBO5wEq.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'The atmosphere in True Cross Academy is lively and boisterous in the days leading up to the grand festival held once every 11 years. During this time, Okumura Rin is entrusted with the responsibility of suppressing the berserk Phantom Train. In the midst of his mission, he meets a devil whose appearance is that of a young boy.


(Source: Official Site)', 'Aniplex', '2012', 'movie', 'released', '2012-12-28', 11737, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n11737-34qhsBR8V3Bc.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 54245, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0O7b4nTRy2A', '2026-08-08 14:35:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1700, 'You and Me.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10460-qvyyqn5teodZ.png', 'series', '7.3', 'The story revolves around four teens &mdash; the good-looking twins Yuuta and Yuuki Asaba, the effeminate Shun Matsuoka, and the class head Kaname Tsukahara &mdash; who have known each other since early childhood. While they are not necessarily good or bad friends, they continue to hang out well into high school. The half-Japanese transfer student Chizuru Tachibana joins the circle of friends in this comedy about the everyday life of adolescence.', 'J.C.STAFF', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-10-04', 10460, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n10460-xJQZzG9McM4g.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 38769, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m1f6AHbmrik', '2026-08-08 14:35:25', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1701, 'Tamayura: Hitotose', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10232-inIllgXxoMqC.png', 'series', '7.3', 'As a little girl, Fuu Sawatari’s father taught her to love photography. They took pictures everywhere they went. But after he passed away, seeing those photographs only served as a reminder of her loss, so she locked them away to be forgotten. Years later, her brother Kou finds their father’s picture album, and as he flips through its pages, the pictures remind Fuu of all the happy memories of her father that she will carry with her forever.

Now, as the shy Fuu enters her first year of high school, she once again takes up her father’s old camera, determined to take wonderful pictures that will bring joy and happiness to others.

(Source: Nozomi Entertainment)', 'TYO Animations', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-10-03', 10232, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10232-CEe4TrbTWT9G.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 14274, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HwBqpXFCCNw', '2026-08-08 14:35:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1702, 'Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei: Nyankin no Kirisuto', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10469-P6NBmFvu387u.png', 'series', '7.3', 'A new special episode that was distributed to those who purchase all three Blu-ray box sets of Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei series on January 31, 2012.', 'Shaft', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-01-31', 10469, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10469-IkO6zOQBUCD2.jpg', 'Comedy', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 7007, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcEwqb4c-1Q', '2026-08-08 14:35:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1703, 'Tamayura: hitotose - Attakai Kaze no Omoide Nanode', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx11793-MCmYBx0Qn4Wv.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Extra episode on the 7th volume of the DVDs and BDs. The episode was aired on AT-X on 05 May 2012.', 'TYO Animations', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-05-05', 11793, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11793-R50WfZwzrCNv.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 3488, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nSCTDc2zFKg', '2026-08-08 14:35:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1704, 'Persona 4 the Animation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10588-44oPKE7GRXA2.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Persona 4 takes place in a rural town named Inaba. There have been mysterious murders occurring whenever there was fog after heavy rain. There were also rumors about a channel on television airing only at midnight called Mayonaka TV, during which it is said that one can see his/her "other half" when staring at the TV screen. 


After hearing about a recent unsolved murder which occurred during the fog, the characters—Narukami, Chie, and Yosuke—discuss how each of them had attempted to watch the mysterious TV channel and witnessed the murder victim. The protagonist later realizes that during midnight when the channel is on, his body can phase into his television set as a gateway to enter another world infested with shadows. 


After discovering this, they all decide to explore. When first completely entering the world, dazed and confused, Narukami meets Teddie. Mayonaka TV and the town murders seem to have a connection. The murder victims may be merely victims of Mayonaka TV. Everyone decides that they will together try to solve the mysterious murders by exploring the hidden world of Mayonaka TV.', 'Aniplex', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-10-07', 10588, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10588-uFzRyGezrWji.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 58000, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BnrWjXVqV2M', '2026-08-08 14:35:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1705, 'Maid-Sama! It''s an extra!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9366-R2IiAvs2YmZG.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Extra episode included in Blu-ray and DVD volume 10, entitled "Omake dayo (It''s an extra!)".', 'J.C.STAFF', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-05-11', 9366, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n9366-fapRtNBBZoEx.jpg', 'Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 30057, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jjtkKbGS3tE', '2026-08-08 14:35:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1706, 'Nichijou - My Ordinary Life: Episode 0', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8857-01xiQMzQWKxU.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'While the title suggests a story of simple, everyday school life, the contents are more the opposite. The setting is a strange school where you may see the principal wrestle a deer or a robot''s arm hide a rollcake. However there are still normal stories, like making a card castle or taking a test you didn''t study for.', 'Kyoto Animation', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-03-12', 8857, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 28545, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yai5PC4cQro', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1707, 'Polar Bear''s Café', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/12815.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Shirokuma Cafe revolves around a Canadian white bear that quits his boring job and starts a cafeteria near a zoo. He loves telling tall tales and always brags about himself. According to him, he was picked up by a human couple who owns a diner while he was drifting around on an iceberg. 

Though he has lost all contact with his Canadian family, he has discovered a new home in serving the diners'' clientele, thanks to the kind couple. His caf&eacute; is an embodiment of his personality. The place is always packed with many regulars, animals and humans, who are drawn by his charismatic magnetism. 

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Studio Pierrot', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-04-05', 12815, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n12815-X8SIFF7sQEVi.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 21806, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GDUu9YROiE8', '2026-08-08 14:35:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1708, 'The Idolm@ster: 765 Pro to Iu Monogatari', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx11889-AVynVKzkGiiZ.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'An unaired episode included with the volume 9 Blu-ray.', 'Aniplex', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-06-17', 11889, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Music, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 8742, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1FrmazZtClo', '2026-08-08 14:35:39', NULL);
