2. February 10: Anywhere Bicycle / February 11: The Tortoise and the Hare

3. June 6: Red Thread / June 7: Deeper Meaning', 'Shaft', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-03-25', 6984, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6984-xIzUdaN9HT4p.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 3, 6581, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2bZ6mF3bWw', '2026-08-08 14:41:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1763, 'Darker than Black: Origins', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7338-c6Uq5DmlEPVs.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Tells the story of what happened to Yin and Hei between the first and second series.', 'bones', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-01-27', 7338, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7338-rV4LzQxXwSXn.jpg', 'Action, Mystery, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 4, 44607, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=upx-_9-RjoE', '2026-08-08 14:41:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1764, 'Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b6171-DO60x2e7jEjg.png', 'series', '7.6', 'A Holy War, from ancient mythology, where the Goddess Athena and Hades have fought against each other while defending the earth repeatedly over the span of 200 years. The story takes place in 18th century Europe, 243 years prior to the original "Saint Seiya" Three small children, Tenma, Alone, and Sasha have all shared a very happy childhood together. Tenma who is quite aggressive but upstanding has moved to Sanctuary to become a saint. It is there that he is reunited with Sasha who is the sister of Alone and learns that she is the reincarnation of Goddess Athena. Alone, who is kind, gentle and loves painting was chosen for the body of enemy King Hades. Tenma eventually becomes a saint of Pegasus and engages in a fierce battle with his best friend Alone, the King of Hades. Pegasus Tenma, King Hades, and the Goddess Athena and through the twist of their 3 fates merge together which unfolds a prologue to the original Saint Seiya.

(Source: TMS Entertaiment)', 'TMS Entertainment', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-06-24', 6171, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6171-07w19HUiDuFM.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 13, 19454, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PJfrA7gazpU', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1765, 'Welcome to Irabu''s Office', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx6774-9yybYg3VePJU.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Many patients with different problems visit the psychiatric ward of Irabu General Hospital; a trapeze artist suffering from insomnia after suddenly failing his jumps, a gangster afraid of knives and sharp objects and a business man who has an erection 24 hours a day. They undergo counseling by Dr. Ichiro Irabu, who is the child-like son of the hospital director. His assistant is the sullen faced sexy nurse Mayumi. With his mysterious injections, and advice that does not make sense, Dr. Irabu confuses his patients. But at the end of his unique treatments, the patients are led to digging further into their souls to find peace of mind.

(Source: fujicreative.co.jp)', 'Toei Animation', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-15', 6774, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6774-qsd4lXiBryY0.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Psychological', 'TV', 'FALL', 11, 27617, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hMmBSCQs1H4', '2026-08-08 14:40:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1766, 'Zan Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei Bangaichi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7044-tFcFVLq3OXWv.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Despair follows Nozomu through a zombie invasion of bad ideas, the way people laugh at things they don''t understand, going with the flow, and more in this sequel to Zan Sayonara Zetsubou-sensei. Also continues the use of numerous puns, inside jokes, and discussions through background text and signs.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Shaft', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-11-17', 7044, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7044-kH3ZK7HSIySz.jpg', 'Comedy', 'OVA', 'FALL', 2, 11389, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcEwqb4c-1Q', '2026-08-08 14:41:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1767, 'Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha: The Movie 1st', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4985-3eEPbpZiMWKB.png', 'movies', '7.6', 'The movie is based on the first season''s story but features new battle animations and a new transformation sequence.', 'Aniplex', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-01-23', 4985, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 9270, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oEncRHPGuXI', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1768, 'Kobato', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5678-yqeedxnJLoT8.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Sweet and na&iuml;ve Hanato Kobato came to Earth on a mission to collect and fill a bottle with ''konpeito,'' which appear after healing a person''s heart that is suffering. Kobato collects these because it is her wish to go to a certain place. Despite her strangeness, Kobato turns out to be well-suited for this mission as her heartfelt sincerity in helping others earns her the love and admiration of everyone she meets. However, she is not allowed to fall in love with anyone whose heart she heals.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'MADHOUSE', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-06', 5678, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5678-EgfgEOrgETII.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 34572, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_fD6NEi_Czo', '2026-08-08 14:41:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1769, 'Yumeiro Patissiere', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6586.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Middle schooler Ichigo Amano has never excelled at anything (other than eating cakes, of course), but a chance encounter with famed pâtissier Henri Lucas changes everything! Henri immediately recognizes Ichigo’s extraordinary palate, offering her a spot at the prestigious pastry school known as St. Marie Academy. There Ichigo meets the Sweet Princes and their fairy guardians, the Sweets Spirits — and together they are determined to become the most acclaimed pastry chefs around!

(Source: Maiden Japan)', 'Studio Pierrot', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-04', 6586, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6586-QqgNwMApqqX5.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 50, 17543, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w3jj2clV_Js', '2026-08-08 14:41:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1770, 'Arakawa Under the Bridge x Bridge', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9074-5T2wyJAGyQXw.png', 'series', '7.5', 'In the dry riverbed of Arakawa River, undefeated elite Ichinomiya Kou (aka Ric) met the lovely homeless girl Nino, a self-declared Venusian. Their awkward love stirs up trouble among the other strange inhabitants of the riverbed.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Shaft', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-04', 9074, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n9074-Y9rbFoz3hAs3.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 33316, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=al_MIXJDQJE', '2026-08-08 14:40:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1771, 'Macross Frontier: The False Songstress', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5310-XvFJTkCobkvk.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', 'Half retelling of the original Frontier series, half new story. Conspiracies arise within the Frontier government when Sheryl Nome arrives to the colonial fleet for her concert and is soon marked as a spy for Galaxy while childhood friends, Alto Saotome and Ranka Lee both try to achieve their dreams as the battle between Frontier and the Vajra draws closer.


This movie serves as part one of the Frontier retelling and will conclude with the second, The Wings of Goodbye.', 'Satelight', '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-11-21', 5310, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5310-By0bmd0ro8pB.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 8353, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y6fnfv_MB3Q', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1772, 'Phantom: Requiem for the Phantom', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5682-13S0UNmJInAE.png', 'series', '7.5', 'A young man wakes up in a strange room with no memory of who he is or how he got there. His past is lost—and his future belongs to Inferno, a violent crime syndicate. They give him a new name—Zwei—and team him with their top assassin, the enigmatic Ein. She’ll teach Zwei all he needs to know about his new life as an Inferno operative, starting with lesson number one: kill or be killed.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Bee Train', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-03', 5682, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5682-a82hdGCnapUe.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 61495, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4omZ0Hkn1lU', '2026-08-08 14:40:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1773, 'Durarara!! Specials', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8408-ty3umDE46vVK.png', 'series', '7.5', 'Two extra DVD episodes of Durarara!!

Episode 12.5

Happens between episodes 12 and 13. A UFO is supposedly spotted in Ikebukuro, but what is it really?

Episode 25

Happens after episode 24, the final episode. Shizuo''s brother hosts a TV special downtown, but his life is apparently in danger.', 'Brain''s Base', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-08-25', 8408, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n8408-QGzgRIr6s4z2.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 2, 33861, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v8cqCapgcaQ', '2026-08-08 14:40:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1774, 'Maria Watches Over Us 4th Season', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx3750-ZKLLtu5mq9Wd.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'The fourth season of Maria-sama ga Miteru.

Life for the young women at Lillian Girls’ Academy couldn’t be more exciting! The Yamayuri Council is working on a theater production with the all-boys Hanadera Academy, and the school festival is quickly approaching. But Yumi’s duties pale in comparison to the task assigned to her by Sachiko: choosing someone as a petite soeur! Will she be able to handle the pressure of such a monumental decision, or will Yumi crumble under the weight of the Council’s — and Sachiko’s — expectations?

(Source: Maiden Japan)', 'Studio DEEN', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-01-03', 3750, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n3750-E3GC8f2FtLvM.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 5113, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vxxO7UnLUzQ', '2026-08-08 14:40:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1775, 'House of Five Leaves', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx7588-iXCwrmgHGJbd.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'Masterless samurai Akitsu Masanosuke is a skilled and loyal swordsman, but his naïve, diffident nature has more than once caused him to be let go by the lords who employ him. Hungry and desperate, he agrees to become a bodyguard for Yaichi, the charismatic leader of a group calling itself “Five Leaves.” Although disturbed by the gang’s sinister activities, Masa begins to suspect that Yaichi’s motivations are not what they seem. And despite his misgivings, the deeper he’s drawn into the world of the Five Leaves, the more he finds himself fascinated by these devious, mysterious outlaws.

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'Manglobe', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-16', 7588, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7588-8MeRXtXObuZT.png', 'Drama, Mystery', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 26631, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tdyiHmINg1s', '2026-08-08 14:40:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1776, 'Shiki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7724-NwNnRsI34eDa.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'During a fiercely hot summer in Sotoba, a peaceful and quiet village with a population of 1300 people, a series of bizarre deaths begin to occur. At the same time, a strange family moves into a long abandoned mansion in the region. After supposedly visiting this strange family, the fashionable Shimizu Megumi goes missing and the entire village goes out in search for her.', 'Aniplex', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-09', 7724, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7724.jpg', 'Horror, Mystery, Supernatural, Thriller', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 22, 129188, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c8_BBZDCFhc', '2026-08-08 14:40:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1777, 'Broken Blade 4', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b9465-emIVntmibiti.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', 'Fourth Break Blade Movie.', 'Production I.G', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-10-30', 9465, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mecha', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 10229, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTo1qSYN_kw', '2026-08-08 14:39:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1778, 'Nodame Cantabile Finale Special', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx8038-b8K9nnetX8Xx.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'DVD special episode taking place before Episode 1 of Finale that focuses on Miki Kiyora making it to the final round of a competition in Paris.

(Source: Wiki)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-07', 8038, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n8038-YkE7Rq6jmgXM.jpg', 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 9556, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_uiAXKql0Nw', '2026-08-08 14:39:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1779, 'Clannad: Another World, Kyou Chapter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6351.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'Included in the 8th and final DVD of Clannad ~After Story~ is an extra episode set in an alternate universe. Here, Fujibayashi Kyou is the main heroine in place of Furukawa Nagisa.


Love can be wonderfully exciting, but also extremely painful. Fujibayashi Ryou, Kyou''s sister, is in love with Okazaki Tomoya, the male protagonist. With the help of Kyou, Ryou manages to sum up the courage to ask him out and now Tomoya and Ryou are a couple. However, as things progress, Kyou begins to acknowledge her feelings for Tomoya, and a love-triangle is formed.


As everything is revealed, the sisters learn the pains of love and try to decide between the two loves of their life: Tomoya, or each other.


[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'Kyoto Animation', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-07-01', 6351, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6351-R7cIGGQDNUvR.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 56218, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IecYMqp1N4k', '2026-08-08 14:39:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1780, 'Colorful ~ The Motion Picture', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8142-C8NvVbzJz7hN.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', '"I" died and was kicked out of the cycle of reincarnation because of the sin "I" committed. An angel told me that "I" won a lottery and he gave me a chance to remember the sin. My spirit possessed the body of the 14-year-old boy Makoto, who committed suicide and "I" tried to recollect my memory. "I" felt distressed by the terrible circumstances of Makoto and the fact that "I" was borrowing his body. "I" have started to realize that people are hurting each other because the world is too colorful to distinguish the true color of themselves from others.

Based on an award-winning first person narrative novel by Mori Eto. The movie won several awards in Japan.', 'Sunrise', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-08-21', 8142, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8142-6OpPG0lnoN4P.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 54252, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_1XZwy6mqHw', '2026-08-08 14:39:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1781, 'A Certain Scientific Railgun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6213-QtrlDQnexApL.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'Academy City is a highly developed place in terms of technology. It is said to be 20 to 30 years ahead of the rest of the world, and 80% of its 2.3 million residents are students. The focus of studies here is directed towards esper powers. Misaka Mikoto, one of the top level espers in town, shares a room with Kuroko Shirai, another high level esper who is a member of Judgement, a law enforcing agency composed of students. Both attend Tokiwadai, a private school reserved for the high-leveled and the rich. Kuroko''s partner at Judgement, Kazari Uiharu, is a low level esper who studies at Sakugawa middle school. Her best friend and classmate there is Ruiko Saten, a level zero, one who has no esper powers. Together, the four encounter several adventures in the exciting scientific town. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-03', 6213, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6213-utGqTxmP6U2F.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 154044, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rIDa2o3bGlY', '2026-08-08 14:39:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1782, 'Valkyria Chronicles', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx5507-t2Y938ikcLBa.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'Valkyria Chronicles is set in a fictitious continent reminiscent of 1930s Europe. The continent, called Europa, is divided into two main powers: The Imperial Empire, a monarchy in the east, and the alliance of democracies called the Federation in the west. In this world, there is a very important resource called ragnite; its uses range from fueling weapons of war to use in medical treatments. Since ragnite is such an important resource, the Federation and the Empire are constantly at war with each other for it.

The story takes place in the neutral country of Gallia, known for its bountiful reserves of ragnite, when the Empire decides to invade and seize the ragnite for themselves. The story follows Welkin, the son of a former war hero; Isara, Welkin''s Darcsen adoptive sister; and Alicia, a member of the Bruhl town watch, as they fight the Imperials in the ragtag Gallian militia group, Squad 7.

Squad 7 fights to regain their homes and livelihoods with Welkin as the squad leader and commander of the Edelweiss tank; Alicia as a scout; Isara as the pilot of the Edelweiss, and a variety of colorful individuals.', 'A-1 Pictures', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-05', 5507, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n5507-yflTeO77rItG.jpg', 'Action, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 23485, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uiRAzl5Q3Ko', '2026-08-08 14:39:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1783, 'Strawberry Marshmallow Encore', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4811-7mizpFG0hlcv.png', 'series', '7.4', 'A two-episode continuation of the previous OVA. Miu hits her head and transcends to heaven to cause a ruckus, followed by a school trip to paint in a park and contemplations of their friendships, as well as prediction of how the girls will turn out in Junior High.', 'Daume', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-01-23', 4811, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4811-DQoELi4OE4Ta.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 2, 7435, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vwx8MwaVhKI', '2026-08-08 14:39:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1784, 'FINAL FANTASY VII: ADVENT CHILDREN COMPLETE', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2952-9uRKqLWuET33.png', 'movies', '7.4', 'AC: Complete contains a considerable amount of new footage that the original version lacks, as well as roughly a thousand revised scenes. This adds a total of 26 minutes to the film.

Some of the new scenes include a more in-depth look at the Geostigma, Denzel and Kadaj''s origins, as well as an extended fight between Cloud and Sephiroth.

The Japanese release of this edition features a new ending track from Kyosuke Himuro called "Safe and Sound", with additional lyrics from My Chemical Romance frontman Gerard Way. The track replaces Himuro''s previous track "Calling" from the original cut of the film. However, in the North American release, the song "Calling" remains, and "Safe and Sound" is absent. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-04-16', 2952, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2952-VWWXPnUWPciQ.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 18186, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tvAa9TpPE1w', '2026-08-08 14:39:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1785, 'Letter Bee Reverse', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/8311.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'After Niche carries the wounded and stunned Lag back to the Bee Hive, the Letter Bee finally begins to piece the puzzle together. Now he knows what''s happened to Gauche, why the Marauders are so focused on stealing mail and the actual intent of the group controlling both, Reverse. However, when he''s forbidden to reveal the truth, Lag is soon forced out of the artificial sunlight and back into the world of perpetual night. And soon Reverse''s plot to take down the Letter Bees and overthrow the Amberground government begins to accelerate. If things weren''t already bad enough, the giant insect creatures called gaichuu are apparently evolving into something new; there may be traitors working within the Hive; and Niche''s sister, who''s definitely not human friendly, shows up to turn family drama into a full-scale siege! It all spells serious trouble for the Letter Bees, but if anyone can weather the storms and gloom of night, Lag and his team are the ones who''ll deliver.

(Source: FUNimation)', 'Studio Pierrot', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-03', 8311, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 11093, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T3pZaTEEDuA', '2026-08-08 14:39:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1786, 'Chi''s Sweet Home - Chi''s New Address', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6024-eYiQMRfPfWiF.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Chi is still living with the Yamada family, but they decide it isn''t fair to force her to hide indoors in their "no pets allowed" apartment. So they decide there is only one thing to be done, Chi must move away for her own happiness.', 'MADHOUSE', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-03-30', 6024, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV_SHORT', 'SPRING', 104, 5538, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i4bqN3FouYA', '2026-08-08 14:39:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1787, 'Wagnaria!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6956-Nxs7H25yHLNS.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Set in a family restaurant in Hokkaido, the northern prefecture of Japan, 16-year-old high school student Souta Takanashi works part-time along with his strange co-workers: Popura Taneshima, a high school girl who''s a year older than Souta, yet easily mistaken for an elementary/middle schooler, and Kyoko Shirafuji, the 28-year-old store manager who doesn''t bother to do any work at all. 

(Source: NIS America)', 'Aniplex', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-04', 6956, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6956-V7ovHknjKRlc.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 13, 91978, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bYp1SFD6SsQ', '2026-08-08 14:39:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1788, 'Hayate the Combat Butler!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b4192-em3eAtYfkz5L.png', 'series', '7.4', 'The second season of Hayate no Gotoku!.

Ever since he first met Nagi Sanzenin, Hayate Ayasaki''s life has become increasingly more crazed and chaotic. Which is a bit of a problem, since, as the eccentric heiress'' butler/personal bodyguard, he''s theoretically supposed to be a stabilizing and protective influence. Unfortunately, Nagi and her friends attract trouble the way dropped lollipops attract dirt, and if Hayate has to take a couple of nasty licks along the way, that''s just part of the job. The real sucker punch, though, is that Nagi''s increasing attraction to Hayate himself is getting precariously close to transforming their professional relationship into something far less professional and much more like a relationship. Is Hayate up for the emotional perils of a round of "upstairs, downstairs"? Or will the purely physical dangers of life on Her Majesty''s Domestic Service do him in first?

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-04', 4192, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4192-Q4N8THD5MCAy.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 20893, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=le9VbvjsZ0g', '2026-08-08 14:39:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1789, 'Broken Blade 3', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9252-DaJ0C9Bwucr9.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'Third Break Blade movie.', 'Production I.G', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-09-25', 9252, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mecha', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 10537, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTo1qSYN_kw', '2026-08-08 14:39:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1790, 'Mazinger Edition Z: The Impact!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5485-yUlFXxKGLZUZ.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Set in the near future, humanity enters another energy revolution following the discovery of Photon Power. Derived from the ore discovered under the foothills of Mt. Fuji, its intended use was to solve the world''s energy problems with its unimaginable power. Seeking this energy is Dr. Hell, a madman craving world domination who with his subordinates Baron Ashura, Count Brocken and Viscount Pygman, commands an army of mechanical beasts excavated from the ruins of ancient Greece to seize the Photon Power Lab for himself. Meeting the attack head on is the hot-blooded teenager Kabuto Kouji, who pilots the Photon Powered robot built by his grandfather, Mazinger Z. But in this battle between Dr. Hell and the Kabuto family, many legends surrounding the Mycenaean Civilization and Bardos Island, as well as the secrets of Mazinger Z remain shrouded in mystery.


A new series based on the mecha show that started it all, Mazinger Z. Shin Mazinger Shougeki! Z-Hen starts over from the beginning with a new cast, to tell a new story unrelated to the original show.


(Source: shin-mazinger.com)', 'Bee Media', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-04', 5485, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Mecha', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 5207, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xPaglCMvDes', '2026-08-08 14:39:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1791, 'Sound of the Sky', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6802-MmsfM8KAgZuR.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'In a lonely corner of the world, on the edge of No Man&rsquo;s Land, sits Clocktower Fortress. It&rsquo;s home to the 1121st Platoon of the Helvetian Army, and their newest member is a 15-year-old volunteer named Kanata Sorami, who enlisted to learn how to play the bugle. When she was a child, Kanata was saved by a beautiful soldier and found inspiration in the clear, golden sound of her trumpet. From that day forward, Kanata decided music would be her life. 

As the other platoon members train her how to be a bugler and a soldier, Kanata''s enduring optimism will inspire them to look for happiness and beauty, even in a world haunted by war.

(Source: Right Stuf, Inc.)', 'Aniplex', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-01-05', 6802, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6802-6fhoYM8iGJsL.jpg', 'Music, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 47202, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KoqptivRx_0', '2026-08-08 14:40:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1792, 'The World God Only Knows', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8525-chaE9kM2x0w4.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Keima is a dating sim champion. Cute girls are rendered powerless by his irresistible game playing techniques. Too bad things aren''t that way in the real world. That is, until his tempting game playing causes a real live&mdash;and very bubbly-cute&mdash;demon hunter named Elsie to materialize! Now Elsie wants Keima to help her free hot girls from sneaky demons who secretly possess them. 

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'TV Tokyo', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-07', 8525, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8525-adOMqsr1Thrs.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 133797, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OdBmj4TWqzk', '2026-08-08 14:40:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1793, 'And Yet The Town Moves', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8726-PX1AiBJxOzyo.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Hotori Arashiyama loves mysteries, but there''s one she just can''t solve: why does the solution to one problem inevitably seem to lead to another? Like how when Hotori has to start working at the Seaside Maid Cafe after school to pay off a debt and her friend Toshiko fortunately knows exactly how a Maid Cafe should be run. Which is fortunate since Hotori has no clue. Except that, unfortunately, Toshiko has no interest in working at the cafe - until she discovers that Hotori''s childhood friend Hiroyuki is a regular. Which SEEMS fortunate. Except that Hotori doesn''t know that, while Toshiko likes Hiroyuki, Hiroyuki secretly likes Hotori, while Hotori secretly has a crush on... No, no more spoilers! 

But if that''s not enough drama, there''s work, angst with a certain math teacher, table tennis between her classmates, her younger brother versus the school''s bad girl... And yet, even though everything seems like it''s going to crash at any moment, somehow Hotori''s life keeps going hilariously forward. 

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Shaft', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-08', 8726, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8726-JZ9aVlxAQERm.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 23340, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5S69WIdpPc4', '2026-08-08 14:40:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1794, 'Eden of the East', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5630-l1YM9YDO8tpt.png', 'series', '7.4', 'On November 22, 2010 ten missiles strike Japan. However, this unprecedented terrorist act, later to be known as "Careless Monday," does not result in any apparent victims, and is soon forgotten by almost everyone. Then, 3 months later... Saki Morimi is a young woman currently in the United States of America on her graduation trip. But just when she is in front of the White House, Washington DC, she gets into trouble, and only the unexpected intervention of one of her fellow countrymen saves her. However, this man, who introduces himself as Akira Takizawa, is a complete mystery. He appears to have lost his memory, is stark naked, except for the gun he holds in one hand, and the mobile phone he''s holding in the other. A phone that is charged with 8,200,000,000 yen in digital cash.

(Source: Production I.G website)', 'Production I.G', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-10', 5630, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5630-YgD37IwSdKlc.jpg', 'Drama, Mystery, Psychological, Romance, Sci-Fi, Thriller', 'TV', 'SPRING', 11, 110734, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3hiWvHuIGhQ', '2026-08-08 14:41:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1795, 'Arakawa Under the Bridge', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7647-NQEKHruZT5ch.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Ko Ichinomiya''s family motto is "Never be indebted to anyone," but after losing his pants and falling into the Arakawa River, he quickly finds himself in debt to his savior, the cutely insane Nino (who happens to live under the bridge). To repay her, he vows to help her with her desire to "experience love." Along the way he''ll meet the river''s other residents, including a hot-blooded kappa, a Sister in drag, and a literal rock star. Sorry, Ko—when you fell into that river, I guess you really got in over your head! 


(Source: NIS America)', 'Shaft', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-05', 7647, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7647-sq4QqwtIjEF1.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 13, 75725, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sqeoy8k6sco', '2026-08-08 14:38:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1796, 'Sound of the Sky OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8197-UYNfrJE3QKQO.png', 'series', '7.4', 'According to the official website, two extra episodes will be included in the Blu-ray and DVD volumes 4 and 7 of "Sora no Woto". The volumes 4 and 7 will be released on June 23rd (episode 7.5) and September 22nd (episode 13), respectively.', 'Aniplex', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-06-23', 8197, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:13', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8197-cgyJpYAANd1M.jpg', 'Music, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 2, 9060, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TmQNuivHLVM', '2026-08-08 14:39:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1797, 'Broken Blade 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b8514-0BU3SXOW84hG.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Second Break Blade movie.', 'Production I.G', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-06-26', 8514, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mecha', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 11077, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTo1qSYN_kw', '2026-08-08 14:41:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1798, 'No Longer Human', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/7651.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'A theatrical film version of Madhouse''s Aoi Bungaku Series anime. The film will re-edit the four episodes based on Osamu Dazai''s No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) novel, which have character designs inspired by manga artist and novel illustrator Takeshi Obata. This "director''s cut" will include new "navigation" footage which is being created specifically for the film with narrator Masato Sakai.', 'MADHOUSE', '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-12-12', 7651, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Psychological', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 7231, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JSK5VkYvQOo', '2026-08-08 14:41:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1799, 'Tentai Senshi Sunred 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6582.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'The second season of Tentai Senshi Sunred.', 'AIC A.S.T.A.', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-03', 6582, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV_SHORT', 'FALL', 26, 1892, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7aErITgfedM', '2026-08-08 14:41:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1800, 'Nura: Rise of the Yokai Clan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7592-28Qy7SBbSquT.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Rikuo Nura appears to be an average middle school student. No one knows that he comes home every day to a house full of youkai, nor that he transforms into the all-powerful leader of these spirits at night. However, much to the disappointment of many, Rikuo is determined to live as normal a life as possible.', 'Studio DEEN', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-06', 7592, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7592-wwjLCtVIGpF4.jpg', 'Action, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 24, 50946, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAuBp_BzXPY', '2026-08-08 14:41:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1801, 'Blue Literature Series', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7193-gC4ULfgsznxh.png', 'series', '7.3', 'The series consists of adaptations of six modern classics of Japanese literature: Osamu Dazai&rsquo;s No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) & Run Melos! (Hashire Melos!), Natsume Soseki&rsquo;s Kokoro, Ryunosuke Akutagawa&rsquo;s Hell Screen (Jigoku Hen) & The Spider''s Thread (Kumo no Ito), and Ango Sakaguchi''s In the Forest, Under Cherries in Full Bloom (Sakura no Mori no Mankai no Shita).

No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) - A high school student becomes lost and alienated. Despondent and aimless, he falls into a cycle of self abuse, depression and drugs that taints his life for years. Told in three chapters, each chapter deals with a different point in his life and the final chapter leaves him standing alone - an empty and hollow charicature of his former self.

In the Forest, Under Cherries in Full Bloom (Sakura no Mori no Mankai no Shita) - A love story between a 12th-century woman and a mountain bandit who abducts her.

Kokoro - A 1914 tale of a young man''s life journey during the Meiji era. The work deals with the transition from the Japanese Meiji society to the modern era, by exploring the friendship between a young man and an older man he calls "Sensei". It continues the theme of isolation developed in Soseki''s previous works, here in the context of interwoven strands of egoism and guilt, as opposed to shame.

Run Melos! (Hashire Melos!) - An updated retelling of a classic Greek tale of the story of Damon and Pythias. The most prominent theme of "Run Melos!" is unwavering friendship. Despite facing hardships, the protagonist Melos does his best to save his friend''s life, and in the end his efforts are rewarded.

The Spider''s Thread (Kumo no Ito) - The Buddha Shakyamuni chances to notice a cold-hearted criminal suffering in Hell. But this criminal did perform one single act of kindness in not stepping on a spider in a forest. Moved by this selfless act, Shakyamuni takes the silvery thread of a spider in Paradise and lowers it down into Hell, but it falls upon the criminal to seize the opportunity and pull himself out - if he can.

Hell Screen (Jigoku Hen) - A famous artist is commissioned by a great lord to create a series of paintings depicting scenes of the ''Buddhist Hell''. The artist is unable to paint scenes that he has not seen himself, prompting him to torture and torment the Lord''s staff to create his imagined images of hell. His creative efforts taint the household, as the story descends into madness and destruction.

(Source: AniDB)', 'MADHOUSE', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-11', 7193, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7193-vh46utU8WjIJ.jpg', 'Drama, Psychological, Romance, Thriller', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 49800, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6Ya9YYPPHIo', '2026-08-08 14:41:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1802, 'Minami-ke: Okaeri', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5162-5UFIak1E0jvL.png', 'series', '7.3', 'A year has passed since "Okawari" and the 3 sisters have grown up. Their likings and mods are almost the same, Haruka the older sister is a love-giving mother to the younger sisters, but she''s also a discipline follower, Kana the middle one leaves everything to the last possible moment and always gives trouble to this trio, and Chiaki the little one is the calculating and manipulating one, she likes to be admired and loved by Haruka and always gives trouble to the less blessed Kana. An unbalanced family, but besides of that they love each other with their whole heart. This family''s daily life is as funny as ever, trouble and love is always present, now its time to see if they''ll survive this age change since Haruka is now a Young adult and she has even more responsabilities while having to watch over the younger while integrating to the adult life.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Asread', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-01-05', 5162, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 13511, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1aZonVVfuyI', '2026-08-08 14:41:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1803, 'Yondemasu yo, Azazel-san.', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7762-1UhSLygPfTdA.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'The great detective Akutabe has an assistant, Rinko Sakuma, who is trying to learn to summon demons. This is the story of her misadventure when she actually manages to summon 2 demons unexpectedly.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Production I.G', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-02-23', 7762, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 4, 7415, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_czcGGY0Qg', '2026-08-08 14:41:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1804, 'Jewelpet Twinkle☆', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8217-0AdC5k7zWMwu.png', 'series', '7.3', 'In Jewel Land, Jewelpets, creatures who has the natural ability to use magic lived in harmony with the Witches, attending the School of Witchcraft and Wizardry to learn to use magic with their Jewel Eyes. However for Ruby, a white Japanese Hare whose magic sometimes fail, is appointed to go to the Human World to search for her partner. But when she used the card the magicians gave her, she was sent to the Human World by accident. In the Human World, A girl named Akari Sakura met her on the beach on her way to school. At first, Akari can''t understand her due to her Jewel Land Language until Ruby took a special candy so she could speak and understand human language. As the day passes, Ruby knew about her problems and later apologized. A Jewel Charm appeared on Akari''s hand and she realized it that she''s chosen by Ruby to be her partner. After that, she decided to enter the Jewel Star Grand Prix, on the prize is that any wish that they wanted will be granted. Will she be the Next Jewel Star and her wish be granted in the end? Or I''ll just end in one big disaster... 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio Comet', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-03', 8217, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8217-CNQfyzZKZ3oa.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 3746, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aNQxYCvimVQ', '2026-08-08 14:41:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1805, 'Seitokai Yakuindomo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8675-5H2QSLvXA7bH.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Tsuda Takatoshi is about to begin his first year in Ousai Academy.  His decision to enter Ousai was based upon it being close to his home and he paid no heed to the fact he''d be among the first boys to enter the recently gender-integrated school.

On his first trip to school, Takatoshi is surrounded by girls; the train has nothing but girls, the walk to school has nothing but girls and once he finally arrives he is approached by a group of girls and summarily appointed vice-president of the student council and, as expected, he is the only boy there.

Now Takatoshi finds himself surrounded by crazy girls who do nothing but horrify him with their candid conversations about feminine hygiene products and, what''s worse, assume he''s the worst kind of man, the kind who doesn''t clean himself and watches porn all day long.', 'Starchild Records', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-04', 8675, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8675-0wWRCPJPnYvZ.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 108991, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dvO96LZWEQk', '2026-08-08 14:41:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1806, 'A Certain Magical Index II', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8937-i3AW4QZxQHMy.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Index is still a fugitive, and many powerful magical organizations and individuals want to take her to use the books in her memory, eliminating her in the process. War between those organizations is also starting to emerge. Index can only rely on her friend Touma, who has always protected her, along with Misaka and other friends from the Academy.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-08', 8937, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8937-P13Yrw7qSux6.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 102512, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sI2ZsiKhLxk', '2026-08-08 14:41:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1807, 'Yumeiro Patissiere SP Professional', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b9441-aDGCs1ZD4rbG.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Done with the Contest in Paris, Ichigo and her friends find themselves heading back to Japan to sharpen their skills. However this time around they will have to do this separated. Some new team members will be added to Team Ichigo and they are Helping out in the most recent task given to Team Ichigo...

Will Ichigo''s dream to make a Patissiere Cake Shop be fulfilled?', 'Studio Pierrot', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-03', 9441, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 7700, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w3jj2clV_Js', '2026-08-08 14:41:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1808, 'Giant Killing', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/7661.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'East Tokyo United, ETU, has been struggling in Japan''s top football league for a few years.  It has taken everything they have just to avoid relegation. To make matters even worse, the fans are starting to abandon the team.

In an effort to improve their performance, ETU has hired a new coach, the slightly eccentric Tatsumi Takeshi.  Tatsumi, who was considered a great football player when he was younger, abandoned the team years before but has proven himself as the manager of one of England''s lower division amateur teams.  The task won''t be easy, the teams East Tokyo United is pitted against have bigger budgets and better players.  However, Tatsumi is an expert at Giant Killing.', 'Studio DEEN', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-04', 7661, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 14124, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=844I-y41B-c', '2026-08-08 14:42:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1809, 'Letter Bee', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b6444-Eiizf1cvuOg5.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Gauche Suede is on his last delivery before a big promotion. In the outskirts of Yodaka, the darkest area of Amberground, Gauche is surprised to find that the package is a young boy named Lag Seeing. Lag had been traumatized by his mother''s abduction and is due to be delivered to his aunt. In this remote area rife with Gaichuu, Lag and Gauche face a dangerous journey that inspires Lag to become a Letter Bee.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Studio Pierrot', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-03', 6444, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6444-hylyRzjObjKU.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 22414, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MMHkoeFUzv4', '2026-08-08 14:42:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1810, 'Broken Blade', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20618-IHq8mYgQAKFn.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'In the continent of Cruzon, an impending war between the Kingdom of Krisna and the nation of Athens is brimming. The people of this land are able to use quartz for whatever purpose they desire. Yet one person, Rygart Arrow, is not. He is an "un-sorcerer," a person unable to use quartz. But this characteristic will enable him to pilot an ancient Golem, one strong enough to put up a fight against the invading army of Athens.', 'Production I.G', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-04-06', 20618, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20618.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mecha', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 19019, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hTo1qSYN_kw', '2026-08-08 14:42:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1811, 'Yozakura Quartet: Hoshi no Umi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b8457-HLjTiI3nOFZs.png', 'series', '7.2', 'An OVA based on the Hoshi no Umi arc of the manga spanning chapters 26-34. 



This arc focuses on Rin Azuma, a Jiang-Shi yokai resident of Sakurashin adjusting to her new life in the city and working for a ramen shop. One day her former friend Zakuro Kurumaki invades Sakurashin to capture Rin and convince her to join her in destroying the city with the other yokai hunters as well as Enjin Hiizumi, the main antagonist of the series. Akina Hiizumi and the other members of the Hiizumi Life Counseling Office take action to save Rin, ''tune'' the yokai controlling Zakuro and protect the city.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-08', 8457, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8457-iOJnFK1vWBUA.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 11222, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30vC49mzb6E', '2026-08-08 14:42:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1812, 'Toaru Kagaku no Railgun: Misaka-san wa Ima Chuumoku no Mato Desukara', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9047-lO6Hlr9sLQO4.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Continuing after the Level Upper incident, another phenomenon torments Misaka. A phenomenon called "Someone''s Watching," its effect feels like the electricity in one''s body flow backwards. With the help of her friends, Misaka fights against the unknown enemy.', 'J.C.STAFF', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-09-26', 9047, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 19481, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jL_vEw6hObw', '2026-08-08 14:43:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1813, 'Eden of the East the Movie II: Paradise Lost', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6637-26qRqL3enXYB.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'The story of political and subversive intrigue in the series finally reaches endgame. Even as the law enforcement net tightens around Saki and her fellow Eden of the East associates over alleged terrorist activities, the complex web surrounding the mysterious Mr. Outside is finally untangled as the remaining Selecao attempt to outmaneuver one another. Takizawa''s memories and identity are also finally revealed including his association with a former Prime Minister and his request to be the King of Eden.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Production I.G', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-03-13', 6637, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6637-Yrc79hh7SVAc.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 28651, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E6JnUZJ7qvY', '2026-08-08 14:42:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1814, 'Saki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5671-XVYut4FxhrLQ.png', 'series', '7.2', 'Miyanaga Saki is a first year high school girl whose family would get angry if she won the family mahjong games. But losing would also have its consequences. Because of this she develops a new way of playing that allows her to stay on the thin line between winning and losing, the plus/minus zero score, an almost impossible score. In a game that relies mainly on luck, the plus/minus zero score is harder than winning, but Saki can achieve this every time.

Having always hated the game, her friend from middle school, Suga Kyotoro, forces her to play in the schools mahjong club. Her developed skill and superhuman luck has made her a worthy mahjong opponent, even to the middle school''s national mahjong champion.

(Source: Anime News Network, edited)', 'GONZO', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-06', 5671, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5671-D3biSQOjNrzC.jpg', 'Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 25437, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pDXwvMOnHYI', '2026-08-08 14:42:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1815, 'Fafner: Heaven and Earth', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8098-AVGxx4gEfNkI.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'A hiveminded alien force reengages war with Tatsumiya Island years after Kazuki led a team of mech pilots to destroy them. In an explosive battle over the fate of humankind, the young warriors risk everything to save their only home from assimilation.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Xebec', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-12-25', 8098, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8098-aN2HrycRmKKa.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 4771, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c_TCnRscGJk', '2026-08-08 14:42:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1816, 'Tales of Vesperia: The First Strike', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx6046-GtrSejqGl8fG.jpg', 'movies', '7.2', 'Ten years after the Great War against the demon-beasts, the empire rules over the world and prosperity relies on the massive use of aer.

Yuri Lowell and Flynn Scifo are two young men who have just enrolled the ranks of the prestigious Imperial Knights. One day, they are sent to the town of Ceazontania, where abnormal aer activity has reportedly caused the proliferation of horribly mutated beasts, with serious threat for the whole region.

Meanwhile, the Knights Supreme Commander Alexei Denoia and the naive Princess Estellise are involved in a behind-the-curtains struggle for power in the capital. The situation in Ceazontania deteriorates as the garrison of Imperial Knights finds that they cannot expect any immediate support from the capital.

Then, Niren Fedrok, commander of the Imperial Knights in Ceazontania, takes an unexpected decision that is going to change Yuri and Flynn&rsquo;s destiny forever.

What are the secrets behind the extraordinary events that are happening around Yuri and Flynn? Will they be able to defend the innocent people of Ceazontania and stay true to their beliefs?

(Source: Funimation)', 'Production I.G', '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-10-03', 6046, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6046-l15lIf3tQwko.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 10015, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bw-VfYRKCys', '2026-08-08 14:42:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1817, 'Fairy Tail', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b6702-KI4qgSMyI8Pm.png', 'series', '7.2', 'Across the Fiore kingdom, wizards join guilds and make their pay by filling magical needs—but one guild has a reputation as the roughest, rowdiest, most dangerous of all: Fairy Tail!

When four young Fairy Tail members unite, their bond is forged by a power found in neither muscle nor magic and grows stronger with every mission. Whatever you do, don''t mess with these friends or you''ll get a taste of Natsu''s flaming fist or Gray''s ice hammer, suffer a painful blow from one of Lucy''s celestial spirits or catch the edge of Erza''s mighty blade! Whether they''re stopping demons from devastating the world or wrestling in the mess hall, this mystical team manages to inflict as much damage to their rivals as they do to the surrounding area!

(Source: Funimation)', 'Satelight', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-12', 6702, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6702-VSHyctSAeUBS.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 175, 373586, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mAAKPx-ndAg', '2026-08-08 14:42:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1818, 'PandoraHearts', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5530-ukD9JNrN47aA.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Oz Vessalius, heir to one of the duke houses, has just turned fifteen. His life is rich and carefree, darkened only by the constant absence of his father. At his coming-of-age ceremony, however, everything changes. For no reason that he can discern, he''s cast into the prison known as the "Abyss", only to be saved by a "chain" known as Alice, the bloodstained black rabbit. It is unknown why was he cast into Abyss, how does Alice factor into it all, and what does the organization known as "Pandora" want with him.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Xebec', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-03', 5530, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5530-VsVYMKkehtiy.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 74193, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Psc_hBkOoc', '2026-08-08 14:43:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1819, 'Squid Girl', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8557-S9DplekRj7mo.png', 'series', '7.2', 'Foolish land-born air breathers! Behold the terror from the depths, the tentacled conqueror of humanity: Squid Girl! With your pollution and stuff you really deserve it, so prepare for menacing, inky doom! 

Squid Girl has come from the depths of the sea to conquer humanity for its pollution of the ocean. Within moments of arriving on the surface world, our easily distracted, little invertebrate is promptly bullied into working for the Aizawa sisters as a waitress, supplying their restaurant with squid ink. If poor Squid Girl can''t handle two pushy Japanese girls, how will she ever subjugate the human race? 

(Source: Media Blasters)', 'TV Tokyo', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-05', 8557, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8557-3mpgWYbYIOQg.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 51126, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YhxbmA1noxg', '2026-08-08 14:43:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1820, 'Nodame Cantabile OVA 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/8190.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'An anime-original story written by Ninomiya Tomoko, this is an extra episode that falls between the end of Nodame Cantabile (Finale) and Nodame Cantabile Opera-hen.  It''s spring.  Nodame is getting very close to graduating from the Conservatoire and Chiaki is keeping himself busy professionally.', 'J.C.STAFF', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-04-26', 8190, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 6413, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_uiAXKql0Nw', '2026-08-08 14:43:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1821, 'Eden of the East the Movie I: The King of Eden', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6372-E8swHIcEAfSj.jpg', 'movies', '7.2', 'The intrigue goes international in The King of Eden, a feature-length conspiracy thriller that continues the action of Eden of the East. The deadly game that began in Japan now intensifies on the streets of New York City. The rules are the same: do whatever it takes to win. Die if you lose.

Takizawa prevented Japan''s destruction - and then he vanished. Six months later, clues lead Saki to the Big Apple in search of her missing friend. Meanwhile, the remaining Selecao are plotting their final move. Some of them would prefer Takizawa dead and out of the way. Some might even be willing to help him achieve his goals. Unfortunately, some are prepared to destroy everything if it means claiming checkmate in Mr. Outside''s puzzling game.

(Source: Funimation Entertainment)', 'Production I.G', '2009', 'movie', 'released', '2009-11-28', 6372, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6372-fu7uYXLk4qWY.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 34358, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JZZXXAfXHcg', '2026-08-08 14:43:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1822, 'Konnichiwa Anne: Before Green Gables', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5494-CX9QBD5wWNRX.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'The story of what happened to Anne Shirley before she was adopted.', 'Nippon Animation', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-05', 5494, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5494-8FWxYgxEwI2P.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 3409, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S5qJXYNNINo', '2026-08-08 14:43:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1823, 'Sengoku Basara: Samurai Kings 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6634-vIE3Zufsz2bP.png', 'series', '7.2', 'The second season of Sengoku Basara.

Japan''s toughest warlords are on the move, leading massive armies against their rivals in a thrilling quest for total domination. Wielding insane weaponry and unleashing the elements to boost their already awesome power, these warrior generals roar into the fray atop turbo-charged stallions, slicing through the enemy with six blades at once.

They brandish explosive shotguns and swing swords the size of men. They crush the opposition with rolling battle fortresses and incinerate their foes with solar death rays. Hordes of ninja assassins and samurai fight to vanquish every adversary in their sight. As loyalties crumble and new alliances are forged in the scorching heat of battle, heroes become conquerors and conquerors become legends. This is war!

(Source: Manga Entertainment)', 'Production I.G', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-11', 6634, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 11169, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hjl_hnYFp4', '2026-08-08 14:43:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1824, 'Minami-ke: Betsubara', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5713.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Valentine''s Day is approaching; Hosaka is still trying to express his love to Haruka by cooking, cross-dressing Mako-chan fears to be found out, Kana-"sensei" teaches the other girls how to "win" Valentine''s Day, and Fujioka is desperately trying to receive Kana''s chocolate.', 'Asread', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-06-23', 5713, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 6429, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q7u7wjHwvZI', '2026-08-08 14:43:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1825, 'Inazuma Eleven: Saikyou Gundan Ogre Shuurai', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b9032-lV20OIXWzh0Y.png', 'movies', '7.1', 'An organization in the future sends the specially trained Team Ogre to defeat Endou Mamoru and his team, to prevent him from influencing the world with his soccer.

(Source: AniDB)', 'OLM', '2010', 'movie', 'released', '2010-12-23', 9032, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9032-GYseH3yrOCCE.jpg', 'Sci-Fi, Sports, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 10436, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rs4HIdzGLqg', '2026-08-08 14:43:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1826, 'The Legend of the Legendary Heroes', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8086-xmkheTESFMRs.jpg', 'series', '7.1', '"Alpha Stigma" are known to be eyes that can analyze all types of magic. However, they are more infamously known as cursed eyes that can only bring destruction and death to others.

Ryner Lute, a talented mage and also an Alpha Stigma bearer, was once a student of the Roland Empire''s Magician Academy, an elite school dedicated to training magicians for military purposes. However, after many of his classmates died in a war, he makes an oath to make the nation a more orderly and peaceful place, with fellow survivor and best friend, Sion Astal.

Now that Sion is the the king of Roland, he orders Ryner to search for useful relics that will aid the nation. Together with Ferris Eris, a beautiful and highly skilled swordswoman, Ryner goes on a journey to search for relics of legendary heroes from the past, and also uncover the secrets behind his cursed eyes.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'ZEXCS', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-02', 8086, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8086-YSOMUCQqMuFn.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 24, 57336, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z-CMX2zf3Ng', '2026-08-08 14:41:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1827, 'Black Butler: His Butler, Performer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6793-WJHPwa0ofanb.png', 'series', '7.1', 'The Phantom Company plans a stage play for the poor children for it''s 3rd anniversary since its foundation. But the original theater performers got into a ship accident on their way to London and won''t make it in time for the presentation. Faced with this situation Ciel commands Sebastian, "Make the stage play a success". And just like that, Ciel, with his three servants, Lau and Ranmao, Soma and Agni, start rehearsing Hamlet. Even Undertaker and Grell show up for the show, and the rehearsals go on. Will the stage play go through as planned? 

(Sources: kuroshitsuji.tv, elune)', 'A-1 Pictures', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-09-30', 6793, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 23676, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S8j5iEklHyI', '2026-08-08 14:42:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1828, 'Tales of Symphonia: The Animation - Tethe''alla Arc', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5306-FrQQ6rETpn9d.png', 'series', '7.1', 'The second arc of Tales of Symphonia that takes place in the flourishing world of Tethe''alla. This OVA takes place up to two-thirds of the game, prior to the Derris-Kharlan arc.', 'ufotable', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-03-25', 5306, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 4, 6673, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tvpIhCcPJ0Q', '2026-08-08 14:41:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1829, 'Baka and Test - Summon the Beasts', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6347-DCSHLkCY7UT3.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The story centers around Akihisa Yoshii, the "baka" of the title. His academy rigidly divides up the student body into classes based on the results of tests. The prodigies are in the A class with reclining seats complete with air conditioning, but Akihisa is in F class, the lowest rung of the school ladder which is furnished only with low, decrepit tables and worn-out straw tatami mats. A girl named Mizuki Himeji is actually one of the smartest girls in Akihisa''s sophomore year, but she had a fever on test day and was pigeonholed into the F class. Besides Mizuki (who Akihisa secretly adores), the F class also has Yuuji Sakamoto, the class president who has been Akihisa''s friend and partner-in-crime since the freshman year.

The school happens to have developed experiments to summon fantasy creatures, and Akihisa decides to rally F class to take on the higher-tiered classes and seize their perks. The F class uses the summoned creatures in an all-out battle for school supremacy.', 'Funimation', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-01-07', 6347, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6347-ZDzk4GrlQdag.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 117831, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B2J-wMIRT9c', '2026-08-08 14:42:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1830, 'Hakuoki ~Demon of the Fleeting Blossom~ Record of the Jade Blood', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9065-LKMdqEOGvMr7.png', 'series', '7.1', 'The continuation of Hakuoki. 

The Edo Era has ended after 260 years of history and the Meiji Era begins. However, bitter strife still continues between the soldiers of the new government and former Tokugawa retainers. This is the stage in which the surviving members of the Shinsengumi find themselves upon their return to Edo following their defeat at Tobafushimi. 

(Sources: ANN, AniDB)', 'Studio DEEN', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-04', 9065, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9065-HdEmYBM1WAOA.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 10, 12172, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d16I_CHn9Kg', '2026-08-08 14:42:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1831, 'When They Cry Rei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3652-Q9wylyMoNZBc.png', 'series', '7.1', 'The endless cycle of murders has been broken and Rika is finally able to settle down for a normal life with her friends. However, she is involved in a traffic accident and wakes up in a world where everything is different. A world where no one commited the sins that shaped them into the persons they are. It''s up to Rika to discover the truth behind this world and whether or not it truly is perfect.', 'Studio DEEN', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-02-15', 3652, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3652-qKKrMnhcqCks.png', 'Comedy, Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural, Thriller', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 5, 44398, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6lZB-Q9vdhY', '2026-08-08 14:42:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1832, 'Zakuro', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx8476-zqkDcM6hrqNy.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Westernization, a time when humans and spirits coexist. 

The modernization of Japan has begun. The Ministry of Spirit Affairs is established to resolve mysterious incidents involving the nation&rsquo;s spirits. This ministry consists of representatives from both the human and spirit worlds. Zakuro, Susukihotaru, Bonbori, and Hozuki are all half-spirits who have been partnered with the second lieutenants Kei, Riken, and Ganryu. These half-spirit girls and the male second lieutenants are all assigned to Spirit Affairs in an effort to join forces and carry out any tasks given to them! 

(Source: NIS America)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-05', 8476, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8476-eIT1jTa6WVpM.jpg', 'Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 21566, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TmONRcfX1Kw', '2026-08-08 14:42:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1833, 'Hanasakeru Seishounen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5835-g7Q2Ra5N8X7b.png', 'series', '7.1', 'A very powerful industrialist directs his daughter to pick a husband from three candidates he has chosen for her. They are to come into her life, and their uniqueness would cause her to recognize them immediately. All three of the candidates are outstanding. Well, it&rsquo;s actually four...

The story evolves along the lines of a power political mystery involving a small middle eastern country.', 'Studio Pierrot', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-05', 5835, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5835-dbV8AQPWtzFe.jpg', 'Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 9708, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iXiourZMKgA', '2026-08-08 14:42:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1834, 'Mitsudomoe', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7627-cSjDaGpufSgP.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The 11-year-old Marui triplets could not be any more different. The oldest one, Mitsuba, is sadistic and kind of mature for her age. The middle one, Futaba, is perverted and very athletic and has the strength of a full-grown man. The youngest one, Hitoha, is generally very quiet and gentle but when push comes to shove, she might just be the strongest, the most perverted and the most sadistic out of the three.

The three are all in the same class, led by the newly graduated teacher Yabe Satoshi. He usually gets pushed around by the girls and, on occasion, abused but the triplets also try to lead him and the new school nurse, the clumsy Kuriyama Aiko, together. However, Yabe had no intention of dating Aiko and the methods the triplets use to accomplish their goal are highly unorthodox...', 'Aniplex', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-03', 7627, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7627-9mZovh52cRmp.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 25650, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2xaZleUrHg', '2026-08-08 14:41:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1835, 'Darker than Black: Gemini of the Meteor', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6573-8D21dF6qwXQ2.png', 'series', '7.1', 'In the sequel, Hei and Yin are now on the run after betraying the Syndicate in the previous season. After leaving Japan, Hei encounters Suou Pavlichenko, a 13-year-old Eurasian girl who becomes embroiled in the war and politics of the various factions and Contractors vying for power. Meanwhile, Hell''s Gate remains standing in Tokyo, after Hei''s efforts to stop the Saturn Ring anti-Gate particle weapon from activating. Although Contractors are safe from the danger of having their existences erased, this does not prevent new and old Contractors from abusing their powers. As Misaki Kirihara and her team in the Public Security Bureau deal with the increasing Contractor cases, she also has to keep the Syndicate at bay, who has major positions in the Japanese police and intelligence bureaus around the world. The storyline setting primarily takes place in both Japan and Russia. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'bones', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-10-09', 6573, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6573-D3QgsayY0eAY.jpg', 'Action, Mystery, Psychological, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 63673, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omqh8sVtDvI', '2026-08-08 14:42:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1836, 'Pani Poni Dash!: Danjite Okonaeba Kishin mo Kore wo Saku', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/5419.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Paniponi Dash! special included in the DVD-Box.', 'Shaft', '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-04-15', 5419, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5419-igMniKCh6Ohs.jpg', 'Comedy', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 2839, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CMTWWIAtKoY', '2026-08-08 14:42:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1837, 'Maid-Sama! LaLa Special', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10298-mnM3kWmFb2TP.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Kaichou wa Maid-sama! special that was included on a DVD released with the magazine LaLa.  Features character introductions and voice swapping comedy.', 'J.C.STAFF', '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-07-24', 10298, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:16', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 21532, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jjtkKbGS3tE', '2026-08-08 14:42:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1838, 'Baccano!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2251-tTQoWxVy4472.jpg', 'series', '8.1', 'During the early 1930s in Chicago, the transcontinental train, Flying Pussyfoot, is starting its legendary journey that will leave a trail of blood all over the country. At the same time in New York, the ambitious scientist Szilard and his unwilling aide Ennis, are looking for missing bottles of the immortality elixir. In addition, a war between the mafia groups is getting worse. On board the Advena Avis, in 1711, alchemists are about to learn the price of immortality.

Based on the award winning light novels of the same name, this anime adaptation follows several events that initially seem unrelated, both in time and place, but are part of a much bigger story&mdash;one of alchemy, survival and immortality. Merging these events together are the kindhearted would-be thieves, Isaac and Miria, connecting various people, all of them with their own hidden ambitions and agendas, and creating lifelong bonds and consequences for everyone involved.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Aniplex', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-07-27', 2251, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2251-FVSbYyJhQPj2.jpg', 'Action, Mystery, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 188880, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MtuNdtfMlJ0', '2026-08-08 14:44:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1839, 'One Outs', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5040-9ruuekq2LZKJ.png', 'series', '8.1', 'The story begins when Hiromichi Kojima, the star batter of the fictional Lycaons in Japan''s Pacific League, heads to the southern Japanese island of Okinawa to train and bring himself out of a slump. There, he meets Toua Tokuchi, a 134-kmph (83 miles per hour) pitcher and the undisputed king of a gambling form of baseball called "One Out." At Kojima''s urging, Tokuchi signs up with the Lycaons under an unusual contract: he gets 5,000,000 yen (about US$46,000) for every out he pitches, but loses 50,000,000 yen (US$460,000) for every point he gives up. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-08', 5040, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5040-DGZoPmQP7bV9.jpg', 'Psychological, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 53337, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=frCs_tLwelw', '2026-08-08 14:44:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1840, 'Natsume''s Book of Friends Season 1', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4081-xi08naD69tjr.jpg', 'series', '8.0', 'Natsume has always been an outcast because he inherited his grandmother''s ability to see yokai. After moving to his grandmother''s hometown and accidentally releasing a yokai imprisoned in a Lucky Cat statue, he learns about his grandmother''s "Book of Friends," which contains the names of the yokai she defeated, and allows its wielder to command the yokai named within. Since then, yokai now visit him on a daily basis, seeking to either get their names back or take possession of the Book of Friends.

(Source: NIS America)', 'Brain''s Base', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-08', 4081, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4081-dbeE4uMExtgc.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 127472, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mea4xITAo_4', '2026-08-29 14:55:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1841, 'Major S3', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1842-HtJQ2w0taDrN.png', 'series', '8.0', 'After leaving Kaido in a promise to meet them at the Koshien tournament, Goro comes back to his home town once again in an attempt to join up with his old friends. Only this time, things aren''t as easy to get back in the groove of.', 'Studio Hibari', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-06', 1842, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 26, 13683, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4kRLRLSs7x8', '2026-08-08 14:44:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1842, 'xxxHOLiC◆Kei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3091-97Yr9KdWI3Ou.jpg', 'series', '8.0', 'Still working to get his wish complete, Watanuki finds himself into more mess than he can handle when certain facts about his everyday life gets revealed and when he needs to learn the lesson of Yuuko the hard way.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Production I.G', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-04', 3091, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3091-d4il9SnBf3gk.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 13, 23520, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FqvMe66VoXg', '2026-08-08 14:44:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1843, 'Major S4', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3226-fMXH8ydO3BmF.png', 'series', '8.0', 'Next season of Major.

After the final game of his Seishuu team against the goal he set himself, Kaidou - the team he left to play against, Gorou has no feelings of remorse anymore. Again he decides to take a step forward and challenge himself.

Saying one more time good bye to Shimizu and his friends, he leaves for the USA, where he plans on competing in the Minor League.

This is where Season 4 starts, in a country that`s foreign to him, a baseball style that`s unknown to him and new friends and strong rivals who share the same love to the game as him. Accompany Gorou in his neverending quest for new challenges. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'NHK', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-01-05', 3226, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 26, 12960, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mzLCDgHM1CQ', '2026-08-08 14:44:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1844, 'Nodame Cantabile', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1698-VhVaiOLkcGCp.jpg', 'series', '8.0', 'Shinichi Chiaki is a first class musician whose dream is to play among the elites in Europe. Coming from a distinguished family, he is an infamous perfectionist; not only is he highly critical of himself, but of others as well. The only thing stopping Chiaki from leaving for Europe is his fear of flying. As a result, he''s grounded in Japan.

During his 4th year at Japan''s top music university, Chiaki happens to meet Noda Megumi; or as she refers to herself, Nodame. On the surface, she seems to be an unkempt girl with no direction in life. However, when Chiaki hears Nodame play the piano for the first time, he is in awe at the kind of music she plays. To Chiaki''s dismay, Nodame moves into the apartment next to his and finds out that she is head over heels in love with him.

Nodame Cantabile tells the story of Chiaki and Nodame, as they not only learn to deal with each other, but learn lessons from one another as they strive for the top of the musical world.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-12', 1698, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1698-YhbmezYfngCk.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 23, 59027, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_uiAXKql0Nw', '2026-08-08 14:44:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1845, 'Tsubasa: Tokyo Revelations', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2685-ZP46utTR0mv8.jpg', 'series', '7.9', 'Continuing their journey from Record Country (the place that held the book of memories), Syaoran and company land into Tokyo Country, a blood-filled country under war from opposing factions for natural resources and survival. While reluctantly involved in the race to live, the group faces their own problems as certain revelations are made, changing their journey forever.

A shocking betrayal and a battle that risks all of their lives. After this revelation, they will never be the same again.', 'Production I.G', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-11-16', 2685, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2685-wIe1ft3foqaB.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 14019, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hEdxTCvYF-Q', '2026-08-08 14:44:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1846, 'Kaiba', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3701-ooD3N9dD2rqa.jpg', 'series', '7.9', 'It is now possible to store memory data, so that the death of your body is not actually "death". As memories are stored in databanks, they can be "transferred" to new bodies. Because so-called "memory trading" now occurs, it is now possible to steal memories and illegally alter them.

Society has fallen apart as authority has become lost and stagnant.

One day, a man awakens in a ruined room. His name is Kaiba. He has no memories, but he does have a pendant with a picture of an unknown woman inside.

In the skies are roiling clouds and electrical storms, impossible to pass without losing one''s memories; above them lies the elusive realm of the rich and powerful, who barter others'' bodies and memories for their own enjoyment and longevity. Below lies a troubled and dangerous world where good bodies are hard to come by and real money is scarce.

After suddenly being attacked, Kaiba escapes into space, and during his travels meets all sorts of people and regains his memories. Throughout it, he continues to be troubled by the world''s problems, as well as his own existence. And what of the woman in the pendant, Neiro?', 'MADHOUSE', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-11', 3701, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3701-8mD0yBstxxuX.jpg', 'Adventure, Mystery, Psychological, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 50305, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFI_Fl1sRWg', '2026-08-08 14:43:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1847, 'Moribito: Guardian of the Spirit', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1827-snIp62SY7ZFK.jpg', 'series', '7.9', 'Balsa’s prowess in battle is legendary, but the weight of death bears heavily on the spear-wielding mercenary’s soul. To atone, she has sworn to save 8 lives, no matter what the cost, and now only one life remains. Prince Chagum has been blessed with the power to stave off the droughts that threaten to starve and destroy his father’s empire, but he has been accused of being possessed by evil spirits, and court officials have set his own father against him. Condemned to death, he is saved by Balsa’s intervention and now, together, the two must unravel the secret of Chagum’s powers and the spirit behind them… before the armies sent to murder them can succeed!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Production I.G', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-07', 1827, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1827-cPDeZs4N6VH6.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 44469, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YbosYHwSVLI', '2026-08-08 14:44:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1848, 'ARIA The OVA ~ARIETTA~', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2563-0rwQlDs37Yb8.png', 'series', '7.9', 'Akari Mizunashi dreams of life after attaining her goal of becoming a Prima Undine, but upon waking realizes that she might not actually have the confidence to run Aria Company on her own. Wary of the future, she seeks advice from her mentor Alicia Florence—one of the three great "Water Fairies" of Neo-Venezia.

Much to Akari''s surprise, Alicia reveals her own struggles of the past, but also shares the steps she took in overcoming her self-doubt of running the company and taking on an apprentice. Finding solace in her teacher''s words, Akari prepares to embrace whatever trials she must overcome on her path toward achieving her dreams.', 'Hal Film Maker', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-09-21', 2563, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2563.jpg', 'Fantasy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 13217, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NraaWUZxWZw', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1849, 'Nodame Cantabile: Paris-hen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx4477-Qg9EwJP1f5NF.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'Having been given the opportunity to study in Paris, Noda accompanies Chiaki to Europe as he strives to become the accomplished conductor he always dreamt to be.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-10', 4477, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4477-t23iFe7Su3Ff.jpg', 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 11, 21234, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_uiAXKql0Nw', '2026-08-08 14:44:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1850, 'Hidamari Sketch x 365', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3604-kQzUwfzAcgTF.png', 'series', '7.8', 'The second season of Hidamari Sketch.

Yuno, Miyako, Hiro, Sae and the rest of the denizens of the most fascinating piece of surreal estate in Japan are back. And they''re still spurning the "A happens after B, happens after C" pattern so prevalent in the rest of the world. In fact, instead of just taking place after Yuno''s first year at Yamabuki High, this season of Hidamari Sketch continues on both sides, around the edges and in-between. Filling in the details in an ever-expanding collage that''s both avant-garde and slice of life!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Aniplex', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-04', 3604, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3604-KTuRodCfqMMY.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 10921, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2bZ6mF3bWw', '2026-08-08 14:44:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1851, 'Lovely Complex', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2034-erjg6gzDetAp.png', 'series', '7.8', 'Love is unusual for Koizumi Risa and Ootani Atsushi, who are both striving to find their ideal partner in high school—172 cm tall Koizumi is much taller than the average girl, and Ootani is much shorter than the average guy at 156 cm. To add to their plights, their crushes fall in love with each other, leaving Koizumi and Ootani comically flustered and heartbroken. To make matters worse, they''re even labeled as a comedy duo by their homeroom teacher due to their personalities and the stark difference in their heights, and their classmates even think of their arguments as sketches.

Lovely★Complex follows Koizumi and Ootani as they encourage each other in finding love and become close friends. Apart from their ridiculous antics, they soon find out an unexpected similarity in their music and fashion tastes. Maybe they possess a chemistry yet unknown, but could love ever bloom between the mismatched pair?

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Toei Animation', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-07', 2034, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2034-AL1Xtj5GqKu3.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 133259, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4nt3bOmkljc', '2026-08-08 14:45:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1852, 'Baccano! Bangai-hen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3901-uUj3GeGsebmj.png', 'series', '7.8', 'Three exclusive episodes made from the light novels included in DVD volumes 5, 7 and 8, which flesh out characters and plot events from the original series and establish closure to the story as Carol and the Vice President return to New York.', 'Aniplex', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-02-27', 3901, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3901-Hxj7TT4dCmBx.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Mystery, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 3, 38394, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PeMM1lKO2o4', '2026-08-08 14:44:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1853, 'Mobile Suit Gundam 00', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2581-MLEf00dNAfqY.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'It is the year A.D. 2307. Fossil fuels on Earth have been depleted entirely, with mankind turning to the next available power source: solar energy. During this time, 3 orbital elevators with solar power generation systems are built, each under control by the Union (formerly United States of America), the Human Reformist Alliance (Russia, China and India) and the AEU (Europe). However, not all countries are able to enjoy the benefits of this system, leading to widespread resentment and war. Arising out of the conflict, a mysterious non-profit military organization known as Celestial Being appears, dedicated to end all warfare using Mobile Suits called Gundam. This begins the stories of Gundam Meisters (pilots) Setsuna F. Seiei, Lockon Stratos, Allelujah Haptism and Tieria Erde as they are thrown into conflict between the 3 superpowers and the other various factions.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-06', 2581, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2581-YJ1YJmB8QRJj.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 42379, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yTGzkTQjGak', '2026-08-08 14:44:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1854, 'Toradora!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4224-PXVMBLNwy2aF.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'Ryuuji Takasu is a gentle high school student with a love for housework; but in contrast to his kind nature, he has an intimidating face that often gets him labeled as a delinquent. On the other hand is Taiga Aisaka, a small, doll-like student, who is anything but a cute and fragile girl. Equipped with a wooden katana and feisty personality, Taiga is known throughout the school as the "Palmtop Tiger."

One day, an embarrassing mistake causes the two students to cross paths. Ryuuji discovers that Taiga actually has a sweet side: she has a crush on the popular vice president, Yuusaku Kitamura, who happens to be his best friend. But things only get crazier when Ryuuji reveals that he has a crush on Minori Kushieda—Taiga''s best friend!

Toradora! is a romantic comedy that follows this odd duo as they embark on a quest to help each other with their respective crushes, forming an unlikely alliance in the process.', 'Genco', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-02', 4224, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4224-iPUOHdMde27j.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 536194, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ya570uUgQNc', '2026-08-08 14:44:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1855, 'Skip Beat!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4722-haxa25k1oSxU.png', 'series', '7.8', 'Kyouko followed her true love and childhood friend Shou to Tokyo so she could help him reach his dream of becoming an idol. She cleans, cooks, works three jobs and does nothing for herself because she loves him so much, but gets nothing in return. Still, she remains by his side. But then one day she goes unannounced to his agency with a delivery, and overhears him talking about her; he reveals to his manager that he only took her with him as a maid, and that he doesn''t care for her at all. Upon hearing this, Kyouko doesn''t just sit around and cry. She cuts and dyes her hair, changes her clothes and attitude and thus begins her journey to join showbiz and have her revenge against Shou.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Hal Film Maker', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-06', 4722, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4722-ZPCSfocx149r.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 44544, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6-oI2IbPfMk', '2026-08-08 14:44:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1856, 'Den-noh Coil', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2164-4tUI4MJCZQO3.png', 'series', '7.7', 'Imagine if the internet was ''projected'' over the living world and you interacted with it using a portable device - glasses and visors which connect you to an augmented reality. In 2026, this technology becomes reality...

Yuuko Okonogi moves with her family to Daikoku, home of an ever expanding tech network which makes up the interactive virtual world. Her grandmother runs an agency to investigate missing children who appear to have vanished from the ''real'' world and entered the city''s Dennou - literally meaning "electric brain" - a term used to differentiate between the virtual and ''real.''

A hacker culture is emerging amongst the children of the city. Yasako is soon introduced to Isako, whose powers for hunting computer viruses known as ''illegals'' belie an agenda that might have sinister motives.

(Source: Siren Visual)', 'MADHOUSE', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-05-12', 2164, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2164-ni3twWmTig6Q.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 42793, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4bkG6YDjfcM', '2026-08-08 14:44:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1857, 'Zoku Sayonara, Zetsubou-Sensei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3228-1HZ2FA34oKAM.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'More crazy antics abound as Nozomu Itoshiki, a.k.a Zetsubou-sensei, who is the worlds most negative person, tries to teach class 2-H about how life is filled with despair and darkness. A harder task than it first may seem, with his students being far from ordinary themselves, including the likes of the most positive girl he has ever met, his very own stalker, a foreign exchange student with split personalities and a perfectionist acting class president, due to the fact the real class president can''t be seen by anyone, among others. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Shaft', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-01-06', 3228, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3228-pdQ6CVaaSuxJ.jpg', 'Comedy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 31435, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sEC_O8Ayew0', '2026-08-08 14:44:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1858, 'Darker than Black', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2025-ZKVteVzUyFLH.png', 'series', '7.7', 'In Tokyo, an impenetrable field known as "Hell''s Gate" appeared ten years ago. At the same time, psychics who wield paranormal powers at the cost of their conscience also emerged. Hei is one of the most powerful of these psychic agents, and along with his blind associate, Yin, works for one of the many rival agencies vying to unlock the mysteries of Hell''s Gate.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'bones', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-06', 2025, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2025-Fx3ALDmrOulv.jpg', 'Action, Mystery, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 176369, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=goYEIQT5m8U', '2026-08-08 14:44:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1859, 'Time of Eve', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3167-IBEzQTk9wvbr.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'The future, probably Japan. Robots have long been put into practical use, and androids have just come into use.

Influenced by the Robot Ethics Committee, it''s become common sense for people to treat androids like household appliances. Their appearance - indistinguishable from humans except for the ring over each android''s head - has led some people to empathize unnecessarily with androids. Known as "android-holics", such people have become a social problem.

Rikuo, a high school student, has been taught from childhood that androids are not to be viewed as humans, and has always used them as convenient tools. One day Rikuo discovers some strange data in the behavior records of his family''s household android, Sammy.

Rikuo and his friend Masaki trace Sammy''s movements, only to discover a mysterious caf&eacute; that features a house rule that "humans and robots are to be treated the same"...

(Source: Official Website - English)', 'Studio Rikka', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-08-01', 3167, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3167-e2qIc6utiYEC.jpg', 'Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 6, 39340, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xru2rINDuXE', '2026-08-08 14:44:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1860, 'Mobile Suit Gundam 00 Second Season', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3927-PtFPKRrcDFeM.png', 'series', '7.7', 'Four years have passed since the final battle between Celestial Being and the UN Forces. Humanity, having established the Earth Sphere Federation, forms an independent security preservation force, A-Laws, separate from the formal Federation army to further unify nations and the will of mankind. But the reality was the inhumane oppression of misuse of powers, doctrines, and ideologies in the name of unity.


Saji Crossroad has followed the path to becoming a space engineer to keep his promise to Louise Halevy, who in turn was compelled to become involved in Federation government reform and joined A-Laws as a mobile suit pilot during the four-year gap.


Meanwhile, Setsuna F. Seiei, having survived the climactic battle four years ago, witnessed a change in the world due to the actions of Celestial Being. With the defeat of Alejandro Corner, he dreamed of a peaceful world without conflict; but before his own eyes was the reality of the continuing strain on peace, the oppression caused by A-Laws. He decides once more to fight with Gundam, the power with the potential to change the world.


(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-05', 3927, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3927-kmYDSciLejNj.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 26259, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EAYSEgvr14g', '2026-08-08 14:44:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1861, 'ef ~ A Tale of Melodies', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4789-zpt5UsK70dJh.png', 'series', '7.7', 'In a story set years in the past, Himura Yuu is a studious and diligent young man intent solely on maintaining his top academic position at Otowa Academy. One day, he meets a mysterious girl named Amamiya Yuuko, who, to his surprise, recognizes him. Memories of a distant childhood, memories rather left forgotten...meeting Yuuko again will force Yuu to confront the regrets and sorrows of their collective pasts and presents.

In the present, Kuze Shuuichi may seem like a womanizer, but upon closer inspection, is a man who would rather be left alone. Hayama Mizuki, however, is not the type of girl who would let him be, especially after hearing the beautiful sounds of his violin performance. As Mizuki attempts to become closer to him, Kuze attempts to push her away&mdash;the tale of their budding relationship is darkened with undertones of an imminent tragedy.', 'Shaft', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-07', 4789, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4789-vI3WUKB98Zg9.jpg', 'Drama, Mystery, Psychological, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 30372, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Sbu73b2Qto', '2026-08-08 14:44:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1862, 'Les Misérables: Shoujo Cosette', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1695-etz4t9yoXO19.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'Based on the famous classic novel Les Miserables.

Being a single mother is hard in early 19th Century France. When young Cosette was traveling with her mother trying to find a job and a place to live, they were always shunned away because very few employers hire single mothers. When she is promised with the prosperity of working in the big city, Cosette is separated from her mother in the hopes a caretaker will watch over her while her mother earns some money. Unfortunately this was a trick and the caretaker is a corrupt man who makes Cosette his indentured servant. Then the kind mayor of the town that Cosette makes her new home in sees how winds of change are so detrimental for children and families, and decides to do something about it.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-07', 1695, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1695-f2BWoFWAhG27.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 52, 9306, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fMP8-Zu0Xsk', '2026-08-08 14:44:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1863, 'ARIA The ORIGINATION: That Little Secret Place...', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4772-ybpWwYAbFfVo.png', 'series', '7.7', 'Special episode based on chapter 39 (or Navigation 39) entitled "The Secret Place". Its action takes place between episodes 5 and 6 of Aria the Origination.

Akari and President Aria take a walk in the eastern part of Neo-Venezia. They are spotted by Akatsuki, who follows them to try to greet Akari. They eventually end up at St Mark''s Basilica, where Akari has a secret place, which is discovered by Akatsuki, Aika, and Alice. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Hal Film Maker', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-06-25', 4772, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 7494, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NraaWUZxWZw', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1864, 'Clannad', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2167-pSDBcyc0vjej.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'Tomoya is a bitter, third year high school student. His mother passed away, causing his father to resort to alcohol and gambling. Tomoya is distant with his father and has become a delinquent in the years since his mother''s death. Walking to school, he meets Nagisa Furukawa who is a year older but is repeating the grade due to illness. She is alone, as most of her friends have moved on. The two begin hanging out, and as time goes by, Tomoya finds his life shifting in a new direction.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Sentai Filmworks', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-05', 2167, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2167.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 23, 298418, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ZseZTshl2k', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1865, 'Clannad: Another World, Tomoyo Chapter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b4059-mrA0Wky7bTgz.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'In an alternate universe to the original Clannad anime, Okazaki Tomoya is dating Sakagami Tomoyo in the 24th and final episode of Clannad.


When Tomoyo is elected Student Council President, her dream to save the school''s cherry blossom trees from being cut down begins to come to fruition. However, her never-ending duties and bad rumors about their relationship spread by fellow students due to Tomoya''s reputation as a delinquent create a rift between the two. As Tomoya watches Tomoyo rise higher and higher into the distance, their relationship is stretched to the limit by a society that threatens to break them apart.', 'Kyoto Animation', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-16', 4059, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4059-1eoho5VXQvhm.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 63924, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ZseZTshl2k', '2026-08-08 14:44:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1866, 'Inazuma Eleven', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5231-SuMNWJQQK8jl.png', 'series', '7.7', 'The main character, Endou Mamoru, is a very talented goalkeeper and the grandson of one of the strongest goalkeepers in Japan, who died before he was born. Even though his skills are incredible his school lacks a real soccer club as the 6 other members don''t appear very interested even in training. But as soon as a mysterious forward called Gouenji moves to Endou''s town, the young goalkeeper sets out to find and recruit members for his soccer team.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'TV Tokyo', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-05', 5231, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5231-Ts5f27IliDgL.jpg', 'Drama, Sports, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 127, 61296, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z-WnyPsSgLg', '2026-08-08 14:45:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1867, 'La Maison en Petits Cubes', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5365-kUWu68IfUZ97.jpg', 'movies', '7.6', 'An old man lives in a town that has become submerged in water. As the water level rises, he''s forced to build additional levels onto his home with bricks (cubes) in order to stay above water. One day he accidentally drops his favorite pipe into the lower levels of his home, and decides to rent scuba diving equipment in order to go searching for it. As he descends through his sunken home, the old man recalls memories of the past in each room.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Robot', '2008', 'movie', 'released', '2008-06-10', 5365, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5365-DfFzzkOzHx45.jpg', 'Drama', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 22921, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jhQ75OV4VRs', '2026-08-08 14:45:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1868, 'Michiko & Hatchin', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4087-TMc9A0GSKiJf.png', 'series', '7.6', 'After escaping from prison, the criminal Michiko rescues an abused girl known as Hatchin. The two are about as opposite as they come, but their fates become intertwined through the connection of a man from both their pasts. On the run from the police and Hatchin''s abusive foster parents, the unlikely duo set out to find this man and ultimately discover their freedom. 

(Source: FUNimation)', 'Manglobe', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-16', 4087, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4087-HXlwFThv4pxw.jpg', 'Action, Adventure', 'TV', 'FALL', 22, 62254, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RJCiRrd-lXE', '2026-08-08 14:45:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1869, 'Big Windup!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2159-eTI4nRTqCTDM.png', 'series', '7.6', 'After a falling out with his middle school team, Mihashi enters Nishiura high school with no social skill, a warped opinion of himself, and every intention to quit baseball. The newly formed Nishiura baseball team, however, needs a pitcher, and they welcome him. Most enthusiastic is Abe, a domineering catcher with his own game issues.

And so a battery every bit as complementary as it is dysfunctional is formed. If they can figure out how to work together, they might be the answers to each other''s problems-and the team might be able to win.', 'A-1 Pictures', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-13', 2159, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2159-mLfzFO9ZQFjU.jpg', 'Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 22749, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gBFrqNqT8y0', '2026-08-08 14:45:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1870, 'Major: Yuujou no Ikkyuu', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5029-zonyG2k3coLq.png', 'movies', '7.6', 'Goro briefly returns to Japan after a triumphant campaign in the US. He is heading towards Fukuoka where he played baseball when he was a fifth grader. Having just moved into a new town, this is where Goro faced a critical point in his life. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Xebec', '2008', 'movie', 'released', '2008-12-13', 5029, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 5588, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CFiF8mIg9Do', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1871, 'Ga-Rei-Zero', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4725-LWoB14AbUyaA.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'An elite squadron trained to combat supernatural forces is called in to investigate reports of invisible monsters terrorizing Tokyo, but their mission is complicated by the interference of a rogue exorcist. When the mysterious female slaughters the overmatched attack force, her former comrades are ordered to lock down the crime scene—and forever silence their old friend.

(Source: Crunchyroll)

 Note: This series is a prequel to the manga series, Ga-Rei.', 'AIC Spirits', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-06', 4725, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4725-XfHi5n4hywb2.jpg', 'Action, Supernatural, Thriller', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 47271, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uHzN2nvSeoU', '2026-08-08 14:45:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1872, 'Macross Frontier', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3572-qYJhokKdsnZR.png', 'series', '7.6', 'After being threatened by extinction at the hands of alien invaders called the Zentradi, humanity undertook the task of guaranteeing itself a future by launching fleets of colony ships into space. On Macross Frontier, one such fleet, high school student Saotome Alto''s life is changed forever: the fleet is suddenly attacked by unidentified creatures while he is performing aerial stunts for a concert by the wildly popular idol Sheryl. 

Alto quickly finds himself in the cockpit of a new-model fighter struggling to protect Ranka Lee, a young girl he met only hours earlier, from the invaders'' swath of destruction. Noting his performance during this incident, the S.M.S. Skull Squadron private military company invites Alto to join their organization, where he continues protecting his friends and Macross Frontier.

(Source: Anime-Planet)', 'Satelight', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-04', 3572, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3572.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 29749, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u_bQLaj9iUI', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1873, 'Bamboo Blade', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2986-WroNLF4WEnRo.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Kojirou is the kendo instructor for Muroe High School and he''s totally broke. But then an unexpected chance is given to him: his team must win against his senpai''s team and the prize is: free meals for a whole year! Now, the only problem left... where to find girls skilled enough and willing to join the kendo team?', 'AIC A.S.T.A.', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-02', 2986, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2986-mNUPM43gBUfc.jpg', 'Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 17901, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4xQk70eLl5s', '2026-08-08 14:45:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1874, 'Goku Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4872-4TEsaUG8uoYl.png', 'series', '7.6', 'A continuation of Zoku Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei, with more stories revolving around Nozomu Itoshiki, the extremely pessimistic or despairing teacher, and the students of class the 2-H, who are each hilariously abnormal in their own unique way except for the one relatively normal girl who hates being called normal.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Shaft', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-17', 4872, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4872-SEblo6QjlS0j.jpg', 'Comedy', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 16433, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcEwqb4c-1Q', '2026-08-08 14:45:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1875, 'Sayonara, Zetsubou-Sensei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2605-euXOWMmXtZMe.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Itoshiki Nozomu is always in despair! Even simple things like paying for the toll on the subway can send him to a despair so deep only attempted suicide is the answer. How Strange is it then, that he should be the teacher of a High School Class filled with students with even more emotional problems than his. This great Comedy will leave you in anything but ''Despair'' as you meet each of his students and watch their wacky adventures.', 'Shaft', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-07-08', 2605, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2605.jpg', 'Comedy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 81836, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sEC_O8Ayew0', '2026-08-08 14:45:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1876, 'Detroit Metal City', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3702-TCo0UYxWQzYj.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Led by phallus-waiving terrorist-from-hell Johannes Krauser II (guitar/vocals,) and given pulsing, throbbing life by indestructible drummer Camus and bassist Alexander Jagi, Detroit Metal City is the hottest ticket on the concert circuit! There''s just one catch. That "hottest ticket" is just a meal ticket, and beneath the makeup, these ultimate head-bangers are hired doppelgangers who don''t even LIKE what they do! Jaggi is actually Wada, who wants to play glam rock; Camus is Nishida, an anime fan with an appalling weakness for curry and NSFW videos; and Krauser is... oh the shame... street-singing Soichi Negishi, whose dreams of singing happy pop hits seem hopelessly doomed by the success of his rage-fueled alter ego! Worse, he can''t even tell anyone who Krauser is. Not even the girl he likes, who HATES DMC! Will rage against the corporate machine consume Negishi''s tortured soul? Is there life after death metal? What it''s like to put your head in a jet engine and turn up the volume? 


(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Studio 4°C', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-08-08', 3702, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3702-91zk0nfkGfYi.png', 'Comedy, Music', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 12, 39185, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8WOS1WNGrgU', '2026-08-08 14:46:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1877, 'Emma: A Victorian Romance Second Act', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2035-yudjGh3sDaRz.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'In the faraway village of Haworth, a new chapter in Emma''s life has begun. Now employed by the wealthy Molders family, Emma has resolved to put the past behind her. She''ll have to adjust to a new house, a charming (but eccentric) new mistress, and a host of fellow servants, some with buried pasts of their own.

Meanwhile, back in London, William is doing his best to uphold his father''s wishes as the Jones family heir, but try as he might, he can''t forget Emma. Yet, whenever he feels at his worst, Eleanor is always there to comfort him with a warm, shy smile. Could the answer to his broken heart be right before his eyes?

(Source: RightStuf)', 'Ajiado', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-17', 2035, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2035-GUsWY437up3q.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 6255, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UpcCcYoEJmE', '2026-08-08 14:46:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1878, 'Tennis no Ouji-sama: Zenkoku Taikai-hen Final', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4053-vybch1WZxfMp.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Seigaku continues through the Nation tournament. Now they are up against the strongest team in the tournament, Rikkaidai.', 'Production I.G', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-25', 4053, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4053-YvBvfnUgboDU.jpg', 'Comedy, Sports', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 7, 6909, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6g8wCA7V1n8', '2026-08-08 14:46:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1879, 'Lucky☆Star OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4472-I4r5rkEdA6zK.png', 'series', '7.6', 'The OVA features six separate stories revolving around the cast, some of which border on the bizarre; one of which is an MMORPG environment being played by Konata, Kagami, Tsukasa, and Nanako Kuroi, and another in which Kagami has a "suggestive" dream about Konata.', 'Kyoto Animation', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-09-26', 4472, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4472-iC1646gsIJtT.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 30770, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZqHj70OXtgE', '2026-08-08 14:46:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1880, 'Genshiken 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2508-4jK3PHZxI5Au.png', 'series', '7.6', 'The Society for the Study of Modern Visual Culture, otherwise known as Genshiken, is now under the charge of a more confident Sasahara. Things have changed in between semesters, and the otaku club now has a new otaku-hating member named Ogiue. Sasahara''s initial goal of starting a doujin circle and selling those fan-made magazines at the next Comic Festival becomes a reality, but reality is a cruel master... who apparently crossplays. Afterward, the club is abuzz with talk about Tanaka and Ohno''s relationship, which takes a hesitant step forward.

(Source: Media Blasters)', 'ARMS', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-10', 2508, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 16122, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8c9HpNgd7ao', '2026-08-08 14:46:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1881, 'The Story of Saiunkoku Second Series', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1914-VmmTPSjufwMs.png', 'series', '7.5', 'Shuurei needs to deal with more obstacles in the new series. More danger comes her way but at the same time meeting friends who will help her with her work as an official.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-07', 1914, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 6008, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SgptuiLbx_c', '2026-08-08 14:46:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1882, 'Tennis no Ouji-sama: Zenkoku Taikai-hen Semifinal', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2752-GAemR7Gsk9n4.png', 'series', '7.5', 'The National Tournament continues for Ryouma Echizen and the Seishun Academy Boys'' Tennis Team as they face off against last year''s semifinalist, Shitenhouji Middle School. As winners of the Kansai Regionals, Shitenhouji is one of the top contenders to win this year''s tournament. What''s more, each member of the Shitenhouji team has skills that are said to surpass their Seishun counterparts. Shitenhouji also has Kintarou Tooyama, another "super rookie" who rivals Ryouma in strength and technique. Seishun will have to push the limits of their abilities to stand a chance at defeating the Kansai champions in this East versus West matchup.', 'Production I.G', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-06-22', 2752, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2752-CHMwQQ28NFP2.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sports', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 6, 7054, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H0aHXo8q85g', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1883, 'Lucky☆Star', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1887-P36Pucd4qKji.png', 'series', '7.5', 'What’s the best way to eat dessert? Do twins really have a psychic connection? What kind of guys are into moe girls? These are the kinds of questions that float through the inquisitive mind of anime super-fan Konata Izumi. When she’s not lost in her favorite manga or logging hours in one of her online games, she’s debating the mysteries of the universe with the best friends a girl could ask for.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Kyoto Animation', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-08', 1887, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1887-wsvLo25cHip4.png', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 144515, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZqHj70OXtgE', '2026-08-08 14:46:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1884, 'ef ~ A Tale of Memories', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2924-MXCrAa1KAdzH.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'On Christmas Eve, Hiro Hirono''s bike is stolen by a girl chasing a thief who stole her purse. He gives chase and finds her unconscious and his bike ruined. The girl, Miyako Miyamura, soon awakes and the two begin to talk. After making sure she is okay, they end up spending Christmas Eve together. Later, Hiro finds out Miyako attends the same school as him and they begin to spend more and more time together, Miyako developing affections for Hiro. Kei Shindou -- Hiro''s childhood friend who has long held a crush on him -- begins to become jealous and a love triangle follows. 

The series also tells the story of Renji Asou. One day, he meets Chihiro Shindou, the twin sister of Kei Shindou, at an abandoned train station. Even though she''s very shy, they get along pretty well and begin meeting at the same spot everyday. However, Renji finds out that Chihiro was in a car accident years ago and as a consequence she suffers from a disability: her memory lasts only 13 hours. Nevertheless, after learning that Chihiro''s dream is to write a novel, Renji finally decides to help her fulfill her dream while also trying to make her overcome the difficulties imposed by her condition.', 'Shaft', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-07', 2924, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2924-rYqzbbIHS0hB.jpg', 'Drama, Mystery, Psychological, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 49568, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=brZdjRwznpg', '2026-08-08 14:46:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1885, 'Toward the Terra (TV)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2158-HQQCVlw2B7iz.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'In the future, humans are living on colonized planets and are controlled in every aspect of their life by a system of computers. Evolution has resulted in the birth of people with extraordinary powers. This new race is called Mu. Hated and feared by the humans, the Mu dream of a place to live in peace: Earth - a mystical far away planet - for humanity had to leave their home long ago as pollution and destruction increased and made it impossible to stay there any longer.

Jomy is a boy excitedly awaiting his birthday, the day he will enter the world of adults. Yet he knows nothing about the unknown powers sleeping in him and the shared dream of returning to Earth one day.', 'Minami Machi Bugyousho', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-07', 2158, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2158-rPFjcos7QEPx.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 14492, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GttgQ07-juE', '2026-08-08 14:47:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1886, 'My Bride is a Mermaid OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4163.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'The OVAs are new stand alone shorts with characters from the series and introduces two new ones. It is now the third year of school, San and Luna''s dads are still being over protective. All the while Nagasumi has his hands full trying to keep everyone around him under control and rescuing damsels in distress. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'GONZO', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-11-03', 4163, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Romance', 'OVA', 'FALL', 2, 10571, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-ntyi_yUwxo', '2026-08-08 14:47:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1887, 'Kino no Tabi: the Beautiful World - Byouki no Kuni: For You', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx2175-ODWaMrFEJVCP.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', 'The film adapts a story from volume 5 of the Kino no Tabi light novel series and tells of another country Kino travels through.', 'Shaft', '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-04-21', 2175, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2175-BUdrUgQGawTa.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 14502, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IJOMthGtTHY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1888, 'Death Note: Relight', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b2994-mlofkz5GpkIu.jpg', 'series', '7.4', '1. Genshisuru Kami (Visions of a God)

A two hour episode of Death Note, mainly a compilation of the confrontations between Light and L, re-edited from Ryuk''s perspective with new dialogue and soundtrack along with additional animation that could not be included in the original series.  An Unnamed Shinigami comes to Ryuk to question him about his new story in the human world.


2. Eru o Tsugu Mono (L''s Successors)

This story continues where the previous left off, continuing the story of Light. As the previous special told Light and L''s battles, this story does the same with the conflicts between Light, Mello, and Near.  


(Source: Wikipedia)', 'MADHOUSE', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-08-31', 2994, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural, Thriller', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 2, 43428, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BHUPZpSKkhk', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1889, 'Gunslinger Girl -Il Teatrino-', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/n3231-MP0WwB4XBx6u.png', 'series', '6.7', 'The girls of the Social Welfare Agency are no ordinary children. They are the grisly remains of human wreckage pieced back together with cybernetic implants and trained to kill by the government.

The oldest, Triela, pursues her targets with a ferocious enthusiasm, unwilling to settle for less than total annihilation. Her mirror in this bloody stalemate is Pinocchio, a shell of a boy raised as an assassin by the FRF: a terrorist faction at war with the SWA. Cold and cruelly efficient, he wields sharpened steel as though it were an extension of his own hand.

Once human, these shattered souls have become murderous machines with only vague recollections of what it meant to be real — and a brutal compulsion to be the last killer standing.

(Source: Funimation)', 'Artland', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-01-07', 3231, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3231-IJ6pGZMzEfpb.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 14014, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=msx9MDbNxOs', '2026-08-29 14:38:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1890, 'Hidamari Sketch Tokubetsu-hen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3165-OtlA3Ni5ZIvw.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Sequel of the Hidamari Sketch TV series.', 'Shaft', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-18', 3165, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3165-iucNJYrSaUWX.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 2, 7699, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2bZ6mF3bWw', '2026-08-08 14:46:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1891, 'Strawberry Marshmallow OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1888-mcnlzqIm34zD.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Based on Barasui''s manga series, Ichigo Mashimaro follows the life of Nobue Itou, her younger sister Chika, and her friends. The basic premise of the show can be summed up in "cute girls do cute things in cute ways", be it trying to quit smoking, going outside to play, celebrating a holiday, or doing school work. This OVA picks up where the series left off, continuing the adventures of your everyday life, only cuter. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Daume', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-02-23', 1888, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1888-xX0n1atmBEVp.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 3, 8126, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ia4iVz9_1qs', '2026-08-08 14:47:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1892, 'Claymore', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1818-KieLJv0qo3mO.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'A brutal scourge stalks the land. Yoma, monsters driven by a hunger satisfied by only one quarry - Humanity. The dark breed knows but a singular foe: Claymore. Human-Yoma hybrids of extraordinary strength and cunning, the Claymores roam from skirmish to skirmish delivering salvation by the edge of a blade.

Thus begins the twisting tale of Clare, one such sister of the sword driven by pain in both victory and defeat. A child silent and suffering hidden in her past, Clare''s march toward vengeance unfolds along a path marked by violence, solitude and scorn. In a land where even the predator is prey, the haunted hearts of hunter and hunted alike wear the scars of the age.

(Source: Funimation)', 'MADHOUSE', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-04', 1818, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1818-7Nt2HYxVIxtA.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 118807, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c5DDD0ofspk', '2026-08-08 14:45:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1893, 'Hidamari Sketch', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1852-N3qrLcuVdUTF.png', 'series', '7.4', 'For years, Yuno has dreamed of attending Yamabuki Arts High School, but now that she''s been accepted, it means the scary prospect of moving away from her home and family for the first time! Fortunately, Yuno quickly learns that if her new neighbors at the eclectic Hidamari (Sunshine) Apartments aren''t technically family, at least the majority share the bond of being fellow art students. From second year students like Hiro and Sae, who try to behave like helpful older sisters (mostly successfully) to her hyperactive new neighbor, classmate and best friend Miyako (who has the scariest apartment ever) Yuno begins to build the support network she''ll need for dealing with strange characters like her oddly masculine landlady, her cosplay obsessed home room teacher, her tooth-chattering principal and all of the other odd denizens who inhabit her chosen world of art. 


(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Aniplex', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-11', 1852, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1852-luCP33l49lkR.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 29092, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2bZ6mF3bWw', '2026-08-08 14:45:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1894, 'Casshern Sins', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4981-V6MbMiJUqdvP.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'In the distant future, where cyborgs and humans struggle to survive after the war which destroyed the world, a being in white suit awakens. His name is Casshern and he remembers nothing of his own past. 

In barren and dark dystopian world, where every being alive seems to hate his existence and the evil from his past wants him dead, Casshern, haunted by the flashes of his past memories has to survive and figure out who or what exactly  he is and how he got to where he is now. But he does not know that he might not like the horrible truth of the past, hidden deep inside his mind...

Created as an intended reboot of Casshern franchise.', 'MADHOUSE', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-02', 4981, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4981-lMta9qbqmkq3.png', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 42126, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dxC2-ZorSrA', '2026-08-08 14:45:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1895, 'Initial D BATTLE STAGE 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/3931.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'This is simply the OAV summing up the major events and battles of "Initial D 4th Stage" much like the "Initial D Battle Stage" original summed up the first 3 seasons. Additionally, has 2 extra battles from the manga that were not incorporated into the original 4th Stage.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'A.C.G.T.', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-05-30', 3931, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Sports', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 7925, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4cfBpb1T-94', '2026-08-08 14:45:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1896, 'Birdy the Mighty: Decode', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3974-Gb9WK53nSsPz.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Tsutomu Senkawa is an average high school kid who is busy studying for his senior entrance exams. Tsutomu goes out for some fresh air, after a hard day''s work studying for a big test, when he runs into a guy fleeing from a pretty young lady. The pursued man is actually an interplanetary criminal on the run from a Federation agent called Birdy Cephon Altera. Caught in the midst of this chase, Tsutomu gets thrown by the man at Birdy, which kills Tsutomu. Fortunately for Tsutomu, there is a way to keep him alive, although it comes at the price of discarding his body. He ends up merged into Birdy''s body.', 'A-1 Pictures', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-05', 3974, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3974-oWzLMiXRWyS0.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 25705, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fX1a3fWQ_D4', '2026-08-08 14:45:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1897, 'Minami-ke', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2963-JxvWsnzcs4IP.png', 'series', '7.3', 'There are three of the Minami sisters: Haruka, Kana and Chiaki, who have an average life. The girls only have each other to depend on and help each other get through everything from love confessions to cooking.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Daume', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-08', 2963, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2963-WP4D4YxOk04F.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 36470, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SPKY_xH15GU', '2026-08-08 14:45:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1898, 'Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha StrikerS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1915-IKthftm6s36b.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Set 10 years after Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A''s, Nanoha, Fate, Hayate and the rest of the crew are now working full time in the Time-Space Administration Bureau. Nanoha is a combat instructor, Fate is a special investigator, and Hayate is a commanding officer. They must unite once again to save the dimensions. Introducing new characters as well: Subaru, Teana, Caro and Erio. Stand by. Ready. Set up!', 'Seven Arcs', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-02', 1915, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1915-ZNdHtzCeDdF3.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 12829, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=npAfCvmmPHM', '2026-08-08 14:45:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1899, 'Piano no Mori', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2594.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Amamiya Shuuhei moves from Tokyo to the country side due to his grandmother''s bad health. His father is a famous pianist and Shuuhei has taken strict piano lessons since he was very young, aspiring to follow in his footsteps. In school, he is teased by his classmates and is dared to play the piano in the forest. This piano is said to be cursed: if you play it, no sound will come. After school, Ichinose Kai, a boy in the same class, takes Shuuhei to the forest. When Shuuhei tries to play he fails, but Kai plays a wonderful song. 

This is the beginning of a strong friendship, and a story of two very different boys developing their skills as musicians.', 'MADHOUSE', '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-07-21', 2594, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 15471, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PKTH9IhMaCY', '2026-08-08 14:45:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1900, 'My Bride is a Mermaid', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2104-8nyExxxIKd3P.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Michishio Nagasumi''s life couldn''t be any more normal. In an odd twist of events, during his summer vacation he ends up almost drowning in the sea. Luckily, the cute mermaid Seto San appears to save him. However, San is from a yakuza mermaid family and according to their law, if a human is to catch sight of a mermaid, either he or the mermaid must die. The only other way is for Nagasumi to be taken in as a family member, marrying San. In attempts to save both of their lives, Nagasumi asks for San''s hand in marriage. Nagasumi''s summer vacation reaped more then what he would expect, as he must now protect San from others finding her secret out.', 'GONZO', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-02', 2104, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:22', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2104-kAmCZ6O27DoA.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 62381, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EFcs-kVNpos', '2026-08-08 14:45:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1901, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D''s', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3972-bSmlWKXrVvDv.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D''s is set in Neo Domino City some time after the events concerning Yugi Mutou (DM) and Judai Yuki (GX). A new form of dueling, "Riding Duels", now take place on motorcycles called "D-Wheels". While regular dueling still exists, Riding Duels have become a popular form of entertainment for spectators, who watch them in specially-designed stadiums.', 'Studio Gallop', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-02', 3972, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3972-4DZnJQsQWXpc.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 154, 31547, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L3Su29yMsNo', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1902, 'Black Butler', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx4898-mW4gabZvwmLC.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'In Victorian-era Europe, a young boy loses everything he once held near and dear to a vicious plot. In his moment of death, he strikes a deal with a demon: his soul, in exchange for revenge. Ciel Phantomhive is now the head of the Phantomhive corporation, handling all business affairs as well as the underground work for the Queen of England. His new partner is a demon butler, Sebastian Michaelis, whose powers as a butler is only surpassed by his strength as a demon.

The story follows the two along with their other servants, as they work to unravel the plot behind Ciel''s parents'' murder, and the horrendous tragedies that befell Ciel in the month directly after.', 'Aniplex', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-03', 4898, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4898-qqGPkf0qkMDh.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 258322, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EoipHZFNXv0', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1903, 'Bokurano', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1690-ubEOKbAzWO9C.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'During a summer camp, 15 children, 8 males and 7 females, find a grotto by the sea. Deep within they discover working computers and some electronic equipment, and later the owner, a man called Kokopelli. Kokopelli claimed to be a programmer working on a brand new game, in which a large robot has to defend the Earth against alien invasions. He persuades the children to test the game and sign a contract. All but one of them signs, barely a moment later they mysteriously awaken on the shore believing what happened was just a dream.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'GONZO', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-09', 1690, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1690-ubdbEDXTyigp.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 45990, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x7jl7BbMGCE', '2026-08-29 14:38:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1904, 'Xam''d: Lost Memories', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4177-olqlJzn1DNN0.png', 'series', '7.3', 'Sentan Island is a small island surrounded by the Yuden Sea. It exists in a state of dreamlike tranquility, cut off from the war between the Northern Government and the Southern Continent Free Zone. Our hero, Akiyuki Takehara, lives on Sentan Island along with his mother Fusa. He is currently separated from his father, the town doctor Ryuzo, but the bond between father and son remains. One day, after taking Ryuzo the lunch that Fusa has made for him as usual, Akiyuki arrives at school, where he is caught up in an explosion along with his friends, Haru and Furuichi. The explosion produces a mysterious light, which enters Akiyuki''s arm, causing him excruciating pain. He''s given no time to understand it, however, as the white-haired girl who rode on the bus with him guides him to a power unlike anything he''s ever known.', 'bones', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-15', 4177, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4177-iJw1IJrdX5LP.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 26, 31420, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6LlF0fc_WcM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1905, 'Chi''s Sweet Home', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3841-PSDYqPPpBVBC.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'A grey and white kitten with black stripes wanders away from her mother and siblings one day while enjoying a walk outside. Lost in her surroundings, the kitten struggles to find her family and instead is found by a young boy, Youhei, and his mother. They take the kitten home, but pets are not allowed in their housing complex, so they try to find a new home for the kitten. This proves to be difficult, and the family eventually decides to keep the kitten, naming her "Chi". 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'MADHOUSE', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-03-31', 3841, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3841-kkjmWatQAo9O.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV_SHORT', 'SPRING', 104, 12936, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i4bqN3FouYA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1906, 'Kyo Kara Maoh! Season 3', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4080-TcGSCwBQIN1q.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'At the end of season 2. Yuuri defeats Shinou, but since Shinou had been defeated, Yuuri and Murata could no longer go to the Shin Makoku. However, because Yuuri had fought and defeated him, his powers had surpassed that of Shinou''s, resulting in him being able to rely on his own power to return to Shin Makoku.

After the ceremony at the age of 16, Yuuri slowly begins to discover that much has happened while he was away. The ten officials of the noble family have decided to make Wolfram the next Maou, but now that Yuuri has returned and taken back his role as Maou, complications arise when one noble disagrees with Yuuri returning to the throne.

In addition, an ancient secret society that threatens the peace of both humans and Mazoku has risen, and a fight for the throne that now leaves the nobles wondering who is the legitimate Maou.', 'Studio DEEN', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-03', 4080, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 5375, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Df6dN4b_gtg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1907, 'Afro Samurai the Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx13709-nUNyhw7NOiLr.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'A movie adaptation of the TV series.', NULL, '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-10-27', 13709, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/13709-qFBtEwucVgte.jpg', 'Action', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 13478, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cnZS1M23gRE', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1908, 'Moyashimon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3001-MhrRs4v3tCPs.png', 'series', '7.2', 'Enter Tadayasu, a freshman college student who can see and talk to cute, chibi bacteria and other microscopic organisms. It''s not all fun and games like it sounds, though, because it gets him into all sorts of trouble. Join Tadayasu as he enters his first year at the Agriculture University, what crazy events await him?', 'Telecom Animation Film', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-12', 3001, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3001-xsTcQO6yqoxP.jpg', 'Comedy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 11, 15876, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W6TNmCMXLCk', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1909, 'Golgo 13 (TV)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4039-oClm06wOAmog.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Golgo 13 has been called a Japanese counterpart to James Bond, except with a darker character, a much more hardcore attitude towards sex, and a complete lack of morality. Golgo 13 is described as a mystery man of undetermined origin, possibility being at least part Japanese, who takes any assignment for any employer (it has been said he has worked for the CIA and the KGB) as long as the right price is given and will always fulfill his contracts, even if he has two or more opposing contracts at the same time. He is an uncanny sharpshooter, with near 100% accuracy and capable of lethal trick shooting, and regularly uses a customized, scoped M-16 rifle in his assassinations. He also is a heavy smoker of cigars. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'The Answer Studio', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-12', 4039, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4039-TqDaHWbK6hZA.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 10500, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OXNTOm4YWLA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1910, 'Saint Seiya: The Hades Chapter - Elysion', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3515-g6kdTI901fhw.png', 'series', '7.2', 'After the 12 Gold Saints sacrifice their lives to destroy the Wailing Wall, The Bronze Saints enter the deepest realm of the Underworld, Elysion, where they face off aganist Hades''s two most powerful servants: The Twin Gods, Hypnos and Thanatos, before they can reach Hades for the final battle.', NULL, '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-03-07', 3515, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3515-SG3wJvIck0jp.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 6, 9152, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iYsHv2sdZJw', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1911, 'Oh! My Goddess: Fighting Wings', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3090-B3LjppvhoMqm.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'An Angel Eater has been freed in Heaven. Since Goddesses and Angels share body and soul, losing your angel results in going into shock for the Goddess. Lind goes to Earth to protect Belldandy and the others unknowing that it is a trap.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-12-09', 3090, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Romance, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 2, 4873, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uLGChggNImA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1912, 'Darker than Black: Beneath Cherry Blossoms in Full Bloom', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4182-Sj5g5kz2WPuT.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'A side story of Darker than BLACK, also known as Episode 26. A Contractor was killed and it was rumored that his corpse and possessions were buried under a Sakura tree. Hei and the others (including the Police) decide to investigate.', 'bones', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-03-27', 4182, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4182-G3Xo6NHOphDL.jpg', 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 30290, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=goYEIQT5m8U', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1913, 'Hell Girl: Three Vessels', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3713.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'After the events of the 2nd season, Ai''s three helpers, Ichimoku Ren, Wanyuudou and Hone-Onna live out their lives in relative peace. This is suddenly shattered when Kikuri returns to recruit them. Meanwhile, Ai mysteriously reappears from the dead and uses the body of a young schoolgirl, Yuzuki Mikage, to continue the Jigoku Ts&#363;shin operation. Yuzuki is aware of Ai''s presence however, when she can see what Ai sees.', 'Aniplex', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-04', 3713, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3713-PJQ9gqsE0hWJ.jpg', 'Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 18959, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zo5wuctIMWk', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1914, 'Macross Frontier Deculture Edition', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4454.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'An expanded version of the first episode of Macross Frontier.', 'Satelight', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-12-23', 4454, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 3382, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u_bQLaj9iUI', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1915, 'Shugo Chara!! Doki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5262-QdR7ooiQfYLY.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'With things having quieted down a bit for the Guardians, they can now focus on things besides fending off the peril of the evil Easter Corporation. Amu is having some troubles deciding which guy she likes the most, and hiding Ikuto in her room. Not only does the Embryo still elude the Guardians, and worries of Easter being suspiciously inactive, the threat of a new X Egg appears...', 'TV Tokyo', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-04', 5262, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n5262-YDqAtRYi4Pqg.jpg', 'Comedy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 17521, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cMFq3xnYMnQ', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1916, 'Shakugan no Shana: Season II', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2787-ACpKjLdA6T5Z.png', 'series', '7.2', 'The heated bond between Shana and Yuji is tested as their paranormal adventures continues. The Flame Haze fends off supernatural foes by night. By day, she contends with a classmate who''s also after Yuji''s heart. Emotions flare as a suspicious transfer student who resembles a recently defeated Denizen clings to Yuji. His training rises in intensity when they catch wind of a revered warrior in search of her lost lover—who will stop at nothing to extract the power keeping Yuji alive! 

(Source: FUNimation)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-05', 2787, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2787-eP3fdmgXVnmT.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 50784, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gqcCX6HT0Ag', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1917, 'Hayate the Combat Butler', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2026-xoCa4unn5iOi.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Hayate Ayasaki''s life wasn''t great, but when he loses the job he used to support his good-for-nothing family, and his deadbeat parents sell him to the Yakuza for cash, it really hits rock bottom! Faced with having to pay off the huge debt before he''s converted into black market organ parts, a desperate Hayate decides to kidnap oddball heiress Nagi Sanzenin for ransom... but when even that goes wrong and he accidentally ends up rescuing Nagi from other kidnappers, it turns out that Hayate is the bodyguard that Nagi has been looking for! So now he''s the Sanzenin family''s butler, and… maybe… it might be the start of a potential romantic relationship… assuming Hayate can survive the on-the-job training, of course.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'SynergySP', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-01', 2026, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2026.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 41480, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=le9VbvjsZ0g', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1918, 'Inuyasha: Kuroi Tessaiga', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4886-xzcW3fD6rmoK.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'A 30-minute Inuyasha feature titled Kuroi Tessaiga screened on Takahashi Rumiko''s picture exhibitions across Japan.

In January 2010, this special ended up, slightly edited, as episode 15 of Inuyasha Kanketsu-hen.', NULL, '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-30', 4886, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 6039, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JVWsano6Dwo', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1919, 'Wangan Midnight', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2608-o3f8kIfo5j8i.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Based on a seinen manga by Kusunoki Michiharu serialised in Young Magazine. 

The story gets its roots from the actual street racing that occurs on Tokyo''s Shuto Expressway, one stretch of which is known as the "Wangan", literally meaning "bay side" (although it is generally used to refer to the freeway), the longest, straightest road in the entire country. Of course, there''s also lots of traffic to contend with, including a fair number of heavy trucks. Because of this, the action is inherently hazardous, and wrecks are common. Blown engines are also a frequent hazard, especially with the extreme-high power engines. 

One day, Akio Asakura, a third year high school student, is driving his Fairlady Z (Z31) and is challenged by Tatsuya Shima, a doctor, in his black Porsche 964 Turbo (nicknamed the "BlackBird"). With a friend in the passenger seat and two girls in the back, Akio pitifully tries to win, but is defeated. Determined to become faster, he goes to the junkyard to buy parts for his car, when he sees a pristine, unscratched midnight blue Fairlady Z (S30) in the junkyard. Intrigued as to why such a machine is about to be junked, he buys it. He soon finds that the car is unnaturally fast due to a tuned L28 engine, bored and stroked to 3.1 liters combined with twin turbos, which produces 620bhp. He also finds that all of the car''s previous owners had unfortunate accidents in it, starting with the first owner''s death. The manga follows Akio''s various encounters, though the central plot revolves around his constant battle with the BlackBird for superiority. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'A.C.G.T.', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-06-15', 2608, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 26, 14073, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LocOhVG9tF0', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1920, 'Sketchbook ~full color''s~', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2942-vxdVXaBnXIza.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'No matter where she goes, Sora takes her sketchbook along. The world is full of mysterious and beautiful things, after all, and Sora doesn''t want to miss a single one. The best way she knows to capture each moment is by drawing and sketching, watching and learning.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Hal Film Maker', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-02', 2942, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2942-plQagt6Gsh4m.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 9970, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZ2Z5n5Zui8', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1921, 'Oh! My Goddess: Flights of Fancy Specials', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2198-0pDZwYhmXHlG.png', 'series', '7.2', 'When Keiichi found his grandpa''s diary and saw a treasure map inside, Skuld and Urd started to feel a great urge to search it. With the company of his friends, Keiichi arrives to Honda Inn, the place indicated on the map. Once the party is inside, they meet Honda Chieko, who seems to share a certain promise with Keiichi. Apart from all that confusion, it''s time for Keiichi to have enough courage to say the words ''I love you'' to Belldandy.', 'AIC', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-02-23', 2198, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Romance, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 2, 4796, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VYK8b-qBZw4', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1922, 'Romeo x Juliet', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1699-QsuvclfX0G9M.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'In the floating continent of Neo Verona, the Montague family seized control and murdered every member of the Capulet family with the exception of Capulet''s daughter, Juliet Fiammata Asto Capulet. 14 years later, Juliet and the remnants of Capulet''s retainers live hidden from the iron fist of the Montague family. Juliet has long forgotten the murder of her family or her identity, and cross dresses as Odin and the town''s hero of justice, "Red Whirlwind". A sudden escape in her daily escapades leads her to meet Romeo Candorebanto Montague, the kind son of the tyrannical Montague. Destiny has been set as these two individuals soon to be "star-crossed lovers" are cruelly toyed with by fate in the midst of war. Loosely based on the play by William Shakespeare.', 'GONZO', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-05', 1699, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1699-VOfSnDLlHD8J.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 30746, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MeZGsFl6ilA', '2026-08-29 14:38:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1923, 'Tentai Senshi Sunred', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5005.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The story revolves around the Tama River area, based mostly in Kawasaki City Kanagawa where battles are fought between the evil organisation Florsheim and the ally of justice Sunred. The twist is that Sunred (referred to most characters familiar with him as Red-san) is a rough-talking, violent and rude hero while the villains of Florsheim (led by General Vamp) are for the most part polite, conscientious and easy-going.

Despite this, both sides still stay true to their roles, with Florsheim dedicated to destroying Sunred and taking over the world while Sun Red battles against them. Other evil organisations and heroes are also mentioned from time to time.

Each episode is divided into various shorts of varying length. Most of the humour comes from the interactions of the characters, especially the main trio of Sunred, his girlfriend Kayoko and General Vamp. Kayoko and Vamp, for example, get along very well and she occasionally consults him about housework or cooking. In contrast, she and Sunred often argue like a long married couple.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'AIC A.S.T.A.', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-03', 5005, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV_SHORT', 'FALL', 26, 5690, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7aErITgfedM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1924, 'Summer Days with Coo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2848-byY6os6NuxRU.png', 'movies', '7.1', 'Kouichi Uehara is a fourth grade student living in the suburb of Tokyo. One day, he picks up a large stone which turns out to be a fossil of a baby "Kappa" sleeping underground for the past 300 years, and names it "Coo". Koichi and Coo become good friends and starts living with his family. However, Coo could not adjust to the life style in Tokyo and starts to miss his family. On a hot summer day, Koichi and Coo decide to go on an adventurous road trip to find his peers. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Shin-Ei Animation', '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-07-28', 2848, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2848-Q7mKLqknjh3a.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 5463, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AodqtH60OqM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1925, 'S.A: Special A', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx3470-L3BUDBujYi7G.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Hikari Hanazono has always been second to Kei Takishima. When they were six years old, their pro-wrestling loving fathers introduced them to each other. Assuming that she was the best in wrestling, young Hikari challenged Kei to a wrestling match only to be thoroughly defeated by him. 


Ever since that fateful incident, Hikari swore to beat Kei in school grades, sporting events - anything. To do this, she has enrolled in the same school as Kei since elementary. Now she attends Hakusenkan, an ultra elite school, that costs her carpenter father a lot of money. 


Hikari and Kei are the top two students in the school, with Kei holding firmly to that number one position. While Hikari considers Kei to be a rival and important friend, she is completely unaware that Kei loves her. The story primarily focuses on Hikari and her constant attempts to defeat her one and only rival, Kei, and how she finds love in their rivalry.', 'GONZO', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-07', 3470, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3470.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 60760, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YX_n---0ASM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1926, 'Shugo Chara!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2923-4gO5g4PBcoxy.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Amu Hinamori is a 5th grade transfer student who is fashionably cool, tough and independent. Despite this, she is also a girl who seems unapproachable, both at home and at school. In reality, the "Cool and Spicy" role she plays is just a facade that she unconsciously plays. With her guardian characters, she fights the Easter Company who is extracting people''s eggs to create X Eggs & X Characters in search of a special egg called the Embryo.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'TV Tokyo', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-06', 2923, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2923-TfdsqP36uIqH.jpg', 'Comedy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 39541, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cMFq3xnYMnQ', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1927, 'Shigofumi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3420-ZHbQqYUJCcUn.png', 'series', '7.1', 'When someone dies, what should their final words be? Words that couldn''t be said while still alive - of love, hate, hope, regret or perhaps words without any importance. These words are sent through letters called "shigofumi" from the recently deceased to the living. Mikawa Fumika is a mail carrier of these shigofumi, delivering them alongside staff and her partner Kanaka. However, there must be something more behind Fumika''s silent exterior; shigofumi mail carriers are deceased humans with the same appearance they had just before death. Despite this, Fumika is still aging...

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'J.C.STAFF', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-01-06', 3420, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3420-MRKbcQNKBhXA.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Psychological, Supernatural, Thriller', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 22395, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EtdjbZB014c', '2026-08-29 14:38:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1928, 'Heroic Age', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2002-sQ6vkoTLbZV3.png', 'series', '7.1', 'When the Golden Race invited other races to join them in the stars, three sentient races answered their call. The Goldens called them the Bronze, Silver and Heroic Tribes. Just before the Gold Tribe left to travel to another Universe, a fourth race appeared, traveling to the stars on their own accomplishments. The Golds named the human race the Iron Tribe. During the passing of time, humanity suffers at the hands of the more dominant races and is now facing extinction. Following a prophecy left by the Gold Tribe, Princess Deianeira sets out to search for the powerful being who might be able to save humankind. She meets a wild haired boy on an abandoned planet - a fateful encounter that will not only change the fortunes of Humanity, but also the fate of the universe.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Xebec', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-02', 2002, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2002-5EWK6nxP6gAZ.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 20978, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eKoW56OLG8k', '2026-08-29 14:38:25', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1929, 'The Daughter of 20 Faces', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3673-Fos7rHpTdnnf.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Chiko is the daughter of the wealthy Mikamo family who has to live with her aunt and uncle after her parents passed away. Because her aunt wants to inherit the Mikamo family''s wealth, she gives Chiko poisoned food. One day, however, she''s kidnapped by the Nijuu Mensou (20 Faces) and decides to join his clan. 

(Source: ZOMG)', 'bones', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-13', 3673, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3673-xT4Iyud3WayT.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'TV', 'SPRING', 22, 7673, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2LotdklGqKA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1930, 'Neuro: Supernatural Detective', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b2985-tfv7c225KMCs.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The series focuses on Neuro Nougami, a demon who feeds on mysteries and puzzles, who comes to the human world to feast on the mysteries offered by humans who release negative energy from their planned crimes. As a demon, he must not make his presence noticed by the humans as it is the law in the human world. Because of this, he makes a permanent deal with Yako Katsuragi (who has her own personal mystery she has to solve), and together they solve crimes for Neuro''s appetite.', 'MADHOUSE', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-03', 2985, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2985.jpg', 'Comedy, Mystery, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 12123, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9C5aqMfugM0', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1931, 'Initial D EXTRA STAGE 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/5228.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Iketani missed an opportunity to see Mako-chan and hates himself for never calling to say he was sorry. By chance he runs into her 6 months later, and the situation is awkward. Iketani does not have time to talk at that moment, but both want to talk, so they arrange a second meeting. Iketani goes to the meeting place early, but an old man was left behind from an tourist bus, and asks Iketani to catch the bus for him. Iketani being a nice guy, so he can''t say no.', 'A.C.G.T.', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-03', 5228, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Sports', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 12070, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VpVjqgV24qc', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1932, 'Gakuen Utopia Manabi Straight!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1858-Iy8gy8YMATXM.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Manabi Straight! follows the lives of a group of young high school girls living in the year 2035 while they attend the all-girl Seioh Private High School. Since the birth rate has dropped dramatically, schools are being closed down due to the sheer lack of students available to teach. Morale in schools has dropped dramatically, and Seioh is no exception.

The story begins when the main character, Manami Amamiya, transfers to Seioh. After some initial hijinks involving a futuristic scooter and a swim meet, followed by an inspirational school song performance, she is inducted as the student council president. The story that follows pertains to Manami working with Mika Inamori, the only other student council member, and three other classmates named Mutsuki Uehara, Mei Etoh, and Momoha Odori, in student council matters.  After some remodeling of the student council room, Manami and her friends set forth to plan for the upcoming student festival.

(Source: Wikipedia, edited)', 'ufotable', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-08', 1858, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1858-m2iWzzPYu5B7.jpg', 'Comedy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 9367, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3cLufk0DjOY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1933, 'Ranma 1/2: Akumu! Shunmin Kou', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5493-qsjGrDAxI11R.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Twelve years after the final OVA was shown, and the end of the manga, a new piece of Ranma &frac12; animation was made for the "It''s a Rumic World" exhibition of Rumiko Takahashi''s artwork. The new 30 minute special is based on the "Nightmare! Incense of Spring Sleep" manga story from volume 34, and was shown on odd numbered days at the "It''s A Rumic World" exhibition in Tokyo from July 30th to August 11th.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio DEEN', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-07-31', 5493, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 3788, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CeUZpSuOuS4', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1934, 'Shakugan no Shana: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b1815-M8GPrlO01336.png', 'movies', '7.1', 'The movie is not a sequel to the anime, but is an adaptation of all the events in the first novel and contains events that were not in the anime series.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2007', 'movie', 'released', '2007-04-21', 1815, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 12341, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YwHyNlFFhDI', '2026-08-29 14:38:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1935, 'Shion no Ou: The Flowers of Hard Blood', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2562.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Shion no Ou follows the story of Yasuoka Shion, a 13-year-old Shougi player with a past of tragedy. Shion''s parents were brutally murdered in front of her when she was 5 years old. The murderer sat down with her and challenged her to a game of Shougi, after telling her that if she wanted to stay alive she should forget how to speak, and forget what happened that night. 

Now Shion has entered the realm of female pro Kishi, mute but strong. As her playing gathers more and more attention, so do the questions about her past and the brutal murder she witnessed. Shion''s memories slowly come back, and the mystery begins to unravel, thread by thread.', NULL, '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-14', 2562, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'TV', 'FALL', 22, 6901, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Toc9x19Cmkg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1936, 'Library War', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3613-b066tE3vNUAQ.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Toshokan Sensou tells the story of Kasahara Iku, the first woman to join the Library Task Force. In the near future in Japan, the Media Enhancement Law has been forced upon the population censoring all books and media. To counter this, the Library Defense Force was created. To protect themselves against the Media Enhancement Law Commission, all major libraries are fully equipped with a military Task Force, who take it upon themselves to protect the books and freedom of media of the people. This anime follows Iku and her fellow soldiers as they protect various special books and artifacts from the oppression of the Media Enhancement Law Commission. A love story, war story, and comedy all rolled into one.', 'Production I.G', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-04-11', 3613, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3613-TTaBaLPGF1AG.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 15347, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lg2xVl7dJhQ', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1937, 'Afro Samurai', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1292-FcyYgq7Ly34H.png', 'series', '7.1', 'After watching his father die in a duel against an unbeatable villian known only as ''Justice,'' young Afro fixes his life on the study of swords and revenge. The tale of Afro Samurai is one of bloody hardship and pain. Along his solitary path of revenge for his murdered father, he sheds no tears & knows no love. Forever chased by powerful enemies in a lawless technology-speckled dystopia, he evades bullets and blade to reach his final prey: a man who will not die. But Afro will reach his quarry - even if it means painting a road of blood and brains from here to the bitter inevitable end.', 'GONZO', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-04', 1292, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1292-eucruhMiEZxx.jpg', 'Action, Adventure', 'TV', 'WINTER', 5, 87023, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GDLv1x2bi4I', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1938, 'The Sky Crawlers', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx3089-AVjAzlLaN7SQ.jpg', 'movies', '7.1', 'The Sky Crawlers is based on a Japanese novel series by Hiroshi Mori. First published by Chu&#333;k&#333;ron-shinsha in June 2001 and spanning five books, it follows the journeys and tribulations of a group of young fighter pilots involved in dogfight warfare, and is set during an alternate historical period.', 'Production I.G', '2008', 'movie', 'released', '2008-08-02', 3089, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3089-OiQzZu3veLmK.jpg', 'Drama, Psychological', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 16754, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O21bxZrHvY8', '2026-08-29 14:38:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1939, 'Over Drive', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2112-txrbJOYMRcco.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Tour de France, it is the biggest bicycle race in the world. Now, a new achievement is about to be recorded in the history of Tour de France. The top racer is a Japanese boy named Shinozaki Mikoto.

"Why don''t you join our bicycle club?" said Fukazawa, Shinozaki Mikoto''s secret love.

Unfortunately, despite being a high school student, he doesn''t know how to ride a bike. With no real idea of what the bicycle club is, he earnestly practices. After he overcomes this challenge, while he pedals along, something that was smoldering in his mind for 15 years ignites.

"I want to devote myself to bike riding."

Experiencing failure with his friends and rivals, he pedals towards becoming the top racer.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Xebec', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-04-04', 2112, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 7456, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jB1XvMyEBNA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1940, 'Ghost Hound', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2596-7VmcTkkQmOST.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'In an isolated region of Kyushu lies the town of Suiten.  Though seeming small and modest, Suiten is not a picturesque place for a vacation, unless it is from the &ldquo;Unseen World&rdquo;.  Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, three boys with traumatic pasts, learn to let their souls cross between the two parallel worlds.  However, the Unseen World is no mere copy of the real Apparent World.  The Unseen World is the home of ghosts, but changes are now allowing the souls of the dead to pass over into the Apparent World, with unpredictable effects.  Follow the journey of Taro, Makoto and Masayuki, as they cross between the two worlds, trying to unravel a great mystery. 

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)

Note: Anime was made as the 20th anniversary project for Production I.G.', 'Production I.G', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-10-18', 2596, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2596-poZ7IzBgRQA4.jpg', 'Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 22, 34308, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jfgJZXsgCfI', '2026-08-29 14:38:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1941, 'Letter Bee: Light and Blue Night Fantasy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5538.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'The story takes place in the land of Amber Ground, a place of perpetual night only partially illuminated by an artificial sun. Lag Seeing works as a "Letter Bee" (delivery boy) at the "Bee Hive" (a delivery service), with his Dingo, Niche, and her "pet", Steak, traveling with him. He is entrusted with the "hearts" of the everyone in Amber Ground to deliver their packages.

(Source: Wikipedia)

Note: The pilot episode of Tegami Bachi shown during the Jump Super Anime Tour in the Fall of 2008, the story was later incorporated into episode 17 of the first season.', 'Studio Pierrot', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-11-24', 5538, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 3038, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MMHkoeFUzv4', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1942, 'A Certain Magical Index', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4654-ba44icsxDQZd.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Set in a city of scientifically advanced superhuman students, but in a world where magic is also real. Touma Kamijou&rsquo;s right hand, the Imagine Breaker, will negate all magic, psychic, or divine powers, but not his own bad luck. One day he finds a young girl hanging on his balcony railing. She turns out to be a nun from the Church of England, and her mind has been implanted with the Index-Librorum-Prohibitorum - all the magical texts the Church has removed from circulation.', 'J.C.STAFF', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-05', 4654, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4654-YLc90XaeWvPb.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 188949, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U04iq9T93ss', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1943, 'Minami-ke: Okawari', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3225-o0alpa3uDh0S.png', 'series', '7.0', 'The second season of Minami-Ke. It picks up where the first season left off, and just like the first season, it''s about the daily lives of the three Minami sisters, Haruka, Kana and Chiaki, and their school friends.', 'Starchild Records', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-01-07', 3225, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3225-RA6ojx4GBLMD.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 14344, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q7u7wjHwvZI', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1944, 'Junjo Romantica 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4814-p0o6nYsrDA81.png', 'series', '7.0', 'The second part of Junjou Romantica continuing the story.', 'Studio DEEN', '2008', 'series', 'released', '2008-10-12', 4814, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4814-wHTj9VMkcOPu.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 24062, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stN31zyrigU', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1945, 'Ouran High School Host Club', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx853-fiUtW8yohsSF.jpg', 'series', '8.1', 'Fujioka Haruhi wins a scholarship to attend Ouran Academy, a school reserved for only the most rich and prestigious. Despite what other students may think of her, she cares little for physical appearances or the fact that she is a commoner.

Unfortunately for Haruhi, her high school days take a sudden turn when she stumbles upon the Host Club, an elite club filled with super rich and beautiful boys who use their specific traits and charms to entertain young ladies. Even worse, Haruhi accidentally breaks an 8-million yen vase in the club. Since she is unable to repay her debt with money, Haruhi finds herself with no choice but to work for the Host Club, becoming a male host herself.', 'bones', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-04-05', 853, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/853-03VYT300hMaf.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 253234, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZM8a3QYtOfA', '2026-08-29 14:38:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1946, 'Black Lagoon: The Second Barrage', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1519-cScqJxQW3LNL.png', 'series', '8.0', 'Okajima Rokuro - now known almost exclusively as ''Rock'' - was once a typical, put-upon Japanese businessman. Then, on a routine business trip, he was kidnapped and ransomed by the Lagoon Company: a band of mercenary pirates operating out of the crime-riddled city of Roanapur. Abandoned by his bosses, he joined the Lagoon Company. Now he must try and stay afloat amongst the ever-shifting politics of the criminal underworld, while simultaneously avoiding death at the hands of his quick-tempered, gun-toting co-worker, ''Two Hand'' Revy.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-10-03', 1519, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1519-3gSdIkwibEND.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 104815, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-KgtNdG_zfE', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1947, 'Major S2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx558-150bXAI8K3ab.png', 'series', '7.9', 'This series picks up a few years after season one. Goro is now older, and has come back to his original home town. As if nothing changed, he starts off right where he left with his old friends and tries to fit back in.', 'Studio Hibari', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-12-10', 558, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 26, 14366, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4yp-xh72yfM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1948, 'Honey and Clover II', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1142-Y3IHBNnS6DqS.jpg', 'series', '7.9', 'The sequel and final installment to the highly popular series once again delves into the life stories and love lives of Takemoto Yuuta, Mayama Takumi and Morita Shinobu. The story continues where the first season left off, after Takemoto''s self-discovery journey around Japan. Of course, the love triangles and tribulations they face will continue, and eventually decide the paths to their future.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-06-30', 1142, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1142-rBjPb78CSg8X.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 20144, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WqoAIXLQcPY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1949, 'Black Lagoon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx889-4S7N2ciq2cwA.png', 'series', '7.8', 'Okajima Rokuro is a Japanese businessman in a town full of Japanese businessmen. His normal day consists of social drinking with clients and being kicked around by his bosses. He finally gets a break though, as he''s sent by his company to the tropical seas of Eastern China to deliver a disc. But his boat gets hijacked by a band of mercenaries hired to retrieve the disc. Rock (as he is newly dubbed by his captors) catches the interest of the only female merc Revy as she thinks he''s worth a ransom, taking him hostage. However, the disc that was stolen has a terrible secret that''s unknown to Rock, which causes massive confusion and chaos for both him and his kidnappers.', 'MADHOUSE', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-04-09', 889, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/889-qZE1iFHexJVz.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 247317, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AlZmD15k-F4', '2026-08-29 14:38:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1950, 'Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha A''s', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx77-SwBCj7R1enWi.png', 'series', '7.8', 'After the events of the Lost Logia case, Nanoha waits patiently for the day she can reunite with her newfound friend, Fate. Although being an exceptionally powerful mage, Nanoha spends her days normally with her friends on Earth. But peace is once again suddenly shattered, as Nanoha is without warning attacked by a powerful mage. A group of violent mages have been attacking anything with magic power for their own goals. Nanoha and Fate, along with their friends Yuuno, Arf, Chrono and the Space/Time Administration Bureau must once more band together to stop these renegade mages from hurting anyone or anything else. Takes place after the first season of Lyrical Nanoha.', 'Seven Arcs', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-10-02', 77, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/77-T4VUflM5o47a.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 15987, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=npAfCvmmPHM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1951, 'Paradise Kiss', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx322-4OvRw6V7JTiK.png', 'series', '7.8', 'Hayasaka Yukari is a typical high-school student who listens to her parents and attends school every day. As she starts to question her way of life, she encounters a group of fashion design students who have a clothing label known as "Paradise Kiss." The group needs to find a model to showcase their designs in an up-coming fashion show and decides to pick Yukari. Initially reluctant to be associated with this seemingly eccentric group, she eventually realizes they are really nice people. Furthermore, their passion and enthusiasm to follow their ideals make Yukari realize she has not been enjoying her life and thus motivates her to pursue her own dreams. The story follows Yukari as she gets involved in the group and eventually falls in love with the leader, George.', 'MADHOUSE', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-10-13', 322, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/322-tkZyVRGr7FGN.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 61706, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nDWf1TlpfDI', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1952, 'Eureka Seven', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx237-P1YEQQFqZ1An.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'Renton is a teenager trapped working as a mechanic in a backwater town. He dreams of joining up with a daredevil group of pilots known as Gekkostate and following in his father''s heroic footsteps.

When a mysterious beauty named Eureka shows up asking for a tune-up, Renton soon finds himself drawn into a high-flying mecha dogfight that makes him a target of the military. When the dust settles on the spectacular battle, Renton is invited to join Gekkostate, but he soon discovers that even a dream come true has a dark side.

(Source: Funimation)', 'bones', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-04-17', 237, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/237-2w9hQ1THtj3C.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 87099, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q8fnpn0rovU', '2026-08-29 14:38:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1953, 'Akagi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx658-vfMTeXswhOzl.png', 'series', '7.7', 'While mahjong is a game that is often played with family and friends, it is also a game that is played in the darkest corners of society. Nangou is a compulsive gambler who has accumulated a debt of over three million yen. In a last-ditch attempt to clear his record, he decides to wager his life on a game of mahjong with the mafia. Unfortunately, as the game progresses, Nangou only moves further from the prize and closer to death.

When all hope seems lost, the game parlor is suddenly intruded upon by Shigeru Akagi, a young boy on the run from the police. Desperate to turn the game around, Nangou hands the game over to Akagi after teaching him a few of the rules. The mafia can only smirk as Akagi sits down to play. However, they soon come to learn that Akagi is a natural-born gambler. An imposing figure who does not fear death. One who is destined to become a legend.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'MADHOUSE', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-10-04', 658, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/658-vAjz5mXc5Him.jpg', 'Psychological, Sports, Thriller', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 30535, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6ivna1QcNR8', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1954, 'School Rumble 2nd Term', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b846-5sTqhxItEaTK.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'Continuing right where season 1 left off: Harima still likes Tenma but still runs into obstacles everytime he tries to confess his love to her. To complicate the situation, Class 2-D challenges class 2-C once again and there''s a rumor floating around that Harima and Yakumo are dating as the school prepares for the cultural festival.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Comet', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-04-03', 846, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/846-Cq2TlJOlQVwU.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 24667, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DJwb93UJC4g', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1955, 'Kenichi: The Mightiest Disciple', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1559-7ZlyZxtBNo8g.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'From wimp to warrior. Sort of…

Yeah, Kenichi’s a total wimp. He’s always getting picked on and doesn’t have a lot of friends to stick up for him. The guy needs motivation if he hopes to graduate in one piece. Well, Miu’s the perfect motivation. She’s hot, she accepts him, and she just so happens to live at a dojo with six martial arts masters. You could say fate has led Kenichi to their door, or you could say he was just following the hottie. Either way, he’s about to get whipped into serious shape. If he can survive some hard-core training, he might survive another day at school. He might even score with Miu. Yeah, you could call Kenichi a wimp. But let’s go with underdog instead.

(Source: Discotek)', 'TV Tokyo', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-10-07', 1559, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1559-5SRwJ2TlstL3.jpg', 'Action, Comedy', 'TV', 'FALL', 50, 51150, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4xDehi5Qjqs', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1956, 'Glass Mask (2005)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx1974-PzoEQUA7jnRS.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'Two Girls. One Dream. And the entire world for a stage.

At 13 years old, Maya Kitajima seems destined to spend the rest of her life toiling in a crowded restaurant alongside her bitter and unstable mother. But when her incredible acting talent is discovered by the legendary diva Chigusa Tsukikage, Maya finds a new future filled with both golden opportunities and terrifying risks. 

For Ayumi Himekawa, success has always been assured, yet she longs to be recognized for her own talents and skills, not her famous parents'' connections. 

For both, the ultimate prize is the role of The Crimson Goddess in the play of the same name, a part created by Chigusa. To achieve this goal, both Maya and Ayumi must seek out and conquer every acting challenge, pushing the limits of their talent and endurance to the utmost, until they are worthy of the part&hellip;

But for one to win, the other must fail! 

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'TMS Entertainment', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-04-06', 1974, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1974-zQbrYBRo4d1f.jpg', 'Drama', 'TV', 'SPRING', 51, 9144, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-T616AY5ZY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1957, 'Full Metal Panic! The Second Raid', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx73-UgXDGEMBPGle.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'This series is set about two months after the events ocurred in the Tuatha de Danaan at the end of the original series. Mithril becomes aware of a secret organization that has technology able to counter the ECS (Electronic Cloaking System) mode. This organization, known as Amalgam, also has "Black Technology", obtained from "Whispered" like Kaname Chidori, and like the other intelligency agencies, they intend to obtain more. However, when Sousuke''s mission to protect Chidori is terminated by Mithril, all seems to be in place for Amalgam''s plans... Like many of its fans know, it is based of the FMP novel "The End of Day by Day."

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Kyoto Animation', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-07-14', 73, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/73-UdHqZ4qFc4o8.png', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 41333, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tnRHkeLvaMc', '2026-08-29 14:38:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1958, 'REBORN!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1604-W2q38L4OCGLI.png', 'series', '7.7', 'Nowadays, the mafia world is ruled by Italy''s strongest family, the Vongola. Vongola''s current head, ninth in the row, is an old man ready for retirement. But before he can hand down his position, he needs help from a professional Hitman to prepare the next generation Boss for ruling over Vongola and the mafia world itself.

Sawada Tsunayoshi is just your ordinary teenage boy who attends Junior High and sucks at it. He is unpopular, has no friends, and is desperately in love with a girl from his class. But his life takes an extraordinary turn when Tsunayoshi meets Reborn, an infamous hitman, who the ninth boss of Vongola has sent to train Tsunayoshi for his upcoming title.

(Source: Katekyo Hitman Reborn! FC)', 'Artland', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-10-07', 1604, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1604-n7a4gHUeqmba.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 203, 95667, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hOgAuJgKZuc', '2026-08-29 14:38:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1959, 'Tekkonkinkreet', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2154-R7xZo22O9FjK.png', 'movies', '7.7', 'Black, a boy who seeks to bend the city to his will through strength, and White, his innocent counterpart, are two orphaned street kids living in the slums of Treasure Town. When real estate developers threaten to transform Treasure Town into a massive theme park, its very existence is put at risk. Determined to protect both White and their city, Black takes on the yakuza and assassins, gradually losing his innocence as he confronts a dark manifestation within himself.

(Source: GKIDS)', 'Studio 4°C', '2006', 'movie', 'released', '2006-12-23', 2154, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2154-Y9c0h2i4VJWD.jpg', 'Action, Psychological, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 34657, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AckfHskre-8', '2026-08-29 14:38:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1960, 'xxxHOLiC', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx861-rbZNhIXwS4JE.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Watanuki Kimihiro can see spirits and other assorted supernatural creatures, which is quite a bothersome ability he strongly dislikes. On the way home one day, while plagued by some spirits, he is inexplicably compelled to enter a strange house. There, he encounters Yuuko, a mysterious woman who claims to be able to rid him of the ability to see and attract the troublesome creatures – for a price. She demands for him to work at her "store" that grants wishes to people, and thus begins Watanuki''s adventures through weird and wonderful events.', 'Production I.G', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-04-07', 861, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/861-9LoNqdFERLvT.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 70864, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zOoZgS7eiBg', '2026-08-29 14:38:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1961, 'xxxHOLiC - A Midsummer Night''s Dream', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx793-36e9w8wPXG6g.png', 'movies', '7.6', 'Yuuko receives a letter from an unknown sender. It is an invitation to an auction. Seven avid collectors were invited to an old mansion. They all admit that they accepted the invitation to complete their collections. They waited for the host, but he does not make an appearance. And one by one the collectors disappear. The strange host and a mysterious girl. A night where odd things happen one after another. What is being auctioned? Who is the host? The cunning and foolish people who are obsessed with "possessions" and the host''s "timeless" passion. What is waiting at the end of this enigmatic series of riddles? And what is the conclusion of the sad love story behind them? Mystery leads to mystery, and reaches the unexpected!

(Source: Production I.G.)', 'Production I.G', '2005', 'movie', 'released', '2005-08-20', 793, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/793-0vuwNQvEsHY3.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 12009, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zOoZgS7eiBg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1962, 'Ergo Proxy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx790-YTUCvBKX8ZWK.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Something is wrong in the perfect domed city of Romdo. Between the sudden rash of murders and a virus affecting all AutoReivs-cyborg companions and workers who assist the people of Romdo - all is not right in their dome home. Detective Re-l Meyer begins to investigate, seeking answers to the weird occurrences that are happening more and more around her. But when she begins to uncover the truth, her world is turned upside down.

First, the strange immigrant Vincent Law goes missing and then a monster appears before her, shaking her to her core. But this monster is something more, something dangerous and sinister. With each question and mystery, she is led back to the creature. But what is it really? What purpose does it serve? A sign of the end or a sign of a new beginning? Whatever it is, it repeatedly brings her back to Vincent and soon, alongside his journey back to another dome world called, Mosk. As they make their way across scarred and deserted Earth, Re-l and Vincent will learn more about the monster and the "awakening"-which could be more of an ending than a beginning.

(Source: Funimation)

Note: Episode 1 received an advanced broadcast on channel WOWOW on February 5, 2006. The start date reflects the start of the regular series broadcasting.', 'Manglobe', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-02-25', 790, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/790.jpg', 'Adventure, Mystery, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 23, 154502, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4cL1SfJO4Mo', '2026-08-29 14:38:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1963, 'Kanon (2006)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1530-nkzstlVZhZNG.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'As a young child, Aizawa Yuuichi had often visited his cousin in the city. However, something drastic happened to keep him away for seven long years. Now, Yuuichi returns, his memories of those days are simply gone.

Settling into the wintry town, Yuuichi comes across several young girls, all of whom are connected to his past. As he befriends them and continues to interact with them, the long forgotten memories from his childhood begin to resurface...', 'Kyoto Animation', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-10-05', 1530, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1530-xl96EB4lBzGL.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 51340, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-p1F1Ks3cTQ', '2026-08-29 14:38:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1964, 'D.Gray-man', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1482-6jc8ZVSmHuLo.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Towards the end of the 19th century, Allen Walker officially joins the organization of Exorcists that destroy the beings known as Akuma; mechanic weapons made by the Millennium Earl with the suffering souls of the dead. Allen has both a cursed eye and an anti-Akuma weapon as an arm, bearing the power of "Innocence", a gift given to him as an apostle of God. Allen, along with his fellow Exorcists must put a stop to the Millennium Earl''s ultimate plot that could lead to the destruction of the world and all who live on it.', 'TMS Entertainment', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-10-03', 1482, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1482-nmGoqdGfaKEt.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 103, 115571, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mJuBki_tehg', '2026-08-29 14:38:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1965, 'Honey and Clover', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx16-S9k8qahNXoYP.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Takemoto Yuuta, Mayama Takumi, and Morita Shinobu are college students who share the small apartment. Even though they live in poverty, the three of them are able to obtain pleasure through small things in life. The story follows these characters'' life stories as poor college students, as well as their love lives when a short but talented 18 year old girl called Hanamoto Hagumi appears.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-04-15', 16, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16-jmEaCBBN5WRS.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 58127, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WqoAIXLQcPY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1966, 'Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex - The Laughing Man', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2449-YZaDA9hyf7Ku.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'In 2024, the terrorist incident known as "The Laughing Man Incident" occurred in which Ernest Serano, president of the groundbreaking micromachine company, Sereno Genomics, was kidnapped and ransomed. One day, the case having remained unsolved for six years, Detective Yamaguchi, who has been investigating "The Laughing Man Incident," sends word that he wants to meet with Togusa from Public Safety Section 9. However, soon after sending this message, Yamaguchi, crucial to the success of the case, dies in an accident. Many days pass and in the midst of a police interview relay concerning suspicions behind interceptors, a forewarning is received from "The Laughing Man" of his next crime. The incorporeal hacker begins to move once again.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Production I.G', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-09-23', 2449, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Mystery, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 8141, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gf6YFrV7zes', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1967, 'ARIA The ANIMATION', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx477-CdKPHW7rGbUP.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Drift peacefully into Neo Venezia, a city on the planet Aqua (formerly known as Mars). By the 24th century, humans have found a way to colonize the previously uninhabitable planet. As futuristic as that sounds, Neo Venezia is still teeming with rustic beauty; gondolas on wide canals and waterways are the main mode of transportation. The city itself is a faithful replication of Manhome''s (the planet formerly known as Earth) Venice.

To make sure that residents and tourists alike get the most from Neo Venezia''s many wonders, companies offering guided tours via gondola were formed, one of which is named Aria Company.

This is the workplace of Akari Mizunashi, a free spirited teenager from Manhome who is now a novice Undine (the title given to tour guides). Join Akari as she becomes intimately acquainted with other Undine, tourists, Neo Venezia''s residents, and even the city itself, learning many valuable life lessons along the way, such as the wonderful truth that there are such things as manmade miracles.', 'Hal Film Maker', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-10-06', 477, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/477.jpg', 'Fantasy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 55585, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NraaWUZxWZw', '2026-08-29 14:54:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1968, 'Eyeshield 21', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx15-A4F2t0TgWoi4.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Welcome To the Gridiron of the Damned!   Huge hulking bodies throw themselves at each other, while a tiny lithe body runs between them for the goal!  No, it&rsquo;s not a game of football, it&rsquo;s Sena Kobayakawa trying to evade the monstrous Ha-Ha brothers down the halls of Deimon High School!  But wait!  Sena&rsquo;s incredible skills at not getting caught have been spotted by the devilish (possibly actually demonic) captain of the school&rsquo;s embryonic American style football team, and when Sena asks to be the teams manager, he gets  thrust onto the field as a running back instead!  But there are two BIG catches: first, to keep the identity of their new &ldquo;star&rdquo; player an absolute secret, Yoichi makes Sena wear an opaque visor on his helmet and gives him the alias of &ldquo;Eyeshield 21.&rdquo;  And the second catch?  Well, in order to hit his fastest &ldquo;speed of light&rdquo; running mode, Sena usually has to be absolutely terrified. Not that THAT will be a problem with the monstrous players that he&rsquo;ll soon find himself running from!  The insanity hits the streets when the feet meet the cleats in EYESHIELD 21! 

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Studio Gallop', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-04-06', 15, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n15-1eTutXlxYzYl.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 145, 33666, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eBaYp_2gDrg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1969, 'Blood+', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx150-YRcwKiJEXcLx.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Saya Otonashi, a seemingly normal high school student, suffers from amnesia and she can''t remember the past year of her life. One day, after a man appears and gives her a katana sword, her destiny begins to be revealed.

Soon she finds herself fighting the latest threat to humanity - Chiropteran monsters, ravenous immortal creatures that can change their form, disguising themselves as human beings. They feed off blood and hide themselves within the human world. An organization known as the Red Shield has been waging a private war to wipe them out and now the struggle has grown. Saya''s journey for the truth has begun.

(Source: Sony Pictures Home Entertainment)', 'Production I.G', '2005', 'series', 'released', '2005-10-08', 150, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/150-zwoYr5tDxtOw.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 50, 65724, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_UtdxT9jS4', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (1970, 'Hell Girl: Two Mirrors', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1594-bFUqsv7hu3La.png', 'series', '7.6', 'Ai Enma once again returns as the Jigoku Shoujo, who uses Jigoku Tsuushin (Hell Hotline) to allow people to post their grudges on their tormentors, sending them straight to Hell. In exchange, the users of the website will end up in Hell after they die. Meanwhile, a mysterious girl with blue eyes called Kikuri appears and seems to have strange intentions towards Ai and Jigoku Tsuushin''s operation. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Aniplex', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-10-06', 1594, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:29', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1594-AZ7NLu498qOk.jpg', 'Horror, Psychological, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 26954, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zo5wuctIMWk', NULL, NULL);
