Episode 1: Tomoyo shows the making of the first opening (Catch You Catch Me) video

Episode 2: Baking lesson with Eriol

Episode 3: The discovery that Yamazaki tells the truth when his eyes are open', 'MADHOUSE', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-09-25', 2424, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2424-RUdlSXuDda0v.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 3, 7045, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PPXc0NF0JgM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2245, 'Fushigi Mahou Fun Fun Pharmacy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b8503-XauC6VH8R0Lq.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'In a small town, there is a small pharmacy called Fun Fun Pharmacy. Popuri, a girl who recently moved in downtown, discovers this pharmacy and meets Miss Fukiko, who is actually a witch. Miss Fukiko gives Popuri a mysterious bottle that can create magic spirits.', 'Toei Animation', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-02-15', 8503, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8503-0XTk8JbVWUc1.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Slice of Life, Supernatural', 'TV_SHORT', 'WINTER', 48, 2706, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XYNGkSvFT8c', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2246, 'Excel Saga', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx379-qjgzMfG8vQAo.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Excel Saga is a one-of-a kind work of art that can only be described as the ultimate parody of anime. From the opening credits - a rather odd spoof of Japanese pop videos - to the ending song featuring Menchi the dog singing/barking a plaintive ballad while a human interpreter translates for viewers, nothing is sacred in the world of Excel Saga.

(Source: ADV Films)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-10-08', 379, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/379-jiT36EYUPwlm.jpg', 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 24046, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kfG4rh0mflo', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2247, 'Hana Yori Dango (Boys Over Flowers)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/n106-KgEGNWhC9XLR.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Makino Tsukushi: a girl who comes from a poor family just wants to get through her 2 last years at Eitoku Gakuen, quietly. But once she makes herself known by standing up for her friend to the F4, the 4 most popular, powerful and rich boys at the school. She gets the red card: F4''s way of a "Declaration of War". But when she doesn''t let herself be beaten by them and is starting to fall for one of the F4; Hanazawa Rui. She starts to see that there is more than meets the eye...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1996', 'series', 'released', '1996-09-08', 106, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106-zcHAiEQdsTxz.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 13587, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9a-GpfASdPc', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2248, 'Shin Getter Robo vs. Neo Getter Robo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx938-VZBqo0JtsljD.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Years after the defeat of the Reptilian Empire, Getter Team has begun training on a new super robot, Neo Getter Robo. But a surprise attack from the Empire''s revived leader forces them to recruit a street fighter named Go Ichimonji as Getter One''s pilot. Faced with an enormously powerful foe, the new team''s only hope for victory may lie in the resurrection of the lost weapon of humanity, Shin Getter Robo.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Brain''s Base', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-12-21', 938, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/938-QILcCsbP6gID.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 4, 3282, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oY9fafDA25E', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2249, 'YAT Anshin! Uchuu Ryokou 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1892.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The space travelling company, YAT, is thrown into the unknown realms of the outer space. At the same time, the group encounters the psychic, Maron, and scientist, Note. Subsequently, the two of them are attacked by the evil monarch, Ganon. Note was captured and taken away after suffering an attack from one of Ganon''s followers, Baras. In order to rescue Note, the group had to use the instantenoeous portable machine which Note invented so as to travel to Ganon''s planet. However, no one knows where the planet is...

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-04-11', 1892, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 25, 456, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8tPANg5-w3o', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2250, 'Initial D Extra Stage', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx822-JgdEklwoIOxm.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The Lancer EVO-driving group "Emperor" have defeated every racing team they''ve met in the Gunma region. Now they''re out to challenge the duo of Mako and Sayuki and their SilEighty - the Impact Blue of Usui Mountain.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'OB Planning', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-11-10', 822, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Sports', 'OVA', 'FALL', 2, 17027, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VpVjqgV24qc', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2251, 'Cowboy Bebop: Yoseatsume Blues', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4037-zpDbjycoZhNI.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Due to the violence portrayed in the Cowboy Bebop world and violence in Japanese schools, the series was briefly cancelled and an extra session was created as a final episode to the first thirteen episodes aired. Called "Session XX: Mish-Mash Blues," a compilation of clips from previous episodes, it aired on June 26, 1998 on TV Tokyo. The episode was never released on DVD. In it, the characters provide a philosophical commentary and end with the words: This Is Not The End. You Will See The Real "Cowboy Bebop" Someday!', 'Sunrise', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-06-26', 4037, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4037-1rwmIePHBzB7.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 13130, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OhNwckCLzis', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2252, 'Boogiepop Phantom', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx369-dwzXLDvzzAmK.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Five years ago, a string of grisly murders shook the city to its core and now the rumors have begun once more. Boogiepop... Everyone knows about Boogiepop: meet her one dark night and you are taken. People tell each other the stories and laugh: no one believes that she can possibly exist in this day and age. Still, strange things appear to be going on and the darkness is taking on many forms. Something is out there. Are you safe?


(Source: RightStuf)', 'MADHOUSE', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-01-05', 369, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:51', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/369-qdcR0yzZC0AX.jpg', 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Supernatural', 'TV', 'WINTER', 12, 42939, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3fFSDOvKKoo', '2026-08-29 14:42:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2253, 'Zoids', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b763-1T59JdI5ohJd.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Zoids are beast-like fighting machines used in both everyday use such as transportation, and special use such as war. Some types of Zoids, know as Organoids, are miniature Zoids that are living organisms. These Organoids have the capability to fuse with a non-living Zoid and make it much more powerful.

Van (Ban) Freiheit discovers a Zoid Organoid in an abandoned laboratory while running from two strangers piloting Zoids. Also in the laboratory, in an animated suspension tube is a strange girl. He breaks the tube open and takes her and the Organoid with him. Spotting a ruined Shield Liger Zoid outside nearby, the Organoid fuses with it and repairs the damages. Making his escape, Van names the Organoid Zeke, and decides to keep him as a friend. The girl, who says her name is Fiona, wants to find something called Zoids Eve, and so Van, Zeke, and Fiona begin their adventure.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Xebec', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-09-04', 763, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n763-kDX6Sqr6GaBu.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 67, 8663, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZqV_dDStvmw', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2254, 'Cooking Master Boy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx110-KB2VJ8Qp3WD6.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'The story takes place in 19th century China during the Qing Dynasty, where the Emperor was weakened and the country was close to chaos. It is also during a fictitious era called "The Era of the Cooking Wars". It was an era in which top chefs with different cooking styles tried their best to improve their skills and to become the best chef in China. It is a country where insulting a high-grade chef or fooling around with cooking could land a person in a jail, and impersonating a top-chef is as good as usurpation of authority. Chefs compete with each other in order to gain respect and even power, but also with the risks of losing everything.

The country of China has four major regions: Beijing, Szechuan, Shanghai, and Guangdong.

The beginning of the story takes place in Szechuan, Mao''s birthplace.

After the death of Mao''s mother, Pai, who was called the ''Fairy of Cuisine'', Mao becomes a Super Chef in order to take the title as Master Chef of his mother''s restaurant. However, before he takes his mother''s place as Master Chef, he continues to travel China in order to learn more of the many ways of cooking, in the hopes of becoming a legendary chef, just like his mother. During his journey, he meets great friends and fierce rivals who wish to challenge him in the field of cooking.', 'Nippon Animation', '1997', 'series', 'released', '1997-04-27', 110, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 4540, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gbrC9T31vXA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2255, 'City Hunter: The Secret Service', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx1477-RdeLezgVD8Mn.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'James McGuire has a dream. He wants to become the president of Guinam and free his people from the military rulers who have been in power up until now. However, one thing stands in McGuire''s way: his past. And it''s beginning to catch up with him, endangering not only his career, but the life of his long lost daughter. McGuire hires the City Hunter, Ryo Saeba and his partner Kaori to protect his daughter Anna, who herself is a Secret Service agent assigned to bodyguard the presidential hopeful.', 'Sunrise', '1996', 'series', 'released', '1996-01-05', 1477, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 1, 2617, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i7J67aUXAs8', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2256, 'Gokudo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/n2409-KVUhBRUc1gtL.png', 'series', '7.0', 'It all starts when Gokudou steals a pouch from a fortuneteller, thinking that it contains a gem. Instead, it turns out to be a rock, from which emerges Djinn. The genie grants Gokudou the standard three wishes, but our anti-hero doesn''t think heavily about his wishes. Gokudou does get his wishes, though not exactly in the fashion that he expected. The best thing he gets out of his wishes is Honou no Maken, a magical sword that enables its owner to do fire attacks and it can be summoned from anywhere in the world.

Even with an enchanted sword, Gokudou doesn''t get much respect. He gets turned into a woman by Djinn, who is also a shapeshifter. He is followed by Rubette La Late, a potential love interest who is more interested in adventure, karaoke and outperforming Gokudou. He gets whapped on the head a lot, especially by the fortuneteller who reappears throughout the series just to plague Gokudou it seems. Later in the series, he gets another sidekick, a former evil magician named Prince, who is more handsome and a better womanizer than Gokudou.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Trans Arts', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-04-02', 2409, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2409-8KyWT6tLwXjo.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 4138, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NzAQS1IlwJk', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2257, 'Sexy Commando Gaiden: Sugoiyo!! Masaru-san', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx582-9f4QqwV5lV1R.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Okometsubu Fujiyama has recently transferred over to a new school, Wakame High School. His goal is to make 100 friends--until he meets the extremely wierd Masaru Hananakajima. Masaru is a martial artist whose specialty is the "Sexy Commando" form of martial art. Masaru forms a club based on this art, including Fujiyama, who he nicknames Fuumin, in the club. The club becomes full of strange, yet wacky people. Aliens, moustaches, and cute fuzzy animals are encountered as the club moves along and gets steadily more popular.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Magic Bus', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-01-05', 582, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV_SHORT', 'WINTER', 48, 3621, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPSWTuX7Qs8', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2258, 'Spring and Chaos', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1206-RYljr0DePi1W.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'A unique biographical sketch of the life of the great modern Japanese poet Kenji Miyazawa, SPRING AND CHAOS is highly stylized and intense and draws on Miyazawa''s writing techniques to tell his life story. Miyazawa often used animals as the main characters in his stories and poems, and it is this technique that allows director Shoji Kawamori to recreate Miyazawa''s fanciful land of Ihatov and use it as the backdrop for Miyazawa`s life. Beautiful and affecting, SPRING AND CHAOS is a fitting tribute to one of Japan''s greatest writers.', 'Group TAC', '1996', 'series', 'released', '1996-12-14', 1206, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 3928, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QK_SOnZ7LOk', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2259, 'City Hunter: Death of the Vicious Criminal Ryo Saeba', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1479-ai1yDwHXPFB8.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'City Hunter, Saeba Ryo, after months of idleness, finally scores a client and it is none other than the beautiful Mega City TV newscaster, Sayaka, who fears for her life. What''s more, the enemy are her employers who are ready to resort to any means necessary to kill her. Ryo takes on the might of a TV station in a bid to save Sayaka, but finds that all is not what it seems...', 'Sunrise', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-04-23', 1479, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 2251, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G20m5NTAVAE', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2260, 'Slayers RETURN', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx869-QTbtFWkoKzWl.png', 'movies', '7.0', 'The inhabitants of the village of Biaz, forced to labor in the serivce of the world-domination-happy Zein organization, hires Lina Inverse and Naga The Serpent to drive off the invaders. Lina and Naga agree, lured by stories of Elfin treasure sleeping below Biaz, only to get considerably more trouble -from the Zein and from the treasure - than they ever expected. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1996', 'movie', 'released', '1996-08-03', 869, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-03 16:42:09', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4848, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:42:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2261, 'Fancy Lala', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx604-gZkEfz6DBhGu.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'What would you do if you could be anything you wanted? Miho Shinohara gets her chance when some little friends drop off a magical crayon that changes her life forever! 10-year-old Miho is about to see what life is like as 15-year-old Lala - pop star, model, and actress extraordinaire! With the ability to transform to Lala, Miho''s life suddenly transforms into a magical fairytale… but life as a normal girl and a pop star can be pretty crazy!

(Source: Bandai Entertainment)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-04-05', 604, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-03 16:42:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n604-xqfj4imyf54u.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Mahou Shoujo, Music, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 4652, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:42:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2262, 'Aoyama Goushou Tanpenshuu', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5578-kcxJ0LgO7zql.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'GOSHO collection reveals the origin of the smash hit &ldquo;Detective Conan.&rdquo;

&ldquo;GO&rdquo; into his world, and we will &ldquo;SHO&rdquo; you SEVEN romantic and exciting stories created by GOSHO AOYAMA.

WAIT FOR ME (30 min.)

A genius inventor, who is still a high school student, has a girlfriend two years older than him. One day, he invents a time machine and attempts to go two years back into the past, to become the same age as her.

However, it is she who ultimately uses the machine to travel through time!

TEN PLANETS IN THE NIGHT SKY (10 min.)

Meet Baby Conan!

Yukiko Kudo is looking for her missing husband. The only clue to find him again is to decipher a mysterious message left for her. Their baby, Shinichi Kudo, one who later becomes the famous high school Detective Conan, will at this age already be offering some important hints for her.

THE WANDERING RED BUTTERFLY (7 min.)

A handsome detective, Yusaku Kitakata, receives phone calls from a mysterious woman day after day, with a new case each day. He of course solves them one by one. But the biggest mystery is who is this mysterious woman?

PLAY IT AGAIN (30 min.)

Thanks to the mystical powers of a Cherry Blossom Tree, a 70-year-old man with a secret sword technique goes back into the past and becomes the same age as his granddaughter. While enjoying his youth for the second time around, he notices that a player is after his granddaughter.

SANTA CLAUS IN SUMMER (30 min.)

Keisuke, a young man of 17, accidentally activates the Earth Destruction System. The destiny of the Earth now depends on whether he can stop the system within 24 hours. However, suddenly amnesia strikes him and he forgets the pin number to stop the system. The time is running out...

DETECTIVE GEORGE&rsquo;S SPECIAL CASE (30 min.)

A girl is fleeing from men in black. She runs into a detective agency and discovers that the detective there is a super-miniature-size, cool dude. He risks his life trying to solve a case for this client. Will they come through in the end?

MAKING OF DETECTIVE CONAN (7 min.)

Do you know how to make animation?

Everybody wants to see the workings of an animation studio.

Based on the concept of Detective Conan, the three sub-characters visit the animation studio of Detective Conan. This episode will surely catch the hearts of Detective Conan fans! 

[The actual animation is also involved in this special.]

(Source: TMS Entertainment, LTD)', 'Tokyo Movie', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-03-17', 5578, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-03 16:43:39', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 7, 2194, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:43:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2263, 'Yu☆Gi☆Oh!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx550-aXb7NoghEGab.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Yuugi is a somewhat frail young boy who happens to be a big fan of gaming of any kind. But when he solves an ancient egyptian puzzle he is granted all the powers of darkness. Now when confronted with danger and injustice, he transforms into a much darker and dangerous form, and proceeds to dish out the justice and punishment for those who so richly deserve it.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Toei Animation', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-04-04', 550, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-03 16:44:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/550-JX3A2cJDr5At.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 27, 53717, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:44:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2264, 'Saiyuki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx129-YjyAZNbmTGxE.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Many years ago, humans and demons lived in harmony. But that unity ended when demons started attacking humans and plotted a mission to unleash Gyumao - an evil demon imprisoned for thousands of years. Now, Genjo Sanzo, a rogue priest, must team up with three demons - Sha Gojyo, Son Goku, and Cho Hakkai - and embark on a perilous journey to the west to stop these demons from resurrecting Gyumao and restore the balance between humans and demons on Earth.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Pierrot', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-04-04', 129, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-03 16:44:41', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129-XboFjnh24xQE.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 10993, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:44:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2265, 'Slayers: The Book of Spells', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1170-lx0HlchPLEVa.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Join Lina and Naga as they thwart a plan to create the ultimate chimera. Watch as they attempt to turn the effeminate son of a noble family into a man deserving appointment to the Royal Guard. And double the trouble when our heroines take on a rogue magic user with a mirror that duplicates his enemies in reverse!

(Source: ADV Films)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1996', 'series', 'released', '1996-07-25', 1170, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-03 16:44:45', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 3, 5032, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:44:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2266, 'Slayers Great', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx868-R4rOWMZVjjvR.png', 'movies', '7.0', 'Laia Einburg wants for her father Galia, who is a talented golem maker, and her equally ambitious brother Huey to end a long running feud. But her luck changes for the worse when Lina Inverse and Naga the Serpent save Laia from a rampaging golem.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1997', 'movie', 'released', '1997-08-02', 868, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4592, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sBkKf13wb6U', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2267, 'Slayers Gorgeous', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx867-7KYmDWP4S43Q.png', 'movies', '7.0', 'Lina Inverse and her sidekick Naga the Serpent are happily enjoying lunch when the entire town ducks under cover before an invasion of Marlene Culvert and her legion of bloodthirsty dragons. The cause of the invasion? Marlene is in a feud with her father, the king, over her allowance.

Lina leaps into action to defend the village against Marlene, her tetrad knights and her dragons, but her dependable Dragon Slave spell fails her.

Right when she thinks she has won, the real battle has just begun.

(Source: ADV Films)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1998', 'movie', 'released', '1998-08-01', 867, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n867-BZvH7F54dreC.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4579, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nen4Hy9gwME', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2268, 'Ojamajo Doremi Sharp (Movie)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2947-XbN3W5mNoq5z.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'One day Pop was out scavenging with Hana, and found a beautiful rose inside the Queen''s garden. Curious, she picked the rose and brought it home. Unwittingly, that rose can cause all wishes to become true, whether good or bad. Good wishes will turn the rose white and bloom, while bad wishes will turn the rose black and wither. After a heated argument with her sister Doremi, Pop wishes that Doremi loses all her magic and be turned into a mouse. Hilarity ensues, as Doremi and the others try to put everything back to normal.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '2000', 'movie', 'released', '2000-07-08', 2947, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2544, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOMEDE2BHwM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2269, 'Saber Marionette J', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx573-pRSpr6N5DpHX.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'In the distant future, since the Earth has become overpopulated, efforts to find and colonize on other planets have begun. However, one of the ships, the "Mesopotamia" malfunctions and all but 6 of its inhabitants are all killed. the remaining 6 manage to escape to a nearby planet named "Terra ll ", which is similar to Earth in many respects. However, all of them are male. Therefore, as to not let their efforts go to waste, they begin to set up 6 countries and to reproduce through cloning and genetic engineering. however, there are still no women, and to make up for it, thy create lifelike advanced female androids called "Marionettes" which do everyday chores and work. However, they are all emotionless machines. But one day, a ordinary boy named Otaru finds and awakens 3 special battle type Marionettes that have emotions due to a "Maiden Circuit" within them. It''s up to him then to teach them and allow their emotions to grow, and when a nearby country threatens with world domination, it''s up to to Otaru and his "human" Marionettes to protect their country.', 'Studio Junio', '1996', 'series', 'released', '1996-10-01', 573, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/573-oKHoPrTvGNcj.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 7618, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4uO4myqH78o', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2270, 'Slayers Excellent', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1171-oltnJVSccEwp.png', 'series', '7.0', 'When Naga torches a tavern to get Lina''s attention, the local townspeople demand that they make restitution by rescuing villagers lost in a labyrinth!

Then, after seeing no profit in protecting the pampered Sirene Fitzmeier, Lina arranges a kidnapping to teach her a lesson. Unfortunately, she hands Sirene over to the wrong kidnappers!

And, formal fashion designer Tatjana Dayward and unisex clothing maker Marty Lenford discover Naga and set out to make her the next fashion craze!

(Source: ADV Films)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-10-25', 1171, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1171-VNVGpFafPWJ8.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 5160, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jb-Z-_iLCF8', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2271, 'GEAR Senshi Dendoh', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2484-cKkTQRNpoAXx.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'The story takes place in the future where war machines from evil mechanical alien empire Garufa finally reaches Earth. In order to protect earth, an Earth defense organization called GEAR (Guard Earth and Advanced Reconnaissance) is formed. GEAR has an ultimate weapon in a form of war mecha, GEAR Fighter Dendoh, which is piloted by two elementary school students, namely Kusanagi Hokuto and Izumo Ginga. Can the friendship between Hokuto and Ginga unleashed the full potential power of Dendoh in order to fight Garufa? 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Sunrise', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-10-04', 2484, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2484-yNDOYWN4jezp.jpg', 'Action, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 38, 1815, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pqqfx4e_e8c', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2272, 'Flame of Recca', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx238-2PeuP9kvnHVe.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Recca Hanabishi is a ninja, but is nearly killed in an accident. However, a girl named Yanagi heals him with her powers. Later, the two are tracked down by a woman who attacks them. She tells Recca to ignite his flame, but he is clueless. Just as she hurts Yanagi, Recca releases a powerful flame upon the woman. She is excited to see this. It turns out that Recca was a baby, from the Hokage Clan of the past, that was sent to the future in order to escape death. Now, Recca is the leader of the new Hokage Clan who must stop his half brother, Kurei, from kidnapping Yanagi.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1997', 'series', 'released', '1997-07-19', 238, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n238-XvJpGM3MKoNE.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 42, 13165, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W5rK_Lv40ks', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2273, 'Grander Musashi RV', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2416-E27vXe8Y4ie7.png', 'series', '6.9', 'Sequel to Grander Musashi. A young but experienced fisherman named Musashi Kazama and his two friends travel around the world in search of seven mysterious objects of fantastic power called "Legenders", each one in the form of a fish. Legenders are said to grant anyone who catches them the power to change the world. Unfortunately, Musashi ends up competing with several other fishermen who share his ambition of capturing a Legender.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-04-04', 2416, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 758, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fmBH3dSBmiY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2274, 'Cardcaptor Sakura: Leave it to Kero!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1078-c24UkFy6f2Xe.png', 'series', '6.9', 'Following the events of Cardcaptor Sakura Movie 2: The Sealed Card, Kero and Spinel (if you don''t know who they are, watch Cardcaptor Sakura and the movie first) share a plate of takoyaki (octopus balls). They get into a fight over who gets the last piece, and in the process send it flying out the window. They both chase the takoyaki, and each other, in a mighty effort to be the "takoyaki captor".

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-07-15', 1078, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1078-8oQZo5mot04l.jpg', 'Comedy', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 7105, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nS8-sAm9M9U', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2275, 'Kindaichi Shounen no Jikenbo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2077.jpg', 'movies', '6.9', 'Invited for a anniversary celebration, Kindaichi, Miyuki and inspector Kenmochi re-visit the Opera House. There they discover that a play of "The Phantom of the Opera" is being rehearsed again. However, it doesn''t take long when members of the acting troupe are killed by the "Phantom". Kindaichi will once again have to solve a murder series in the Opera House.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1996', 'movie', 'released', '1996-12-14', 2077, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Mystery', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 1515, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZikmWBfJ8dI', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2276, 'Carried by the Wind: Tsukikage Ran', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx606-mlF89GEEGHBX.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'In the Edo or Tokugawa period (1600-1868), Ran, a female wandering samurai whose skill with the katana is only matched by her taste for sake (rice wine), is joined by a chinese martial artist who calls herself Lady Meow of the Iron Cat Fist. Tsukikage Ran has individual episodes that are just short stories of their adventures.', 'MADHOUSE', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-01-26', 606, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/606-SJtWnPJq5Yib.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 5304, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H6Gx3voDIwA', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2277, 'Tenchi Forever', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1144-pN5vygIZrfxQ.jpg', 'movies', '6.9', 'Tenchi walks into the mountains and disappears. After searching all over Japan for Tenchi, Ayeka and Ryoko finally locate him in Tokyo where he is now several years older. Tenchi appears to be in a parallel world with a mysterious girl, named Haruna, and doesn''t remember Ayeka and Ryoko! What is the mysterious connection between Haruna and Tenchi''s grandfather, Yosho? It''s up to Ayeka and Ryoko to discover what Haruna wants with Tenchi and to rescue him before he disappears forever!

(Source: Geneon Entertainment)', 'AIC', '1999', 'movie', 'released', '1999-04-24', 1144, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 3814, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=__xzZdXryFg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2278, 'Kyoro-chan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/4375.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'While exploring ruins on Angel Island, a doctor finds a myserious newborn bird called Kyoro-chan. Together they form a bond and decide to travel the world together. Three years later when the Doctor and Kyoro-chan try to return to Angel Island they become shipwrecked from a storm. Kyoro-chan was able to make it safely to the island but the Doctor was nowhere to be found. Kyoro-chan prays for his safety and hope he returns as he now starts his new life on Angel Island.', NULL, '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-07-01', 4375, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 91, 846, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wxF9noeqJcY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2279, 'My Neighbors the Yamadas', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx415-6DDsl72NV0cv.png', 'movies', '6.9', 'Join in the adventures of the quirky Yamada family -- from the hilarious to the touching -- brilliantly presented in a unique, visually striking comic strip style. Takashi Yamada and his wacky wife Matsuko, who has no talent for housework, navigate their way through the ups and downs of work, marriage and family life with a sharp-tongued grandmother who lives with them, a teenage son who wishes he had cooler parents, and a pesky daughter whose loud voice is unusual for someone so small. Even the family dog has issues!

(Source: Disney)', 'Studio Ghibli', '1999', 'movie', 'released', '1999-07-17', 415, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/415-i5TmXJHtji6B.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 15801, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C9ujuCPlnY', '2026-08-29 14:42:25', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2280, 'Princess Nine', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1846-R6ZT968xSoSG.png', 'series', '6.9', 'Keiko Himuro, Chairman of the Kisuragi School, puts together an all-girl baseball team led by Ryo Hayakawa, daughter of a legendary pitcher, in hopes of proving that girls can compete just as well as boys. Their goal: Koshien Stadium, where only the best teams get the opportunity to play. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Phoenix Entertainment', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-04-08', 1846, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1846-8Aj3XCWZ0KWl.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 4119, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m9M7lJer-pw', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2281, 'Saber Marionette J to X', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1231.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Taking place mere months after the Saber Marionette J OVA series, this newest installment in the Saber Marionette line follows the continuing adventures of Otaru and his clan of selfless, obsessive marionette girls. This time, the evil Faust is back, and again toying with Marionette technology that was never meant to be explored. The Saber Dolls are back, and torn between their newfound love for Otaru and their undying loyalty to Faust; Will Otaru, Lime, Cherry and Bloodberry be able to stop Faust again, or are they all headed for the scrap heap?

(Source: AniDB)', 'Hal Film Maker', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-10-06', 1231, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1231-uR5Gh8Id1jwT.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 2948, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OinchBAqlqw', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2282, 'Medabots', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1138-g8MywkMhN8lB.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'In the near future, humans and robots coexist. “Robattles,” a competition in which Medarot are pitted against each other, is popular among kids. A Medarot’s consciousness, effectively its brains, is located in a Medal that can be inserted into and ejected from the robot body. By chance, nine-year-old Ikki finds a Rare Medal, and soon after has his own Medarot named Metabee. This is the story of their friendship and growth as they use wisdom and courage to fight countless opponents in robot battles.', 'Bee Train', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-07-02', 1138, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1138-12lSvUNY8ByS.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 52, 13139, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zH0YkoJdRqQ', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2283, 'Brigadoon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1450-YmqNYnB6MGRq.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Marin is a typical junior high school girl with a sunny disposition and a loving adoptive family. Her life takes a drastic change when a mysterious mirage is seen in the sky above the entire earth. Killer androids called Monomakia descend to earth from the formation in the sky called Brigadoon and begin to hunt down little Marin. She discovers a blue bottle in a shrine as she seeks escape and from the bottle comes a protector, a sword carrying gun slinging alien called Melan Blue, together they must save the earth and deal with family crisis, school prejudice and the police and come to an understanding of Marins past and Melans unexplained mission, as well as learn to trust each other. Set in 1969 Japan with a colorful cast of friends and enemies.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-07-21', 1450, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1450-6dQB7q6PjNTU.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 26, 5760, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LIBnpOhpbT4', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2284, 'Samurai X Special', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b12067-zfDvibz9jK41.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'A bonus OVA episode included in the VHS/DVD release.

Note: Also known as episode 95.', 'Studio DEEN', '1998', 'series', 'released', '1998-12-02', 12067, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Romance', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 5270, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V83Kxuvt9Jc', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2285, 'Saber Marionette J Again', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b1191-KOfFm1N6sd0O.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Lime, Cherry, and Bloodberry, female-like androids called marionettes, have returned to Otaru`s side. The somewhat reformed marionettes of Faust (Tiger, Luchs, and Panther) are sent to stay with Otaru and friends to learn more about being human. Enter a seventh marionette named Marine, who has a mysterious power -- and they all possess the special maiden circuit that allows a marionette to feel emotions!

(Source: AniDB)', 'Hal Film Maker', '1997', 'series', 'released', '1997-11-25', 1191, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1191-7ZSRI2YshcQe.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 6, 2675, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nC2RE7peI9g', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2286, 'Love Hina Christmas Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx191-pKngFO6EOiqI.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'As another round of preliminary tests approach for Keitaro, so does Christmas. And as the first Christmas of the millenium, there is a rumor that if one confesses his love on this special eve it will come true. Keitaro has decided what he needs to do on this Christmas eve, but being a retaker can he afford taking attention away from the tests on the same day...

The Winter has begun in Hinata. X-mas is coming up. There are rumors about this special christmas eve: If someone is going to confess his love on this christmas eve, any wish will come true. Keitaro decides to confess his love to Naru. But he isn''t the only one confessing on this christmas eve...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Xebec', '2000', 'series', 'released', '2000-12-25', 191, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/191-wEOQ9OE6tffB.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'SPECIAL', 'FALL', 1, 8768, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hY5NEtyYH00', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2287, 'Dai-Guard', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1312-OYqoSXlRIpti.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Thirteen years after their sudden disappearance, an alien race known as the Heterodyne resurface without warning. To combat the Heterodyne, three office workers from the 21st Century Security Corporation operate Dai-Guard - a giant robot no longer regarded as an oversized paperweight. Unfortunately, Dai-Guard is somewhat obsolete and in disrepair. It''s a tough job, but salarymen can also save the world.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Xebec', '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-10-05', 1312, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1312-fUwi9SH9n5z3.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 3505, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5d1h_k2d93w', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2288, 'Bucky: The Incredible Kid', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2330-EGxPGTZuKZAd.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'In the Twelve-World, the mysterious land in an unknown dimension, the humans, monsters and spirits coexist in harmony for a long time. All the lives are protected by the Princess of the Needle Tower in the Zero World. All of a sudden, the balance of the Twelve World is crumbled. The Princess of the Needle Tower is confined to sleep. After losing the protection of the Princess, the monsters are released from the chain of life and become uncontrollable. They begin to attack the humans...

The troubleshooters called the Great Children dealing with the incidents involving the monsters are the only ones who can restore the harmony and balance of the Twelve World. Spaak is the best of the group of the Great Children and the center of children''s admiration. He learns that the Zero World was invaded. On the way to the Needle Tower, he meets an incredible boy, Bucky. Young and ambitious Bucky wants to be the strongest man and conquer the world. Spaak feels something special in Bucky and chooses the boy to be his successor. So, Bucky sets out for his quest to be the best Great child of the world. While going ahead recklessly, Bucky learns that the monsters are controlled by an unknown power from another dimension. He meets Kai, Pinky and other fellow Great Children and continues to travel to the Needle Tower with them.

(Source: Enoki Films)', NULL, '1999', 'series', 'released', '1999-10-05', 2330, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:53', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 2927, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4uWVQQ6UPXY', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2290, 'Sailor Moon S', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx532-D6yrPcsSxhSE.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'This season makes a turning point in the Sailor Moon story. The Sailor Senshi are confronted by a new enemy, the Death Busters. Rei had a premonition that this enemy would rule the world in an era called the Silence. To do this, the Death Busters need to find the three Talismans that would summon the Holy Grail. However, two mysterious Sailor Senshi, Sailor Uranus and Sailor Neptune, plan to find the Talismans before them... but without Sailor Moon''s help.', 'Toei Animation', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-03-19', 532, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/532-EUIf0FtAE9Zl.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 38, 32146, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XXerXH6DO0Q', '2026-08-29 14:43:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2291, 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes: Overture to a New War', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3016-ubCyMga7qCq6.png', 'movies', '7.8', 'Led by Reinhard von Müsel, the Galactic Empire crushes the Free Planets Alliance in the Fourth Battle of Tiamat. Arriving in the Imperial capital of Odin to a hero''s welcome, Reinhard''s victory earns him a promotion to High Admiral and the distinguished title of Count von Lohengramm. On the other side, Yang Wen-li safely returns to the Alliance capital of Heinessen without fanfare and reunites with his dear friends.

Reinhard and Yang look forward to a long-awaited reprieve. However, at the request of the scheming Duke Otho von Braunschweig, the Imperial High Command orders the new High Admiral to invade the Alliance with a fleet of twenty thousand ships. After the Duke leaks the plan to the Alliance government, three fleets totalling forty thousand ships are sent to counter the incoming attack and recreate the famous Battle of Dagon. But even though Reinhard is outnumbered two to one, he has an ingenious plan—and Yang sees right through it. Will Yang''s superiors heed his warning before it is too late?

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Artland', '1993', 'movie', 'released', '1993-12-18', 3016, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3016-dfK5ZHC7tBWe.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 12934, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=muVc2AnGwCA', '2026-08-29 14:56:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2292, 'Kyou kara Ore wa!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx851-iuPWbPLMlUgs.png', 'series', '7.8', 'This anime is about two students who are tired of being normal and unpopular at their old schools, after they both transfer to a new one they try to change that by deciding to become delinquents. After a rough start they become friends and the righteous Itou with the cheater Takashi start their (dis)adventures trying to survive the other delinquents from both their own and other schools.', 'Studio Pierrot', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-04-01', 851, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/851-KdNhkQBeeJv4.jpg', 'Comedy', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 10, 11615, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lQz3Vnw5Ko8', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2293, 'Ramayana: The Legend of Prince Rama', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx4921-VA0YoWZBkNpQ.jpg', 'movies', '7.7', 'In Ayodhya, the royal palace of Kosala kingdom in ancient India, four princes were born to three queens, each of whom grew to great stature. After being banished from the palace for fourteen years due to court intrigue, Prince Rama retreated to the forest with his beautiful wife Sita. Then, Rama, who had vanquished the demons of the forest, invites the wrath of the demon king Ravana, and his wife Sita is kidnapped. Rama goes to rescue Sita with the help of the monkey army. But while fighting the powerful Ravana army, his brother Lakshmana is seriously wounded. At this time, Hanuman, the general of the monkey army, flew to the Himalayas and carried a mountain of medicinal herbs that healed his wounds, saving his life. Eventually, Rama''s army defeated Ravana''s army using the "Heavenly Weapons" and returned to Ayodhya in triumph.', NULL, '1993', 'movie', 'released', '1993-01-10', 4921, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4921-N5NBIrTHCYAD.jpg', 'Adventure', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 3896, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=42tDHKICVOM', '2026-08-29 14:42:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2294, 'Black Jack', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1520-4AFl8cpVoRQU.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'In the medical profession, there is a name spoken in hushed tones, of an unlicensed genius physician who can save lives&mdash;for a price. His name is Black Jack, and he is a dashing, moody figure, caped in black, a Harlock of medicine, a man who lives by no rules other than his own&mdash;and the Hippocratic Oath. A man who would defy the will of God himself in the name of preserving life. 

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Tezuka Productions', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-12-21', 1520, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1520-oPXf4wHTanw2.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 10, 14128, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C3B4fPGLy3k', '2026-08-29 14:43:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2295, 'Sailor Moon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx530-O8q6KpJ244Qk.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Usagi Tsukino is an average student and crybaby klutz who constantly scores low on her tests. Unexpectedly, her humdrum life is turned upside down when she saves a cat with a crescent moon on its head from danger. The cat, named Luna, later reveals that their meeting was not an accident: Usagi is destined to become Sailor Moon, a planetary guardian with the power to protect the Earth. Given a special brooch that allows her to transform, she must use her new powers to save the city from evil energy-stealing monsters sent by the malevolent Queen Beryl of the Dark Kingdom.

But getting accustomed to her powers and fighting villains are not the only things she has to worry about. She must find the lost princess of the Moon Kingdom, the other Sailor Guardians, and the Legendary Silver Crystal in order to save the planet from destruction.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Toei Animation', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-03-07', 530, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/530.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'WINTER', 46, 103670, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UL_F6L1tSAM', '2026-08-29 14:43:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2296, 'Giant Robo the Animation: The Day the Earth Stood Still', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx2321-ETrAaZnKGpUS.jpg', 'series', '7.6', '10 years ago Dr. Shizuma and his colleagues invented the Shizuma drive which is a revolutionizing new form of renewable and recyclable energy. Though they had to pay a heavy price for their success in a catastrophic accident that the world only wants to forget about. However, all is not well as the secret organization Big Fire is hell-bent on taking over the world. They have obtained two of three mysterious Shizuma drive samples with an unknown function, which are an integral part of their world domination plans. The third sample has however been stolen by Dr. Shizuma who during his escape is saved by Daisaku, Giant Robo and the Experts of Justice. Then a desperate struggle begins between the Experts of Justice and Big Fire for the control of the last sample as Big Fire unleashes their mightiest weapon, the Eye of Volger, upon the unsuspecting world. Soon everything points towards the hidden truth behind the accident 10 years ago as the starting point of everything.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Phoenix Entertainment', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-07-23', 2321, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2321-2XL84oxJ2xrt.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 7, 11042, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D1co_cqe598', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2297, 'Gokinjo Monogatari', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx852-1chkfKkfOczt.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'The protagonist, Mikako Kouda, is a student of "Yaza Gaku." Specialising in fashion design, Mikako dreams of becoming a fashion designer with her own brand. Living next to her is her childhood friend, Tsutomu Yamaguchi. Even though they have been close since they were young, they share a platonic friendship. However, Tsutomu has been gaining popularity, especially with the girls, because he seems to resemble a popular vocalist from a band and somehow, Mikako begins to see him in a different light.

This is a story about how youths cope with dreams, love and friendship.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-09-10', 852, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/852-3Xuaf1xS3o43.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 50, 12084, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w9Vw48qq6zk', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2298, 'Mobile Police Patlabor: The New Files', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1289-dWwOLHwIC0gv.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Special Vehicles Division 2 is back on duty, along with their Ingram Patrol Labor (Patlabor) robots. Using their courage as well as the Ingrams, Captain Goto''s motley crew of officers battle crime in Tokyo city. They also deal with their personal lives, as well as the supernatural. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-11-22', 1289, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1289-wzVOiKkcU8bt.jpg', 'Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 16, 5555, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTkZPSmpFKY', '2026-08-29 14:42:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2299, 'Sailor Moon R', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx740-XZhoxj6aJjNc.png', 'series', '7.6', 'The season is divided into two arcs.

The first arc shows Usagi and Co. having their memories restored from the first season. Their enemies are a pair of aliens, Ail and Ann, who are seeking human energy to restore their life tree. Mamoru had yet to recover his memories and he appeared as the Moonlight Knight rather than Tuxedo Kamen. This arc only lasted for 13 episodes. 

The second arc introduces Chibi-Usa, a little girl from the future who is searching for the Silver Crystal. The new enemies are the Black Moon Clan, comprising of the Ayakashi sisters (Cooan, Beruche, Karaberas, and Petz), Rubeus, Safir, Esmeraude, Prince Demando, and Wiseman. They too want the Silver Crystal so that they can take over the future. The Sailor Senshi''s adventure continues...', 'Toei Animation', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-03-06', 740, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/740-AhvRJvteYZoM.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 43, 35067, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IAaHjzrnP_Y', '2026-08-29 14:42:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2300, 'Memories', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1462-wHe4bW5b6XRE.png', 'movies', '7.5', 'Memories is a compilation of three standalone short films encompassing different genres.

Magnetic Rose — a science fiction tale that tells a chilling story of love, loss, and the unwillingness to forget.

Stink Bomb — a tongue-in-cheek story of a chemical researcher who is just looking for a way to get rid of his cold... so why is everybody around him dying?

Cannon Fodder — an introspective tale about modern wars and simply following orders.', 'Studio 4°C', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-12-23', 1462, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1462-yvmw3ttBZmfl.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Psychological, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 3, 47926, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=op8am32MWBg', '2026-08-29 14:42:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2301, 'The Irresponsible Captain Tylor', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx569-xlw4m3TkFBll.png', 'series', '7.5', 'Justy Ueki Tylor had his life all planned out: join the military, get a cushy desk job, and then retire with a big fat pension check. The perfect plan... until he wandered into a hostage situation and somehow managed to save an admiral! Now Tylor - a man who wouldn''t know what discipline was if it bit him on the backside - has been made Captain of the space cruiser Soyokaze.

The crew of this run-down ship is the craziest rag-tag team of misfits you''re ever likely to see, and they''re not too fond of their complacent new leader. But they''d better learn to work together, because they''re about to go head to head with the mighty Raalgon Empire. For better or for worse, the Earth''s fate has been placed in the hands of a man who''s either a total idiot - or an absolute genius!

(Source: RightStuf)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-01-25', 569, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/569-tx53LgxBLaxX.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 26, 15748, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K2Z2kQ9UlhM', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2302, 'City Hunter ''91', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1473-2L3kL5SdYdqU.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'Ryo Saeba is back as the City Hunter, a "sweeper" (private detective) working on the streets of Tokyo. He and sidekick Kaori Makimura are hired to solve the problems of desperate people. When Ryo is not using his sharp shooting skills against bad guys, he''s aiming his sites on pretty ladies. Kaori uses a giant anti-ecchi hammer to make sure he behaves', 'Sunrise', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-04-28', 1473, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1473-tJxGphGZkcl6.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'TV', 'SPRING', 13, 6146, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v1-2BQkhZlc', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2303, 'Macross Plus', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx474-lyjbbltW5ZX4.png', 'series', '7.5', 'The year is 2040 and the galaxy is flourishing with several colonies and advanced technology. AI is near perfection and the current top idol is the near-completed Virturoid Idol Sharon Apple. All that is missing are her actual feelings, which instead are supplied by Myung Fang Lone. Sharon''s debut concert is on planet Eden, where at the same time, fighter pilots Isamu Dyson and Guld Bowman battle over air superiority for the "Supernova Project." Isamu, Guld and Myung were once childhood friends, but after an accident seven years ago, they went their own separate ways. With Myung back in the picture, the old disputes are once again awakened. And when an unstable and illegal AI technique is installed in Sharon, the situation is worsened.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Triangle Staff', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-08-25', 474, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:22:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/474-WOoYctkP0cHi.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 4, 17054, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:22:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2304, 'Mobile Fighter G Gundam', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx96-as1zJO34Qevb.png', 'series', '7.4', 'It is time for the "Gundam Fight" tournament! Each country sends a Gundam to Earth for this prestigious tournament in the hopes of winning power and glory for their homeland! But this time, there''s an unseen evil lurking behind the scene. Domon Kasshu, Neo Japan''s reluctant Fighter, is determined to uncover this evil and clear his family name! The fight to the top begins now!

(Source: Nozomi Entertainment)', 'Sunrise', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-04-22', 96, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:22:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/96-GUFHtfLF4KjF.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 49, 18227, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:22:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2305, 'Sailor Moon R: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx531-FCc5IMkzRlrU.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'When Mamoru was little he gave a rose to a little boy named Fiore. Fiore promised that one day he would bring Mamoru lots of flowers. Now Fiore has come back to earth but his intentions are not merely to fulfil a promise...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1993', 'movie', 'released', '1993-12-05', 531, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/531-vUUNbB8EcmXU.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 14603, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OdTp0qVOmKo', '2026-08-29 14:42:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2306, 'Ranma ½ (OVA)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1007-UPcDEzlonXK6.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Ranma Saotome continues his search for a way to become a normal teenage boy again. He gets into many hilarious situations involving the many girls in his life. One of the biggest challenges is overcoming the proposals from others who have found a suitable bride for Ranma. But he has his own worries and must muster up the best of his wits and martial arts to keep his sanity. It''s not easy being desired by so many women (and men) and not breaking hearts of a few along the way. He just might be able to find it in his heart to confess to Akane or simply find another excuse that he can''t marry such a tomboy girl.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio DEEN', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-10-21', 1007, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:22:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1007-dJU6x9tFw9OD.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 6, 7573, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:22:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2307, 'Macross Plus Movie Edition', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1211-0HhVts22SYvB.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'A.D. 2040 - Thirty years have passed since the battle between the Earth and Zentraedi forces changed the lives of both races. On planet Eden, a top-secret project known as "Supernova" is being held to determine U.N. Spacy''s next-generation variable fighter. Competing to win the funding are Shinsei Industries'' YF-19 and General Galaxy''s YF-21. Piloting the YF-21 is Guld Goa Bowman, a half-human, half-Zentraedi. Shinsei receives its new test pilot in the form of the unruly fighter pilot Isamu Dyson, who was once a friend of Guld. Meanwhile, as Isamu and Guld furiously battle to see which of their fighters is superior, a Virturoid Idol named Sharon Apple is to perform her debut concert on Eden. In charge of Sharon is producer Myung Fang Lone, another former friend of Isamu and Guld. When the three meet each other, old disputes spark from a troubled past. Little do they know that their past incidents - along with the Supernova Project and Sharon Apple - will somehow bring them together.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Triangle Staff', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-10-07', 1211, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:29:57', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1211-aLC0Cqskws4E.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 5814, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:29', '2026-09-03 16:29:57');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2308, 'Chibi Maruko-chan: Watashi no Suki na Uta', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx9348-cI6xYx6pkJGG.jpg', 'movies', '7.5', 'Sakura Momoko''s teacher assigns the third grade to draw an image based on their favorite song to enter a contest. Momoko loves a song she recently learned during her music class and is anxious to make a good drawing based on it. On her way to meet her relatives in Shizuoka, she meets Shouko Kimura, a university student who occasionally draws portraits at the local train station and plans to also participate in an art contest. Fascinated by her illustrations, Sakura meets Kimura once again. Shouko is enchanted by Momoko''s sympathy and honesty. They quickly become friends and end up inspiring each other in their own way.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1992', 'movie', 'released', '1992-12-19', 9348, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:23:32', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9348-tl73dOWHBrCp.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 1506, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2309, 'Sailor Moon SuperS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1239-bYf4KsFfsUhf.png', 'series', '7.4', 'SuperS centers heavily on Chibi-usa and the Sailor Team. A new enemy, the Dead Moon Circus, has now appeared. Their motive is to find the Golden Dream Mirror that would be used to rule the world. To do this, the enemy attacks innocent victims for their Dream Mirrors and test their energy. Chibi-usa also has a new ally on her side, Pegasus. This season also sees the Sailor Senshi obtaining new powers.', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-03-04', 1239, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1239-Af9ZbY7Zu6VU.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 25199, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6LmfzEF8XiU', '2026-08-29 14:43:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2310, 'The Slayers', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx534-BPGH9zsSFPm3.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Welcome to a world where magic reigns and monsters lurk behind every corner. Into his land of deadly dragons and menacing magicians comes our heroine -- Lina Inverse, a cute, fireball-throwing sorceress who steals from the wicked and gives to herself! Along with Gourry, a handsome but dumb-as-a-rock swordsman, Lina challenges the forces of not-so-goodness as she seeks truth, justice, fame and gold! Well, mostly fame and gold... Grab your pack and join the wackiest bunch of misfits ever to embark on a quest!

(Source: Software Sculptors)', 'E&G Films', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-04-07', 534, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:23:42', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/534-NdEKPCbTQqGb.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 31678, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2311, 'Gunsmith Cats', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx650-he0bSyXq2pTz.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Rally Vincent knows her weapons well, while her partner Minne May Hopkins loves to play with explosives. The pair run a gun-shop illegally and one day Bill Collins of the ATF, blackmails Rally and Minnie May into working for the ATF. Little do they know, that they are getting involved in a mission larger than they could imagine.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'OLM', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-11-01', 650, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/650-NcuZIsS80rUS.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 28534, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qb08UFLAHQo', '2026-08-29 14:42:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2312, 'Mysterious Thief Saint Tail', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1567-Is6i6GqL5m2b.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Meimi Haneoka, 14, is a normal girl during the daytime, but during the night, she assumes the "position" of Saint Tail, a modern-day Robin Hood who steals from thieves and gives items back to their original owners. She is aided by her friend, Seira Mimori, a nun-in-training, and she is chased by her classmate (and soon-to-be love interest), Daiki Asuka (often called "Asuka Jr."). 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-10-12', 1567, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1567-7kIjdBagE01y.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 43, 6776, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=asunwZv-i_8', '2026-08-29 14:42:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2313, 'Galaxy Warring State Chronicle Rai', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3907-iXsAAbTSc94r.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Rai is a space opera that fuses feudal Chinese and Japanese customs with vast galaxy spanning empires and space-going societies. The story follows the life and times of the samurai Rai, and the quest of several spacefaring factions for control of territory and, of course, the Empire.', 'E&G Films', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-04-08', 3907, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:23:53', NULL, 'Adventure, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 4115, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2314, 'You''re Under Arrest!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1577.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Running late on her first day as a patrol woman for the Bokuto Police Department, spunky moped rider Natsumi Tsujimoto decides to take several shortcuts, only to be chased down and cited by mechanical genius and expert police driver Miyuki Kobayakawa. Upon arrival at the precinct, Natsumi finds out that her new partner is the same woman who ticketed her earlier. At first, she doesn''t trust Miyuki, but in a short period of time, they develop an unbreakable friendship that overcomes traffic accidents, reckless drivers and even the strongest typhoons to hit Tokyo.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio DEEN', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-09-24', 1577, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:23:56', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1577-RYdvOriUF209.jpg', 'Action, Comedy', 'OVA', 'FALL', 4, 14855, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2315, 'Only Yesterday', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx1029-Ch9LIVLFnssA.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Taeko Okajima is a typical "office lady" in a big company in a big city. When she takes a sabbatical to the countryside in Yamagata Prefecture, the hometown of her brother-in-law, the journey recalled her memory of her 5th grade year. During her stay in Yamagata, she works hard and happily as a farmer and is surrounded by friendly relatives and villagers, bringing up more memories. Their hospitality makes her to reconsider her choice of life.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Ghibli', '1991', 'movie', 'released', '1991-07-20', 1029, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1029-rl9EFlXhQ3YH.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 47126, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfkQlZArxw0', '2026-08-29 14:42:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2316, 'Sailor Moon S Movie: Hearts in Ice', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx997-53WPReZCvbaI.png', 'movies', '7.3', 'An unusual snow storm hits Tokyo and the Sailor Senshi discover that an evil snow queen Kaguya, wants to freeze the entire earth. It''s up to the Inner Sailor Senshi along with the Outers, to defeat the Queen. Meanwhile, Luna falls in love with a human astronomer named Kakeru whose girlfriend is an astronaut about to take a space shuttle mission. Kakeru becomes ill and Luna wishes she could be a human to help him.', 'Toei Animation', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-12-04', 997, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/997-LzofwSXW9xsf.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 10904, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wbq_ybcuofc', '2026-08-29 14:42:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2317, 'Ranma 1/2 SUPER', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1011.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Super OVA 1: Based on a story from vol. 27 of the manga, Shampoo and Ukyo arrange to travel to a cave that is legendary for breaking up couples. They hope they will cause Ranma and Akane to break-up and Shampoo hopes to ditch Mousse the same way.

Super OVA 2: "Jaaku no Oni" (lit. "The Wicked Demon") was released in 1995. Based on a story from vol. 29 of the manga, an Oni (that wears a tiger-striped diaper just like the Oni of Urusei Yatsura) escapes it`s sealed box and begins to possess people in the neighborhood.

Super OVA 3: This is a story from vol. 31. Ranma disturbs a doll that takes revenge on anyone that shows it disrespect. In order to teach Ranma a lesson, the doll possesses Akane and tries on many occasions to attack him. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio DEEN', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-09-21', 1011, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:24:06', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1011-jAlbYSBkF0BA.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 5148, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2318, 'Nadia: The Secret of Blue Water', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1251-flub1WMUIr93.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'In 1889, the world is on the pinnacle of great discoveries in technology. In mankind''s grasp for the future, a sinister foe known only as Gargoyle, obsessed with restoring the former Atlantean empire to the glory it once held, begins his plans to take over the world. Nadia, with the help of a young inventor, Jean Raltique, and the mysterious captain Nemo of the submarine Nautilus, must fight to save the world from Gargoyle and Neo-Atlantis. Based on the Novel ''20,000 Leagues Under the Sea'' by Jules Verne.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Gainax', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-04-13', 1251, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1251-2oEwIJlFWpe3.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 25170, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6lefduazQQA', '2026-08-29 14:42:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2319, 'Yuusha Keisatsu J-Decker', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5075-Ztiyz5rMk6wE.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Grade schooler Yuuta Tominaga stumbles upon Deckerd, a humanoid robot under construction by the Japanese police, built to fight advanced forms of crime. Yuuta''s constant contact with Deckerd gives the robot a "heart", or personality; when Yuuta is recruited as the "boss" of the "Brave Police" as a result, a true human/robot partnership occurs. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-02-05', 5075, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:24:13', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 2397, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2320, 'Ninja Scroll', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx617-yo9IcTEQRNuN.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Jubei Kibagami has always been the master dealer of death, but in rescuing a ninja woman from a monster he sets loose a chain of events that puts death in his own veins and sends them on a nightmarish odyssey through a surreal and devil infested ancient Japan. How do demonic possessions, an annihilated village and a man Jubei thought safely buried in his past all connect? If Jubei can''t piece the blood-soaked clues together, his only consolation will be that he won''t live to regret it for very long! Prepare your mind and steel your gut for the insanely gore-packed orgy of violence that still stands alone and unchallenged as the ultimate anime action feature.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Animate Film', '1993', 'movie', 'released', '1993-06-05', 617, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/617-eL7kKCrbKf9D.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 36455, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U4H32pFc-Qk', '2026-08-29 14:42:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2321, 'Slam Dunk: Roar!! Basket Man Spirit', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2499-qAUPg4OdYFnU.png', 'movies', '7.3', 'Ichiro Mizusawa, a player from Rukawa''s old junior high school, Tomigoaka, is diagnosed with a crippling leg condition and wants to play one last game with Rukawa. Hanamichi sets out to help the boy and fulfill his wish. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-07-15', 2499, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:24:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2499-IhdcWBIRGM7L.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4686, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2322, 'MINKY MOMO in Yume ni Kakeru Hashi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx3462-4xLkDwIwm6NJ.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'A bridge''s legend tells that when two people meet on it, they will surely meet again. Momo meets a boy who doesn''t believe the legend, and promises that she will meet him again to prove it. As the year passes, she comes every day to wait for him, and becomes a small part of many people''s lives.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Junio', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-05-21', 3462, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-03 16:24:22', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3462-JS2rDDcFHafl.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 2101, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2323, 'Tenchi Muyo! Ryo-Ohki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx539-rwTm0bUFunNX.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Tenchi Masaki was a normal 17-year-old boy until the day he accidentally releases the space pirate, Ryoko from a cave she was sealed in 700 years ago as the people thought she was a demon. In a series of events, four other alien girls show up at the Masaki household as Tenchi learns much of his heritage he never knew about and deal with five alien girls who each have some sort of romantic interest in him. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-09-25', 539, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:57', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/539-mcJklaaaHshY.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 6, 12276, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kgWmTaz9MVc', '2026-08-29 14:42:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2324, 'Tenchi Muyo! Ryo-Ohki Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/540.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'This OVA series gives the viewer more in-depth details on Sasami, Washu, and Ryo-ohki, as well as introducing members of the Juraian royal family.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-09-25', 540, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:29', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 6, 5898, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2325, 'Chibi Maruko-chan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b6149-w9IRcMlFkn4i.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Momoko Sakura is an elementary school student who likes popular idol Momoe Yamaguchi and mangas. She is often called "Chibi Maruko-chan" due to her young age and small size. She lives together with her parents, her grandparents and her elder sister in a little town. In school, she has many friends with whom she studies and plays together everyday, including her close pal, Tama-chan; the student committee members, Maruo-kun and Migiwa-san; and the B-class trio: ''little master'' Hanawa-kun, Hamaji-Bu Taro and Sekiguchi-kun. This is a fun-loving and enjoyable anime that portrays the simple things in life.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1995', 'series', 'airing', '1995-08-01', 6149, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 15:40:12', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', NULL, 1860, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:40:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2326, 'My Daddy Long Legs', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1375-Oi6bDqjChClb.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Daddy Long Legs is based on the novel of the same name by Jean Webster. It chronicles the adventures of Judy Abbott, an orphan in New York. During a meeting for the superintendent, with other important and rich people in attendance, a scholarship is offered to Judy by a mysterious benefactor. Catching only a glimpse of his tall shadow as he leaves, Judy calls him "Daddy Long Legs" and writes him letters every month as per his request. While studying at the Lincoln Memorial school, she makes many friends and learns about a world she never knew about before.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-01-14', 1375, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:32', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1375-xY92v5E1lnuZ.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 40, 4837, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2327, 'Little Women II: Jo''s Boys', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2558.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Nan Harding is the new student at Mr. and Mrs. Bhaer''s school. Everyone thinks that she is a pain in the head, but not Mrs. Jo. Together with the other kids, they all embark on their personal adventures and misfortunes while learning in school.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-01-17', 2558, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:35', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2558-ZbScDBMwsskM.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 40, 1816, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2328, 'Slam Dunk: Shohoku Maximum Crisis! Burn Sakuragi Hanamichi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2498-mCUC4VHfw0jU.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'After losing the titanic match against Kainan High, Team Shohoku and a newly shaven Hanamichi Sakuragi are challenged to an exhibition match by virtual basketball unknowns Ryoukufu High. Coach Anzai sees this as an opportunity for Shohoku to regain their confidence, but Ryoukufu are revealed to have a newly assembled championship calibre lineup and may give Sakuragi & Co their toughest test yet.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-03-04', 2498, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:38', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2498-iR2bytCMV3va.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 4829, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2329, 'Hime-chan no Ribbon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2037-QHc1pdhGwV0S.png', 'series', '7.2', 'Erika, the princess of the Magic Kingdom has come to Earth in order to find a human girl who looks just like her. That girl turns out to be Himeko Nonohara, a tomboy''s tomboy. Erika must give Himeko a magical item she has created in order to prove her worth as a successor to the crown. Himeko must test this item, a hair ribbon that allows her to transform into any other person she sees, to see if it is worthy. The series follows Himeko''s adventures and her budding romance with Daichi, the boy who discovers her secret.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Gallop', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-10-02', 2037, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:41', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2037-7N3397qA1SvH.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 61, 3545, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2330, 'Be-Bop High School', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx9645-Vx2xMtVXdQ5P.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'For the invincible and basically happy punk lads Hiroshi and Toru, what they care about every day is to get a lot of attention from girls and to win the fights against the lads from other schools. Whenever provoked, they just go out fighting and settle the situation no matter what it costs.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-01-26', 9645, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:44', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9645-EPZ6KPWBd1SN.jpg', 'Comedy', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 7, 4936, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2331, 'Mama wa Shougaku 4 Nensei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx333-SaISVsNKTlPn.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'Natsumi Mizuki is a 4th grader whose parents have gone to London. Her Aunt Izumi comes to live with her. Izumi is an aspiring manga writer who is trying to get her first big break, so she doesn''t have time for a baby that appears out of thin air on Natsumi''s first night alone. The baby''s name is Mirai and her mother is *Natsumi*, but 15 years older. Somehow, Mirai had traveled back in time. Now the young Natsumi has to raise Mirai while trying to keep her 4th grade life from falling apart and keep Mirai-chan secret from everyone. She has the dubious help of Izumi and some baby-care gadgets from the future.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-01-10', 333, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:47', NULL, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 51, 2483, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2332, 'Sailor Moon SuperS the Movie: Black Dream Hole', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1240-kAKXTWVzFfOr.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'Everywhere around the world, the children sleep. Unaware of danger lurking in the shadows. But tonight, a strange darkness floats in the wind. And the children, one by one, begin to disappear. It seems to be a supernatural force that feeds on their dreams. The evil queen, Badiyanu, and her loyal fairies assist in using the "Black Dream Hole" to swallow the earth. It is up to Sailor Moon and the Sailor Soldiers to prevent the approaching Darkness.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-12-23', 1240, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1240-N72UZD3iVk9R.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 9196, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uMGMTPfxVAU', '2026-08-29 14:43:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2333, 'Dragon Quest: Dai no Daibouken', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2229-aAZ38PLgyd1P.png', 'series', '7.2', 'After the defeat of the demon lord Hadlar all of the monsters were unleashed from his evil will and moved to the island of Delmurin to live in peace. Dai is the only human living on the island. Having been raised by the kindly monster Brass, Dai''s dream is to grow up to be a hero. He gets to become one when Hadlar is resurrected and the previous hero, Avan, comes to train Dai to help in the battle. But Hadlar, announcing that he now works for an even more powerful demon lord, comes to kill Avan. To save his students Avan uses a Self-Sacrifice spell to attack, but is unable to defeat Hadlar. When it seems that Dai and Avan''s other student Pop are doomed a mark appears on Dai''s forehead and he suddenly gains super powers and is able to fend off Hadlar. The two students then go off on a journey to avenge Avan and bring peace back to the world.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-10-17', 2229, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:53', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2229-d1aD3JiGTKTk.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 46, 5470, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2334, 'Ranma 1/2 Special', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/n1008-gvztwCP8BLA0.jpg', 'series', '7.2', '"Reawakening Memories" deals with Akane suddenly remembering a trip to Ryugenzawa when she was a small child. While there she was saved from a giant platypus by Shinnosuke. Akane travels back to Ryogenzawa and once again meets Shinnosuke, who falls in love with her. Akane blames herself for Shinnosuke`s life-threatening injuries, and decides to stay and help out. This irritates Ranma, who thinks that Akane has fallen in love with Shinnosuke, and will do what it takes to get her back.', 'Studio DEEN', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-12-16', 1008, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:24:57', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 2, 4939, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2335, 'Magical Circle Guru Guru', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx331-BzpIrGJZePCA.png', 'series', '7.2', 'There is a small village called Jimuna on the continent of Jamu Jamu. This village is home to a girl named Kukuri. She is the last descendent of the Migu Migu Tribe. She is raised by an old witch who teaches her the secret magic of the tribe, but Kukuri is not a good student.

In the same village lives a boy named Nike. He has been raised by very strict parents. They discipline their son to become a brave hero of the village. Nike himself does not want to be a hero at all, but he grows up to become a mighty boy.

One day the king of the village, Kodai, recruits troops to fight against the ruler of the darkness, Giri. Kukuri and Nike are accepted. The two children, the strong but reluctant hero Nike, and the eager but unskilled little witch Kukuri, set out on a wonderful journey full of adventures and friendship.

(Source: Nippon Animation)', 'Nippon Animation', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-10-13', 331, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:01', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 45, 3900, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2336, 'Fushigi Yugi: The Mysterious Play', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx123-nTVq4CHgK5Ly.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'While visiting the National Library, junior-high students Miaka Yuuki and Yui Hongo are transported into the world of a mysterious book set in ancient China, &ldquo;The Universe of The Four Gods.&rdquo; Miaka suddenly finds herself with the responsibility of being the priestess of Suzaku, and must find all of her celestial warriors for the purpose of summoning Suzaku for three wishes. However, the enemy nation of the god Seiryuu has manipulated Yui into becoming the priestess of Seiryuu. As enemies, the former best friends begin their long struggle to summon their respective gods and obtain their wishes&hellip;

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'Studio Pierrot', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-04-06', 123, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:04', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/123-aB3o7LLZrWWV.png', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 21591, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2337, 'Magic Knight Rayearth II', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1563-iBCCwEnUoRVm.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Soon after Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu return to Tokyo, the three of them meet at Tokyo Tower to talk. Hikaru says that she wishes they could return to Cephiro and do something good for the land that Princess Emeraude protected so dearly. Umi and Fuu agree. Suddenly, a light appears in the sky and they are transported to Cephiro. Clef explains to them that with no Pillar to keep Cephiro peaceful, it has fallen into chaos. Monsters are multiplying and the land is becoming desolate. All the remaining inhabitants of Cephiro have moved into a magical castle. Clef also tells the girls some alarming news; three other countries, Chizeta, Fahren, and Autozam are trying to invade Cephiro and take over the Pillar system for their own purposes. The girls must stop the invaders as well as the mysterious and evil Lady Debonair, who believes she is the rightful Pillar, all the while desperately hoping and searching for a new Pillar to make Cephiro into the beautiful land it once was.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'TMS Entertainment', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-04-10', 1563, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1563-qzo4v2Pmv1y9.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Mecha, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 29, 8098, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2338, 'Slam Dunk: National Domination! Sakuragi Hanamichi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1861-gLafT1OtdB9a.png', 'movies', '7.1', 'Set during the Inter High Championships, Shohoku take on Tsukubu, one of this year''s dark horses. It''s a clash of acquaintances as Anzai will face his former student which is now the coach of Tsukubu, while Akagi & Kogure meet Godai their former classmate and Tsukubu''s captain. Finally Sakuragi is irked by the presence of Nango, Tsukubu''s center, who vies for Haruko''s attention.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-08-20', 1861, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1861-snIrGsslYakY.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4813, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2339, 'Magic Knight Rayearth', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx435-WO3USrR2jB5u.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Three young girls, Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu, are transported to a magical world called Cephiro during a field trip to Tokyo Tower. They are soon greeted by Master Mage Clef, who explains to them that they have been summoned to become the Legendary Magic Knights and save Cephiro. The girls are less than enthusiastic about this idea, and only want to return home. Clef further explains that they must seek out the three Rune Gods to help them fight. He bestows armor and magical powers to each of them. They learn from Clef that High Priest Zagato has kidnapped the Pillar of Cephiro, Princess Emeraude. The Pillar of Cephiro has the sole responsibility of keeping Cephiro alive and in balance with her prayers. Without Princess Emeraude, Cephiro would fall into ruin. Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu must fight off Zagato''s henchman and find the Rune Gods if they ever want to get back home. They soon learn that friendship and loyalty are the only things they can rely on in the crumbling Cephiro.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-10-17', 435, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:15', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/435-xN9wghZ2oUDd.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 20, 21075, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2340, 'Shin Seiki GPX Cyber Formula 11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1392-s8zDzECPnVw6.png', 'series', '7.1', 'It is now time for the 11th Cyber Formula World Grand Prix. With all the expectations and pressures placed upon him, Hayato Kazami struggles to regain the championship form that he had a year ago. Moreover, Osamu Sugo, aka Knight Schumacher, has reentered the competition, and declared Hayato to be an enemy. Hayato, with the new Super Asurada AKF-11, must now defeat someone he once deeply trusted in order to secure his second championship.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-11-01', 1392, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1392-No82DhEFGwMm.jpg', 'Drama, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'OVA', 'FALL', 6, 1411, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2341, 'Mobile Suit Gundam Wing', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b90-umBjF3yaeIdo.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Mankind has moved into space. Thousands of people live on giant orbiting space colonies called "Sides." However, the Earth Government, which rules the colonies, is unjust and cruel. A group of revolutionaries build five robotic weapons called Gundams and plan to send them to Earth to begin their fight for independence. Piloted by five young men, these Gundams carry the colonists'' hopes and dreams of freedom with them as they descend to Earth to begin Operation Meteor!

(Source: Nozomi Entertainment)', 'Sunrise', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-04-07', 90, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/90-hhE4GDd5rx1G.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 49, 31837, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2342, 'Tenchi Muyo! Tenchi Universe', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx696-q40thYobzxmz.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Tenchi Masaki may be a 17-year-old young man in rural Japan, but little does he know how bad his day will be getting. When a space pirate chased by a pair of Galaxy Police officers crash-lands at his grandfather''s temple, Tenchi is sucked into a new adventure that will literally blast him off into outer space and beyond. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-04-02', 696, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/696-d3QphXIJN64c.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 18325, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G350vJSKH1U', '2026-08-29 14:43:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2343, 'Junkers Come Here', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1116-hoHyyuyGEAVm.jpg', 'movies', '7.1', 'This heartwarming and unexpectedly mature story concerns a young girl named Hiromi Nozawa and her dog, Junkers (pronounced Yoon-kers). Hiromi walks us through her childhood troubles of love, schooling, and family bonds. Her companion Junkers accompanies her on this adventure.  However, Junkers is no ordinary dog - he can talk and grant 3 wishes.', 'Triangle Staff', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-03-18', 1116, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:30', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1116-NvJ0A7PPdtXg.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 3757, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2344, 'Comet in Moominland', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2313-p6yEnLwcoBID.jpg', 'movies', '7.1', 'Unusual things have been happening in Moominvalley. Moomin, Sniff and Mee leave for the Observatory on the Lonely Mountains to confirm the Muskrat''s words: a comet is about to hit Moominvalley and destroy everything. On the way they meet Snufkin, the Hemulen and the Snorks and experience many adventures. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1992', 'movie', 'released', '1992-08-08', 2313, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2313-MB3HILEvSREW.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 3320, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2345, 'Shin Seiki GPX Cyber Formula ZERO', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1393-3ez32d9OEzZm.png', 'series', '7.1', 'A freak accident during the 12th Cyber Formula World Grand Prix causes Hayato Kazami to miss the rest of the season, and critically injures both his body and his will to continue racing. Hayato''s longtime friend, Asuka Sugo, helps nurse him back to health, and in return he proposes to her and promises her that he would never race again. But as time goes on, Hayato begins to doubt whether he really wants to retire, and decides to make a comeback after all. And with the 13th Cyber Formula World Grand Prix now underway, he must struggle to regain his racing form; regain the trust of Asuka, whose promise he broke; and thwart the malicious intents of Henri Clayton. All the while, the reason behind Hayato''s accident begins to unveil itself: the "Zero Zone."

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-04-01', 1393, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:37', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1393-KN1aCsoZcoL1.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 8, 1246, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2346, 'The Trapp Family Story', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2557-jLHlIopf1kXN.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Based on the same story that produced the classic musical ''The Sound of Music'', this is the story of Maria, who leaves her life in a convent to take up the responsibility of taking care of Captain Trapp''s children.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-01-13', 2557, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:30:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2557-Qo3Kvo3HRs4E.jpg', 'Drama, Music, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 40, 2657, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:40', '2026-09-03 16:30:20');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2347, 'Pom Poko', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1030-epXaUwnycmQE.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'Faced with the destruction of their habitat due to the growth of Tokyo, a group of tanuki try to defend their homes. They decide to use their transforming talents to try to hold back the new development. Two of them, especially skilled at transforming, are sent to Shikoku to enlist the help of three sages. Meanwhile, the rest of them do their best to disrupt the construction site, at first causing accidents, and then actually haunting the site. However, the humans are very persistent, and soon the tanuki are forced to use more and more extreme measures to save their home.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Ghibli', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-06-13', 1030, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1030-wnxJEkttJqgs.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 32039, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7cowIHjCD4', '2026-08-29 14:43:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2348, 'Future GPX Cyber Formula', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1391-99GnhCkyPKCn.jpg', 'series', '7.0', '14-year-old Kazami Hayato is the youngest driver of Cyber Formula, a Grand Prix in which each vehicle is equipped with computers to aid in racing. With the help of Asurada, the most advanced cybernavigation system, and team Sugo, Hayato races to become the winner of the 10th Cyber Formula Grand Prix. Along the way, Hayato will have to learn what it truly means to be a racer and that victory cannot be achieved simply by driving the best machine. In addition, Kazami will have to gain the respect of the veteran racers, thwart those who attempt to steal Asurada, and participate in races outside of Cyber Formula.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-03-15', 1391, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:46', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1391-zkX5A0GjuplU.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 37, 4193, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2349, 'Yu Yu Hakusho: Eizou Hakusho', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2125.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'These are two recap specials that focus on Team Urameshi''s matches in the Dark Tournament, with a few character songs playing in the background. 

There are also two shorts at the end of each episode, both of which are about 1:20 long.

Eizou Hakusho Series: Ankoku Bujutsukai no Shou - Gekan

-Group Photo

Eizou Hakusho Series: Ankoku Bujutsukai no Shou - Joukan

-Koto''s Interview', 'Studio Pierrot', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-09-21', 2125, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2125-WxCFwl4VstOY.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 2, 5252, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1BJR5cJz_ZU', '2026-08-29 14:43:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2350, 'Shounan Junai Gumi!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1913-jsiD6dL81mMk.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Eikichi Onizuka and Ryuji Danma are members of infamous biker duo, the Oni Baku. When not out riding around, they can be found in school, trying to pick up young women. This is the story of the young Onizuka, who would later become the greatest teacher in Japan, and his partner Ryuji in their quest to lose their virginity and reach maturity. 

They are widely feared bosozoku, and are known for their tenacity and viciousness in a fight. However, this lifestyle does not exactly endear them to the opposite gender, so they decide to change their ways. However, this is easier said than done. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-01-21', 1913, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:53', NULL, 'Action, Comedy', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 5, 13032, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2351, 'The Brave of Gold Goldran', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5440-qYpD0zIpyNh1.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Goldran follows the adventures of three young boys who are tasked with finding alien robot fighters, or Braves, that are sleeping in the form of crystals. Their major antagonist is the flamboyant and thoroughly incompetent Walter, and the villains that follow him are often similarly humorous. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-02-04', 5440, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:25:57', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 1647, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2352, 'Tekkaman Blade', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1459-LeqV4WNUfcNM.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Tekkaman Blade takes place in the year 2300 AD. On a certain moment, the Radam attack earth. A few months after the beginning of the invasion, a tekkaman appears, he calls himself Blade and with the help of the Space Knights, Blade starts to fight the radam. But there are a few things that Blade isn''t telling about his past.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-02-18', 1459, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:26:00', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1459-yQQYEwrXfmHO.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 5838, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:26:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2353, 'Sailor Moon SuperS Plus: Ami''s First Love', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1278-Nfyto6U4HTHm.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Quiet bookworm of the Sailor Senshi Ami takes pride in her studies, but a rival naming himself "Mercurius" is suddenly outscoring her on the national exams. Combine this with a sudden love letter and a youma feeding on Ami''s stress over the whole situation, and Sailor Mercury finds herself in a huge pinch.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-12-23', 1278, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:26:03', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1278-Zhq3kKZ3Ok7i.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 1, 5668, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:26:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2354, 'City Hunter: Bay City Wars', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1475-uSmxYaXBLBs8.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'A new island resort has been built in Tokyo bay, and it is run by one of the world''s most powerful super computers. The City Hunter gang has been invited to the grand opening party, but only Miki & Kaori have gotten there. Soon, they and the rest of the party goers are taken hostage by an exiled South American dictator called General Gillium. Now it''s up to Ryo and Umibozu to free the hostages, and prevent Gillium''s daughter from using the super computer to launch a nuclear attack on the USA.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1990', 'movie', 'released', '1990-08-25', 1475, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:26:06', NULL, 'Action, Comedy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2960, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:26:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2355, 'Macross 7', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1397-D9MLYHZhOnYO.png', 'series', '7.0', '35 years have passed since Lynn Minmay had brought peace between the Zentradi and the humans in the events of Macross. Nekki Basara is a guitarist and a singer of the band Fire Bomber. Living in a less-developed part of the flying colony City 7 which is looking for a habitable planet, he composes and sings songs in the belief that music holds a greater power.

During its flight, an unknown alien race appeared and started laying siege upon City 7. However, its attacks are not conventional -- instead of trying to destroy them, they steal what is known as "spiritia", rendering victims unresponsive and zombie-like. During these battles, Basara always goes out into the middle of the warzone, singing his songs and expecting friend and foe to listen and be moved by his music.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Ashi Productions', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-10-16', 1397, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:26:09', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1397-R8KenRg7Qerw.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 49, 11310, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:26:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2356, 'Record of Lodoss War', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx207-B2lxEFGigYgd.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Created from the aftermath of the last great battle of the gods, Lodoss and its kingdoms have been plagued by war for thousands of years. As a quiet peace and unity finally become foreseeable over the land, an unknown evil begins to stir. An ancient witch has awakened, bent on preserving the island of Lodoss by creating political unbalance throughout the many kingdoms and keeping any one from maintaining central control. Only a mixed-race party of six young champions, led by the young warrior Parn, stand between this new threat and Lodoss'' descent back into the darkness of war and destruction. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-06-30', 207, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/207-kn1uKSa5c8Qz.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 13, 29217, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7hJ7SJC1vFY', '2026-08-29 14:43:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2357, 'Marmalade Boy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx334-j0qi6uccfNwv.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Miki Koishikawa lived a normal life - until her parents tell her they''ll get divorced.. She doesn''t agree, until she meets Yuu Matsuura... the handsome son of another couple, with whom her parents are switching spouses. They all live together now in an enormous house, and Miki and Yuu find themselves falling in love. They''ll have to struggle with their own feelings, other people who want to be with them, and whatever Lady Luck and Fate throws in their ways...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-03-13', 334, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:26:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/334-xaItOoh8vCvS.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 76, 12813, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:26:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2358, 'Tanoshii Moomin Ikka Bouken Nikki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5712-CfznnIZexohI.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'A direct continuation of Tanoshii Moomin Ikka.

In the remote and mysterious Moomin Valley live the Moomin trolls, gentle and peaceful creatures. Young Moomin and his family experience many strange adventures, both magical and mundane. Based on the children''s stories by Tove Jansson.

(Source: Anime News Network)

Note: In several countries'' releases these episodes are treated as part of the first season.', 'Telescreen BV', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-10-10', 5712, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:55:59', '2026-09-03 16:27:46', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5712-crUjATLM63he.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 2242, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2359, 'Yuusha Tokkyuu Might Gaine', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3486-4rN0JJRd8pOd.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Nouvelle Tokio City locates on the place where it used to be Tokyo Bay. At the first glance, the prosperous city seems to enjoy its freedom and peace, but the city is suffering from the crimes.

Senmuji Maito is a perfect 15-year-old boy, bright, handsome, smart, and all-around sportsman. Furthermore, he is the leader of Senpuji Trading group, and a multimillionaire. He spends his private fortune to found "Brave Express Squad" which consists of several robots. They are the robots that have various special abilities. Above all, the leader, Gaine, has a super artificial intelligence and has own personality. They can transform into trains. In case of incidents, they will appear anywhere in the world using the highly developed railway system.', 'Sunrise', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-01-30', 3486, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:00', '2026-09-03 16:27:49', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 47, 1887, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2360, 'Tottemo! Luckyman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3672-93nRmP6VDcFY.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'This gag comedy series focused on the adventures of a bizarre superhero powered by special cooking and fights against various aliens and other enemies threatening the planet Earth.', 'Studio Pierrot', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-04-06', 3672, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:00', '2026-09-03 16:27:53', NULL, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 1684, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2361, 'Kingyo Chuuihou!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx727-CBqW4AJztnfz.png', 'series', '7.0', 'The show starts with the tale of Chitose Fujinomiya, a girl who goes from riches to rags and back and remains a snob despite it all. When her wealthy father dies, remaining debts leave Chitose almost broke, and she is kicked out of the affluent Tokai no Gakuen, or City Academy. She is left with nothing in the world but the clothes on her back and one pink goldfish named Gyopi-chan, the only memento she has of her father. Wandering lost, she collapses on the grounds of the poor-but-happy Inaka no Chugakko (Country Jr. High School), where the students are rough if friendly, and farm animals regularly roam the school grounds and even attend class. Recovering, she enters into the school but is repelled by its air of poverty, to which she is unaccustomed.  

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Toei Animation', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-01-12', 727, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:00', '2026-09-03 16:27:56', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/727-Ypt2i7MVcoPR.jpg', 'Comedy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 54, 2075, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2362, 'Cyber City Oedo 808', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1352-1Sytay3y8ZON.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'It is the year 2808. Three convicts are recruited as members of the Cyber Police to keep major criminal activity in Oedo (formerly Tokyo) in check. In return, their life sentences will be reduced by a few years for every mission accomplished. However, to ensure that these convicts are doing their job, the police have secured special collars around their necks. If they attempt to remove their collars or fail to meet the time limit of their mission, the collars will self-destruct.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-06-21', 1352, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:00', '2026-09-03 16:27:59', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1352-YR39oBZLsbLz.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 3, 11538, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2363, 'Otaku no Video', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx785-aaH0guDvFr2o.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Somewhat based on the real story of how Gainax was founded, Otaku no Video addresses all aspects of an otaku lifestyle. Ken Kubo is a young man living an average life until he is dragged into a group of otaku. Slowly, he becomes more like them until he decides to abandon his former life to become king of otaku &mdash;the otaking! 

Mixed in are live-action interviews with real otaku, addressing every aspect of hardcore otaku life. Not only are anime and manga fans included, but also sci-fi fans, military fans, and other groups of Japanese geeks.', 'Gainax', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-09-27', 785, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:00', '2026-09-03 16:28:02', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/785-0NImIvpjPOCn.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 2, 12994, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2364, 'Red Riding Hood Chacha', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx103-v029gLfcQajN.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Chacha is a cheerful girl who spends most of her days practicing magic under her teacher Seravi, hoping to become as skilled as he is. Though Chacha is enthusiastic, her tendency to make unfortunate puns out of her magic chants leaves her teacher wondering if she is ready for magic school. Deciding that there is no better time, Seravi gifts Chacha the Princess Medallion, allowing her to transform into a magical princess capable of defeating even the fiercest opponents.

Together with her best friends Riiya, a werewolf boy, and Shiine, an apprentice of Seravi''s old rival, Dorothy, Chacha sets out to defend the world from sinister forces. However, between the Great Evil Lord plotting against them, Riiya and Shiine''s rivalry to win Chacha''s affection, as well as Seravi and Dorothy''s complicated relationship, Chacha struggles to find balance between fighting evil forces and mending relationships in her everyday life. Though obstacles continue to come her way, Chacha is determined to overcome any problem she faces with love, courage, and hope by her side.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Studio Gallop', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-01-07', 103, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:00', '2026-09-03 16:28:06', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n103-dPxprIcIeq1Q.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'TV', 'WINTER', 74, 4514, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2365, 'Aoki Densetsu Shoot!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1327-B3BUwfGKCQIB.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Aoki Densetsu Shoot! (Shoot!!), is the story of Toshihiko Tanaka, Kenji Shiraishi, and Kazuhiro Hiramatsu. Three high school freshmen who have become best friends during their junior high years while playing soccer together. There they were known as the Kakenishi golden trio for their role in making Kakenishi Junior High`s soccer team into a force to be reckoned with. After junior high, all of them decided to go to the same high school, Kakegawa High, a school only founded a year before, because of their star soccer player, Yoshiharu Kubo, whom they had idolized. 

This young man led Kakegawa High Soccer Club to the best 8 of their prefecture in their first ever appearance with a freshmen only team almost single-handedly. He refuses offers from a number of foreign professional soccer clubs so he can stay at Kake-High to lead them to the All-Japan High School Championship. As the three of them start playing soccer for Kake-High, they experience hardships, romance, and losses on their road to becoming the best Japanese high school soccer team - a team of legends. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-11-07', 1327, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:09', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1327-9U7RzxW4CJIW.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 58, 3316, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2366, 'City Hunter: Million Dollar Conspiracy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1476.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'Beautiful American Emily O''Hara offers the City Hunter (Ryo Saeba & Kaori Makimura) one million dollars to protect her from a man named Douglas. Ryo & Kaori take the job, but things are not quite what they seem. The real target just might be Ryo, but it''s unclear who wants Saeba dead.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1990', 'movie', 'released', '1990-08-25', 1476, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:12', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1476-p1yNmuWGe9C9.jpg', 'Action', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2596, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2367, 'Devilman: The Demon Bird', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2355-OiUU6AhqJ4jR.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Demons exist and their power is beyond what humans can fathom. In fact, they are so strong that humans do not stand a chance against them in a fight. 

The only thing strong enough to defeat a demon is another demon, and it is through this logic that Ryo Asuka hatches the plan to have his good-hearted friend, Akira Fudo, possessed by a demon. If a person is of pure of heart, then they might be able to control the demon that possesses them, and thereby acquire power equal to a demon. After raising some hell in a club, the plan works, and Akira is possessed by the powerful demon known as Amon. 

Now Akira is humanity''s sole champion of justice against the hidden demon menace that has plagued humanity since the dawn of time.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Oh! Production', '1990', 'series', 'released', '1990-02-25', 2355, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2355-NSbzMIJm6UGg.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 9045, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2368, 'Slam Dunk Movie 1', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1764-8AxfOVdCcMr0.png', 'movies', '6.9', 'Sakuragi and the Shohoko team takes on Oda and Takezono High School. This is Sakuragi''s second match as he faces Oda, a basketball player who went to the same junior high.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-03-12', 1764, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1764-43njOimRHeyO.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 6048, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2369, 'Slayers: The Motion Picture', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx536-j3i5b9EgIA1a.png', 'movies', '7.0', 'In this prequel movie to the Slayers televison series, Lina Inverse travels to Mipross Island with her rival/traveling companion Naga the Serpent. While they originally came for the hot springs, they soon find them selves mixed up in a conspiracy involving a mazoku named Joyrock. Years ago, he killed all of the elves that inhabited the island and absorbed their power. They are soon joined by an old mage named Rowdy Gabriev, who was in love with one of the elves slaughtered and also wants to defeat Joyrock. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-07-29', 536, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n536-HQCk4Y9qUyLb.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 5923, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2370, 'Tenchi Muyo! Ryo-Ohki: The Night Before The Carnival!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1146.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'A few days after Kagato is defeted everything returns to normal. Ryoko finds Mihoshi and Sasami reading shojo manga which Sasami tells that they are guides to tell how to win a boy Earth style. So Ryoko decides to try to use ideas from manga to win Tenchi. Ayeka finds out what she''s doing and starts using the manga to win Tenchi as well. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-09-25', 1146, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:28', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1146-h14T6NYTxTsD.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 4675, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2371, 'Ranma ½: One Flew Over the Kuno''s Nest', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1010-lnoMM9Yc9osK.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'Kuno purchases a strange egg, believing that the mysterious powers of the legendary Phoenix will help him defeat Ranma. But when the egg hatches on his head, the bird goes out of control and wreaks havoc all over Tokyo. Ranma and the gang must use any means necessary to get the Phoenix to leave Kuno''s head and fly away.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio DEEN', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-08-20', 1010, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:32', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4385, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2372, 'Oh! My Goddess', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx49-jv1G7rSP4lxg.png', 'series', '6.9', 'When college student Keiichi Morisato dials the wrong number while ordering for some food at his dormitory, he accidentally gets connected to the Goddess Hotline and a beautiful goddess named Belldandy appears out of a mirror in front of him. After getting kicked out of the dorm, Keiichi and Belldandy move to an old shrine and soon afterwards, Belldandy''s sisters Urd and Skuld move in.', 'AIC', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-02-21', 49, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:36', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/49-qgxvhyIpIAuD.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 5, 12133, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2373, 'Yu Yu Hakusho: Eizou Hakusho II', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2126.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Eizou Hakusho II actually consists of four separate volumes. Each volume focuses around one of the main characters; Yusuke, Kurama, Hiei, or Kuwabara. Each episode is basically recap about the specific character''s involvement in the series.

The beginning of each episode also contains a short music video about the specific character, with a song by its seiyuu.', 'Studio Pierrot', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-12-16', 2126, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2126-sNv2yVSwCsp1.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 4, 4218, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1BJR5cJz_ZU', '2026-08-29 14:43:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2374, 'Honoo no Toukyuuji: Dodge Danpei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2228.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Danpei Ichihgeki is the son of Daijurou Ichigeki, a great dodgeball player. As his father, Danpei gives all he has for this game and so it shows in every match.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Animation 21', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-10-14', 2228, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:43', NULL, 'Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 47, 1347, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2375, 'Brave of the Sun Fighbird', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4532-yWo6gZ4F7Mex.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'In 2010, an evil Minus-Energy Lifeform called Draias has made his way to Earth, and allies himself with an evil scientist known as Dr Jango to create chaos and ruin the planet. A unit dispatched from the peacekeeping Space Police Force follows him to Earth, and their leader Fighbird inhabits the body of an advanced android built by Dr. Hiroshi Amano, becoming Yuutarou Katori. Katori and his team, inhabiting various Earth vehicles and accompanied by Dr. Amano''s grandchildren Kenta and Haruka, fight against Draias''s forces while adapting to life on Earth.

(Source: Brave Series Wiki)', 'Sunrise', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-02-02', 4532, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:47', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4532-2U4bIAOayYT7.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 1957, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2376, 'Captain Tsubasa J', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1674-yr7mrN4uadVZ.png', 'series', '6.9', 'The first 33 episodes are a summary of the previous series. In the first new episodes a new character, Shingo Aoi, (playing in Italy) is introduced. After that the world cup begins, this time with extraordinary, new countries like Sweden, Thailand or Uzbekistan. Unfortunately the Anime ends in the middle of the world cup after the match Japan-Uzbekistan.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Comet', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-10-21', 1674, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1674-39WyLvX15h4g.jpg', 'Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 47, 5851, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2377, 'El Hazard: The Magnificent World', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx117-GUF1ulwYZWsk.png', 'series', '6.9', 'When Makoto Mizuhara discovers an old monument in his school and awakens a beautiful woman, he, his teacher, his worst enemy and one of his female friends is transported to the magnificent world of El Hazard. There they discovers that they have received some special powers. Makoto and his teacher Fujisawa lands in a jungle and saves a princess from some large bugs. Makoto''s friend Nanami lands in a desert. And Makoto''s rival, Jinnai lands in the middle of the bug''s kingdom and becomes their general, plotting to destroy Makoto and his new friends. After several having his attacks repelled by Makoto several times, Jinnai learns about an ultimate weapon, the demon Ifurita. And so everyone sets of to find Ifurita, and when she''s found Makoto learns that she is the same woman that sent them to El Hazard. But the one gaining control of her is Jinnai.

(Source: Anime News Network)

Note: The first & last episode have a duration of ~46 minutes', 'AIC', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-05-26', 117, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n117-UWWgQ20ldKXE.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 7, 5699, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2378, 'H2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx386-x4amUWWKw0qR.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Hiro has two loves: baseball and porn, but due to an elbow injury, gives up baseball, choosing a school with no baseball team. His childhood friend Hikari attends a different school with baseball ace Hideo. The two of them wish that Hiro had not given up baseball. Hiro joins the soccer team and meets Haruka, a very clumsy girl who is also the daughter of his father''s boss. Haruka is the manager of the unofficial baseball club at Hiro''s school. When the soccer team challenges the baseball club to a game, with hopes of humiliating them, the baseball club nearly loses until Hiro, disgusted by the soccer team''s arrogance, switches to the baseball club. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Ashi Productions', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-06-01', 386, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:28:58', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/386-1C3TtYJTWGco.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 41, 3257, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2379, 'Irresponsible Captain Tylor OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1168-PIeqe2W74s7F.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Six long months have passed. The Raalgon Empire has developed a horrible new type of weapon, and Tylor has been charged with the duty of intercepting it as it is being transported. But when all that could go wrong does go wrong, the crew members of the Soyokaze find themselves at the mercy of their enemies. As the hours tick down toward their execution, the crew wonders: has their irresponsible captain misled them? Or is this all a part of some greater strategy?

(Source: RightStuf)', 'Studio DEEN', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-10-01', 1168, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:01', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1168-ODnL985hKBMj.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 10, 2864, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2380, 'Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon SuperS Special', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3076-p9sWcCjTW1Wq.png', 'series', '6.8', 'The first episode is a summary of SM, SM R and SM S, the second episode is about Haruka and Michiru on a cruising. They fight one of the SuperS enemies and decide to leave this villains to the classical Sailor Team. (That''s an explanation why the outer Sailor Team doesn''t appear in this season.) In episode 3 Chibiusa uncovers one of her classmates as a monster and fights her with the Sailor Team in a vampire castle.', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-04-08', 3076, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:05', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Romance', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 3, 4914, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2381, 'Densetsu no Yuusha Da-Garn', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2803-nDtpKT2F1fFk.png', 'series', '6.9', 'Seiji Takasugi obtained a jewel called "Aurin" which is the earth''s alter ego and it has elected him to be the commander of eight brave robots. The Brave robots are sleeping in many parts of the world as "Brave Stones". However, they become super robots by fusing with modern people and machines once Seiji awakens them and they soon follow his instructions. Their enemy is Lord Oh-Boss who is an invader who aims at stealing the planet''s energy with the aid of his subordinates that Da-Garn and the other brave robots must stop in order to save the world.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-02-08', 2803, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2803-gYavv1ZDXFNL.jpg', 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 46, 1798, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2382, 'Fairy Princess Minky Momo 2nd', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5953-rGeLhcu5U2XY.png', 'series', '6.8', 'This series starts with the second Minky Momo arriving from "Marinasa", a land of dreams and magic, similar to Fenarinasa, that has sunk to the bottom of the sea. On Earth, she tries to accomplish what the first Momo couldn''t, restore humanity''s hopes and dreams, in order to save Fenarinasa and Marinenasa from extinction. 

Note: Although the structure of this series is almost the same as the one from 1982, it has a heavier story, with real-life social issues incorporated as themes in many of the episodes.', NULL, '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-10-02', 5953, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:27:05', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5953-9LybgeTC9BEA.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'FALL', 62, 1550, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2383, 'Ushio and Tora', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b842-fVGV9fp1o9io.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Ushio thinks his father''s tale of an ancient ancestor impaling a demon on a temple altar stone with the legendary Beast Spear is nuts, but when he finds the monster in his own basement, Ushio has to take another look at the family legend! Fortunately, Ushio knows it''s best to let sleeping dogs lie and leave captured demons where they are. 

Unfortunately, the release of the monster''s evil energies begins to beckon other demons to Ushio''s hometown! To save his friends and family from the invading spirits, Ushio is forced to release Tora from his captivity. But will the cure prove to be worse than the curse? Will Ushio end his life a Tora-snack? Or will the Beast Spear keep Tora in line long enough to save the city?', 'Pastel', '1992', 'series', 'released', '1992-09-11', 842, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/842-U7o7cOpxssjo.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 10, 4703, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2384, 'Ghost Sweeper Mikami', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2400-qtL4ZLOVQeWH.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'You say you got a ghost in your prefecture? In Japan that means you need to call Ghost Sweeper Mikami, the paranormal detective agency that''s a little abnormal. Okay, make that a LOT abnormal, but they DO specialize in disposing of things that most people don''t even believe exist. Run by the visually delicious and even more avaricious Reiko Mikami, and aided by the very perverted (but also very loyal) Tadao Yokoshima, they''ll take any case that pays. And Tadao will do anything that might let him sneak a peek at Reiko''s magnificent physique. How unfortunate for him that Reiko basically sees him as cannon-fodder, something that''s quite useful when your day to day business involves exorcising oni, yurei, yokai and anything else you might find in The Illustrated Bag of One Hundred Random Ghosts.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Toei Animation', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-04-11', 2400, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2400-RZmFo9Dx9oUf.jpg', 'Comedy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SPRING', 45, 4684, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2385, 'Who''s Left Behind?', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2753-JZjEB7d4XF2e.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'Kayoko is a young girl in 1940, just starting first grade. She''s a bit of a crybaby, which is no secret to those around her. She loves playing with friends and singing cute schoolyard chants, and occasionally having fun with her three older brothers. Her mother is pregnant, and so she looks forward to being a big sister, only partially understanding the responsibility that might bring. Meanwhile, the war effort is growing, and it`s only the natural thing to do to be patriotic and support the country...

Kayoko goes so far as to contribute her favorite dolly, whose materials could help build explosives. Time passes, and as she grows older, Kayoko sees how the war has affected her life and those around her. Nothing can prepare her for 1945, however, and the bleak times that are soon to come. Based on original creator Kayoko Ebina''s real life experience during World War 2 on Showa era.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Mushi Production', '1991', 'movie', 'released', '1991-03-09', 2753, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:33:43', NULL, 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 4280, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:23', '2026-09-03 16:33:43');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2386, 'Roujin Z', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2000-BFVMqByhjMNW.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'The Z Project was intended to give the new generation a break from caring for the old. The original intention was to create a machine to care for them without any intervention. At first glance, it looked like an excellent plan, and many of the younger generation approved of its application. But when old Mr. Takazawa became the test subject for the Z-001 machine, Haruko questioned both the tactics of the hospital and the moral implications of the machine. This is just the beginning, as Haruko has not just the hospital, but the odds against her. But then, she discovers an odd quirk about the machine: it uses a biochip, and it eventually acquires a mind of its own!

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'APPP', '1991', 'movie', 'released', '1991-09-14', 2000, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:27', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2000-VBVRGICYXBvK.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 15542, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2387, 'Tico and Friends', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/n3199-vMMUBCkFaX1m.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Nanami Simpson is a young girl. Her mother dies when she is young, and she goes to live with her Father, Scott Simpson, on board a Marine Research Vessel , the Peperonchino. Her Father is a Marine Biologist, and he is in search of a creature known as the Glowing Whale. When He finds the bones of one of these, he is saddened, and resolves to change his mission towards preserving and caring for the creatures. Nanami befriends an Orca which she names Tico, and She goes swimming with it every day. Eventually, she learns to breathe Underwater which astounds her Father. Nanami nearly drowns one day, and one of the glowing whales saves her from certain death and returns her to the vessel, where her Father finally gets to see it.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-01-16', 3199, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:30', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3199-kLNARrD3BVkm.jpg', 'Adventure, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 39, 1993, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2388, 'Virtua Fighter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx961-c2Y2JNLfMm01.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Legends speak of a great constellation of stars, only visible to those who possess true strength. Having lost his ability to see those stars, Akira walks the earth in search of answers. His quest pits him against powerful fighters like the Koenkan and the mysterious Kage Maru, and lands him in the center of an international conspiracy. For the first time on DVD, come the adventures of Akira, Jacky, Sara and Pai. Facing off with the greatest martial artists from all over the world, all the top characters from the best-selling video game are ready for action!

SEASON 1 = EPISODE 1 - 24

ROUND 1 = EPISODE 1 - 12

ROUND 2 = EPISODE 13 - 24

SEASON 2 = EPISODE 25 - 35

(Source: AniDB)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-10-09', 961, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:34', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'TV', 'FALL', 35, 2962, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2389, 'Street Fighter II: The Animated Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1362-Z5U3WEbo0Q6H.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'M.Bison''s plan to crush those who would oppose his evil Shadaloo organization is simple: brainwash the strongest martial artists around the world with his dreaded psycho power and turn them into living weapons! And now, he''s found his newest target: Ryu, a traveling vagabond said to be the strongest man in the world. In order to stop the dictator''s evil plot, Interpol agent Chun-Li forms a rocky partnership with Major Guile of the United States Air Force.

But they''ll have to put aside their differences and learn how to work together if they want to stop M.Bison; while the wandering Ryu is a hard man to find, M.Bison is closing in on Ryu''s eternal rival Ken in a bid to lure out his real target! Will Shadaloo succeed, or will the World Warriors beat M.Bison to the punch?

(Source: Discotek)', 'Group TAC', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-08-06', 1362, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:38', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1362-nHJkSyx5rOPr.jpg', 'Action', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 8597, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2390, 'Mojakou', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2736-GcLsXOm93Rq6.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Sorao is an ordinary student who lives an ordinary everyday life of a typical kid, accidentally makes friends with two aliens stranded here on Earth. His life changes as he decides to help them find a way to get home. When they do reach the aliens'' homeworld, Sorao along with Miki, discovered a blood feud between two different tribes. Things gone awry as the tribes'' representatives try to out do one another in search of the missing treasure of the past with the help of an uncovered clue.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-10-03', 2736, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:41', NULL, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 74, 735, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2391, 'Yu Yu Hakusho: The Movie - Poltergeist Report', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx883-UIYWXCIn0zMN.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'Millennia ago, a war was fought between the Netherworld and the Spirit World. Ultimately, the Netherworld was destroyed and Lord Yakumo, the King of the Netherworld, was banished to the depths of space. Now, five defenders from the Spirit World must team-up against Yakumo''s Demon-Gods for possesion of five, mystical sites. But Lord Yakumo is dangerously close to reclaiming the Power Sphere - the source of the Netherworld''s energy - and once it is again in his possession, our world will become the new Netherworld.', 'Studio Pierrot', '1994', 'movie', 'released', '1994-04-09', 883, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:44', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 7576, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2392, 'The Cockpit', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2500-GqIx6Oz61vap.jpg', 'series', '6.8', '1. Slipstream

About a Luftwaffe pilot who must choose between his duty to his country: to guard a bomber loaded with Germany''s final hope of victory... the world''s first atomic bomb... or his duty to the world: to let it fall in flames to enemy Spitfires and be a footnote in history. Of course, things are complicated by the plane''s other cargo... the woman he loves. 

2. Sonic Boom Squadron

Near the end of the war, Japan has implemented a new weapon -- a human-piloted rocket-propelled flying bomb. Aboard a bomber carrying one of these, young Ensign Nogami awaits his chance to die as a "cherry blossom", a suicide pilot. In a few hours, he will die. The date of his death is set: August 6, 1945.

3. Knight of the Iron Dragon

Two soldiers attempt to reach an air base in order to fulfill a promise despite the fact that it might have been rendered moot in the reality of war.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-10-22', 2500, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:48', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2500-RRPKYh9OdRji.jpg', 'Action, Drama', 'OVA', 'FALL', 3, 5360, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2393, 'Shippuu! Iron Leaguer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2758-KLF834IktdBA.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'In the future, mankind has developed a multi-sport tournament known as Iron League, using artificially intelligent robots as the players instead of humans. The competition is very popular. However, its main support comes from the Dark Organization, a group that produces cheating Iron Leaguers that use dirty and violent tactics in games as a sure ticket for fame and popularity. While the sports community has been turned into a dangerous and (figuratively) bloody contest, Silver Castle, the team with the lowest winning ratio, tries to preserve true sportsmanship by playing sports by their original rules without any cheating or violence. The team''s fate as well as the fate of the Iron League itself is changed when two Iron Leaguers - Mach Windy, Dark Prince FC''s former ace striker and Magnum Ace, a mysterious but skillful baseball-playing Leaguer - join Silver Castle, and gradually lead the team back to its forgotten glory. It''s not all fun and games, however; as the story goes on, it is revealed that the Iron League is actually a front for something far more sinister...

(Source: TV Tropes)', 'Sunrise', '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-04-06', 2758, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:52', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2758-OfYKs5LV2ClD.jpg', 'Mecha, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 862, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:52', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2394, 'Ranma ½: Big Trouble in Nekonron, China', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx418-O6mu6r1k40jt.png', 'movies', '6.8', 'It''s just another day at the Tendo Anything-Goes Martial Arts Training Hall - that is, until a strange girl named Lychee and her giant elephant Jasmine arrive to settle a score with lecherous martial arts master Happosai. Apparently, a very long time ago, Happosai gave Lychee''s great-grandmother half of a legendary scroll guaranteed to bring happiness to whoever was holding it. The women of Lychee''s family have been waiting for three generations now, and the prince STILL hasn''t come - but of course, the moment Lychee lets the scroll out of her hands, the prince finally appears. Only now it''s Ranma''s reluctant fiancee Akane Tendo that''s holding the scroll, and the long-awaited prince is only too ready to sweep his lucky bride off her feet. Now Ranma and Co. have no choice but to follow Prince Kirin''s majestic flying barge all the way to Nekonron, China, where they find themselves in a showdown with the Seven Lucky Gods of martial arts!

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'Studio DEEN', '1991', 'movie', 'released', '1991-11-02', 418, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:29:55', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 5070, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2395, 'Macross 7 Encore', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1399.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Three unbroadcasted episodes of the Macross 7 series. In "Fleet of the Strongest Women," the Macross 7 fleet encounters a rogue Meltrandi fleet led by an old rival of Millia. "On Stage" focuses on Ray''s past as a fighter pilot, how he first met Basara, and how they formed Fire Bomber. In "Which One Do You Love," when Millia falls ill, she feels her life expectancy is running short and attempts to have Mylene engaged to Basara.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Ashi Productions', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-12-18', 1399, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:31:33', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 3, 3301, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2396, 'Nurse Angel Ririka SOS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/616.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'The Evil Forces of Dark Joker are closing in on our planet after having destroyed the beautiful planet of Queen Earth. Now, 10 year old Moriya Ririka, with the help of her childhood friend Seiya and the mysterious Kanon, must transform into the Nurse Angel and find the elusive Flower of Life, the only way to defeat the evil forces. The Flower of Life, that once bloomed all over the Earth, is where no one thought it ever would be. And Ririka must make the hardest decision of her life in order to acquire it and rid the universe of evil once and for all.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Gallop', '1995', 'series', 'released', '1995-07-07', 616, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:31:36', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/616-d4UUQYV2eZkn.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 35, 2423, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2397, 'Marmalade Boy Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx520-ZtKgtAomVgeb.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'A prelude to Marmalade Boy the TV series. Yuu remembers the day when his parents decided to divorce each other and remarry with another married couple. Toubled by the news, Yuu decides to take a walk, on which he spots a girl he falls in love with at first sight. He decides to follow this unaware girl and falls more in love with her. However he discovers who the girl really is...she''s the daughter of his parents'' new lovers. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1995', 'movie', 'released', '1995-03-04', 520, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:31:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/520-uNpURpgwkx6X.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 2736, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2398, 'Muka Muka Paradise', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4086.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Uiba Shikatani, the daughter of a pet shop owner is heartbroken after some reptile eggs fail to hatch. In his attempts to cheer her up, her father brings home a large, striped egg, which he hopes will successfully hatch (unexpectedly into a green dinosaur whom they call ''Muka-Muka'', which are the only words which the baby reptile can speak). 

Muka-Muka soon becomes the talk of the town and comes into the interest of the town''s professor and his wacky inventions, including a time machine which successfully teleports the Shikatani''s among other families and their homes to pre-historic times where they encounter several other dinosaurs and enchanted beings on their adventures.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1993', 'series', 'released', '1993-09-04', 4086, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:31:43', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 814, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2399, 'Key the Metal Idol', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1457-2fMgN8MtD4mZ.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Her classmates at school called her Key, as in the "key" to a strange mystery. Key''s "grandfather" was a kindly old scientist wanting to use his skill in robotics to create peace and love in the world. But when that kindly old scientist passed away, poor Key was left behind, lacking even the ability to smile.

There still is hope, however a message left behind for Key suggests a fantastic possibility. Could it really be possible for Key to become a real, live human, if she can only win the love of 30,000 people? A dark, haunting tale of cybernetic sci-fi dreams, spiritual visions, and the turbulent world of Japanese pop music.

(Source: Discotek Media)

Note: The two last episodes have a duration of ~98 minutes', 'Studio Pierrot', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-12-16', 1457, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:31:46', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1457-MTfRddGoswwj.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 15, 12250, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2400, 'Kinnikuman: Kinnikusei Oui Soudatsu-hen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3281-UoyXtFcafEvl.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Kinnikuman has proven himself worthy to be crowned the next king of Planet Kinniku. But at the ceremony, five other Kinnikuman''s arrive, all claiming to be the true prince of Planet Kinniku. Now, a Royal Survivor Tournament is being held to decide the true successor to the throne, and with the help and support of his friends and with his recently acquired knowledge of the Ultimate Technique (The Muscle Spark), Kinnikuman fights for what is rightfully his.', 'Toei Animation', '1991', 'series', 'released', '1991-10-06', 3281, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-03 16:31:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3281-JaDjI6xonQzS.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 46, 1385, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2401, 'Iria: Zeiram The Animation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx432-zJOnlSMC93cO.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Iria is the story of a girl and the Alien being she loves to hate. The series begins with her brother, Gren, taking a job. He is a bounty hunter, and one well known for his incredible skill. Iria, being a skilled apprentice bounty hunter herself, tags along. What is the job, one might ask. It is to find out what has happened to the crew and cargo of a Space Station. Needless to say, nothing is as it seems, and the war between Iria and Zeiram begins in earnest.', 'Ashi Productions', '1994', 'series', 'released', '1994-06-23', 432, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n432-NmmzCtPk7uwh.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 6, 9402, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NyPomyrm5Fg', '2026-08-29 14:43:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2402, 'Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx82-aw5fvnBOYuNw.png', 'series', '8.0', 'The Side 6 space colony is a neutral oasis in the war between Zeon and the Earth Federation. Alfred Izuruha, a ten-year-old boy, finds relief from the tedium of schoolwork by following the war''s progress and collecting military memorabilia. When rumors that the colony is hiding a Federation mobile suit development program bring Zeon special forces to Side 6, Alfred views them as a source of additional excitement. But, as the Zeon mission becomes more urgent and both sides take increasingly desperate measures, he might be in for an unexpectedly close look at the reality of war.', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-03-25', 82, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/82-1Nw88oF9L4Pt.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 6, 22113, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qTnYWoyXXgQ', '2026-08-29 14:44:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2403, 'City Hunter 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1471-fGdrcINlEmwT.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'Ryo Saeba is a "sweeper" know as the City Hunter. He and his sidekick Kaori Makimura are hired to solve problems that the police can''t (or won''t) handle. When he''s not keeping the streets of Tokyo clean, Ryo is chasing the ladies, and Kaori chases after him with a giant anti-ecchi hammer.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-04-02', 1471, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:01', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1471-XO9WqmM0OuO5.jpg', 'Comedy, Mystery', 'TV', 'SPRING', 63, 7749, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2404, 'Maison Ikkoku', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1453-mghhMKzxEVcQ.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'Maison Ikkoku is a romantic comedy series created by Rumiko Takahashi. The story centers around the development of the relationship between Kyoko Otonashi and Yusaku Godai. Kyoko is a recent widow who moves into the apartment house Ikkoku-kan where she becomes the manager. Godai is a wanna-be student ("ronin") struggling with college entrance exams.

When they meet, it''s love at first sight&mdash;for Godai anyway. Along the way, the other tentants, the mysterious Yotsuya, the seemingly alcoholic Ichinose, and the brash Akemi, watch and occasionally take part to make their lives more interesting. To complicate matters further, the wealthy tennis coach Shun Mitaka has his eye on Kyoko, while Godai is pursued by both Nanao Kozue and Ibuki Yagami. Covering a wide range of emotions from hysterically funny to painfully sad, Maison Ikkoku&mdash;all 96 episodes&mdash;is well worth seeing.', 'Studio DEEN', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-03-26', 1453, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:04', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1453-sC5wVW5UoeHi.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 96, 25736, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2405, 'Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx85-zdvoyoXDpjSs.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'The year is Universal Century 0087. Seven years have passed since the end of the One Year War. In its zeal to stamp out any remaining opposition, the Earth Federation has organized the Titans, an elite fighting force. However, the Titans soon get out of hand, committing atrocities on par with the worst the Principality of Zeon had to offer during the war. In response, dissatisified citizens, former Zeon soldiers, and even members of the Earth Federal Forces form a resistance group known as the Anti-Earth Union Group, or AEUG. As the next war is brewing, a small AEUG group arrives at Side 7 to investigate the new Gundam Mk. II...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-03-02', 85, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/85-DcFgPYUElRVu.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 28007, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2406, 'Touch', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1065-kwtHZDN5cAOG.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'The story centers around three characters - Uesugi Kazuya, his twin older brother Tatsuya, and Asakura Minami. Kazuya is the darling of his town as he''s talented, hardworking, and the ace pitcher for his middle school baseball team. Tatsuya is a hopeless slacker who''s been living the life of giving up the spotlight to Kazuya, despite the fact that he may be more gifted than him. Minami is the beautiful childhood girlfriend and for all intents, sister from next door who treats both of them as equals. Society largely assumes Kazuya and Minami will become the perfect couple, including Tatsuya. Yet as time progresses, Tatsuya grows to realize that he''s willing to sacrifice anything for the sake of his brother, except at the expense of giving up Minami to Kazuya. And thus the story is told of Tatsuya trying to prove himself over his established younger brother, how it affects the relationship between the three, and both brothers'' attempts to make Minami''s lifelong dreams come true.', 'Group TAC', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-03-24', 1065, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:12', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1065-4tE9AuI1vAKX.jpg', 'Drama, Romance, Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 101, 12474, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2407, 'Gunbuster', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx949-LDCFxDufSwTQ.png', 'series', '7.7', 'In the very near future, a race of huge, insect like aliens is discovered traveling the galaxy. These aliens seem dedicated to the eradication of the human species as it takes its first steps away from the solar system, and they are getting closer and closer to Earth. Humanity has responded by developing spacegoing battleships and giant fighting robots. These robots are piloted by the best and brightest of Earth''s youth, picked from training schools around the world.

The story begins in the year 2023, not long after the first battles with the aliens, and centers on young Noriko Takaya. Although Noriko''s father was a famous Captain in the space fleet who was killed during one of the first battles of the war, her own talents as a pilot are questionable. Nonetheless, she has entered a training school. Through the series Noriko, joined by the beautiful and talented Kazumi Amano, will fight to overcome the trauma of war, the doubts of her peers, and her own lack of confidence. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Gainax', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-10-07', 949, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/949-SeKG5aRhF26j.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 6, 49020, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2408, 'Patlabor the Mobile Police', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx324-fAAhdp1NQIts.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'In the future, advanced robotics has created heavy robots ("labors") for use in a variety of functions: construction, fire-fighting, military, and more. However, though the robots are only machines, their operators are also only human - and humans sometimes turn to crime. Since a heavy labor unit can be a dangerous weapon, the police of the future are set to fight fire with fire, using advanced patrol labor units, "patlabors". This is the story of the Second Special Vehicles Division, a motley crew of patlabor policemen and -women doing their best to fight crime and live a normal life. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-11', 324, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/324-YXxjmSkwtpc1.jpg', 'Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 47, 14136, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G2zsLRDbRmM', '2026-08-29 14:43:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2409, 'City Hunter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1470-V0Zr2VOc8eoK.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'Ryo Saeba works the streets of Tokyo as the City Hunter. He''s a "sweeper" and with his sidekick Kaori Makimura, he keeps the city clean. People hire the City Hunter to solve their dangerous problems, which he does with a Colt Python. When Ryo''s not working on a case, he''s working on getting the ladies, and Kaori must keep him in check with her trusty 10 kg hammer.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-04-06', 1470, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1470-fURymWaaBt33.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'TV', 'SPRING', 51, 26703, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2410, 'Legend of the Galactic Heroes: My Conquest Is the Sea of Stars', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx3014-HcjYHAbi1bnd.jpg', 'movies', '7.6', 'This movie, based on an anecdote of "Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu" written by novelist Tanaka Yoshiki, preludes the 110-episodes TV series by describing the first encounter between the ambitious young man Reinhard von Museal under the imperial flag and the passive Yang Wenli who serves a corrupting democracy. Set in an imaginative future, the story describes the first encounter between Yang and Reinhard and discusses how heroes are born.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-02-06', 3014, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3014-xPKJu0ZRcYHa.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 15554, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=muVc2AnGwCA', '2026-08-29 14:55:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2411, 'Angel''s Egg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx885-UqlerD6tJKxs.png', 'series', '7.6', 'In a desolate and dark world full of shadows, lives one little girl who seems to do nothing but collect water in jars and protect a large egg she carries everywhere. A mysterious man enters her life... and they discuss the world around them. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio DEEN', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-12-15', 885, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/885-T7WYeSNHEile.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Psychological', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 67691, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j3qMwnMtnhQ', '2026-08-29 14:43:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2412, 'Mobile Suit Gundam: Char''s Counterattack', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx87-SCCIlaJZjSvz.png', 'movies', '7.6', 'U.C. 0093. 13 years have passed since the events of the original Mobile Suit Gundam series. But the foundations of peace are once again threatened by a new Neo Zeon army, led by the infamous Char Aznable! Their ultimate goal is to plunge Earth into a nuclear winter, forcing humanity to emigrate completely into space. Armed with the state-of-the-art Nu Gundam, Amuro Ray and his Federation comrades are all that stand against Neo Zeon. Torn between vengeance, duty, and love - the final battle is at hand!

(Source: Sunrise)', 'Sunrise', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-03-12', 87, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/87-YhOEoJL9FMOr.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 18243, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R9_myo8a8g0', '2026-09-03 16:32:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2413, 'Patlabor: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1095-uHF4BmIHLzbG.png', 'movies', '7.6', 'The year is 1999 and Tokyo''s Mobile Police have a new weapon in the war on crime &ndash; advanced robots called Labors are used to combat criminals who would use the new technology for illegal means. The suicide of a mysterious man on the massive Babylon Project construction site sets off a cascade of events that may signal the destruction of Tokyo.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Production I.G', '1989', 'movie', 'released', '1989-07-15', 1095, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1095-opwiGO1PYs0A.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 18833, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ZKL1eEtMUY', '2026-08-29 14:44:25', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2414, 'City Hunter 3', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1472-xs6VFKpwztMe.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'Ryou Saeba and his long-suffering partner Kaori are out to make the streets of Shinjuku safe for the weak, the poor, the down- trodden, the... Well, actually, Ryou’s just hoping for a little mokkori from a grateful client. And Kaori’s just hoping her 100-ton hammer is big enough to get Ryou’s mind off the girls and on his job. With a bevy of beautiful women and a host of dastardly villains hanging around, City Hunter’s got to be ready for any kind of action!

(Source: Discotek)', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-15', 1472, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:30:43', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1472-oBj1YX89fvNK.jpg', 'Comedy, Mystery', 'TV', 'FALL', 13, 6521, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:30:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2415, 'Shounan Bakusouzoku', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2463-ri3SqhF6RRaz.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'In Japan, the country that inspired the slogan "Born to be Mild," the blood of young men still runs hot. In the old days they''d go off into the country and hack each other up with swords, but these days, what with school, that isn''t very practical. 

So some of them do something very un-Japanese. They strap on a big bike, roar around annoying people, and pound anyone they consider dishonorable. 

Now meet Eguchi Yousuke, leader of a high-school Biker gang AND the school''s handicrafts club. Which means he divides his time between fistfights and fancy needlework. 

And if you think he''s weird, wait until you meet the rest of his gang... 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-09-10', 2463, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:47', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2463-GwWl4ZmFYbvH.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Slice of Life', 'OVA', 'FALL', 12, 4040, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2416, 'Ginga: Nagareboshi Gin', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b589-H6dhNw4ssJCK.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Born in the bitter cold of the Ouu Mountains as the son of Riki, the mightiest bear-hunting dog, is the magnificent tiger-striped puppy, Gin!

To defeat the murderous Akakabuto—who seeks to build a stronghold deep in the mountains of Ou after defeating his grandfather and father—Gin joins the Ouu Army, his youthful blood boiling with determination!! With only three months left until the final showdown with Akakabuto, his eyes are set on finding true “men” who will fight alongside his comrades to the bitter end against Akakabuto, as he races across the entire land of Japan!!

(Source: Toei Animation, translated)', 'Toei Animation', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-04-07', 589, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/589-9KYFh6K7PIxX.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'TV', 'SPRING', 21, 6359, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2417, 'Kimagure Orange Road: I Want to Return to That Day', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/n2454-7t8qOvScDNDu.png', 'movies', '7.4', 'After the TV-series of Kimagure Orange Road, Kyosuke and Madoka have finally arrived at the point where they are close to graduation and have to decide where they want to go to college. Naturally, they want to go together, so beside all the studying they also have to look for a proper college where they can enter both.


Hikaru, still a year from graduating, wants to support Kyosuke as well and does that in her own way. But while she does that, Madoka feels jealous and tells her feelings to Kyosuke.

And then Kyosuke has to take action to finally decide on the girl he loves... thus concluding the story of the Kimagure Orange Road.


(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-10-01', 2454, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2454-4MrHX3flO51s.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 3582, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2418, 'The Transformers: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2265-uGaMUjSpJVWa.png', 'movies', '7.4', 'It is the year 2005. Twenty-one years after the heroic Autobots and the evil Decepticons resumed their neverending war on planet Earth, the Decepticons have conquered the robots'' home planet Cybertron. After a surprise attack by the Decepticons, both factions wage a gruesome battle at Autobot City. In the midst of the battle, Autobot leader Optimus Prime dies during his fight with Decepticon leader Megatron. The Autobot Matrix of Leadership is then passed on to second-in-command Ultra Magnus. Meanwhile, a badly-damaged Megatron is jettisoned by Starscream into deep space, where he encounters the planet-eating robot Unicron and is reborn as Galvatron, the new Decepticon leader. With Galvatron''s reign on the rise and Unicron''s imminent arrival within Cybertron''s orbit, the Autobots must act quickly and protect the Matrix or face total annihilation. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-08-08', 2265, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:32:57', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2265-R4Yra1Qmmlgw.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 3500, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2419, 'A Little Princess Sara', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2547-q6wOsnE2Eu5E.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Sara, a pretty girl born into a rich British family in India, is treated like a little princess at a dormitory school in London. Sara’s sweet school life turns to tragedy when she learns of her father’s death and the family’s bankruptcy. However, Sara endures her hard luck with kindness and imagination and escapes from her misery through fantasies. 

(Source: Nippon Animation) 

Based on the novel "A Little Princess" by Frances Hodgson Burnett.', 'Nippon Animation', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-01-06', 2547, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:29:12', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2547-wyFxZUpWJf3J.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 46, 6511, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:29:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2420, 'Aim for the Ace!: Another Match', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx314-ZDzJz1ZrobY7.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Three years has passed since the events of the first series. Hiromi continued training with her coach and became Japan''s junior champion. Their common profits have also contributed to the coach being chosen as the first trainer of the Japanese Selection of Tennis and is arranged to head a trip with the youngest members of the team to USA. The relation between Hiromi and its trainer is narrower at personal level but it exceeds the teacher-student bond with great difficulty.', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-07-25', 314, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:00', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/314-tsxCDczPLfxo.jpg', 'Drama, Sports', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 13, 2094, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2421, 'Saint Seiya: Knights of the Zodiac', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1254.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Ages ago, the goddess Athena was served by fighters called Saints who channeled the power of the Cosmos within them. Now a youth named Seiya has trained to become a Saint himself by earning the mystical Cloth of Pegasus. He is joined by other Saints with Cloths of their own to fight for Athena. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-10-11', 1254, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:03', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1254-8sEdD7gwYipm.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 114, 38650, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2422, 'Gosenzo-sama Banbanzai!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4639-MMpC9cBIdfg4.png', 'series', '7.3', 'The Yomota family is small and typical: father Kinekuni (42), mother Tamiko (38), and son Inumaru (17). One day, a beautiful girl appears at their front door, calling herself "Maroko Yomota," granddaughter of Inumaru who travels back in time with a time machine to visit her ancestors. Even with Tamiko''s strong objection, Kinekuni and Inumaru welcome her to stay with them, and the structure of a happy family has begun to collapse.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-08-05', 4639, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:07', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4639-Fs0dcwfwZBBJ.jpg', 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 6, 6086, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2423, 'Area 88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1488.jpg', 'series', '7.2', 'In a cruel twist of fate, talented young pilot Shin Kazama is tricked into serving as a mercenary for Area 88. A hell on Earth where men survive by gunning down anyone who stands in their way. To return home, Shin must sell his soul to the battlefield and pave the road back to Japan with the corpses of his fallen opponents.

(Source: Discotek)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-02-05', 1488, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1488-Bz8ogaW5FPHs.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 3, 7606, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:10', '2026-09-03 16:33:19');
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2424, 'Royal Space Force: The Wings of Honnêamise', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1034-MaTXyGHuFvbu.png', 'movies', '7.2', '"I will not give up. I will realize my dream...even if it means death!"

When cadet Shiro Lhadatt signs up with the Royal Space Force, he encounters ridicule and apathy from manipulative leaders and a cynical public. But a chance encounter with a devout young woman spurs Shiro on towards his destiny: to become the first man in space! While military leaders conspire to use the space program to spark an all-out war, Shiro and a team of aging scientists race against time to complete the first launch.

(Source: Bandai Visual)', 'Gainax', '1987', 'movie', 'released', '1987-03-14', 1034, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1034-YlFs9a9ENOPR.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 15843, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1qI04RX5jMU', '2026-08-29 14:44:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2425, 'Night on the Galactic Railroad', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1441-NOIDPZ2svpoS.jpg', 'movies', '7.2', 'What is true happiness? For Giovanni, the answer is as far away as the stars. Mired in hardship, the young kitten faces problems that should be unknown to someone his age. At school, his classmates mock and ridicule him, and after the bell rings, Giovanni toils at a job to earn enough money for bread. Then at home, instead of being taken care of by his mother, he must take care of her. The sole bright spot is that of the Festival of Stars, where he hopes to run into Campanella, his only friend. When they finally meet up, however, it isn''t while looking up at the stars, but rather traveling amongst them... as the Galactic Railroad whisks the two away for parts unknown!

(Source: Discotek)', 'Group TAC', '1985', 'movie', 'released', '1985-07-13', 1441, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:17', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1441-9SX2Pe0i02uK.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 13591, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2426, 'Mobile Police Patlabor', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/1288-5XFOZjW78BbM.png', 'series', '7.2', 'In the future, rapidly advancing technology gives birth to giant robots known as "Labors," so named for their usefulness in heavy industry. However, this also gives rise to "Labor crimes," resulting the need for a new branch of law enforcement equipped with and dedicated to the policing of Labors. When Izumi Noa, a female police officer, becomes the newest recruit of Special Vehicles Division 2, she and her top of the line "Patrol Labor" (or "Patlabor") Alphonse are swept into a series of adventures featuring crazed construction workers, eco-terrorists, and sea monsters. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio DEEN', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-04-25', 1288, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1288-OTcHhYJFCbE9.jpg', 'Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 7, 20528, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HHolkn-PKn4', '2026-08-29 14:44:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2427, 'Urusei Yatsura Movie 5: The Final Chapter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1924-ManowHsbyauK.png', 'movies', '7.2', 'The Urusei Yatsura story comes to a climax in this animated retelling of the final Manga story (although not the final movie). Lupa, yet another one of Lum''s fiancés, arrives on the scene, and Lum and Ataru have to repeat their game of tag in order to prevent the Earth from being destroyed.


All Ataru has to do to win is say "I love you" the three words he has steadfastly refused to say to Lum. Will he admit his true feelings and save the Earth? Or will his pride doom it to destruction?


(Source: AniDB)', 'Magic Bus', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-02-06', 1924, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1924-aBkt45SCiODJ.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 3635, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2428, 'Kimagure Orange☆Road', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1087-zqIJ1FZjwilM.png', 'series', '7.1', 'It can be hard moving to a new school, and fifteen-year-old Kyosuke has it harder than most. He’s fallen head over heels for his classmate Madoka, a girl who won’t even give him the time of day, and unintentionally ended up dating her best friend, Hikaru, instead. Worst of all, Kyosuke and his family have amazing supernatural powers, but he has to keep them hidden from the rest of the world! How is Kyosuke ever going to balance the affections (or lack thereof) of two girls, schoolwork, and his secret abilities all at the same time?

(Source: Discotek Media)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-04-06', 1087, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:28', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1087-ibInHaGwOFPg.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 48, 16745, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2429, 'Tales of Little Women', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2548-hTF8lyM7Tqq3.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Meg, faithful and gentle, Jo, independent and energetic, Beth, quiet and shy, Amy, amiable and precocious&ndash;the four sisters live vigorously and happily at home with their gentle mother while waiting for their father to return from the Civil War. Helping each other, they challenge their fates and grow up to become wonderful women.', 'Nippon Animation', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-01-11', 2548, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2548-RXvb3cqfo2r3.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 3112, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2430, 'YAWARA! a fashionable judo girl!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx691-lRvyZe0jETOt.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Yawara! is a sports anime laced with comedic and romance elements. It starts off with Yawara Inokuma, a high school girl who is most interested in doing the things that your average Japanese high school girl does. However, she has been trained in Judo for years by her grandfather, Jigorou (A former Japan Judo Champion), who has much grander plans in store for her as a Judo superstar. He manipulates matters so that Yawara ends up having to perform in matches and tournaments. His final plan is for Yawara to "Win the Gold Medal in the Olympics and be awarded the Nation Medal of Honor".

(Source: AniDB)', 'MADHOUSE', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-16', 691, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:36', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/691-N7dkx7Pnpql0.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 124, 8303, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2431, 'Devilman: The Birth', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2354-f19GQZMwf235.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Akira is just another normal kid in modern-day Tokyo, until an old friend of his, Ryo, shows up and turns his world upside down. Akira learns that there is an upcoming war of demons on humanity and he has just been enlisted for a major tour of duty. But the only way to fight a demon is with their power, so Akira and Ryo risk a dangerous ceremony in an attempt to create humanity''s only hope: the powerful Devilman.', 'Oh! Production', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-11-01', 2354, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:33:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2354-w5z5t2EsDt8I.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 12695, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2432, 'Kikou Ryouhei Merowlink', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2048.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Years after the Great War in Armored Trooper Votoms, Merowlink has decided to hunt down the general that tried to kill him and his squadron and take vengeance for his departed comrades. Merowlink has the unique talent of being an Armor Hunter — that is, without using mecha, he manages to take down enemy mecha by himself, with the aid of a giant mecha-killing gun and his trusty combat knife.', 'Sunrise', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-11-21', 2048, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:35:37', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2048-6CV2XwJNcIu1.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 12, 5483, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2433, 'Urusei Yatsura - OVA Series', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1919-i8bCgrlfEEll.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The adventures of Lum, Ataru, Ten, and all the gang from Tomobiki continue in an assortment of new &ndash; but no less weird &ndash; stories. 

Watch as Lum, Ataru, and Shinobu encounter a rabbit-clad youth, enter the Room of Destiny, and get a glimpse into their futures in "Inaba the Dreammaker," or see Ran''s plans to use a sherbet cone-producing bird to open a sherbet shop one hot Tokyo summer go terribly awry in &ldquo;Raging Sherbet.&rdquo; Ataru has yet another bad experience with Lum''s cooking in "I Howl at the Moon".

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-09-24', 1919, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:35:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1919-zJnzuWMASEAv.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 11, 3258, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2434, 'Barefoot Gen 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1825-xpZcbEtcTTaa.png', 'movies', '7.1', 'Three years have passed since the bombing of Hiroshima and Gen is now a fourth-grader. Hiroshima is still a ruin, and Gen must scrounge for scrap metal to help keep himself and his remaining family fed, but at least commerce has returned to the land. As his mother gradually grows ill from radiation sickness, Gen and Ryuta befriend a group of orphans led by a tough-nosed older child and including a girl who still bears ugly burn scars from the day of the bomb. An old man suffering from depression is also drawn into the group as they come together to support each other and form a makeshift family. Reality is still harsh, however, as many orphans still die lonely deaths and the grim reminders of what happened linger everywhere.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-06-14', 1825, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:35:43', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1825-jmgdWdhcZ6PX.jpg', 'Drama', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4644, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2435, 'Kimagure Orange☆Road OVA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2458-5cbeZogZ2fVB.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Kimagure Orange Road OVA is basically the extension from the TV series. The time frame is probably in the middle of the TV series.

Order to view with the TV series.

White Lovers - among the episodes 35 and 45

Hawai Suspence - among the episodes 17 and 25

I was a cat, I was a fish - among the episodes 17 and 30

Hurricane Akane, the shape-shifting girl - among the episodes 20 and 25

Spring is for Idols - among the episodes 23 and 30

Birth of a Star - Right after "Spring is for Idols"

Unexpected Situation - after the OAV of Akane

Message in Rouge - after the episode 48', 'Studio Pierrot', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-03-01', 2458, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:35:46', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2458-8jh23oy5NC3G.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 8, 2820, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2436, 'Sakigake!! Otokojuku', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2903-w6JQtYpB5p0l.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Otokojuku - a private school for juvenile delinquents that were previously expelled from normal schools. At this school, Japanese chivalry is taught through feudal and military fundamentals. Similar to an action film, the classes are overwhelmed by violence. Only those who survive it become true men. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-02-25', 2903, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:35:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2903-6dmXkhRRfhY7.jpg', 'Action, Comedy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 34, 4513, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2437, 'Armored Trooper Votoms: The Last Red Shoulder', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2583.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Released in 1985, this OVA tells a critical part of the story between the TV show''s Uoodo and Kummen arcs. Although the TV series covered the Red Shoulders in some detail, we didn''t get to see much of Chirico''s time there or the people involved, and we get both of those here.

(Source: mahq.net)', 'Sunrise', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-08-21', 2583, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:06', '2026-09-03 16:34:28', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 1894, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2438, 'City Hunter: .357 Magnum', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1474-Sasa1WNPnkwi.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'A beautiful pianist comes to Tokyo for a charity concert, and City Hunter is there. But music isn`t his forte; he wants lessons in the language of love. Desperation becomes the word of the day as the bodies start dropping. A foreign dignitary is assassinated in cold blood. Secret agents scour the streets for a missing microchip. Diplomatic infighting swirls around the upcoming concert, and City Hunter is the only hope! 

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'movie', 'released', '1989-06-17', 1474, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:35:56', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1474-bIjdcv6aqKDo.jpg', 'Action, Comedy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2840, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2439, 'Bubblegum Crisis', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1347-4NzCZYQQwIjb.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'In the near future, Tokyo was left flattened as a result from a great earthquake. A new city, MegaTokyo, was then recreated due in no small part from the aid of a multi-million dollar company, Genom Corp. Genom created and mass-produced biomechanical creatures called Boomers to aid in the restoration of MegaTokyo. When the Boomers began to run out of control, the ADPolice at first tried to stop them, but they proved to be far more difficult to deal with than was first imagined. Under the ever looming Boomer threat, a group of four girls from varying degrees of society banded together. Calling themselves The Knight Sabers, they were the only ones with enough firepower and resourcefulness to defend the fledgling MegaTokyo from Genom and it''s berserk Boomers.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-02-25', 1347, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:35:59', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1347-vgFUa6HCzYu8.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 8, 20344, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2440, 'Ace wo Nerae: Final Stage', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx312-dMZG3uDq8wWl.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Hiromi continues developing her tennis and shows the results while undergoing an emotional change into an adult.', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-25', 312, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:02', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/312-5N1UIvHk5WFS.jpg', 'Action, Sports', 'OVA', 'FALL', 12, 1594, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2441, 'Robot Carnival', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2182-jq5JLynVUl6X.jpg', 'series', '7.0', '9 of Japan''s leading animators were asked to create a short segment that followed the theme of "Robots," for their inclusion in this film. Essentially, this "movie" is 9 short films, all independent of one another. The common element is human interaction with robots, namely the consequences of creating life with one''s own hands, played in nine very different ways.

(Source: Anime News Network)

1. Opening (dir. by Atsuko Fukushima and Katsuhiro Otomo)

2. Franken''s Gears (dir. by Koji Morimoto)

3. Deprive (dir. by Hidetoshi Omori)

4. Presence (dir. by Yasuomi Umetsu)

5. Star Light Angel (dir. by Hiroyuki Kitazume)

6. Cloud (dir. by Mao Lamdo)

7. A Tale of Two Robots (dir. by Hiroyuki Kitakubo)

8. Nightmare (dir. by Takashi Nakamura)

9. Ending (dir. by Atsuko Fukushima and Katsuhiro Otomo)', 'APPP', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-07-21', 2182, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:05', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2182-jaXWCFdBEi1V.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 9, 11172, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2442, 'Dirty Pair (OVA)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx4200-9x7l994VJk2N.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Set in the future Kei and Yuri are Trouble Consultants for The 3WA. Code Named "Lovely Angels", but, they are known throughout the galaxy as The Dirty Pair. They always solve their case, but, not without causing collateral damage and mayhem.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-12-21', 4200, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4200-8AVzxiWXzKxE.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 10, 3384, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2443, 'Shin Captain Tsubasa', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2117.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Shin CT takes place at the U-16 world cup in France. After some friendly matches in Germany, Japan defeats one opponent after another and finally reaches the final round against Germany. After hard matches against Italian and French top players, the German team seems to be even more supreme. The giant goal keeper Moeller, the all round ace Kalz and Europe''s best player and forward Schneider offer the Japanese team an extremely hard match, but in the end Japan wins 3:2.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'J.C.STAFF', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-07-01', 2117, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2117-9lrOT2l6OvW7.jpg', 'Action, Sports', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 13, 3958, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2444, 'High School! Kimengumi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b714-J770J3curufA.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'A group of 5 male high school students that call themselves the funny-face group cause trouble at school with their crazy antics. 


(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Comet', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-10-20', 714, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:14', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/714-sGTnNvhT8wmf.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 86, 1869, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2445, 'Penguin''s Memory: Shiawase Monogatari', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx16434-TB6BGLuXkCnJ.jpg', 'movies', '6.9', 'Mike is a penguin soldier who returns home after being injured during combat. Estranged from his family and friends, he leaves his hometown and starts to roam adrift through the country.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Animation Staff Room', '1985', 'movie', 'released', '1985-06-22', 16434, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:17', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16434-FOD5xtw2gn9d.jpg', 'Drama, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2796, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2446, 'Riding Bean', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx917-oN745Odnh2sb.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Bean Bandit and his partner Rally Vincent are couriers for hire - transporting clients and delivering goods in his custom sports car "Roadbuster" for a hefty price. But when they are hired to escort a kidnapped girl named Chelsea to her home, they don''t realize they''re being framed for kidnapping as their former clients Semmerling and Carrie plan their escape with Chelsea''s father and the ransom money.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'AIC', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-02-22', 917, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/917-VzGutTqTfZrW.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 10335, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IyoUhF039nM', '2026-08-29 14:44:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2447, 'Manie Manie: Neo Tokyo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1951-88OR0FQqiYiL.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', '1) Labyrinth Labyrinthos

A girl and her cat fall through a looking-glass into a dark labyrinth full of strange people.

2) Running Man

In the distant future, a tough racer uses his psychokinetic powers against his opponents during his final race. 

3) The Order to Stop Construction

A snooty salaryman is sent by his bosses to the jungle to stop a completely automated construction job, and spends several days there arguing with the robots.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1987', 'movie', 'released', '1987-09-25', 1951, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1951-YwXlkI4rKCjI.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 3, 14143, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2448, 'Hello! Lady Lynn', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2405.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'This is the second series of Lady Lady. Every year at Lynn''s school, an honorable &ldquo;Lady Quest&rdquo; is given to the most sophisticated lady. Lynn strives to receive this honor.

(Source: Toei Animation)', NULL, '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-05-12', 2405, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:32:42', NULL, 'Drama', 'TV', 'SPRING', 36, 1114, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2449, 'Blue Comet SPT Layzner', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx5755-OkEeBIBFm0zd.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'The Layzner OVA serves as an alternative version of the TV series. 

The first episode, titled "Eiji 1996", recaps the first part of the series (episodes 01-24). 

The second episode ("Le Caine 1999") takes place after a time skip, and contains episodes 26 through 37 (episode 25 of the TV series, being a recap itself, is skipped here). 

The final episode, "Seal 2000", is an expanded version of the final episode of the TV series (38) and features new animation and a longer epilogue.', NULL, '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-08-21', 5755, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:27', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 3, 1239, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2450, 'Lady Lady!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2227-oKShcZwjNDs5.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Lynn lost her mother at the age of five and lives in with her father in England. Lynn''s father is not able to be by her side all the time because of his busy schedule and Lynn is often left on her own. Despite having to endure the harsh loneliness, Lynn strives to protect her promise with her mother to become a strong and elegant lady.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-10-21', 2227, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:31', NULL, 'Drama', 'TV', 'FALL', 21, 2009, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2451, 'Armored Trooper Votoms: Origin of Ambition', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2585.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'After armored trooper pilot Chirico Cuvie  is given orders to transfer to Planet Odon, he and all of the other new recruits are sent into a simulated battle to test their abilities. However, this ''simulated battle'' turns out to be a serious fight to eliminate those without the necessary skills. Chirico survives along with just three others, despite the fact that he fought while injured. It soon becomes apparent that this is not the first time he has survived against incredible odds, a fact that Colonel Peruzen wishes to exploit. But is Chirico truly immortal? 

(Source: Anime-Planet)', 'Sunrise', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-03-19', 2585, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2585-lTCdVXXrSq1R.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 2031, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2452, 'Grimm''s Fairy Tale Classics', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4061.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Every episode is a stand-alone retelling of a different fairy or folk tale.  Not all of them are based on the fairy tales collected by the Brothers Grimm.', 'Nippon Animation', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-10-02', 4061, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:38', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 23, 961, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2453, 'Bosco Adventure', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3460-sQL4ZaaikRY8.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Apricot, princess of Fountain land, is kidnapped by evil Hoodman and his mercenaries Jack and Franz to keep her away from returning to her home until the total eclipse of the Sun. Humanoid animals from Bosco forest, Frog, Tutty and Otter, help her out and agree to take her to her homeland, before it''s too late. On they way over, they become plunged into many adventures where they show their willingness to help the others in need and importance of water—all-life enhancer.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-10-06', 3460, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:41', NULL, 'Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 932, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2454, 'Saint Seiya: Legend of Crimson Youth', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1255-Jhh95SAoZqQq.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'The former Sun God Abel returns to life, bent on punishing the humans and cleansing the Earth from their presence. When Athena joins him, leaving humans to their fate, the Bronze Saints must defend the Earth in their greatest battle yet. 

(Source: IMDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-07-23', 1255, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:44', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1255-62weecY1jtSa.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4146, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2455, 'They Were 11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1901.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'In the distant future, ten space cadets embark on a survival test that sets them adrift in a derelict spacecraft from which they must find their way home. Terror strikes when the cadets discover eleven of themselves aboard the ship. Who is the imposter, and what is his (or her) purpose? Paranoia runs rampant and lives hang in the balance as the cadets scrutinize one another for any wrong move. Can they identify the spy before it’s too late?

(Source: Central Park Media)', 'Magic Bus', '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-11-01', 1901, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:48', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1901-lqaRwZbgVavc.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 5118, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2456, 'Miracle Giants Dome-kun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5273.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Dome Shinjo, a 10-year-old boy who is son of a deceased legendary player of the Yomiuri Giants. From his father he inherited the love for baseball and his great abilities for such sport, although his mother and his older sister try to avoid that he practices it. In fact, his father, before dying, had time to teach him a magical shoot. Dome, after his mother gave him the glove his father used, he makes that shot in a training session of the Giants and is contracted immediately. With the support of the veteran players of the team, this young player will, from this very moment, make the Giants become unbeatable at home and none of the main batters of the Japanese professional league manages to end with his magical shot. Although that does not apply to the games played away, as Dome is just allowed to play at home, in the Tokyo Dome in which his father was consacrated (and the place by which he did chose such name for his son). When the veteran captain of the Dragons manages to bat his shot, it seems that the young boy is finally and definitely defeated, but then he invents another magical shot. New rivals, but also friends (such as Melody Norman, an American girl who disguises herself as a boy because women can''t play baseball), will appear in scene, until the arrival of the mysterious Don Carlos, a Spanish ex-bullfighter who plays for the Hiroshima Toyo Carp and seems to have something pending with his father. Will Dome succeed in giving the league to the Giants? 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio Gallop', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-04-02', 5273, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:51', NULL, 'Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 49, 548, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2457, 'Once Upon a Time... Life', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3624-UA6xrVgqsoPo.png', 'series', '6.7', 'The series "Once Upon a Time... Life" teaches about the human body and about the different systems in it with the same characters from the other "Once Upon a Time" seasons. "The good Characters" represent the body''s defense mechanisms, whereas "the bad Characters" represent the viruses and bacteria that threaten to attack the human body.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Procidis', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-09-13', 3624, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3624-AbOpmnom7Tbd.jpg', 'Adventure, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'TV', NULL, 26, 1917, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2458, 'Seton Animal Chronicles', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/7845.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Documentary in which the achievement of Ernest "Black Wolf" Thompson is settled in different Episodes. Every single episode is a documentary in which one sort of Animal is described.', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-14', 7845, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:36:57', NULL, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 45, 392, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2459, 'Maison Ikkoku: Final Chapter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2460.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'Taking place after the tv-series, this movie tells the story of what happened with Godai, Kyoko and the tenants after the TV series ended (don''t take the last episode in account, since that is a summary of what will come).', 'Ajiado', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-02-06', 2460, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:37:01', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2460-VxxCPZ6SmcqT.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 2897, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:37:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2460, 'The Guyver: Bio-Booster Armor', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6016-mfW3gMYKp8xg.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Shou and his friend, Tetsurou, stumble upon a strange orb-like mechanism, the Guyver Unit, in the woods. It physically bonds with Shou and turns him into the alien soldier, Guyver. His mission is to protect the Guyver Unit from the Japanese corporation known as Chronos. They are after it and two other units just like it. To retrieve the object, they send out vicious monsters known as Zoanoids. So no one is safe in Shou''s life; not even himself.', 'Animate Film', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-09-25', 6016, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:37:04', NULL, 'Action, Horror, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 6, 4225, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:37:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2461, 'Urusei Yatsura Movie 3: Remember My Love', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1922-GFf90uJYHSUr.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'It seems that when Lum was born, a postal screwup resulted in a witchy friend of the family not getting an invitation to the celebration. The witch put a curse on Lum, that she would never be happy with her True Love. 

In the present, a new Amusement Park has been built in Tomobiki, and opening day finds the whole gang sampling its pleasures. At a magic show, however, Ataru gets turned into a large pink hippo-potamus, FOR REAL! 

When Lum attempts to track down the magician that transformed her Darling, things start to get very weird, very fast! 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio DEEN', '1985', 'movie', 'released', '1985-01-26', 1922, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1922-ou3dESwi2jWW.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 3655, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2462, 'Idol Densetsu Eriko', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2938-q1dJScuPYdYC.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Eriko Tamura is Kousuke Tamura, the chairman of Tamura Productions (reknown music company) and Minako Tamura''s (former famous idol singer) only daughter. Having talent for singing since birth, she has always loved her parent''s media world. Then one day tragedy strikes when her parents get into a horrible car accident, which kills her father and leaves her mother in coma. She is left in her father''s best friend, Mr. Uchida''s care. Now Eriko must take the path of singing, a path her parents did not want her to pursue. Then her uncle is out to destroy her career. But in spite of all the hardship, she becomes an idol and wins hearts all over Japan.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Ashi Productions', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-04-03', 2938, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2938-3Kn5FYuhWmGr.jpg', 'Music', 'TV', 'SPRING', 51, 2545, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2463, 'Mister Ajikko', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3437-wBfBvioNuQ7D.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Ajiyoshi Yoichi is a culinary prodigy who manages the eating house together with his mother. One day, Murata Genjiro appears in the eating house and is surprised at the delicious taste and delicate culinary skills of the katsu-don prepared by Youichi. Subsequently, Youichi is being invited to the Aji-oh Building in which he is involved in a spaghetti match with the in-house Italian chef, Marui. Youichi''s novel culinary ideas, coupled with his enthusiasm of serving the best for his guests, allow him to defeat Marui in the match. From then on, Youichi begins to compete with other rivals in the race for the best tastes and dishes. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-10-08', 3437, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3437-lbFt6eOP9bS4.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama', 'TV', 'FALL', 99, 1644, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2464, 'Alpen Rose', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3807-uRtS1pueVvmG.png', 'series', '6.7', 'While Randy was walking through the Swiss countryside he finds a small girl, who seemed to be the only survived person from an airplane crash. The little girl didn&rsquo;t remember anything, and Randy decided to take care of her and he called her Judy. The both go their childhood together. A few years later, Judy, now 16 years old, wants to find her past. With the help of Randy, she leaves to research her origins. Her single clue is a song that she keeps hearing in her head, the song is called Alpine Rose. At a time of world war, these two young people will have to overcome many obstacles to arrive at their goal in this time of war, with having only each other to comfort and support. the depth of their love.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-04-08', 3807, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:27', NULL, 'Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 20, 1930, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2465, 'Magical Emi, the Magic Star', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2038-8pQpYgitKQyB.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Kozuki Mai is an elementary student who wants to be a magician and perform in her family''s "Magicarat" magical act. However, she is too young, and her magic skills are not very good. Then one day, she encounters a ball of light that was put into a stuffed doll of flying squirrel, bringing it to life and somehow giving her the power to turn in to the 18 year-old magician "Magical Emi." As Emi, Mai was able to join the magic act. But she must keep her identity a secret from her family and from her crush.', 'Studio Pierrot', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-06-07', 2038, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:35:53', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2038-fFel8KYMktSM.jpg', 'Comedy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 38, 2533, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2466, 'Kiteretsu Encyclopedia', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6509-a14QqkXpymOc.png', 'series', '6.7', 'The main character is a scientific genius boy named Kiteretsu, who has built a companion robot named Korosuke. He frequently travels in time with his friends and Korosuke in the time machine he built. Miyoko is a girl in his neighborhood who is basically his girlfriend. Tongari is his rival, who happen to share some similar traits of Honekawa Suneo. Buta Gorilla (Kumada Kaoru) is a typical neighborhood bully, who also share similar traits of Gian (Takeshi Goda) except that he often antagonizes Korosuke (though they are in grade school).

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio Gallop', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-03-27', 6509, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:30', NULL, 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 331, 2442, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2467, 'Project A-ko', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx212-SSB2S3cbIumn.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'On a splendid morning, an effervescently cheerful teenaged schoolgirl named A-ko sets off for school with her delightfully ditzy friend, C-ko. The duo are students in a marvelous futuristic city, but A-ko is about to run afoul of the wealthy and powerful B-ko, a young lady used to getting everything she wants—and what she wants is C-ko! Also, a vast and powerful alien fleet is about to touch down in Graviton City, and they''re after something, too. Fortunately for us, A-ko’s no ordinary schoolgirl—she’s got super powers of her own!

(Source: Discotek)', 'APPP', '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-06-21', 212, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/212-Zfa1QJcRdJZ8.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 9082, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2468, 'Venus Wars', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/544-Hp5n7x9QgllH.png', 'movies', '6.7', 'When an ice comet slammed into the planet Venus, terraforming its toxic atmosphere into one capable of sustaining human life, mankind’s dream of colonizing other worlds became a reality. Unfortunately for the colonists, Venus isn’t the paradise they’d dreamed of. As crops fail and competition for resources intensifies, hostilities grow until the two inhabited continents stand on the brink of war.

Reporter Susan Sommers arrives in the capital of Aphrodia just as Ishtar attacks and only the intervention of Hiro Seno and his Battle Bike team saves her from certain death… but now Aphrodia is under Ishtar’s control and Sue, Hiro, and his teammates find themselves on the run! However, their unique skill at Battle Bike, which combines motorcycle racing with roller derby, may just prove to be the secret weapon Aphrodia needs to win the Venus Wars.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Kugatsusha', '1989', 'movie', 'released', '1989-03-11', 544, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/544-8SzH1bqnT3Jz.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 6548, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HL1LuxOWQNk', '2026-08-29 14:44:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2469, 'Urusei Yatsura Movie 4: Lum The Forever', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1923-F2EGuJX0bBJg.png', 'movies', '6.7', 'Strange things begin happening in Tomobiki Town... 


When a great cherry tree, "Tarozakura" is cut down while Lum & Co. are making a movie, Lum loses her horns-and her powers! Thus begins the strangest and most lyrical of the Urusei Yatsura movies...


(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio DEEN', '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-02-22', 1923, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1923-C2fFGpXYQF3m.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 3562, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2470, 'Sunny Ryoko', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx729-PPuU5qAjDF9F.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Kishimoto Kasumi, a 15-year-old girl, was supposed to live at her auntie''s house in order to go to high school since April. However, when she moved to the house she was surprised with the fact that there were already four new male students living in the same house. To make the matter worse, that day while she was taking a bath, Takasugi Yusaku, one of those boys, came into the bath and saw her naked. This is how Kasumi''s troublesome high school days started. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Group TAC', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-03-29', 729, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:43', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/729-nk1dY6IZxpqa.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 48, 2376, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2471, 'The Jungle Book', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2569.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'After his parents died, Mowgli is raised by the Wolf Pack of the Seeonee Forest led by Akela and other wild animals such as Bagheera and Baloo. The young boy goes through several heartwarming, bittersweet, and life-threatening adventures as he seeks after his true purpose in life. And one of many dangers he has to face is the man-eating tiger, Shere Khan...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-09', 2569, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:47', NULL, 'Adventure, Drama', 'TV', 'FALL', 52, 1915, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2472, 'Captain Tsubasa: Europe Daikessen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2118.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'The first Captain Tsubasa movie is about a match between an "All Europe Boy Soccer Team" and an "All Japan Boy Soccer Team" and takes place at the end of the first TV series. When the Japanese team arrives in Europe they meet incredible players with skills and strength they never had to face before. Shortly after the beginning of the match the Tachibana brothers shoot a goal with their "acrobatic soccer", but the Europeans have a supreme organisation and their legendary captain Karl-Heinz Schneider from Germany seems to be undefeatable. For Wakashimazu is totally overcharged with Schneider, the injured goalkeeper genius Wakabayashi takes his place and manages to stop Schneider''s "fire shots". After that Japan finally manages to win the match 3:2.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1985', 'movie', 'released', '1985-07-13', 2118, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:08', '2026-09-03 16:39:50', NULL, 'Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1847, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2473, 'Dancouga: Super Beast Machine God', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2255.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Deep in outer space, the emperor Muge plots his next conquest - an out-of-the-way planet known as Earth. Mustering all the forces of his own personal Empire of Death, the Emperor is by far the most formidable foe humans have ever faced. And now he''s even more fearsome thanks to the defection of Shapiro Keats, a power-hungry Earthling reborn as an Empire informer.

Army after army crumbles in the face of an onslaught of the Empire''s seemingly indestructible robots. But now there''s a team that just might be able to stop them: an ace pilot named Shinobu, Sara (Shapiro''s one-time girlfriend), and Ryo, a very unlikely young hero. Together, they''re in command of a new weapon developed in a laboratory hidden deep in a lake in Japan. Enter Dancouga, the Super Beast Machine God - and the battle''s just beginning!

(Source: Discotek Media)', 'Ashi Productions', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-04-05', 2255, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:09', '2026-09-03 16:39:54', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 38, 2793, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2474, 'Megazone 23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1935-rEaYG766b8tp.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Motorcycle enthusiast Shogo mistakenly comes into possession of a government prototype bike. Pursued by ruthless goverment agents he plans to save himself by exposing the bike to the public on a live TV show hosted by a popular singing star. But, even the lovely Eve has secrets of her own and the government has much more to hide than just a transforming military motorcycle. As Shogo begins to unravel the mystery of the bike, he discovers a reality-shattering secret about the city and the world he thought he knew.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Artmic', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-03-09', 1935, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:09', '2026-09-03 16:39:57', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1935-ddvQgQjOTTeJ.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Mystery, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 10240, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2475, 'Ronin Warriors', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1264-sIhmsUTxzL3h.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Thousands of years ago, the evil emperor Talpa attempted to conquer the Earth. Defeated, he was banished to the Nether Realm and his armor was divided into 9 separate suits. Now, he has returned to conquer Earth, having reclaimed 4 of the suits. The other 5 are in the possesion of those who are the only hope of stopping him: The Ronin Warriors. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-04-30', 1264, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:09', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1264-FvbMnm5yfwbp.jpg', 'Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 4690, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5QVLNPBeFEg', '2026-08-29 14:44:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2476, 'Metal Armor Dragonar', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx865-izgThpRMbYaK.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'A.D. 2087 - the United Lunar Empire Giganos wages war on the Earth Federation Military to take control of the planet and establish a "rebirth" of the human race. During an invasion of a colony by Giganos'' forces, three civilian men stumble upon a trio of top-secret Metal Armor units called "Dragonars" and pilot them to combat the enemy forces.', 'Sunrise', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-02-07', 865, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:09', '2026-09-03 16:40:04', NULL, 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 2850, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2477, 'Mado King Granzort', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2818-qeiEiTIzzCjE.png', 'series', '6.6', 'In the future, the moon is a habitable place with atmosphere and gravity and also a famous tourist attraction. There are also stories about a "long ears" creature like rabbits on the moon who can use magic. Haruka Daichi heads off to the moon during a summer holiday alone because he likes to see the long ears creature by himself.

However, he get himself dragged into an acient conflict between two acient moon racess: the "long ears" race and Jado race. Jado race wanted to conquer the universe and resurrect ancient evil powers to seize control of the Earth. Now the "long ears" race and Daichi must seek three warriors who could use magic to release Mado King to fight Jado race and to release "long ears" race`s kingdom, Rabiluna, from Jado race.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-04-07', 2818, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:09', '2026-09-03 16:40:07', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 41, 1072, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2478, 'Time Quest', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2820-ecPIZeQCgr2E.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'The series starts when Hayato, a soccer enthusiast, and his girlfriend Yumi, an aspiring musician, went to a visit to Dr. Leonard''s lab. They accidentally activated the Tondekeman, a funny talking kettle who transported them many centuries in the past. 

In Baghdad, Hayato and Yumi gets reunited but they got separated from Tondekeman. They meet Aladdin, Prince Dandarn and Princess Shalala. They also meet the cunning Abdullah who is always ready to kidnap the princess so that he could marry the princess to his master. 

Our heroes get to go to different places and times and meet several historical and literary figures as they follow Abdullah as he escapes through time to abduct the princess. 

Hayato and Yumi are stuck in the past until they get Tondekeman from the possession of Abdullah. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-19', 2820, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:11', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'TV', 'FALL', 39, 745, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2479, 'Crusher Joe: The OVAs', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2696-6063TksRtX8M.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'The galaxy is a strange and dangerous place, and there are times when even the United Space Force can`t help. That`s where the Crushers come in - skilled troubleshooters who will deal with any problem, large or small, for a fee (large only!) And there is no better Crusher than Crusher Joe!

(Source: AniDB)', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-02-05', 2696, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:14', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2696-uR1WhPrXh5NY.jpg', 'Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 2, 1936, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2480, 'The Golden Bird', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3760-KHrIZc00oMvo.jpg', 'movies', '6.6', '"Kin No Tori" is an adaptation of the homonymous fairy tale "The Golden Bird" by Brothers Grimm.

A golden apple is stolen from the King''s garden. The King orders his three sons to guard the apples in turn and to find out who is the thief. When the youngest son, Hansu, presents a feather that he got from the golden bird that stole the apple the king sends his three sons to bring this bird to him and so Hansu journey begins. 

Completed in 1984, this film was shelved for three years before being theatrically released.', NULL, '1987', 'movie', 'released', '1987-03-14', 3760, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:17', NULL, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 1705, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2481, 'Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b86-vaOa1TaV0T0K.png', 'series', '6.6', 'It is the year 0088 of the Universal Century in Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ. The badly damaged assault cruiser Argama docks at the run-down space colony of Shangri-La for much-needed repairs. While the Argama is in drydock, a young junk dealer named Judau Ashta sneaks aboard in an attempt to steal the Zeta Gundam. He wants to sell it in order to help his sister, but instead he finds himself coerced into joining the Argama’s crew. Unfortunately for Judau, the Argama is being pursued by a dedicated Neo Zeon officer named Mashymre Cello. In order to protect both his sister and himself, Judau must master the Argama’s newest mobile suit, the ZZ Gundam.

(Source: Right Stuf)', 'Sunrise', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-03-08', 86, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:37:53', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/86-TWbUNZ84tfI0.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 47, 18009, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:37:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2482, 'Dragon Warrior', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2819-pkB0KboXOxTz.png', 'series', '6.6', 'Dragon Quest is loosely based on Dragon Quest III. The names and some of the characters are familar, but the world map is smaller and a very different shape. The two main characters are Abel and Tialah. Tialah receives the legendary Red Stone from the Aliahan Village sage Master Yogi. Soon after, Tialah is kidnapped by the evil Baramos who wants to use the Red Stone to resurrect The Great Dragon and be granted eternal life. Abel swore to rescue Tialah and he is given the Blue Stone, which can only seal the Dragon once it has been released. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'NAS', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-12-02', 2819, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2819-yFHXovBmdgIw.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 43, 2499, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2483, 'Ai Shoujo Pollyanna Story', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2554-a3wsOFA22pcl.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Motherless since birth, Pollyanna was an ordinary happy-go-lucky girl, leaving peacefully with her father, the vicar. Then one day her life changes completely when her father dies and she has to live with her aunt whom she has never met before. In the beginning, she seems to be detested by her but as time passes, they develop a very strong bond.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-01-05', 2554, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:32', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2554-NAsENvF3Qlbf.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 51, 1972, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:32', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2484, 'Oishinbo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1093-oNUjFBdNsYlU.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Oishinbo is a drama about newspaper reporters. The main character is a cynical food critic named Yamaoka. Oishinbo is a popular mainstream comic for adults in Japan. It is even mentioned in an episode of "Iron Chef". 

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-10-17', 1093, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1093-Qx3xozlzOSOF.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 136, 2771, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2485, 'Phoenix: Karma Chapter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2997-kgY0qrUIcpBU.jpg', 'movies', '6.6', 'The story is about two characters, Akanemaru, a sculpture genius, and ex-burglar Gao whose only purpose in life is sculpting, and how they struggle with the fate to compete with each other over their capacity and talent.

(Source: AniDB)', 'MADHOUSE', '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-12-20', 2997, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 1782, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U2TVBaC6Sqo', '2026-08-29 14:44:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2486, 'Dominion Tank Police', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1151-SvOaX2oMD1oc.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Leona Ozaki joins Newport City''s infamous Tank Police division. With aid of Al and her newly built mini-tank, Bonaparte, she wages war on Buaku and his cohorts, the Puma Sisters. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Agent 21', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-05-27', 1151, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1151-ZCJH3EkGgDHW.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 4, 7875, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2487, 'Laughing Salesman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3077-r93tm0fXWl46.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Each episode follows Fukuzou Moguro, a traveling salesman, and his current customer. Moguro deals in things that give his customers their heart''s desire, and once his deals are made and their unhealthy desires are satisfied, Moguro''s customers are often left with terrible repercussions, especially if they break the rules of his deals...

Also includes the prologue to Warau Salesman that aired a week before the official episode 1 was released.', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-10', 3077, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:38', NULL, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror, Psychological, Supernatural', 'TV_SHORT', 'FALL', 104, 3200, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2488, 'The Poem of Wind and Trees', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1637-tvLm2NJfmuid.jpg', 'series', '6.6', '1887, at a remote, elite boarding school in France: Serge Battour returns after his graduation, and remembers the days of his youth...

1880, at the same school: Son of a viscount and a Roma prostitute (both deceased), Serge is intelligent, sweet, talented, and alienated by his family due to his heritage. Upon being sent to his new school, he rooms with Gilbert Cocteau, a gorgeous loner of a boy who sells his body for reasons unknown. Serge''s attempts to reach out to Gilbert fail spectacularly, and yet there is something in both of them that attracts them to each other.', 'Triangle Staff', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-11-06', 1637, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:42', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1637-niAzUo3mHS1D.jpg', 'Drama, Romance', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 5716, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2489, 'Tenkuu Senki Shurato', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2113-wj4f5lRC9lrB.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'A 16-year-old boy named Shurato and his friend Gai happen to be drawn into a gigantic ball of light while competing in the final match of a martial arts tournament. When they regain their senses, they find themselves transferred to a mystic heavenly sphere with a divine atmosphere. It''s soon discovered that Shurato used to be the governing king of this world and that he has only been brought to his original state. Shurato is shocked as Gai suddenly turns hostile. After this unfortunate incident, a spectacular yet fantastic drama develops involving the two.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-04-06', 2113, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:45', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 38, 2896, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2490, 'Mashin Eiyuuden Wataru', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3837-ndUUnFPysgM3.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'The story is about a 9-year old boy named Wataru Ikusabe that is magically transported to a magical realm of the gods called Soukaizan which he is supposed to save. In his quest to save the realm, he manages to transform a clay sculpture into a somewhat autonomous (small) Super Robot.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-04-15', 3837, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:41:42', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n3837-XLOYIjiTIvsl.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 45, 1637, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:41:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2491, 'The Phoenix -Space-', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2998.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'It is an animation version of the original story by Tezuka Osamu that depicts the cruelty of love through the fate of spacemen destined to drift through the universe after losing their mother ship..

(Source: AniDB)', 'MADHOUSE', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-12-21', 2998, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:41:46', NULL, 'Drama, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'WINTER', 1, 1465, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:41:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2492, 'Princess Anmitsu', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b6093-Z6xZwPa5Xm2y.png', 'series', '6.6', 'At age 16, a tomboy princess, Princess Anmitsu, has no love interest in her life and worries her parents. Despite their concern, Anmitsu runs away from the castle to venture into the commoners'' life. During her daring adventure, she befriends a group of children who make a living by pick-pocketing. At the same time, she finally meets her prince charming Senbei, the leader of the group. However, she soon finds herself in an awkward position when she learns of the children''s new plot: they are planning to steal the treasures from her own castle. Will she be able to put a stop to it without revealing her true identity?', NULL, '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-10-05', 6093, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:41:35', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 684, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:41:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2493, 'VAMPIRE HUNTER D', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx732-dksIxsja9LX7.png', 'movies', '6.5', '10,000 years in the future, the world has become a very different place; monsters roam the land freely, and people, although equiped with high tech weapons and cybernetic horses, live a humble life more suited to centuries past. The story focuses on a small hamlet plagued by monster attacks and living under the shadow of rule by Count Magnus Lee, a powerful vampire lord who has ruled the land for thousands of years. When a young girl is bitten by the Count and chosen as his current plaything, she seeks out help of a quiet wandering stranger, D. It so happens that D is one of the world`s best vampire hunters, and he takes it upon himself to cut through Magnus Lee`s many minions, and put an end to the Count`s rule.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Ashi Productions', '1985', 'movie', 'released', '1985-12-21', 732, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/732-us0j3KVEjWMe.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 34175, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6bc9z5Tmq4w', '2026-08-29 14:44:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2494, 'Magical Princess Minky Momo: La Ronde in my Dream', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2272.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Minky Momo travels to an island where she finds a land of children and gets tangled up in an absurd, no-holds-barred standoff against the world''s nations. Has "Dr. Strangelove" references.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Ashi Productions', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-07-28', 2272, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:41:53', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2272-3RMwpgTiadVU.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 1297, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:41:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2495, 'Konchuu Monogatari Minashigo Hutch (1989)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8140-12plXdLXKWBf.png', 'series', '6.6', 'A remake of the 1970''s version.', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-07-21', 8140, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:41:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8140-5eFEY0nbjfPO.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 55, 502, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:41:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2496, 'The Super Dimension Fortress Macross: Flash Back 2012', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1504-D0FjhoonS0Fk.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Flash Back 2012 is Minmay''s farewell concert. Featuring some of her best songs, the music is performed over various scenes and events taken from the Macross TV series as well as the movie "Do You Remember Love?". Also included is a newly animated closing sequence showing the launch of Misa''s colony vessel, the Megaroad-01, into space.

(Source: Anime News Network, edited)', 'Artland', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-06-21', 1504, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:41:49', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1504-d4KIgbPrxndU.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 3519, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:41:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2497, 'GoShogun: The Time Étranger', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2511-9zPafXsGPuTJ.jpg', 'movies', '6.5', 'In Goshogun the Time Etranger, forty years after the events of the TV series, Remy Shimada, ex-pilot of the GoShogun, suffers a terrible accident while on her way to a meeting with her former robot-piloting comrades. While they rush to the hospital, Remy floats between life and death. She sees visions of her life when she was young, and stranger still, experiences a hallucination of being with her friends, all of them young again, in a mysterious city filled with hostile fanatics.

Far from being the reunion Remy hoped for, a ghastly letter arrives for each member of the team that predicts their gruesome deaths. Slated to die in two days, both in reality and in her dream, Remy struggles to find a way out of the City of Fate, relying on the memories of her friends to see her through, even as they surround her death bed in the waking world. 

(Source: RightStuff)', NULL, '1985', 'movie', 'released', '1985-04-27', 2511, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:37:57', NULL, 'Action, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 1895, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:37:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2498, 'The Three Musketeers', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2333.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'The Three Musketeers: The year is 1625. The young D''Artagnan arrives in Paris at the tender age of 18, and almost immediately offends three musketeers, Porthos, Aramis, and Athos. Instead of dueling, the four are attacked by five of the Cardinal''s guards, and the courage of the youth is made apparent during the battle. The four become fast friends and embark upon an adventure that takes them across both France and England in order to thwart the plans of the Cardinal Richelieu. Along the way, they encounter a beautiful young spy, named simply Milady, who will stop at nothing to disgrace Queen Anne of Austria before her husband, Louis XIII, and take her revenge upon the four friends.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Gallop', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-10-09', 2333, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:00', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2333-zljD8QAJsQAk.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 52, 1658, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2499, 'The New Adventures of Kimba The White Lion', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2556-5hxl9W0Qi4xd.png', 'series', '6.5', 'Leo is a young ambitious lion cub who takes his father''s place as emperor of the jungle when is father is killed by poachers. Even though his father''s fate was met by the hands of humans, Leo is one of the few animals in the Jungle that doesn''t fear or feel hatred toward humans. He is not alone either, he is guided by friends of his father to help create the best animal kingdom there can be. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tezuka Productions', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-12', 2556, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:04', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2556-nYkVXjMug6QU.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama', 'TV', 'FALL', 52, 1457, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2500, 'Alfred J. Quack', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2813-lnn3FopSjEi7.png', 'series', '6.5', 'Alfred J. Kwak (Dutch, it takes place in The Netherlands) lost his parents, brothers and sisters when he was young. He was raised by a mole. The series covers the life of Alfred from the day he is born. In his life Alfred tries to help all sorts of animals all over the world. The series are meant to entertain children and teach them about life, covering historical events like World War II. 

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-04-03', 2813, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:08', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 1731, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2501, 'Blue Blink', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3631-gp2iOBWuZqj3.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Story of a young boy named Kakeru and his adventures together with a magical blue pony named Blink.', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-04-07', 3631, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:12', NULL, 'Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 751, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2502, 'Vampire Princess Miyu', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1384-BQKMLYCYwKjc.png', 'series', '6.5', 'A quiet gothic horror story about a vampire girl, Miyu, whose destiny it is to hunt down murderous demons known as Shinma and return them to their land of origin, the Dark. Miyu is pursued by the Spiritualist Himiko, determined to find out who Miyu is and to stop her from sucking the life blood from helpless humans. Each of the four episodes chronicle one of Miyu''s encounters with a Shinma and the humans that it is affecting, from the perspective of Himiko''s pursuit of Miyu. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'AIC', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-07-21', 1384, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1384-9NbtS4th2kTC.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Horror, Psychological, Supernatural', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 4, 6865, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YTAuYfE9pZ4', '2026-08-29 14:44:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2503, 'The Phoenix: Chapter of Yamato', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/2999.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Based on Tezuka Osamu''s original work portraying life based on the myth of Yamatotakeru.', 'MADHOUSE', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-08-01', 2999, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 1241, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=57S5VAGOZIM', '2026-08-29 14:44:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2504, 'Little Lord Fauntleroy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2555.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'After his father''s sudden death, Ceddie moves to England as an heir to his grandfather, the Earl of Dorincourt. 

The Earl is a stubborn and selfish old man. Gradually, however, Ceddie''s innocent love opens the Earl''s heart and changes him into a caring and generous person. 

This is based on "Little Lord Fauntleroy" by F.H.Burnett. 

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Nippon Animation', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-01-10', 2555, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:18', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2555-pTapft8SGzkn.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 43, 1639, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2505, 'Armored Trooper Votoms: The Big Battle', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2584.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Big Battle is a one-shot OVA set after the climax of the original Votoms storyline, but before the epilogue at the end of the series itself. With the Gilgamesh and Balarant forces still trying to advance their PS programs, Chirico and his old friends are forced into one last gladiatorial battle against a special PS and a formidable land battleship.', 'Sunrise', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-07-05', 2584, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:22', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 1643, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2506, 'Saint Seiya: The Heated Battle of the Gods', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1258-rGxxU1urNfD8.jpg', 'movies', '6.5', 'In northern Europe, the reincarnation of Odin, Dolbar, rules supreme. One day, Hyoga rescues a man in Siberia so warns him about trouble in the Asgard. Athena goes out to investigate and sends Hyoga in advance but when she and the others arrive at the Asgard, Hyoga is nowhere to be found. When Dolbar captures Athena to take control of the sanctuary, the bronze saints try to help her but are attacked by the God Warriors.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-03-12', 1258, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:25', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1258-8xeNAF4u9g4p.jpg', 'Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 4270, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:25', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2507, 'Ninja Robots Tobikage', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3059-CKnm3o7jfDz2.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Ninja Senshi Tobikage tells the story of a boy named Joe Maya. One day, Joe, who lives on Mars, witnesses a battle between aliens. Those from Planet Zaboom are attacking the princess of Planet Radorio, she has escaped from the emperor of Zaboom who is scheming to conquer the universe and has crash landed on mars. Joe stumbles aboard the princesses ship, this starts a chain reaction of events that will alter their lives. Joe and his friends wield three powerful mecha beasts against the emperor of Zaboom and his forces, but the odds are stacked heavily against them. When all hope seems to be lost a mysterious ninja robot named Tobikage appears as if from nowhere to provide assitance, able to combine with the 3 mechanical beasts provides Tobikage with unmatched power, with his aide Joe fights the forces of Zaboom...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-10-06', 3059, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:28', NULL, 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 43, 1747, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2508, 'Chinpui', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5908-aGnyFBMTWi2E.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'TV anime show based on the manga by F. Fujio Fujiko.', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-02-11', 5908, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:35', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 56, 892, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2509, 'Five Star Stories', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2042-Y1AjGO4uCdCS.jpg', 'movies', '6.5', 'Amaterasu is the god of light, the future emperor of the Joker Star System. Under the guise of young mecha conceptor Ladios Sopp, he is compelled by an old friend, Dr Ballanche, to save his two latest Fatimas Lachesis and Clotho. And so began the stories of the Joker System, as well as Amaterasu''s love for Lachesis.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1989', 'movie', 'released', '1989-03-11', 2042, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:39', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2042-Tov90m6kP4ah.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 6957, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:39', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2510, 'Little Nemo: Adventures in Slumberland', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2286-DqqpxLrOazca.png', 'movies', '6.4', 'Welcome to the fantasy world of "Little Nemo," where dreams of enchanted lands and new friends take young Nemo into an exciting, fun-filled adventure through Slumberland. On one unforgettable night, Nemo falls asleep. Soon, with the help of his flying pet squirrel Icarus and his friend Professor Genius, they journey together into Slumberland. Nemo is lovingly embraced by the people of Slumberland, particularly the King, who adopts Nemo and makes him heir to the throne. He is entrusted with two very special possessions: the prized royal Scepter, and a mysterious key that unlocks many secrets!

Though Nemo is warned not to open the one door with the power to destroy Slumberland, temptation proves too strong and the King is abducted as a black cloud of nightmares washes over the formerly idyllic dreamscape. Now, if Nemo is to reverse his error and bring the King back, he must rally his friends and journey deep into Nightmare Land.

(Source: Discotek Media)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1989', 'movie', 'released', '1989-07-15', 2286, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2286-uh9L7sNpGw9w.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2950, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=99VKtcydHUU', '2026-08-29 14:44:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2511, 'Himitsu no Akko-chan 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3838-rz45etpWGqn5.png', 'series', '6.4', 'Akko-chan is a bright and energetic 5th grader in elementary school whose father is a newscaster and mother is a picture-book writer. Akko always cherishes the palm-sized mirror that was given to her by her father and treats it with care. However, the mirror was accidentally broken by her absent-minded mother. On a night where a beautiful full-moon hangs in the sky, Akko-chan buries the mirror pieces in the garden and goes to sleep. She is awakened by a soft and kind voice which belongs to the Queen of the Mirror Kingdom. She sends her gratitiude to Akko-chan for cherishing the mirror with care and offers her a magical compact mirror. Whenever she sings the magical words, Akko-chan will be able to transform into anything she wants.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-10-09', 3838, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:42', NULL, 'Comedy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'FALL', 61, 958, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2512, 'Dash! Yonkurou', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3116.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'A young boy named Hinomaru Yonkurou, the owner of a minicar the Emperor, which is left to him by his deceased father, leads a mini 4WD racing team called Dash Warriors, as they enter the mini 4WD championship. To win the tournament they have to face racers from the Death Corp.', 'Aubeck', '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-10-03', 3116, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:46', NULL, 'Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 740, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2513, 'Uchuusen Sagittarius', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3317.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Working for a multi-purpose space agency, Toppy and Rana make friends with Giraffe, a scientist, and go through various adventures in space. The three encounter danger at times, but their friendship always saves them just in the nick of time.

(Source: Official site)', NULL, '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-01-10', 3317, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:50', NULL, 'Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 77, 740, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2514, 'Fight! Kickers', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3053-CjZTqgh5ODGO.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'The Kickers are first and foremost a football team. Actually, they''re only playing for their school, but haven''t exactly covered themselves with glory. When the new player, Gregor (Daichi Kakeru) arrives at the school, they just had faced a resounding defeat again. However, thanks to Gregor, things are going to change. Highly motivated, they''ll try to get rid of their "always-loser-team" image. Their strongest enemy are the Devils, who Gregor provokes right from the start. However, it''s not all about football. When the captain, Mario (Hongou Masaru), is not pursued by his female fans, the Kickers often hang around and do stuff together.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-10-15', 3053, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:38:57', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3053-xp487JLAWZi3.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 2239, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2515, 'Gegege no Kitarou (1985)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/7307.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'As civilization advances, people are beginning to lose the consideration and kindliness for Nature. This has incurred the wrath of the ghosts who are becoming increasingly unhappy with the selfishness of the human kind. However, there is a conflict of interests within the ghosts in which one extreme opposes the humans completely while another extreme desires the co-existence of humans and ghosts. Kitaro and his family belongs to the latter category and yearns to seek mutual understanding between the humans and ghosts. Kitaro''s fight for love and hope continues.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-10-12', 7307, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:40:27', NULL, 'Comedy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 108, 1073, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2516, 'Tsurupika Hagemaru-kun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5830.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Hagemaru Hageda is a young kid, studying in fourth standard living with his parents in Japan. Only child of his parents, he and his parents are a big misers. They do anything for saving money and this is the basic plot of the show. Hagemaru also has a pet dog named Pesu, who often comments about Hagemaru''s family being too miser and not giving him anything to eat.

He is best friend of his class-mate Masaru Kondo and he has a crush on Midori, a girl from his class. In most of the episodes, Hagemaru goes to school and the story revolves around his teacher (his ''miss'') and his friends. At the end of the each episode, top ten snippets are shown.', NULL, '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-03-03', 5830, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:39:02', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 59, 1038, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2517, 'Megazone 23 Part II', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx129595-AuLhSlwfmL23.png', 'series', '6.4', 'The Dezalg have returned with a new, horrible weapon and unleashed it on Megazone 23''s defences. Believing their salvation is also in new weapons, B.D. is still bent on breaking EVE''s final protection level. Full control of Megazone 23 would mean unfettered weapons development.

Shogo, meanwhile, has tried to return to a normal life — hanging out with his biker gang, Trash and his girlfriend, Yui. But, his convictions about the Megazone''s shadow government policies have not changed and when EVE calls for his help, he discovers where the Garland bike has been hidden.

It is showdown time for Shogo and B.D., Trash and the military, as well as the Dezalg and Megazone. However, EVE''s final secret, A.D.A.M., may mean no one will survive.', 'AIC', '1986', 'series', 'released', '1986-04-26', 129595, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129595-YxsOz2uNmg3o.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Mystery, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 1916, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2518, 'Transformers Victory', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/926.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Set in 2025 A.D., Transformers Victory introduces Star Saber, the mightiest Cybertron warrior and the greatest swordsman in the galaxy. The Destrons are continuing to invade planets throughout the universe, so the Cybertrons have joined with the humans to form the Space Defense Force, with Star Saber as its leader. Leading the Destrons is Deathzaras, who has targeted Earth as the next planet to plunder...

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1989', 'series', 'released', '1989-03-14', 926, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:34', NULL, 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 44, 1158, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2519, 'Saint Seiya: Evil Goddess Eris', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1256-hOj9i3AIVFlt.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'Eris is the goddess of chaos and uses the body of Elien, who is a friend of Hyoga, to revive herself. She obtains the golden apple to drain Athena''s life energy to make her ressurection complete and to be able to turn the world in a place filled with chaos. But to be able to attack Eris, Seiya and his friends will first have to defeat the Ghost Knights.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1987', 'movie', 'released', '1987-07-18', 1256, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:38', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1256-YUCEyBqrDJDI.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4667, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2520, 'Around the World with Willy Fog', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2579-VYTG0ibRu5dm.png', 'series', '6.4', 'Willy Fogg accepts a bet from members of the Reform Club that he can make it around the world in 80 days. His plan however does not include being stopped by unknown enemies. Based on the Jules Verne novel.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1987', 'series', 'released', '1987-10-10', 2579, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:39:05', NULL, 'Adventure, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 1503, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2521, 'Musashi no Ken', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b4062-ZTXTQygLAbau.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Musashi no Ken is the story of a boy named Musashi who aims to be the Kendo champion.  Part of the anime is him as a child, and part is of him as an adult.', NULL, '1985', 'series', 'released', '1985-04-18', 4062, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:43', NULL, 'Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 72, 891, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2522, 'Uchuu Kazoku Carlvinson', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4533-9EJbRoh7eBU8.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'When a motley band of travelling performers have a deep-space collision with another spacecraft, they find that the sole survivor of the other craft is a humanoid infant. They decide to raise the child as their own on the nearest planet as they wait for other members of the girl''s race to come and find her. 

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-12-21', 4533, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:46', NULL, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 1716, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2523, 'Captain Tsubasa: Sekai Daikessen!! Jr. World Cup', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2121.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'In the fourth movie, the classical Japan-Europe match becomes intercontinental. This time they arrange a world cup with 4 teams: Japan, USA, "All Europe", and "All South America". In the first match, Japan easily defeats the USA 3:0 and in the second match Europe loses 2:3 against South America. In the final round S.A. shows their "soccer cyborg" Carlos Santana, a more than supreme player who seems to be undefeatable. All their classical tricks like Hyugas "Tiger Shot" or Tsubasas "Top Spin" seem to be totally worthless, but in a hard and spectacular match the Japanese learn more and more to play in unison and finally they get the win.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1986', 'movie', 'released', '1986-07-12', 2121, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:50', NULL, 'Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1492, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2524, 'Sore Ike! Anpanman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1960-ueSmUxBXWuFK.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'One night, a Star of Life falls down the chimney of a bakery nestled deep in the forest, causing the dough in the oven to come to life. The dough becomes Anpanman, a superhero made of anpan (a sweet roll with bean jam filling). Together with his friends, Anpanman fights his rival Baikinman and helps the malnourished.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'TMS Entertainment', '1988', 'series', 'airing', '1988-10-03', 1960, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 15:40:15', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1960-9Vx6QVIU8z4Z.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', NULL, 1419, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:40:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2525, 'Iron Fist Chinmi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4663-5Xf9Mmx1p8vG.png', 'series', '6.4', 'The Ironfist Chinmi or Tekken is kung-fu adventure of a teenage who will complete the art of kung-fu a temple which is Dairin Temple. Adventure background is a huge China Kingdom with a huge history in it and even it''s very big territorial. This teenager&rsquo;s name is Chinmi and companion with a funny monkey, which usually called Go Ku, to across the wide of kung-fu''s world. Chinmi is an orphan teenage that only have an older sister, Mei Lin. They both, before Chinmi''s going to explore his talent in kungfu in Dairin temple, lived near the Choko River in a small restaurant owned by them. It was Master Yosen who gave the first time to Chinmi an inner power kung-fu''s style which becomes the first style to rely on every fight in Chinmi''s adventure.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Ashi Productions', '1988', 'series', 'released', '1988-07-02', 4663, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:53', NULL, 'Action, Adventure', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 20, 1078, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2526, 'Sakigake!! Otokojuku (Movie)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4031.jpg', 'movies', '6.4', 'Otokojuku, a private school for juvenile delinquents that were previously expelled from normal schools. At this school, Japanese chivalry is taught through the feudal and military fundamentals. Similar to an action film, the classes are overwhelmed by violence. Only those who survive it become true men.

(Source: Animenfo)', NULL, '1988', 'movie', 'released', '1988-07-23', 4031, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:11', '2026-09-03 16:34:55', NULL, 'Action, Comedy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 977, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2527, 'Urusei Yatsura Movie 2: Beautiful Dreamer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1921-YYKPVDPdHXbH.png', 'movies', '7.8', 'In Urusei Yatsura: Beautiful Dreamer, Tomobiki High is in a frenzy to get ready for the school festival. Props need to be made, costumes designed, and maybe somewhere sleep to be had! Ataru, Lum, Shutaro, Shinobu, and the rest of Class 2-4 are determined to not be outdone this year, and they''re rushing to make the final preparations for tomorrow''s grand opening.

Once they wake up the next morning, they continue their mad rush to get ready for tomorrow''s grand opening. And then the next day... hey, isn''t something strange going on? Silence lingers over the city, the buildings filled with nothing but dust and mold. Is this a dream? Or have the kids (and a few related adults) of Class 2-4 finally woken up? If they can spend each day having fun with each other, does it matter?

(Source: Discotek)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-02-11', 1921, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1921-gAGwBnhbMce1.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 8634, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6frJs0YmvmA', '2026-08-29 14:45:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2528, 'DAICON IV Opening Animation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx121664-W0B2xLXXNxpj.jpg', 'movies', '7.8', 'A "bunny girl" crosses paths with iconic characters from comic books, live-action films, literature and animation.

(Source: IMDB)', 'Gainax', '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-08-20', 121664, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:34:59', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/121664-pC5VqgwWHrhq.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 3993, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2529, 'Macross: Do You Remember Love?', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1089-uoP83D60OHxP.jpg', 'movies', '7.7', 'A.D. 2009 - The human race is in the middle of a three-way war with a race of giant humanoid aliens called the Zentraedi (male) and Meltrandi (female). After executing a space fold that sent it and part of South Atalia Island to the edge of the Solar System, the space fortress Macross is on its way back to Earth. During a small skirmish with Zentraedi forces, young pilot Hikaru Ichijo rescues idol singer Lynn Minmay and their relationship develops as they''re stranded somewhere within the ship. But shortly after returning to Macross City, Minmay is captured by the Zentraedi, and Hikaru and female officer Misa Hayase end up back on Earth - only to view the aftermath of the destruction of their civilization. Only a song discovered eons ago - along with Minmay''s voice - can determine the outcome of the war.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-07-07', 1089, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:02', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1089-QrL6y85OKpa5.jpg', 'Action, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 16560, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2530, 'Mobile Suit Gundam III: Encounters in Space', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1092-OYhbgaXa6sPm.jpg', 'movies', '7.6', 'The One Year War comes to a close, as the Zeon forces now retreat back into space. Amuro learns much more about his Newtype abilities and tries to use them the best way he can. He''s pushed to his limit as he encounters the infamous Char Aznable once again. He also falls in love with a mysterious woman named Lalah Sune, who knows the full potential of the Newtype abilities. 

The greatest battle is about to begin, as many loved ones fall to the power of war. Can the Earth Federation defeat the Principality of Zeon? Can Char prove that he''s a better Newtype than Amuro? All these questions will be answered now...

(Source: Otakufreakmk2)', 'Sunrise', '1982', 'movie', 'released', '1982-03-13', 1092, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:05', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1092-jwkXzDwSQRQV.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 14111, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2531, 'Armored Trooper Votoms', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2582-aB1Vh1jDobQ3.jpg', 'series', '7.6', 'A century of bloodshed between warring star systems has plunged nearly 200 worlds into the flames of war. Now, an uneasy truce has settled across the Astragius Galaxy...

Chirico Cuvie, a special forces powered-armor pilot is suddenly transferred into a unit engaged in a secret and highly illegal mission to steal military secrets - from their own military! Now he''s on the run...from his own army!

Unsure of his loyalties and to cover their own tracks, Chirico is left behind to die in space. Surviving by luck, the renegade is now hunted by both the conspirators and military intelligence.

He is driven by the haunting image of a mysterious and beautiful woman - the objective of their mission, and his sole clue to unraveling their treacherous scheme. But the conspirators will do anything to preserve their mysterious agenda... 

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Sunrise', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-04-01', 2582, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2582-rlQUrWDtXDjf.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Mystery, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 11582, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2532, 'Macross', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1088-b2eAPvA5zmmi.png', 'series', '7.5', 'In 1999, a giant alien spacecraft crash lands on South Ataria island. Humanity proceeds to attempt to rebuild this marvel, but political conflicts centered around the Macross result in a global war. After 10 years, the Unification Wars are finally over, the new Earth United Nations Government is in power, and work on the Macross is complete.

On the day of the launching ceremony, its main cannon fires on its own, destroying an alien spacecraft. This fateful day marks the beginning of the war between the humans on the Macross and the Zentradi, a race of humanoid aliens of giant proportions.

(Source: AnimEigo)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-03', 1088, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1088-qEDmlgWXrKH3.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 36, 31871, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2533, 'The Mysterious Cities of Gold', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1279-m4VozI4m665B.jpg', 'series', '7.5', '1532. Esteban (12) is a foundling from Barcelona, with a mysterious power of ordering the Sun to appear, for which he is called "Child of the Sun". Upon the death of his adoptive father, Esteban learns he was rescued as a baby from a sinking ship in the ocean. The mysterious medallion that Esteban wears since ever has a trace somewhere in the New World, probably coming from the Mysterious Cities of Gold. Esteban leaves Spain to find his parents and find out who he is. On the way he meets Zia, an Inca girl who was kidnapped from her people years back and has exactly the same medallion as him. Later on they are joined by Tao, a young Galapagos robinson, the last descendant of the Empire of Heva, an Empire said to have built the Cities of Gold. Following Coyolite, the shining star represented on their medallions, the three children travel through the unexplored New World, searching for the Cities of Gold, believing that this way is leading them to their lost parents.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-06-29', 1279, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:14', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1279-hgTJF1oO4MP3.jpg', 'Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 39, 4700, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2534, 'Barefoot Gen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1824-YN6bpoNBh0eK.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'It''s the summer of 1945. 3 years have elapsed since the war between Japan and USA began. Gen is a young boy living a struggling yet satisfying life in the city of Hiroshima, that has been strangely spared by the bombing taken in almost every other Japanese City. Food is scarce, and Gen''s family is suffering from severe malnutrition, which endangeres his pregnant mother. There isn''t much spare time as Gen and his little brother Shinji help their father and mother at work and try to make sure their family survives the tought times. Little do they know, what the Americans have in store for the city of Hiroshima and as of the 6th of August 1945, their lives are about to change dramatically.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'MADHOUSE', '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-07-21', 1824, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:17', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1824-cmusZCf5PMld.png', 'Drama', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 16818, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2535, 'Space Adventure Cobra', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2451-nNs4TE6zKxjW.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'Seeking reprieve from a painfully ordinary 9-to-5 existence, mild-mannered office worker Johnson visits the TM corporation, a company that sells virtual dreams. In Johnson''s dream adventure, he''s the notorious space pirate Cobra! Accompanied by his android partner Lady Armaroid, Cobra fights the lowlife scum of the Pirate Guild by day and saves sultry sirens of space by night.

After the journey is over, events unfold that bring reality into focus. His experience wasn''t a dream at all - it was a reawakening of his buried past! With the most feared weapon in the universe, the Psycho Gun, Cobra sets out into the galaxy in pursuit of love, fortune and fame.

(Source: Discotek)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-07', 2451, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:21', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2451-P5zq4gU8i8rk.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 31, 9008, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2536, 'Urusei Yatsura', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1293-xohJFutZXimo.jpg', 'series', '7.4', 'It all begins when aliens invade and threaten to conquer the Earth! However, one member of the human race is chosen at random to duel the aliens and save the planet: Ataru Moroboshi, a lecherous slacker from Tomobiki High School who begrudgingly participates. All he has to do? Play a game of tag and catch Lum — the beautiful alien princess in a tiger-stripe bikini — by the horns. Unfortunately for Ataru, it’s not so simple, since Lum can fly and deliver electric shocks! Perseverance pays off, but once he catches her, Ataru experiences another shock: He’s now Lum’s betrothed “darling” and she isn’t going back to her home planet anytime soon!

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-10-14', 1293, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1293-XmAkK3xVNmQh.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 195, 30417, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vPJ3TwG63Hk', '2026-08-29 14:45:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2537, 'Taiyou no Kiba Dougram', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2257-rKWjJXEqGjd2.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'The story is centered around a small group of guerilla freedom fighters on a colonial planet named Deloyer, who are known as the "Deloyer 7", or "Sun Fang" team. In an unexpected coup, the elected Governor of Deloyer becomes dictator and rules Deloyer under martial law with the support of Earth''s Federation. Fighting for independence from Earth''s Federation influence, the freedom fighters begin a rebellion against the Federation''s Combat Armors using a Combat Armor of their own: the Dougram.', 'Sunrise', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-10-23', 2257, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2257-uQCe0JyYVEEa.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 75, 3852, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2538, 'Captain Harlock: Arcadia of my Youth', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2202-mARxwjZ7oXO4.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Earth has been conquered by the evil Illumidus Empire, with parallels drawn to the U.S. post World War II occupation of Japan. Captain Harlock with a group that will become his life long friends begin their fight against this tyranny visited upon the planet Earth, with no regard to the costs the struggle will have on them, caring only for the ideal of restoring freedom to the people of Earth.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1982', 'movie', 'released', '1982-07-28', 2202, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:27', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2202-YoNdDED7oDhj.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4545, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2539, 'Blue Gale Xabungle', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2254-D5MWDU2JJCHn.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'Jiron Amos seeks revenge against the outlaw who killed his parents, but in a world where crimes are forgiven if they’re not brought to justice within three days, there’s only one thing he can do: steal the mecha Xabungle.

(Source: Hidive)', 'Sunrise', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-02-06', 2254, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:30', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2254-0goCw60bwvAi.jpg', 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 3579, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2540, 'Space Runaway Ideon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx930-q5HD8fnAiRQD.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'From the continuing reclamation of the ruins of the planet Solo, mysterious mechas are excavated. But suddenly, an alien called Buff Clan attacks seeking the limitless energy “Ide.” The earthlings are backed into a corner, when the three mechas piloted by the earth boy Yuki Cosmo and others fuse together. Becoming the giant robot Ideon, they use their incredible power to fight back against Buff Clan. 

(Source: Sunrise)', 'Sunrise', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-05-08', 930, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:35:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/930-9s0WMPVmu0dX.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 10981, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:35:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2541, 'DAICON III Opening Animation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2724-q3BwS59924IV.jpg', 'movies', '7.2', 'A girl is visited by two men from a space ship. They give her water she needs to water her daicon (radish). On her journey to deliver the water, this girl has to fight demons and giant robots.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Gainax', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-08-22', 2724, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:30:47', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2724-2hSomR12fveU.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Music, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 8633, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:30:47', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2542, 'Sherlock Hound', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1972-r2VNEnzoA7P7.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'This story takes place at the end of the 19th century in London. A famous dog detective, Sherlock Hound, was relaxing with his pipe... Dr. Watson is, of course, with Sherlock. The night is very foggy. From the light of a street gas lamp, one can only see for a few yards. From the distance, a coach comes dashing towards Baker Street and stops in front of Hound''s flat. Someone violently knocks at the door. "Watson, something''s afoot!!" Hound in his well-known deer stalker hat and Inverness cape, leaves his flat in his prototype Benz with Dr. Watson.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-11-06', 1972, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:30:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1972-a9MbID3FIWDV.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Mystery', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 5408, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:30:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2543, 'Mobile Suit Gundam II: Soldiers of Sorrow', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1091-VSmUzzebMq7V.jpg', 'movies', '7.1', 'As the War continues, Amuro and the White Base crew must make their way toward the Earth Federation Headquarters, Jaburo. On their way they will meet several new enemies and face off against impossible odds. They will fight in Operation Odessa to relieve the Earth from the clutches of the Zeon forces.

Lives will be lost, new friendships will be made, and discoveries lie at every corner. Amuro soon learns that he possesses the power of the mysterious Newtypes.

(Source: Otakufreakmk2)', 'Sunrise', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-07-11', 1091, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:30:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1091-OzzxSPrzcZ4D.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 14449, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:30:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2544, 'Swiss Family Robinson', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2544.jpg', 'series', '7.1', '10-year-old Flone is a very active, tomboyish sort of a girl. One day, her father receives a letter from his English friend who is now in Australia. In the letter, the friend asks her father to come down to Australia because of a serious shortage of doctors. The family decides to leave their old house in Bern. Now their drifting voyage has begun! 

Flone''s fantastic adventures will teach children about the importance of family and the joys of living amidst nature''s beauty.', 'Nippon Animation', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-01-04', 2544, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:30:57', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2544-xMDzu09h3pFx.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 2686, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:30:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2545, 'Captain Harlock: Arcadia of my Youth - Endless Orbit SSX', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2203-2SKplVCINxKb.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'At the end of Arcadia of My Youth Capitain Harlock and the crew of the space ship Arcadia had been banished from Earth. The Earth, as well as many other planets in the universe had been taken over by the Illumidus, a race of destructive humanoids who ruin, enslave or destroy almost any inhabitable planet they come across. In "Endless Orbit SSX" Harlock battles the Illumidus while searching for a mythical "Planet of Peace" where all the peoples of the universe can live freely and without war.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Toei Animation', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-13', 2203, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:01', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2203-tOJ7NLy0mwNH.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 22, 2962, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2546, 'Adieu Galaxy Express 999', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1302-EWYtczQU91xl.jpg', 'movies', '7.1', 'Two years after the events in Galaxy Express 999, Earth has become a battleground. Tetsuro, older and fighting the Machine People, rejoins Maetel aboard the GE999.', 'Toei Animation', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-08-01', 1302, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:04', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1302-palEc3EhS7bI.jpg', 'Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 3822, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:04', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2547, 'Giant Gorg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3327-81DjqHJrXkFK.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'Austral Island is located 2,000 km south from Samoa islands. The existence of the island was removed from the official records, and Tagami Yu made a journey to search for the reason.


He sailed for the island with Dr. Waive who was his father''s friend, Doris who is the daughter of Dr. Waive, and Captain who is the friend of Dr. Waive. On their way to the island, GAIL, the international conglomerate, and gangster, Cougar Connection lead by Lady Lynx attacked them.


They managed to arrive at the island, but suddenly a mysterious monster began to attack them. When they became ready for death, a blue giant robot appeared. It destroyed the monster and saved them. Although it was an existence far beyond human knowledge, it reminded Yu of something warm and familiar.


It was Giant Gorg which is called "Messenger of the God" by the inhabitants of the island. Escaping from the attack of GAIL''s assault team, Gorg guided Yu into the underworld. There, he found alien''s relic and an alien who woke up after 30,000 years'' sleep. 


(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Sunrise', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-04-05', 3327, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3327-BYQ8n4dlgR3b.jpg', 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 3757, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2548, 'Mobile Suit Gundam I', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1090-EzpeffMoflBS.jpg', 'movies', '7.1', 'It is the year Universal Century 0079. Over 90 million humans populate the Earth, and many have been forced to live in space. People now live in large cylinder-like colony clusters called Sides, all ruled over by the "Earth Federation Space Force" (E.F.S.F.). Around this time, a group of colonies called Side 3, located near the dark side of the moon, proclaimed themselves independent from the Earth Federation and made themselves known as the "Principality of Zeon".

Now the war has gone on for eight months and doesn''t seem to be ending any time soon. Both factions are at a stalemate. As a last resort, the Federation attempts to produce a new, stronger force to fight against the Zeonic armies. They create the White Base and a powerful Mobile Suit called the "Gundam". However, these suits are piloted by youths...', 'Sunrise', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-03-14', 1090, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1090-IuQ15ERz31Mb.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 18571, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2549, 'Patalliro!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/n2835-2iugxDsTZz74.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Patarillo! is set in a society much like ours in most ways, with one decided twist. The manga on which it is based is one of the much-read works produced for adolescent Japanese girls that features a healthy proportion of gay men and beautiful teenagers aka bishounen (beautiful boys). Most of the action takes place in Marinera, the land of eternal spring, located somewhere in the South Seas. The country is a major producer of diamonds; they provide much of the basis of conflict in the anime series. They come from one of the most prolific mines in the world, owned by the king of Marinera, the vertically challenged but horizontally endowed boy-king Patarillo himself. The International Diamond Syndicate - a huge semi- criminal organization/ secret society dedicated to taking over the world`s entire diamond supply- wants that mine and will stop at nothing to get it. In the early episodes they send off a number of bishounen assassins to do in Patarillo, which necessitates his having a bodyguard, the English MI6 agent, Major Jack (`Bishounen-Killer`) Bancoran. Bancoran`s nickname doesn`t mean he shoots bishounen in cold blood. The soubriquet comes from the fact that no male under the age of 17 can resist his sexual fascination. This, to Bancoran`s eternal disgust, includes Patarillo himself. The action switches often from Marinera to MI6 headquarters in London (London seems to be an easy two hour`s flight from the South Seas) or Bancoran`s palatial condo in the suburbs of same. (MI6, be it noted, looks a lot like Fritz Lang`s Metropolis, while Jack`s `apartment` bears a passing resemblance to Randolph Hearst`s spread.) The action also goes into the past and future and out into space. Patarillo evidently gets around.

(Source: aestheticism.com)', 'Toei Animation', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-04-09', 2835, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:15', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2835-7efrqC6e0OjV.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 49, 4489, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2550, 'Glass Mask', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx506-wfDcUJMnvMed.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Kitajima Maya, a 13-year old girl with a talent for acting, was discovered by the reclusive actress Tsukikage. The story follows Maya''s growing up, intense training, overcoming challenges, and evolving into the foremost actress of her generation (she is about 20 so far). Maya''s greatest rival is Himekawa Ayumi, the beautiful daughter of a famous movie couple. They ultimately vied for the most sought-after role - the "Crimson Goddess". An equally important subplot Maya''s relationship with the handsome and ruthless entertainment mogul Hayami Masumi, who secretly became her number one fan, but misunderstandings and bad-timing obstructed their romance...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Eiken', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-04-09', 506, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/506-hqggxE83Rujb.jpg', 'Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 23, 4764, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2551, 'Igano Kabamaru', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2762.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'After the death of Saizou, Kabamaru''s horribly strict grandfather and Iga ninja teacher (sensei), an old lady, Ran Akoko, claims that she received a letter from him asking her to take care of his grandson. So Kabamaru runs off with Lady Akoko to the big city Tokyo to gorge on yakisoba, ramen, chow mein, and attend a regular school&mdash;which turns out to have weird quirks of its own.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Group TAC', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-10-20', 2762, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:22', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2762-v7Fv2CkH0jxE.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 24, 2658, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2552, 'Lupin the Third Part 3', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1426-DOXCZNxTn7f0.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Lupin III chronicles the adventures of Arsene Lupin III, the world''s greatest thief, and his partners in crime: master marksman Daisuke Jigen, beautiful and scheming Fujiko Mine and stoic samurai Goemon Ishikawa XIII. Lupin and his gang travel around the globe in search of the world''s greatest treasures and riches and always keeping one step ahead of the tireless Inspector Zenigata, who has vowed to bring Lupin to justice. 

(Source: AnimeNewsNetwork)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-03-03', 1426, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:26', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1426-11KpXpbcFlU0.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 8374, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2553, 'Round Vernian Vifam', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2987-OfJdwOIeDgLu.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'AD. 2058, on the Clayad which was the 3rd planet of the Ypserlon system, which was 43 light years away from Earth, suddently aliens raided the planet.The emigrants on the Clayad had to escape from the planet. Because of the confusion during the escape, the children were strayed from their parents and got in the training space ship, Janous. With a lot of sacrifices, they managed to arrive at 4th planet Belwick. However, the Belwick had been already in the war. Therefore, the 13 children had to go to the Earth by themselves.


(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Sunrise', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-10-21', 2987, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:29', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2987-xdFZAohhvIRk.jpg', 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 46, 2476, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2554, 'Cat''s Eye', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2043-3utzsFtcHE3a.png', 'series', '7.0', 'The three Kisugi sisters &mdash;Rui, Hitomi and Ai&mdash; during the day run a small cafe called "Cat''s Eye". To discover the whereabouts of their father, the artist Michael Heintz, who has disappeared, Hitomi and her sisters rob art galleries as the smart and mysterious thief "Cat''s Eye" in the hope that his works can give them clues about his vanishing. The crucial point is that Hitomi has a relationship with Toshi, a police inspector who has sworn to catch "Cat''s Eye" &mdash;and of course he has no idea about Hitomi''s double life. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-07-11', 2043, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2043-HshGQr8FynR3.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 36, 8783, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2555, 'Unico in the Island of Magic', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2429-DxUplF0kJqU3.jpg', 'movies', '7.0', 'Based on "Unico and the Kingdom of the Sun," which was newly written as a theater version, this animated film features a battle between the wizard Kukuruku and Unico. Kukuruku builds a castle using dolls transformed from men as building parts. The story revolves around the sorrow and terror of men who have been transfigured into dolls, and a girl named Cherry who wishes to recover the kindness in her brother, who is a student of Kukuruku. This work reminds us of the fact that "transformation" or "transfiguration" - favorite themes of Tezuka Osamu - involves not only material aspects, but also man''s immaterial heart.

(Source: Tezuka Osamu''s Website)', 'MADHOUSE', '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-07-16', 2429, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:31:57', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2429-LULrPvixSy7I.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1734, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:31:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2556, 'Queen Millennia', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1548-lgNWG433PyKs.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'The year is 1999. Amamori Hajime is just a normal, everyday elementary school student, trying to study and hanging out with his crazy pals. But then one day as his father is testing a piece of equipment he has been working on, something causes it to blow up, taking the house with it! Now orphaned, Hajime is taken in by his uncle, who is an astronomer. There at his uncle''s observatory, he meets a girl he''s seen before and developed somewhat of a crush on. He finds out her name is Yukino Yayoi, and her parents run a ramen shop in town. But even better than that, she''s his uncle''s assistant! What luck! 

But Yayoi isn''t exactly what she seems. There is a reason she helps out Amamori-san at the observatory. She is the Millennial Queen (Sen-Nen Joou), specially chosen by her home planet, LaMetal, to go to Earth and help prepare for the possible annihilation of the planet. What will cause this disaster? LaMetal has an extremely elliptical orbit, which sends it very, very near Earth every 1000 years. When it gets close enough, the earth reacts, causing all sorts of natural disasters. Although she was chosen with the idea of protecting LaMetal in mind, her personal plan is to evacuate as many humans as she can to LaMetal, so if their planet is destroyed, they will survive. 

However, there is one person who strives to stop her plan, the head of the Millennial Theives. Why does he want to stop Yayoi? And how does he know about the Millennial Queen, anyway? 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-04-16', 1548, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:32:19', NULL, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 42, 2576, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2557, 'Dr. Slump: Arale-chan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2222-wJc3oXlh4SDV.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Dr. Slump creates a little android girl, Arale, who is very stong, happy, and totally common senseless. They live in Penguin Village where the strangest things happen (e.g., the dawn is announced by a little pig wearing a basquee).

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-04-08', 2222, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:32:27', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2222-v9bANWdxPTd4.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 243, 5170, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2558, 'Tiger Mask Nisei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5832-6di0YSEHyF3v.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Second season to the original Tiger Mask, with a different cast of characters.', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-04-20', 5832, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:08', NULL, 'Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 33, 1712, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2559, 'Magical Angel Creamy Mami', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2044-v7Ier4v9I2Jq.png', 'series', '6.9', 'Creamy Mami is about a young girl, Yuu, who after seeing a spaceship is given the power to use magic for one year. She is also given 2 cats, Poji and Nega, to watch over and guide her. Using her magic powers to transform into the idol Creamy Mami, Yuu must work hard at acting, singing, helping her parents at their crepe shop, fighting aliens and bad guys, going to school, plus try to get the affections of her childhood friend Toshio.

(Source: AnimeNewsNetwork)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-07-01', 2044, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:12', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2044-9DthmDfKtmDX.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 52, 6447, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2560, 'Stop!! Hibari-kun!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3332-bOr7eIk0eIUT.png', 'series', '6.9', 'Kousaku, a teenage boy, moves in to the home of his mother''s friend after she dies. This friend happens to be a Yakuza boss with four beautiful daughters. Kousaku is surprised to discover that  the most beautiful daughter, Hibari, is biologically male. Hibari is also very interested in Kousaku, and so their crazy but happy life together begins. 

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-05-20', 3332, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:15', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3332-rmTSd3vPhIWR.jpg', 'Comedy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 35, 5665, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2561, 'The Adventures of Tom Sawyer', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2577-hQ3UqXtVoHn3.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Tom Sawyer is a young boy growing up along the Mississippi River in the mid 1800s. Along with his best friend Huckleberry Finn, he spends his days ditching school, fishing, climbing trees and having adventures.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-01-06', 2577, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:18', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2577-PQudkN84UwP2.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 3523, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2562, 'Transformers Generation 1', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2268.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Fleeing from the war that has raged on the planet Cybertron for millions of years, the heroic Autobots led by Optimus Prime encounter a surprise attack by the evil Decepticons led by Megatron. The ensuing melee aboard the Autobot ship ends when the ship crashes on a volcano. Four million years later, an earthquake reactivates the ship`s computer and resurrects both the Autobots and Decepticons, resuming the great war of the Transformers.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-09-17', 2268, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:21', NULL, 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 98, 2526, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2563, 'Ganbare Genki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3213.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Horiguchi Genki was 5 years old boy. His mother died when he was born, and he was raised only by his father. His father, Shark Horiguchi, was a professional boxer, but he was ruined and become an itinerant boxer. However, Genki believed his father was strong and he would become a champion, and he had a dream to become a strong boxer as his father. 

After his father&rsquo;s death, he was adopted by his grandparents. Although they opposed Genki boxing, Genki made up his mind to become a boxer, and he continued training secretly. Meeting with various people, for example, Teacher Ashikiwa who resembles his mother, Mishima who is a high school boxing champion, he made his way to be a boxer. 

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Toei Animation', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-07-16', 3213, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:25', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3213-3s0c9Hf3x1Kb.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 35, 1166, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:25', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2564, 'Lady Georgie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2542-zhtI5nAS2hfv.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'An Australian farmer returns home from the woods with a baby named Georgie. The girl lives ignoring the terrible secret hidden in the golden bracelet on her hand. Her "Father" and Her "brothers", Abel and Arthur, love her dearly, but her "mother" considers her an intruder and doesn''t manage to open her heart to the girl. Georgie grows up into a beautiful young girl, and both her "brothers" are deeply in love with her. Not knowing the truth, Georgie eventually falls in love with the handsome grandson of the British Governor. When Mother finally reveals the truth to her and condemns the girl for being an exile''s daughter, Georgie leaves for Britain in search of her real parents - and for her love, who has also left Australia. Abel and Arthur follow her and the three are thrown into the cruel world of London aristocracy, lies and intrigues.', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-04-09', 2542, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:28', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2542-0ZXoGEotGEEc.jpg', 'Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 45, 3713, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2565, 'Space Adventure Cobra: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2452-i3EvWxRFphBI.png', 'movies', '6.9', 'Cobra, a notorious space pirate, is enlisted by bounty hunter Jane to rescue her sister from the strange being known as Crystal Boy, but then finds himself drawn into a complex struggle over the fate of a mysterious wandering planet.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1982', 'movie', 'released', '1982-07-03', 2452, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2452-MzFxvtcsDWKT.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 4333, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2566, 'Tomorrow''s Joe 2 the Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2922-LvUB8Ny8EHyw.png', 'movies', '6.9', 'Yabuki Joe is left downhearted and hopeless after a certain tragic event. In attempt to put the past behind him, Joe leaves the gym behind and begins wandering. His return home puts Joe back on the path to boxing, but unknown to himself and his trainer, he now suffers deep-set issues holding him back from fighting. In attempt to quell those issues, Carlos Rivera, a world renowned boxer is invited from Venezuela to help Joe recover.', NULL, '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-07-04', 2922, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2227, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2eSCseLlzjw', '2026-08-29 14:44:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2567, 'Crusher Joe: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2722-z9zqg2mEfGW4.jpg', 'movies', '6.9', 'Crushers: intergalactic Jacks-of-All-Trades who will take on any assignment for the right price. Crusher Joe heads a small team of these outer space troubleshooters that includes the cyborg Talos, the beautiful Alfin, and the obligatory kid sidekick Ricky. A routine assignment escorting a cryogenically frozen heiress to a medical facility goes awry when the girl goes missing and Joe and his team are left holding the bag. It seems space pirates are trying to play the Crushers for patsies, but Joe doesn&rsquo;t take kindly to the setup and tracks the pirates to their home world. The four heroes not only have to rescue their human cargo but take down the pirates in the process, which involves a heck of a lot of space dogfights, explosions, and good old-fashioned hand-to-hand combat. 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Sunrise', '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-03-12', 2722, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2722-pTgnnshWInBm.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 4830, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2568, 'Tokimeki Tonight', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3125-WGdWNr44dg2E.png', 'series', '6.9', 'The main character, Ranze, is a junior high girl with troubles: her father is a vampire and her mother is a werewolf. Ranze has yet to manifest her supernatural powers, and her parents are beginning to get worried she might be normal. So begins the fantasy romantic comedy story.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Group TAC', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-07', 3125, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:37', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3125-o60Jgc8mymmH.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 34, 4637, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2569, 'Aura Battler Dunbine', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx929-JfJS6SsLNF4B.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Pulled into the mystical word of Byston Well from Japan after an accident, Show Zama is recruited with others by Lord Drake Luft to pilot his newest weapons. These Aura Battlers are a combination of Byston Well magic and Earthien technology. Marvel approaches Show during battle and convinces him of Luft’s sinister intentions.

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'Sunrise', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-02-05', 929, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/929-taFPFB4F2Ab8.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 7197, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Km1kVJ-zf3k', '2026-08-29 14:44:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2570, 'Kinnikuman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3272.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Kinnikuman is a superhero... a bad one. The one day a person named Meat tells Kinnikuman that he is the prince of an alien planet. Kinnikuman must save the day numerous times fighting evil chiyojins and competing in tournaments to prove himself to his family and to gain respect and money.', 'Toei Animation', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-04-03', 3272, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:15', '2026-09-03 16:27:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3272-z7ZhilwbvrKi.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 137, 4012, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2571, 'Astro Boy (1980)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx3044-SrS7Q0Y0v38J.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Creating a robotic boy in the image of his recently deceased son Tobio, Professor Tenma thought nothing could go wrong now that his beloved child had been "reborn"... that is, until he comes to realize that this invention could never replace his son. Before long, however, the robot is kidnapped and spirited away to a robot circus in America, where he is soon rescued by Dr. Ochanomizu, and taken into his care. Tobio is given the new name Tetsuwan Atom, and transforms into Japan''s crime-fighting hero, although his anti-violent pacifist views and overall childlike naivety tend to clash with his battles often.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tezuka Productions', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-10-01', 3044, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:27:43', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n3044-oLvIoG7Y5oD0.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 52, 4568, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:27:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2572, 'Fantastic Adventures of Unico', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2427-EnOgIGEFnhMo.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'Unico the Unicorn has the amazing power to make anyone he meets happy. Whether it''s because of his personality or the powers of his horn, no one knows. However, the gods become jealous of Unico, thinking that only gods should be able to decide or let people be happy or not. Unico is banished to the Hill of Oblivion, and the West Wind is ordered to take him there. She can''t stand giving this fate to an innocent like Unico, so Unico''s adventures begin, as the West Wind takes him from one place and time to the next, in a neverending journey to escape the wrath of the gods. In this adventure, Unico meets Beezel a devil child and then Katy (Chao), a cat who wants to be a witch! Can he become friends with them?

(Source: AniDB)', 'MADHOUSE', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-03-14', 2427, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:28:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2427-TKobOVdPFDbS.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 2993, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:28:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2573, 'Plawres Sanshirou', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1873-W5uXjCe7czv9.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Plawres is a wrestling game that the players make their robots, which are about 30 cm tall, fight in the ring. The main character, Sugata Sanshiro, is a plawres player. Using his plawrestler, Juohmaru, he beats strong rivals.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Kaname Production', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-06-05', 1873, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:32:30', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1873-Wh8jzD7q0TbN.jpg', 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 37, 1332, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2574, 'Star Blazers: The Bolar Wars', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1652-XyonpdSstJsc.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'A stray missile from a confrontation between the Galman empire and the Bolar Federation crashes into the sun, turning it into a time bomb of radiation. The Star Force once again sets off into space, this time on a quest to look for a new world for the human race.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Douga', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-10-11', 1652, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:32:38', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1652-EY9g1D2yl1ZA.jpg', 'Drama, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 2397, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:32:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2575, 'Heavy Metal L-Gaim', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2598-cnuraEHNmj4x.png', 'series', '6.8', 'In the Pentagona System, a young man by the name of Daba Myroad leads a rebellion against Pentagona''s leader, Oldna Poseidal. Daba''s not alone however, meeting a large number of allies along his journey and having in his possession the powerful L-Gaim, a white Heavy Metal left to him by his father.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Sunrise', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-02-04', 2598, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:33:13', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2598-NYxSdlAruuZt.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 54, 4199, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2576, 'Mahou no Yousei Persia', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2039-AxPNFZieeyLi.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Pelsia, a cute ten-year-old girl who grew up among the animals in Africa, is taken back to Japan. She is transported to a magic world where she is given a headband which creates a baton which transforms her into a pretty sixteen-year-old girl with various outfits. She also has three cute magical pets to advise her along with her pet lion from Africa, now transformed into a talking plush toy.

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-07-06', 2039, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:22:37', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2039-1vSA58yaNVTu.jpg', 'Comedy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 48, 1892, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:22:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2577, 'Cat''s Eye Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx146310-ZqQepwwerJgT.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Together, Hitomi, Rui and Ai are Cat’s Eye, the greatest art thieves Japan has ever known. But they don’t steal for money or fame - they do it in the hopes of finding their father, a great painter who went missing after World War II. While they’re off searching for him in Europe, a new female thief claiming to be Cat’s Eye starts wreaking havoc in Tokyo! She steals anything she can get her hands on, and her brutal methods are putting the lives of the police at risk... It’s time for the real Cat’s Eye to head back to Japan and bring her reign of terror to an end! 

(Source: Discotek)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-10-08', 146310, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:23:36', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'TV', 'FALL', 37, 1639, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2578, 'Little Pollon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3136-YEwZ0jJZ4Nyd.png', 'series', '6.8', 'Anime about the funny lives of the Greek gods up on Mount Olympus. Polon is the naughty daughter of Apollo. With her little cherub friend Eros, she interferes in various comical ways as she tries to show that she is fit to be a goddess. Her activities often misfire, getting her in trouble with some deity or other and causing chaos for gods and humans. Feeling neglected by her godly parent, she often assists him in his woman-chasing in the hopes of getting a new mommy.', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-05-08', 3136, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:23:46', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3136-RdmOOXQJLaQr.jpg', 'Comedy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 46, 1362, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2579, 'Urusei Yatsura Movie 1: Only You', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1920-CKOf0o7efVqF.jpg', 'movies', '6.8', 'Lum doesn''t need much assistance going ballistic when everyone in Tomobiki gets an invitation to Ataru''s wedding -- and she''s not listed as the bride! It seems that some 11 years ago, Ataru played "Shadow Tag" with a young girl named Elle and won. Unfortunately, Elle was yet another Alien Princess; and on her planet, if a boy steps on a girl''s shadow, they have to marry. 

When Elle''s emissary comes to make arrangements, Lum redefines the term "the atmosphere was electric," but to no avail: a force-field now protects Ataru from her high voltage love-zaps. Lum''s friend Benten suggests a pre-emptive wedding, and they proceed to abduct Ataru and all of the wedding guests, and the stage is set for the shotgun wedding of all time!

(Source: AniDB)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-02-13', 1920, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:23:49', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1920-9iGPJXNC0iZT.jpg', 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 5131, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:23:49', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2580, 'Ninja Hattori-kun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4936.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'Ninja Hattori-Kun and his brother are training to be great ninjas and constantly run into hilarious situations.', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-09-28', 4936, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:24:00', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV_SHORT', 'FALL', 694, 3761, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2581, 'Star Musketeer Bismark', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2361-sCJBIIT8LZXY.png', 'series', '6.7', 'In the distant future, humanity has explored beyond Earth and colonized both the inner and outer planets of the Solar System. In order to protect the colonies and maintain law and order in the solar system, the Earth Federation Government (EFG) was created. Soon, many settlers started to resent the EFG''s and its sphere of influence, straining the relationship between the central government and the colonies.

While a strained peace was being forged between Earth and the colonies, a race of non-human creatures known as Deathcula invaded the System. Without provocation, they attacked the colonies and killed many of the colonists. The EFG quickly realized that the Deathcula were technologically superior and their forces were hopelessly matched. In order to have a chance at survival, Dr. Charles Louvre developed a transformable starship known as the Bismarck.

Knowing that an advanced team of specialists were required to operate the Bismarck, four individuals came together and were charged with keeping the outer colonies safe from further Deathcula attacks.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-10-07', 2361, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:24:03', NULL, 'Action, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 1952, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2582, 'Galaxy Cyclone Braiger', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4240.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'In the year 2111, the solar system has been colonized. The colonized moons and planets are lawless and the police are helpless. In order to battle the evil within the solar system, Isaac Godonov creates J9, made up of himself, Jotaro Kido, Steven Bowie, and Angel Omachi. They are a team that will handle any missions the police will not with their robot Braiger... for a price.

(Source: Anime News Network, modified)', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-10-06', 4240, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:24:09', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4240-58qm5soIXVq6.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 39, 1785, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2583, 'Space Warrior Baldios', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1737-Kto0TF8t1gBw.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Marin Reigan lost his father and his home when Gattler staged a coup, forcing their people to abandon their dying planet and invade another. Seeking vengeance, Marin pursued. But when he saw the world they planned to invade, Marin found a new mission: to protect the untarnished skies and seas of that blue planet--Earth!

The battle will not be easy. Marin''s technology is the only thing that can stand against Gattler''s forces. But the Earthlings are not quick to trust him, and the ruthless enemy commander Aphrodia is hungry for vengeance of her own. Can Marin gain the Earthlings'' trust, avenge his father, and stop the war? 

(Source: Discotek Media)

Note: Originally planned and scripted for 39 episodes, the series was cancelled with various reasons cited including lack of anime magazine coverage and constant airtime changes. The 31st and last episode to air was actually produced as episode 32. Three unaired completed episodes (31, 33, 34) were later released on LaserDisc/DVD/Blu-ray, and the finished scripts and storyboards for the final 5 episodes had been shared in various magazines and a deluxe book.', 'Ashi Productions', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-06-30', 1737, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:24:16', NULL, 'Adventure, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 34, 1779, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2584, 'Tomorrow''s Joe: The Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2920-7rvrEGt2PODe.png', 'movies', '6.7', 'A summary movie of the first season for people to get reminded on what happened before the airing of the second season.', 'Mushi Production', '1980', 'movie', 'released', '1980-03-08', 2920, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:24:26', NULL, 'Action, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 2683, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2585, 'Aishite Knight', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2221-oCptOvuZ7PmC.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Yaeko Mitamura is an 18 year old girl working in her father''s Okonomiyaki restaurant. One day Yakko casually meets a little boy, Hashizo and his odd cat Juliano. Hashizo has lost both parents when still a baby and has been brought up by his elder brother. Hashizo''s brother Go Kato is the lead singer of the emerging rock band "Bee Hive". When Yakko meets Go and his friend and "Bee Hive" member Satomi Okawa an unexpected series of events unfolds. Love, jealousy, rock''n roll and the sparkle of newly borned stars is what makes this anime so lovable.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-03-01', 2221, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:24:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2221-sBbkHuUPcYVS.jpg', 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 42, 2813, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:24:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2586, 'Tsurikichi Sanpei', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3137-uWbwNUazQS65.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'Mihira Sanpei talks with a Tohou accent and is a down-to-earth boy with a cheerful and optimistic personality. However, when it comes to fishing, he becomes very serious and is a youth who enjoys fishing more than anything else. The village where he lives in is a natural environment which provides different kinds of fishing challenges. Despite his lack of experience, Sanpei has a first-rate sense with regards to fishing and decides to maxmise his potential by entering into different fishing contests. As he faces various challenges, he learns to solve difficult problems and learn from his mistakes to the extent that he is able to fish anything out of the waters. Along the way, he encounters all kinds of rivals and companions who increase his experience points and help him in his growth.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-04-07', 3137, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:25:26', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3137-TUhnEGe45NhN.jpg', 'Adventure, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 109, 2120, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2587, 'Space Battleship Yamato - Final Chapter', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3072-IrYBKIlNGPaT.jpg', 'movies', '6.7', 'The year is 2203, not long after the Bolar Federation was defeated by Desslok''s Galman-Gamilon Empire. A subspace dimensional dislocation has caused a distant Red Galaxy to be relocated in a collision course with the Milky Way. Stars and planets collide, making a wreck of the Galman-Gamilon homeworld. The Star Force is dispatched to investigate. They reach Galmania to find Desslok''s palace in ruins.

As they pay their respects, tossing white roses down to the surface of the planet, a huge red planet crashes into Galmania, forcing to StarForce to escape with an immediate and uncalculated warp.

(Source: AniDB)

Note: The 35mm cut for the film has a runtime of 152 minutes. While the 70mm extended cut is 163 minutes long and once held the record for the longest theatrical animated film in the world for 36 years.<i/>', NULL, '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-03-19', 3072, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:25:43', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3072-20jDTjy6epoJ.jpg', 'Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 1802, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2588, 'Shiroi Kiba White Fang Monogatari', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5933-aSMH32Ujh6Eu.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'White Fang is born on the planes of Alaska to a wolf father and a half-wolf, half-dog mother. One day he and his mother run into an Alaskan inuit boy Mit-sah, who has long dreamed of a dog of his own, and by a marvellous twist of fate, the wolves are taken in by him and his father. But life in Alaska is harsh for humans and wolves alike, and as winter comes, hardships lie in waiting for White Fang and Mit-sah. Facing the extreme coldness of their habitat and that of humans'' greedy hearts, the two journey towards what they hope to be a happier environment.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-05-05', 5933, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:25:50', NULL, 'Adventure', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 726, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:25:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2589, 'Moero Arthur: Hakuba no Ouji', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b4614-Hvwy9GbpPjaQ.jpg', 'series', '6.7', NULL, NULL, '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-04-06', 4614, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:17', '2026-09-03 16:26:13', NULL, 'Adventure', 'TV', 'SPRING', 22, 525, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:26:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2590, 'Fairy Princess Minky Momo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx518-wOLKHgeKCJvj.png', 'series', '6.6', 'Momo is a little girl who lives with her parents. She is from the land of dreams sent to earth to help people not lose their dreams. Momo and her parents own and run a hotel. Momo lives in Fenarinarsa which is near earth''s space to help people who lost dreams. She uses her ability to change herself or something into various things.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Ashi Productions', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-03-18', 518, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:33:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/518-VIYAridDDobP.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SPRING', 63, 4770, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:33:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2591, 'Katri', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3162-91KVah5tQXGw.png', 'series', '6.6', 'This series tells the story of 9 year-old Katri, a  girl who lives on a farm in Finland with her grandparents. Katri''s mother has been away in Germany for three years.  The farm is not doing well, so to help support her family, she goes to work on a neighboring farm. Katri faces many struggles and challenges.', 'Nippon Animation', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-01-08', 3162, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:36:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3162-Ew8n143Ulz9J.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 1794, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:36:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2592, 'Lucy-May of the Southern Rainbow', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2573-TIj8OKZ65g1h.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Lucy''s family moves from England to Australia planning to run a big farm. Starting a new life proves to be full of frustrations. Their agonizing days of despair continue until they finally obtain their farmland. However, Lucy and her sisters enjoy a range of new experiences such as discovering exotic animals and meeting with aborigines and other new people.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Nippon Animation', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-01-10', 2573, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:40:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2573-7DidlDW0xZPc.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 1242, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2593, 'Ohayou! Spank', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2912-ruRDeiKzm19X.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Morimura Aiko is a junior high school student who is short for her age. Her father went on a yacht ten years ago and his whereabouts remained in obscurity. Her mother, a designer for hats, left for Paris, leaving Aiko in the care of her uncle, Mr Fujinami. Aiko had a pet dog, Papi, but it died in a car accident. Around the same time, another dog, Spank, appears before her. Having gone through so many unfortunate events in her life, Spank''s presence begins to brighten up Aiko''s life and put a smile on her face.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-03-07', 2912, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:38:15', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2912-pOh1VBGHHyyh.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 63, 1006, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2594, 'Queen Millennia Movie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1549.jpg', 'movies', '6.6', 'AD 1999, the Earth was in a critical situation; a planet Lar Metal was approaching to the Earth. Meanwhile, Yukino Yayoi was heard about Lar Metal from Dr. Amamori of Tokyo Observatory. She was a junior high school teacher, but she also worked for Dr. Amamori who appreciated her astronomical knowledge. Actually Yukino Yayoi was Queen Millennia who had come from Lar Metal 1000 years before, and she had been watching human beings since then.

Soon, numerous meteors fell on the Earth, and people were in panic. In this catastrophe, Hajime, who was a student of Yayoi, came to help Yayoi. Yayoi invited him into a big cave under the ground.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', 'Toei Animation', '1982', 'movie', 'released', '1982-03-13', 1549, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:40:01', NULL, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 2058, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:40:01', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2595, 'Golgo 13: The Professional', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b1760-PmH18u0MQNPB.jpg', 'movies', '6.6', 'After assassinating the son of business tycoon Leonard Dawson, Golgo 13 finds himself prey to the CIA and the U.S. Army, whom Dawson has personally hired to kill the assassin. As days pass by, Dawson slowly loses his sanity as he continues to plot every attempt to kill Golgo 13 even without caring about who hired the assassin to kill his son.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-05-28', 1760, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:39:36', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1760-yg3ToxFd2qus.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 7532, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:36', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2596, 'Gauche the Cellist', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1049-xHBQFAuKiK94.jpg', 'movies', '6.6', 'The story concerns Gauche, a professional cellist. During rehearsals for a performance, he is scolded by the conductor because his playing is not good enough. His timing is off and he seems to have no "feel" for the music.

Gauche returns to his lonely cottage and starts practicing. Then a cat enters who tricks him into understanding the inner meaning of the music. The importance of practice is shown by a cuckoo, rhythm by a badger and tenderness by a mouse. In four days he learns the true meaning and feeling of music and develops into a great musician.

Laced with popular classical music this special combines fun and inspiration for all ages and audiences.

(Source: AnimeNfo, edited)', 'Oh! Production', '1982', 'movie', 'released', '1982-01-23', 1049, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:34:41', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1049-QA71Y1IPLoTC.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Music', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 6231, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:34:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2597, 'Belle and Sebastian', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3836.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'After befriending a white Pyrenees dog he names Belle, Sebastian sets out on a journey to find the mother he knows is still alive.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-04-07', 3836, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:00:42', NULL, 'Adventure', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 1512, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:00:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2598, 'The White Whale of Mu', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4933-eOYkz2Fz2f8y.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'This series has nothing to do with Moby Dick. In fact, it was the first series by TMS that was not based on any original work. The story: In ancient times, the continents of Atlantis and Mu fought a war, and Atlantis lost. After losing the war, Atlantis transformed itself into a small planet and timeslipped to the present-day to try to take over the world again. But five warriors from Mu assemble on Easter Island, and together with giant cyborg white whale that houses the brain of the ancient queen of Mu, fight Atlantis off at various famous ruins around the world.', NULL, '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-04-04', 4933, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:00:45', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 986, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:00:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2599, 'Galactic Whirlwind Sasuraiger', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4244.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'It is 2911 and the solar system is made up of of 50 planets. I.C Blues, a gambler, makes a bet with the boss of a criminal syndicate known as Bloody God that it is possible to navigate the whole solar system in one year. Helping out Blues is J9-III, made up of Rock, Beat, and Birdy. To clear any obstcles, they have the transforming train-robot Sasuraiger. But the Bloody Syndicate will do anything to ensure the Blues loses the bet.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-04-05', 4244, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:00:48', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Mecha', 'TV', 'SPRING', 43, 924, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:00:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2600, 'Little Women', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4132.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'In the United States, the Civil War has just broken and Mr March, a physician and father of four daughters, went to the front. Madam March remains alone with her four daughters: the eldest Margaret (Meg), Josephine (Jo) budding writer, a real boy failed, Elisabeth (Beth), the timid passionate piano, and the latest addition, Amy, who loves to draw. The four girls will quickly get to know their neighbor Mr. Lawrence, which they had a little scared at first, but also to his grandson Laurie who at the age of Jo. Together, they go through many hardships, more or less happy, the furies of Aunt March, jealousies, the joys and the war in fabric background, hoping that their father will come back safe and sound ...

(Source: Planete Jeunesse)', 'Kokusai Eigasha', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-04-07', 4132, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:00:51', NULL, 'Drama', 'TV', 'SPRING', 26, 616, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:00:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2601, 'Jarinko Chie', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx3946-VTArQe4ZAdrH.jpg', 'movies', '6.6', 'Jarinko Chie is a movie directed by Takahata in 1981. Based on the very popular manga by Etsumi Haruki, it is about ten year old Chie, "the most unfortunate girl in Japan," who manages her family diner while her unemployed yakuza father and her mother are separated. This sounds really depressing, but it''s actually a very funny comedy. 

The story is set in Osaka, which has a totally different culture from Tokyo.', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-04-11', 3946, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:00:55', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3946-VHheQMYCfl3i.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 2336, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:00:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2602, 'The Wonderful Adventures of Nils Holgersson', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2151-WCFtJrFnrhB0.png', 'series', '6.6', 'Nils is a lazy and greedy boy whose mischief makes everyone miserable, whether it''s his parents, the animals on his farm, or the fairy-like tomte he captures one day. But he gets his comeuppance when the pint-sized tomte casts a spell to make Nils just as tiny as him! The only way to break the spell is to go on a journey to distant Lapland with Morten the farm goose, Carrot the hamster, and a flock of wild geese.

Along the way, he contends with cruel witches, talking statues, wise ravens, and one very persistent fox. Under the guidance of the stern but caring Captain Akka, leader of the flock, Nils discovers his kind heart and his love for nature. But when the time comes, will he be able to choose between his human family and his feathered friends?

(Source: Discotek Media)', 'Studio Pierrot', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-01-08', 2151, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:00:58', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2151-PSCkl1pkMiO8.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'WINTER', 52, 2271, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:00:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2603, 'Hello! Sandybell', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2799.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Sandybell is a playful girl from Scotland. She is happy even if her mum died when she was little. Past secrets begin to reveal after Sandybell gets a white lily from a rich lady. After a tragic act Sandybell moves to London where she is trying to find clues to her past.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-03-06', 2799, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:02', NULL, 'Adventure, Romance', 'TV', 'SPRING', 47, 1701, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2604, 'Alps Stories: My Annette', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2546-wnryAvUfCAEq.png', 'series', '6.6', 'Annette was born into a poor family in Switzerland. 

She is a sweet girl and takes good care of her little brother Dannie. Lucien is her best friend. 

One day, Lucien angrily slaps Dannie''s Ermine, which develops into a limp. 

The happy days turn into a long period of suffering, but little by little Annette and Lucien regain their lost friendship.', 'Nippon Animation', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-01-09', 2546, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:06', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2546-BPiHA3HWKcnw.jpg', 'Drama, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 48, 1620, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2605, 'Shin Dokonjou Gaeru', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx126865-1bQOEHkKKbwq.jpg', 'series', '6.6', NULL, 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-09-07', 126865, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:09', NULL, 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'FALL', 30, 306, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:09', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2606, 'God Mars', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3399.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'In the year 1999, humanity begins to advance beyond the solar system. The leader of the planet Gishin, Emperor Zule, aims to conquer the galaxy and ends up in a conflict with Earth as a result. In an act aimed to eliminate the Earth, he sends a baby named Mars to live among humanity. Mars is accompanied by Gaia, a giant robot that utilizes a new power source strong enough to destroy an entire planet. Once Mars grows up, he will destroy the Earth by activating the bomb within Gaia. However, upon arriving on Earth, Mars is adopted into a Japanese family and given the name Takeru. Seventeen years later, Takeru has grown a love for humanity and he refuses to detonate the bomb as ordered by Zule. However, the bomb within Gaia is set to explode if Takeru were ever to die, which would ultimately result in the Earth''s destruction.

Takeru possesses psychic powers (ESP) and decides to join the Earth defense forces and becomes a member of the Crasher Squad (an elite space defense force) where he and his friends take a stand against the Gishin attack.

Unknown to the Gishin, five other robots were created in secrecy along side Gaia by Takeru''s father and sent with Gaia to protect Takeru. The five other robots are Sphinx, Uranus, Titan, Shin and Ra. Whenever Earth is in danger, Takeru is able to summon the five other robots to combine with Gaia form the giant robot Godmars.', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-10-02', 3399, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:13', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n3399-NCinK3Y7DoGz.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 64, 1480, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2607, 'Genesis Climber Mospeada', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3670-gZaTpO3nsAMh.png', 'series', '6.5', 'The story takes place in the 21st century. Due to the fact that pollution was becoming a major problem, scientists had developed the use of hydrogen fuel called "HBT" as an alternative to fossil fuels. At this time humans have colonized Mars in search of new place to call home as a result of overpopulation. In the year 2050, a mysterious alien race called the Inbit invaded the Earth. Unable to fight the Inbits, Earth became desolate with only a few pockets of human beings scattered throughout the planet. Many of the refugees escape aboard a few remaining shuttles to seek shelter on the Moon. The Inbit set up their main base of operations in the Great Lakes area of North America called "Reflex Point".

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Artmic', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-10-02', 3670, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3670-amBVGAOvKGm8.jpg', 'Action, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 3328, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2608, 'GoShogun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2510-8mBXm44tEWw0.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'A meteor strikes the Earth and is found to emanate a powerful new energy called Beamler, which is used to power a battle robot, GoShogun, and a teleporting fortress, Good Thunder. The Docougar Crime Syndicate, lead by crime lord Neo Neros, try to steal the secret of the energy from the inventor of GoShogun, but he kills himself rather than let them acquire it. His son is targeted by Neo Neros next, but he is taken in by the crew aboard Good Thunder, who travel the world fighting NeoNeros''s forces with GoShogun. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Ashi Productions', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-07-03', 2510, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:20', NULL, 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 26, 1932, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2609, 'Be Forever Yamato', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3069-itU5r69psuDy.jpg', 'movies', '6.5', 'The Black Nebula Empire attacks Earth and threatens to blow up the planet with a bomb they placed on Earth if counter attacked. Earths hopes rest on the Yamato crew as they go to the Black Nebula Planet and try to find a way to difuse the bomb before it''s too late.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1980', 'movie', 'released', '1980-08-02', 3069, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:24', NULL, 'Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 1769, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2610, 'Urashiman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2933-yGgn0Udwm3fm.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'In 1983, a young man on the run from the police finds himself mysteriously transported to the year 2050. With no memories and newly developed superhuman powers, he finds himself recruited by the Neo Tokyo Mobile Police Unit to help them take down a vicious crime syndicate known as Necrime. But will this man, now known as Ryu Urashima, be able to take down the Necrime and find his way back to the past? Or will he be trapped in the future forever?

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-01-09', 2933, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:27', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2933-K0aIQkRYsqiG.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 1388, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2611, 'Galactic Gale Baxingar', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4242.jpg', 'series', '6.5', '600 years ago, J9 roared through the Solar System to fight evil and get rich. Now things are worse than ever, as lawlessness threatens to overcome the fragile ruling government and an alien fleet from outer space arrives to upset the balance even more. Amid the chaos, old friends Digo and Schutecken found the Cosmo Rangers, an updated J9, to combat crime in the asteroid belt and beyond. But even with talented members like Billy the Shot, Jumping Sama, and Lila the Immortal Butterfly, they quickly get in over their heads as their group expands to the size of an army and they become the guardians of a crumbling government.

(Source: Discotek)', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-07-06', 4242, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:31', NULL, 'Mecha', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 39, 973, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2612, 'Captain (TV)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b9905-OuancermINlz.png', 'series', '6.5', 'The original is an impressive sports manga featuring not heroes, but common boys, and the story depicts the growth of Sumiya 2 junior high school baseball team (the successive captains and players) in downtown Tokyo. Takao Taniguchi, who was a substitute player of the second team of Aoba Gakuin, a prestigious junior high school in the baseball world, but he transferred to Sumiya 2 and he became the captain of the baseball club. After steady training, the team try to do a final game in the regional preliminaries, against Aoba Gakuin.', 'Eiken', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-01-10', 9905, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:35', NULL, 'Sports', 'TV', 'WINTER', 26, 526, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2613, 'Attacker You!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3081-AImZL1q06D1v.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Attacker You! is the story of ambitious and energetic 13-year-old junior high schoolgirl You Hazuki (variously known as "Mila," "Jeanne" or "Juana" in Western dubbed versions of the anime), who moves to Tokyo from Osaka to live with her father Toshihiko, a cameraman recently returned from Peru, and attend school. You''s mother is not in the picture, having left when You was very young. Also living with You and her father is her younger brother Sunny, who is very attached to his older sister and tends to follow her everywhere she goes, including to school and to her volleyball matches. You is also curious about Kyushi Tajima, the pretty blonde woman whom she sees covering volleyball games on television, and about why her father becomes very angry whenever You mentions her.

You is passionate about volleyball and dreams of one day being a part of Japan''s national women''s volleyball team in the 1988 Seoul Olympics. She joins her school''s girls'' volleyball team and quickly becomes one of the top players, although her coach (who is also her homeroom teacher) is brutal and literally slaps his players around when they don''t live up to his expectations. You begins a tumultuous friendship with former school volleyball champ and former arch-rival Nami Hayase (French name: "Peggy"), which comes to a head when the two girls join opposing professional teams. She also develops a crush on So Takiki, the captain of the Hikawa boys'' volleyball team (known as "Shiro," "Serge" or "Sergio" in various Western versions), and puts as much effort into trying to win his heart as she does into her game.', 'Knack Productions', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-04-13', 3081, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:38', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3081-jmKvYm1xfKRD.jpg', 'Romance, Sports', 'TV', 'SPRING', 58, 2611, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2614, 'Gu-Gu Ganmo', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3020-5IFGHXGrOUkq.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'One morning in the Tsukuda household, Hanpeita''s sister, Tsukune, lets his pet bird escape out of spite. On the way home from school, she finds a strange egg from another planet and brings it home to give her brother, in order to make up for her earlier mistake. However, he isn''t too pleased with it.

Not too long after, the egg swells up, cracks its shell, and out comes a pink, strange chicken-like alien creature named Ganmo! He speaks like a human being and comes to live with the Tsukudas. Not wanting to be a mere freeloader, Ganmo takes the initiative to run errands, clean the house, and do other menial chores, yet he blunders at everything he does. Everytime Ganmo tries to clear his reputation his efforts end up causing even more confusion.

A charming young, purple-haired girl named Ayumi Ichigaya moves next door to the Tsukudas. She has a strange pet myna bird named Déjà Vu. It''s foppish with a poisonous tongue and always teases Ganmo for being so odd-looking.

And so begin the messed up daily lives of young Hanpeita and his new pet.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Toei Animation', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-03-18', 3020, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:41', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 642, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2615, 'The♥Kabocha Wine', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3159-rHQnUe7czWUx.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Transfer student, Aoba Shunsuke, arrived at Sunshine School only to find the premises empty. He was secretly gleeful to be the first to reach the school, oblivious to the fact that it was Foundation Day and a rest day for the institution. At that moment, a big-sized "L"(Eru) beauty by the name of Natsumi appeared before him and the two of them hit off together even though Shunsuke was so much smaller than her. Shunsuke''s mother runs a women''s apparel business but the shop is in need of manpower. 

Shunsuke offers to help out at the shop but fumbles a lot because he does not know how to interact with the ladies. Eru decides to step in and help out around the shop and this pleases Shunsuke''s mother. This is a romance story that shares the joys and woes of the "SL" combination between Shunsuke and Eru.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-07-05', 3159, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:18', '2026-09-03 16:01:45', NULL, 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 95, 1777, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2616, 'Superkid (1983)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/11595.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Mitsuo encountered Superman, an alien who is a part of a federation that tries to maintain peace in the galaxy. He then received a helmet (that also serves as a mask) that gives superhuman strength, a cape that enables the wearer to fly, and a badge that allows him to breathe underwater and communicate with his fellow comrades whom he met soon after he utilized these gifts. Superman made it clear to all Permans that their identity must be kept a secret or their brain will be destroyed should it ever be revealed and they are given a special doppelganger robot that can replace them while they are away to achieve this feat, although it is not entirely foolproof nor is it free from potential problems. These equipments then allowed them to be young Permans who try to maintain peace and help the people who are in need.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Shin-Ei Animation', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-04-04', 11595, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:01:48', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV_SHORT', 'SPRING', 526, 1715, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2617, 'The Star of Cottonland', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1207-YMCmETpgZhkC.jpg', 'movies', '6.5', 'After two-month-old kitten Chibi-neko is abandoned by her former owners, she is found by 18-year-old Tokio. Although his mother is allergic to cats and has a great fear of them, she agrees to let him keep the kitten because she fears he is becoming too withdrawn after failing his university entrance exams. Chibi-neko soon falls in love with Tokio.

In her own mind, Chibi-neko is a small human who speaks in human words, although people only ever seem to hear her meow, and she believes that all humans were once kittens like her. A stray cat tells Chibi-neko of a paradise called Cottonland, where dreams can come true.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Mushi Production', '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-02-11', 1207, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:01:52', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1207-qOw6U7QNhB9a.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 3510, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:52', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2618, 'Ulysses 31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b2331-240yHFHhjinJ.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'It is the thirty-first century. Ulysses killed the giant Cyclops when he rescued the children and his son, Telemachus. 

But the ancient gods of Olympus are angry and threaten a terrible revenge: Ulysses is sentenced to travel through the universe of Olympus with a frozen crew on a quest to find the Kingdom of Hades. Only when he has found the Kingdom of Hades will his crew be free of their curse and he will be able to return to Earth and to his beloved Penelope.

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-10-03', 2331, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:01:55', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2331-o8YJ8DSMnWtZ.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 2273, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2619, 'Tongari Boushi no Memole', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3754-RP5ACc7zQrm7.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Memoru is one of 245 people who came to earth from the Riruru Star when their ship had an emergency crash-landing on earth. Memoru''s people have such tiny bodies that they could stand on a human''s palm. One day she hears lovely music, and she follows its source and comes upon a huge house she hasn''t seen before to find a girl taller than her playing on the piano. Memoru visited her again secretly with her friends Popitu, Rupangu, and Pi, but the human girl, Marielle, seemed sick and likely to die any moment. Feeling sad for the girl, Memoru''s tear drops on the girl''s lips. The girl gets better and a strong friendship starts between them.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-03-03', 3754, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:01:59', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/3754-dWdbh4QZrXlo.jpg', 'Fantasy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 1516, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:01:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2620, 'Saikyou Robot Daioja', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4574-Glm3px9KudCB.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'This is the story of Mito Mitsukuni in mecha style. Prince of the Edon Star, Edward Mito begins a trip to the galaxy with his servant Baron Kalkus, Duke Skead and the ninja girl Shinobu. Under the false identity of Bocchan, Suke and Kaku they help the oppressed people and fight with the super robot Daioja.', 'Sunrise', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-01-31', 4574, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:02:02', NULL, 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 50, 660, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:02:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2621, 'Nanako SOS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3619.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Nana, is a young girl who unexpectedly acquires supernatural powers and at the same time loses her past memory. By accident, a scientific genius called Marlow, is present when she acquires her powers. Marlow is an industrious high school boy with extraordinary ambitions. He talks to Nana into joining his detective agency by promising to help her regain her memory. Nana innocently believes him, but Marlow''s real intent is to use her powers to benefit his agency and himself.

The story unfolds as Nana encounters a variety of dangerous missions and mysterious events, but her natural sunny disposition helps her through all the incidents as she solves each mystery one after the other.

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-04-02', 3619, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:02:06', NULL, 'Comedy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 39, 1068, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:02:06', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2622, 'Armored Fleet Dairugger XV', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3609.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'In the original storyline as aired in Japan, Dairugger XV was simply an exploration robot, as well as an intended peace-keeping force. The Earth is in a time of prosperity. The president of the Terran League (the "Galaxy Alliance" in Voltron) launches a mission to explore beyond the galaxy. After commencing its mission of exploration, the starship Rugger-Guard is attacked by a ship of the Galbeston Empire. Dairugger, the super robot, is deployed in order to defend the Earth. It is somewhat by fate that they must help the people of Galbeston find a new planet before it explodes, and liberate it from its despotic Emperor. In the Japanese version, it does not have anything to do with King of the Beasts GoLion, as opposed to the U.S. version, Voltron: Defender of the Universe.

There are three assault team units: Land, Air, and Sea. There are a total of 15 parts referred to as "Rugger," which can combine together to form the super-robot Dairugger. The design of the 15 separate Rugger units came from the sport of rugby, since 15 players are required to form a rugby union. The U.S. version would rename the "Galbeston Empire" to "Drule Empire," along with editing a fair amount of violence and sexual content to keep the show safe for general audience broadcast.

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-03-03', 3609, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:02:10', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 1024, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:02:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2623, 'Kaibutsu-kun (1980)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3130.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Kaibutsu-kun and his companions, Dracula, Wolfman, and Franken, travel from Kaibutsu Land to the Human Realm, where they encounter and battle several monsters, mainly assassins from the demon group Demonish.

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-09-02', 3130, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:02:14', NULL, 'Comedy, Horror', 'TV', 'FALL', 94, 778, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:02:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2624, 'Space Emperor God Sigma', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4183.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'The year is 2050 and an energy crisis is Earth''s main concern. A brilliant scientist in Trinity City develops the Trinity energy, a new source of energy powerful enough to supply the entire world. The alien empire of the Elda learn of this energy and plot to seize it by force. They attack Earth''s space colony on Jupiter''s moon of Io and occupy it. Meanwhile, the Trinity energy has been applied to three giant robots that combine to form God Sigma, a mighty robot led by martial artist-turned-pilot Dantou Shiya. With its mighty sword, it now stands between the peace of Earth and the power of the Elda forces. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Toei Animation', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-03-19', 4183, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:02:17', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4183-mWyCeItqoIel.jpg', 'Action, Mecha', 'TV', 'SPRING', 50, 847, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:02:17', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2625, 'Mahou Shoujo Lalabel', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3878.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'Lalabel is a magical girl who arrives in the Human world to stop an evil wizard from stealing various magical objects or items. As a magical girl, she has a kitty for a companion and a magic wand. Coincidentally, she lands on the doorstep of the Tachibana couple and lives in with them during her stay in the human world. She attends the local school and begins to learn about the different things in the human world.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-02-15', 3878, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:02:21', NULL, 'Comedy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'WINTER', 49, 1152, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:02:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2626, 'Panzer World Galient', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5153-AWKW1wR7XUIw.png', 'series', '6.4', 'Set in a far flung medieval-looking world of Arst, Prince Jordy Volder takes up the fight against the ambitions of the conqueror Marder. Jordy uses the legendary giant robot "panzer" Galient, which is one of many panzers that have been preserved underground for thousands of years. Using an army of advanced robot panzers, Marder is conquering all of Arst in preparation of his plan for dominance of the Crescent Galaxy.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-10-05', 5153, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:39:12', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5153-FRfUSTOc5F8j.jpg', 'Fantasy, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 2041, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2627, 'Manga Mitokoumon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b11829-YH77hK7coGgC.png', 'series', '6.4', 'Mitokomon is the empror''s trusted man with a high sense of justice. He is sent to travel around the country in order to observe the quality of life in each province and run a check on the official''s performances and report back to the empror. Along with him are sent two bodyguards, Kaiko (known for his extraordinary power) and Tsuke (known for his amazing swordsmanship). The three men, traveling unknown, face lots of adventure on their journey to bring justice to the citizens and eliminate corruption from the governing system.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-09-03', 11829, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:39:08', NULL, '', 'TV', 'FALL', 46, 451, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:39:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2628, 'Go Lion', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/1448.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Golion, a powerful sentient robot, abuses his great powers by attacking and killing creatures known as Deathblack Beastmen, boasting that no one could defeat him. A divine space being punishes Golion for his arrogance and abuse by seperating him into 5 different lion robots. In the year 1999, a group of 5 young men return to Earth after a space voyage, only to find it ravaged by nuclear war. After encountering the alien race known as the Galra, the 5 youths end up on the planet Altea, and learn that the 5 lion robots that Golion was split into are in hibernation in various parts of Altea. Somehow, they must reunite the lions and form Golion, the only hope for the human race.', 'Toei Animation', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-03-04', 1448, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:38:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1448-vnJZEKwZLnxy.jpg', 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 2935, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:38:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2629, 'Sea Prince and the Fire Child', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2029-DZm3iwKmvBRi.jpg', 'movies', '6.3', 'Gods once lived on earth, and two siblings, Oceanus - God of Water, and Hyperia - Goddess of Fire, lived in peace and dearly loved each other. However, the God of Wind, Algaroc, become jealous of the pair''s happiness, and spread lies and deceit between them until their hatred for each other brought about war. 

Finally, Algaroc was imprisoned by the King of Gods, but after that time, the brother and sister still despised each other, so the Children of Fire and Water forever remained apart. But, then Prince Syrius of the Water and Princess Malta of the Fire meet and fall in love. The love of Syrius and Malta may not be enough to surpass their parents'' hatred. Whether they can stay together forever may be impossible 

(Source: AniDB)', 'Sanrio', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-07-18', 2029, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:10', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2029-WoMFnYMDUYTT.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2479, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2630, 'Radio City Fantasy: Machikado no Märchen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx11221-1m1uCP08c3z9.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'A boy with a drawing book meets a mysterious girl in the streets of Tokyo. They become friends and enjoy each other''s fantasies.', NULL, '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-07-21', 11221, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:13', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11221-eASBCJ9zXLpc.jpg', 'Music, Romance', 'OVA', 'SUMMER', 1, 1958, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2631, 'OKAWARI-BOY Starzan S', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx8799-DdIoTOJJAxof.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'On planet Kirakira live two tribes: Senobi and Robot. Senobi, quiet and peacefully set, settle down in the forest. Robot comes from the desert and starts war to take control of afforested grounds. A young hero coming from Senobi tries to appease the whole situation.', NULL, '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-01-07', 8799, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:16', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 34, 451, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2632, 'Urusei Yatsura: Haru da, Tobidase!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx1481-2H06QluOtQWx.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Broadcast between episodes 21 and 22, the Spring special was a 1-hr show with 2 parts. The first part, "Urusei Yatsura All-Star All-Out Attack!", was a series of outtakes from the preceding episodes and recaps of the first 21 episodes. The second part, "The School Excursion! Run, Kunoichi!", was an original episode, but not part of the ongoing series.', 'Studio Pierrot', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-04-02', 1481, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:19', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 2490, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2633, 'Akuu Daisakusen Srungle', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx6452-wilNb4hhTW5j.png', 'series', '6.3', 'In the year 2545, an experiment gone wrong puts test pilot David Jance through the center of the galaxy and into another universe, which ends up in the middle of life and death struggle against the armies of GRIP, led by Dark Star.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-01-21', 6452, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:22', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'WINTER', 53, 904, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2634, 'Space Warrior Baldios (Movie)', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4371-9jgl0twrjFJK.png', 'movies', '6.3', 'This film supplied the ending to the cancelled Space Warrior Baldios television series.', 'Ashi Productions', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-12-19', 4371, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:26', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 929, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2635, 'The New Adventures of Maya the Honey Bee', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/8373.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'The sequel to Mitsubachi Maya no Bouken.

Each episode follows Maya and her various insect friends through plot lines that almost always contain some sort of lesson for young children.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Nippon Animation', '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-12', 8373, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:29', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'TV', 'FALL', 52, 1286, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2636, 'Powered Armor Dorvack', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5143.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'When an alien force lands at the base of Mont Blanc, the proud armies of Earth mobilize to fight back! Colonel Takagi created the Dorvack Team and its fabulous transforming Variable Machines in preparation for this day, but the military bureaucracy has put its faith in powered armor infantry instead.

Undeterred, young pilots Masato, Louie, and Pierre seek to prove their worth. But as the Dorvack Team begins to climb the ranks, they’ll learn at every turn how rarely real world battlefields turn out the way they do in movies.

(Source: Discotek)', 'Ashi Productions', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-10-07', 5143, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:33', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 36, 987, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2637, 'Yuki: Snow Fairy', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/8598.jpg', 'movies', '6.3', 'Up in Heaven, Yuki&rsquo;s grandparents decide that, having turned thirteen years old, she must go down to Earth to a village that is torn by bandits and intervene to save its people. However if she does not succeed within one year she will become as insubstantial as the wind. Down in the village, Yuki is befriended by a group of orphans whose parents have all been killed by the bandits and who now subsist by begging. Yuki amazes them by taming the wild horse Blizzard. She is instrumental in getting the orphans and farmers to stand up to first the warring bandits and then Goemon, the greedy lord that owns the region. But Yuki must face her greatest challenge yet when the displeased Demon God that lives in the volcano emerges to destroy those who live beneath.

(Source: moria.co.nz/fantasy/yuki.htm)', NULL, '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-08-09', 8598, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:38', NULL, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 966, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2638, 'Lightspeed Electroid Albegas', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5891-I5HvFjSx1uhv.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Three talented students of a technical high school, Daisaku, Tetsuya and Hotaru create award-winning robots as part of a school competition. At this time, the evil Derinja race that plans control of all space extends its ambitions to Earth. To combat this threat, Hotaru''s father, Professor Mizuki, takes the three robots and modifies them for battle. Albegas, a super robot, is born. 


(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-03-30', 5891, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:41', NULL, 'Mecha', 'TV', 'SPRING', 45, 881, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2639, 'Chikkun Takkun', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b16303-JlUp65c6pyQc.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'The "Waruchin Ceremony" has been stolen from All Star, a planet that exists in the outskirts of space. The computer that is built into it is programmed to make anything possible. The thief is actually the villain, Doctor Bell. Doctor Bell schemes to invade the other planets through the use of Waruchin. The prince of All Star, Prince Chikkun, together with his trusty advisor, the intellectual Takkun, decides to head towards Earth in pursuit of Doctor Bell.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-04-09', 16303, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:46', NULL, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 23, 480, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2640, 'Hi no Tori 2772: Ai no CosmoZone', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2793-lvRbV4rAVXxE.jpg', 'movies', '6.3', 'Phoenix 2772 starts with twelve minutes without dialogue, much like a silent film, recalling the birth and education of Godo. In this brave new world, children are born in test tubes and are raised by computers and robots. Godo learns the skills that will make him into a great pilot, assisted by the robotic wonder Olga. Everything that Godo needs is provided for him until he eventually goes for training with his automaton companion. He soon realizes that the world is not what he expected...

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1980', 'movie', 'released', '1980-03-15', 2793, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:50', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n2793-IHw4BWUUxRYi.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 1655, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2641, 'Miyuki', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2231.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'Masato Wakamatsu lives with his step-sister, Miyuki, with whom he does not have blood relationship. Their father is always working overseas and left the two of them living by themselves in Tokyo. Miyuki is cute, nice, sensitive and very popular among guys around Masato. Masato has a girlfriend at school whose name is Miyuki Kashima, who is pretty and gentle, the ideal dream of every high school boy.

(Source: AnimeNfo, edited)', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-03-31', 2231, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:54', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2231-SJm0GHYFVamw.jpg', 'Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SPRING', 37, 2125, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2642, 'Dogtanian and the Three Muskehounds', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3761.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'The story begins with the arrival of a brave young boy in Paris. His ambition is to join the glorious Imperial Guards, but fierce competition and the minimum age requirement hinder him from joining. The boy then challenges the well-known Three Musketeers in order to demonstrate his excellent skills with the sword. However, at the very moment the fight begins, a power-hungry group cuts in. Realizing their wicked intention, the boy D''artagnan and the Three Musketeers quickly cooperate and defeat them. This is the beginning of their friendship and commitment to fight conspiracy.', 'Nippon Animation', '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-10-02', 3761, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:03:58', NULL, 'Adventure', 'TV', 'FALL', 26, 1193, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:03:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2643, 'GALACTIC PATROL Lensman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2769.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'The young Kimball Kinnison is leaving home for a wider education when a Galactic Patrol ship crashes on his family''s land and the dying pilot gives him a mysterious Lens. Half-sentient, the Lens now implanted in his hand becomes the focus of changes in Kim''s life including his father''s death, a space battle, and an encounter with Galactic Patrol nursing officer Chris. Impelled by the Lens, he discovers a new world of experiences opening before him and he risks his life to save Chris and the Universe. 

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-10-06', 2769, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:05', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 818, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2644, 'Kagirinaki Rakuen', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b169017-WyagPTu2vtV4.jpg', 'movies', '6.3', 'An 8mm animation that was produced by Harada during his high school years.', NULL, '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-01-01', 169017, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/169017-JOHHtorrzU52.jpg', 'Drama, Horror, Psychological', 'MOVIE', NULL, 1, 747, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5IWXAjHXCo8', '2026-08-29 14:45:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2645, 'Serendipity the Pink Dragon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3201.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'Kona is a boy who has a friend: a pink dragon named Serendipity with a kind nature. They want to stop the evil captain who tries steal gold from their peaceful island.', NULL, '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-07-01', 3201, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:12', NULL, 'Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 26, 365, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2646, 'Fumoon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5862-Tyz8LmffgxtZ.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'Nuclear testing has resulted in the abrupt evolution of the Fumoon, a tiny but highly intelligent humanoid race on a small island, who are detected by Dr. Yamadano. Except for a few witnesses including the detective Shinsaku Ban, and the young men Rock and Kenichi and Kenichi&rsquo;s sister Pichi (Pinoko), no one believes him. The Fumoon are kidnapping animals from around the world to bring with them as they use their space ships to evacuate the earth, because they know Earth is shortly to be destroyed by an enveloping cloud of black gas created by a stellar explosion. The Fumoon intend to abandon mankind, but one Fumoon, Rokoko, who becomes good friends with Kenichi, tries to help Dr. Yamadano and the others to develop a space ship to allow a few humans to escape, with the help of Dr. Ochanomizu and Dr. Frankenstein. 

(Source: Tezukainenglish.com)', NULL, '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-08-31', 5862, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5862-bUDLVjfq7Aqo.jpg', 'Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 727, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iLug3T48g6g', '2026-08-29 14:45:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2647, 'Swan Lake', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3186.jpg', 'movies', '6.2', 'When Prince Siegfried spots a beautiful swan with a crown on its head, for some reason he feels compelled to follow it. He discovers that the swan is, in fact, a princess named Odette, who is under a wizard''s curse that causes her to become a swan by day. The wizard, Rothbart, wants to keep Odette to himself, and the only thing that can break the spell on Odette is a man who truly loves her, with all his heart and soul...

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Toei Animation', '1981', 'movie', 'released', '1981-03-14', 3186, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:21', NULL, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 1588, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2648, 'Super Dimension Century Orguss', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2089-QGwwTwdFvs6H.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'In the year 2062, the world''s two superpowers are fighting a long and brutal war. In a desperate attempt to win, pilot Kei Katsuragi is given the mission to detonate a super weapon called the Space/Time Oscillation Bomb. The bomb explodes but the results are completely unexpected: a multitude of dimensions, times, and realities are unleashed into the world. Can Kei reverse the effects and bring life back to normal? 


(Source: ImaginAsian Entertainment)', 'Tokyo Movie Shinsha', '1983', 'series', 'released', '1983-07-03', 2089, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2089-2JHfnd12uNQs.jpg', 'Adventure, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 35, 3381, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2649, 'Wingman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3021-bs3eQdhySVV0.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'Hirono Kenta is your average geeky Junior High School student. His childhood obsession has always been Tokusatsu and Anime. In fact, he fancies himself as a "Hero of Justice" and often is seen running around in a makeshift costume of his own design called "Wing Man." Most of his fellow classmates thinks he`s just a crazy "otaku", but his childhood friend Ogawa Miku thinks he`s a noble spirit.

One day as Hirono is walking to school, a beautiful and voluptuous girl, literally drops out of the sky and into his life.

Hirono, bewildered by the event, none-the-less takes the girl to his home to recuperate (this is his duty as a "Hero of Justice"). He also keeps the "Dream Note" so that he can transpose his favorite "Wing Man" costume designs into it.

Later, Hirono is confronted by the girl who reveals herself to be Yume Aoi, Princess of the Dreamscape called Botoreem. Her domain has been conquered by the power mad despot, Rimeru and his armies of monstrous "Seed Men". She barely escaped her domain with the power artifact known as the "Dream Note".

The "Dream Note" enables its possessor to create anything they desire by merely drawing or writing information within its pages. Rimeru seeks to steal it to become Master of the Universe.

She demands that Hirono give her back the book, but Hirono had already begun drawing into the book (mystically linking himself to it).

Hirono soon discovers that his designs and notes on Wing Man become reality and he in turn becomes his own creation.

Using these powers and abilities, he and Aoi begin their strange and amazing adventure. Along the way, Hirono inadvertently involves all of his friends, especially Miku in his quest to help Aoi free her people and save her father.

Rimeru sends his various minions to Earth''s dimension to retrieve the book. One his henchmen is the noble yet devious Kitakura who goes as far as infiltrating Hirono''s Junior High School masquerading as a teacher.  

(Source: AniDB)', 'Toei Animation', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-02-07', 3021, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:29', NULL, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'WINTER', 47, 1484, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2650, 'Patalliro! Stardust Keikaku', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/12663.jpg', 'movies', '6.2', 'Patarillo! is set in a society much like ours in most ways, with one decided twist. The manga on which it is based is one of the much-read works produced for adolescent Japanese girls that features a healthy proportion of gay men and beautiful teenagers aka bishounen (beautiful boys). Most of the action takes place in Marinera, the land of eternal spring, located somewhere in the South Seas. The country is a major producer of diamonds; they provide much of the basis of conflict in the anime series. They come from one of the most prolific mines in the world, owned by the king of Marinera, the vertically challenged but horizontally endowed boy-king Patarillo himself. The International Diamond Syndicate - a huge semi- criminal organization/ secret society dedicated to taking over the world''s entire diamond supply- wants that mine and will stop at nothing to get it. In the early episodes they send off a number of bishounen assassins to do in Patarillo, which necessitates his having a bodyguard, the English MI6 agent, Major Jack (''Bishounen-Killer'') Bancoran. Bancoran''s nickname doesn''t mean he shoots bishounen in cold blood. The soubriquet comes from the fact that no male under the age of 17 can resist his sexual fascination. This, to Bancoran''s eternal disgust, includes Patarillo himself. The action switches often from Marinera to MI6 headquarters in London (London seems to be an easy two hour''s flight from the South Seas) or Bancoran''s palatial condo in the suburbs of same. (MI6, be it noted, looks a lot like Fritz Lang''s Metropolis, while Jack''s ''apartment'' bears a passing resemblance to Randolph Hearst''s spread.) The action also goes into the past and future and out into space. Patarillo evidently gets around.', NULL, '1983', 'movie', 'released', '1983-07-10', 12663, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:33', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 939, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2651, 'Shin Tetsujin 28', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/4208.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'Shortly after pre-teen Shoutarou Kaneda discovers his late father''s legacy, a 60-foot-tall, 50-ton remote-controlled robot, he''s put in charge of it. Shoutarou accepts the V-controller and duty that his father intended for the giant robot, Tetsujin: to fight evil and keep the peace. As the youngest member of Interpol, Shoutarou’s adventures take him around the world, under the sea, through time, and the deepest reaches of space. His mentors are Dr. Shikishima, his father’s brilliant colleague, and Inspector Ohtsuka, the sometimes buffoonish chief Interpol liaison, but in someways, Shoutarou is closest to his giant avatar, Tetsujin. Together, they battle various menaces, from mad scientists to pirates to ninjas to international criminals, all with their own unique giant robots, but the deadliest villain that Shoutarou and Tetsujin build up to is the Space Demon King, an alien so powerful that he threatens to swallow up the Solar System.

(Source: Discotek)', NULL, '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-10-03', 4208, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:41', NULL, 'Action, Mecha', 'TV', 'FALL', 51, 930, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2652, 'Oshin', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/9866.jpg', 'movies', '6.2', 'Oshin comes from a family of poor rice farmers. Her father and brother must work in the fields and her grandmother and mother, who is expecting another child, barely have enough to eat. In order to make ends meet for her family, 7-year-old Oshin gives up school and decides to become a servant in the household of a wealthy family, where she faces trials and tribulation beyond her worst fears.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-03-17', 9866, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:45', NULL, 'Drama', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 644, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2653, 'Eleven Cats', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6071.jpg', 'movies', '6.2', 'A gang of eleven stray cats wreak havoc in a small town, costing them much trouble.

They defend themselves by stating they were just ''hungry''.

The cats hear of an urban legend about a scary, giant fish. They decide to take on the challenge to find and catch that fish, proving the citizens of the town that they''re not all useless after all.

The task is pretty tricky and the path they have to cross is stony and danger lurks everywhere.

Will our little furry heroes be brave, confident and strong enough to master the challenge of challenges?', NULL, '1980', 'movie', 'released', '1980-07-19', 6071, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:48', NULL, 'Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 534, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2654, 'Sue Cat', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9906-G1IvvoROZiyj.png', 'series', '6.2', 'After an accident, the amnesiac Sue was taken in to live with Torao''s family. She always had the urge to become a singer, but didn''t know why. As it turns out, Sue is actually part of a band formed with her two twin sisters. But Sue''s climb to the top of the charts is a long and hard way.

(Source: AniDB)', NULL, '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-06-04', 9906, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:52', NULL, 'Adventure, Music', 'TV_SHORT', 'SUMMER', 40, 403, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:52', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2655, 'Golden Warrior Gold Lightan', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7106-8u4Pd1Ax3Lyg.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'When a young boy called Hiro finds what appears to be a broken lighter in an empty field, it changes his life forever. This lighter is actually the Gold Lightan, a robot that fell to Earth from the Robot Dimension. When called upon to defend the Earth from Ivalda the Great''s evil robots, Gold Lightan transforms into a giant super robot, known as the Golden Warrior. Gold Lightan joins forces with Hiro''s and his gang, the One Pack Rangers to protect the Earth from the evil schemes of Ivalda the Great and his armored forces.', NULL, '1981', 'series', 'released', '1981-03-01', 7106, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:04:56', NULL, 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 52, 838, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:04:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2656, 'Locke the Superman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx3522-JkJ23zaJYIoE.png', 'movies', '6.1', 'A quiet, polite, lonely immortal esper about which little is known, he is called "Locke the Superman", but often denies being so. It is not known where or when he was born, and if asked, Locke will say he does not remember. It is entirely possible this is true. However, when asked by Cornelia Prim in "Millennium of the Witch" which star he was from, Locke replied "Toa."

He has appeared at various times throughout the history of the galaxy, either as a direct influence, an indirect influence, or a simple observer. Using his esper abilities, Locke can learn and do most things more quickly than a normal human. His power also allows him to remain eternally young, or even turn himself into a child again to be adopted by kind-hearted families. It is speculated he remains youthful as an excuse not to take responsibility for whatever cause he is approached for, since no one expects youths to have such responsibilities.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Nippon Animation', '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-03-11', 3522, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:03', NULL, 'Action, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 1804, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2657, 'Robby the Rascal', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/7956.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'Apparently inspired largely by Akira Toriyama''s popular Dr. Slump, Cybot Robocchi is the story of Robocchi, a fun-loving, mischievous robot with a TV set in his stomach.

Robocchi lives in a peaceful village with various other robots, all created by the eccentric and somewhat lecherous Dr. Art Deko. Although he is an android, Robocchi has a warm, kind heart and is always willing to help out a friend in need. With his human girlfriend Kurumi, he gets into a variety of wacky adventures.

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-07', 7956, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:07', NULL, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'FALL', 39, 332, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2658, 'Toward the Terra', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx2560-fGJFfEvVBGMB.png', 'movies', '6.1', 'In the future, mankind''s seemingly utopian society is strictly controlled by the government, and anything that threatens to disrupt the status quo is ruthlessly suppressed. When 14-year-old Jomy begins to question the way the society is run, he suddenly becomes a target for both the government and the Mu, an outcast race with extra-sensory abilities who have been fighting against the government for generations. Now, each is determined to hunt him down - one to kill him and the other to save him.

(Source: RightStuf)', 'Toei Animation', '1980', 'movie', 'released', '1980-04-26', 2560, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:11', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2560-IwgxLlDphkwQ.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 5169, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2659, 'Jumping', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/2211.jpg', 'movies', '6.1', 'A boy walks down the street and as he goes along his strides increase. Eventually he leaps over towns, forests, and oceans, seeing many things and surprising many people along the way.

(Source: Anime News Network)', NULL, '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-06-16', 2211, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:15', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2211-nmLr5BT3alxM.jpg', 'Adventure', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 2193, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:15', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2660, 'Amazing Sarutobi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/3806.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'Nikumaru, meaning "meatball" in Japanese, is a seventeen-year-old student at Ninja High School, a special school for the training of ninja. He is short and chubby, but he possesses a super technique known as the "kamikaze", where he stirs up a whirlwind with his feet. The series introduces his many adventures and pranks as Nikumaru meets with his rivals both in and out of school.

(Source: AnimeNfo)', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-10-17', 3806, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:19', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 69, 752, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2661, 'Mecha-Doc', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx7160-Rm14M3T11JfI.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'Mechadoc is a powerful race car obtained from a simple economy car, which is able to race on any ground.', NULL, '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-09-01', 7160, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7160-L8d7IPX8SQgB.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 30, 1332, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2662, 'Galaxy Express 999: Eternal Traveler Emeraldas', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx6734-mkiTWzdULi6J.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'A remake of episode 22 of the TV version.', 'Toei Animation', '1980', 'series', 'released', '1980-04-03', 6734, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:27', NULL, 'Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'SPRING', 1, 1096, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:27', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2663, 'Acrobunch', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b3880-QgYG6q0C9ktb.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'Led by scientist Tatsuya Randou, the Randou family undertakes a journey around the globe in order to search out ancient ruins to uncover the legend of Quetzalcoatl, which unlocks the key to a fabulous treasure. However, tailing the Randou family is Gopurin, an evil organisation that covets the legendary treasure for itself. The Randou family has the secret weapon of super robot Acrobunch. It becomes a race around the world of who finds the treasure first. 

(Source: Wikipedia)', NULL, '1982', 'series', 'released', '1982-05-05', 3880, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:30', NULL, 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 24, 883, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2664, 'Super Dimensional Cavalry Southern Cross', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx4503-CP0hReZA0iM0.jpg', 'series', '6.1', 'By the year 2120, humans have successfully colonized other planets following the near devestation of Earth from the last great world war. However, on Gloire, one such colony are surprised and unprepared at the arrival of The Zor, a group of beings whom were the original inhabitants of the planet and left following similar near fatal events. Coming to reclaim their former home world, a relentless war erupts between both races that ultimately leads to a cataclysmic showdown and into a no-win scenario for either.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Tatsunoko Production', '1984', 'series', 'released', '1984-04-15', 4503, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n4503-lPdnIp5ke5Fv.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 23, 2615, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (2665, 'Dr. Slump & Arale-chan The Secret of Nanaba Castle', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6028.jpg', 'movies', '6.1', 'Dr. Slump found the secret treasure named &ldquo;Eye of Rainbow&rdquo; of legendary Nanaba Castle in the mountain. This treasure makes every dream come true. When the robbery gang of Arale, Ga-chan tried to steal this treasure, Bisna who is the descendant of Nanaba Kingdom took the treasure. Bisna wanted to revive the devil and Nanaba Kingdom. Arale and her friends went towards the secret Nanaba Castle to get back the treasure. 

(Source: Official Website)', 'Toei Animation', '1984', 'movie', 'released', '1984-12-22', 6028, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 18:56:20', '2026-09-03 16:05:37', NULL, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 697, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3083, 'Rich Girl Caretaker: I''m Secretly the Caregiver of the Most Popular Girl in This Rich Kid School', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx201514-BHAeWhSbcBrT.png', 'series', '7.0', 'Hinako Konohana is the perfect young lady—graceful, elegant, and flawless… or so everyone thinks. Behind closed doors, she’s a total disaster who can’t handle basic chores! When ordinary student Itsuki Tomonari becomes her caretaker, he’s thrown into 24/7 damage control, maintaining her “perfect” image. It’s awkward, nonstop chaos—but it starts softening into something that feels like love…

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Brain''s Base', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-05', 201514, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:23', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/201514-8dAOB0Xw124G.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 39765, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JoRr4dfpXIU', '2026-09-03 15:40:23', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3084, 'Jaadugar: A Witch in Mongolia', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx190569-KnCQLI3Z8hPX.jpg', 'series', '8.2', 'After losing her mother and her homeland, Sitara’s despair transforms into determination with the power of knowledge. New possibilities unfold when a family of scholars takes her in, deepening her education. Meanwhile, Genghis Khan’s Mongol Empire conquers nation after nation, nearing Sitara’s new home. After the Fourth Prince of the empire takes her captive, a flame of revenge is ignited.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Science SARU', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-04', 190569, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/190569-fQrApHKs9PIz.jpg', 'Adventure, Drama', 'TV', 'SUMMER', NULL, 39849, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GBHYXPp1lt8', '2026-09-03 15:40:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3085, 'The Ogre''s Bride', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b194219-56EhyK775lga.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'A Japanese-style ayakashi Cinderella story! "You''re the bride I''ve been searching for all this time." The ayakashi and humans coexist in harmony. The ayakashi, having superior abilities and beautiful appearances, sometimes find their partner among human women, making them their "bride". The bride, in exchange for bringing prosperity, receives absolute love from the ayakashi. Yuzu is constantly compared to her sister, a bride of a demon fox, and is resented by her family every day. One day, when Yuzu just couldn''t take things anymore, a man appears before her on a bridge. This man is the most beautiful man Yuzu has ever seen... and he''s calling her his wife?! "Just be quiet and let me hold you." The most powerful, "cold-hearted" ayakashi is pouring his heart out for Yuzu?!

(Source: MangaPlaza)', 'Colored Pencil Animation Japan', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-05', 194219, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:34', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/194219-t8ID9kSIpXxf.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 20010, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1hYWc5MCIPk', '2026-09-03 15:40:34', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3086, 'Hanaori-san Still Wants to Fight in the Next Life', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx199066-YXDVsguvFZMm.jpg', 'series', '6.9', 'Once the Demon King, now a shut-in NEET—Ryuusei Narukami’s second life is anything but peaceful! When Meteor Hanaori, the Hero who once defeated him, suddenly returns as a normal high school girl, his world is thrown into chaos. Determined to change, Ryuusei reenters society as a teacher and ends up teaching at her school! Their explosive reunion reignites the past—and sparks an unexpected love!

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'LIDENFILMS', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-12', 199066, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:37', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/199066-nmAYnI6uChse.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 23174, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xueZbCyZcnI', '2026-09-03 15:40:37', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3087, 'The Cat and the Dragon', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx186863-AO4efoB8HuzA.png', 'series', '7.7', 'The story follows a fire-breathing, human-hating dragon raised by a mother cat in a forest. The dragon, known affectionately as "Uncle Wing," watches over the many curious cats — such as one that goes on an adventure with a human prince, and another that lives in the city and people-watches as a hobby — and gradually warms up to humans along the way.

(Source: Crunchyroll News)

Note: Each episode streamed 1 week early on ABEMA and dAnimeStore. The original TV broadcast started on July 4, 2026.', 'OLM', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-06-27', 186863, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:40', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/186863-hRsC2yxvILTx.jpg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 12, 22227, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xi4rGcyeYr8', '2026-09-03 15:40:40', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3088, 'The Duke’s Son Claims He Won’t Love Me Yet Showers Me with Adoration', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Elsa, the daughter of a fallen aristocrat, receives news. It was a marriage proposal from Julius, a very elite nobleman. Elsa is wondering," Why would such a distinguished man marry me"? But after the wedding, Julius, who had been kind and gentle up to that point, changed completely! In a cold voice, he tells her," I have no intention of loving you".

(Source: MangaPlaza)', 'Zero-G', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-05', 208225, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:42', NULL, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 11633, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MNzf8UswtzI', '2026-09-03 15:40:42', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3089, 'I Became a Legend After My 10 Year-Long Last Stand', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png', 'series', '6.3', 'Luck, an S-rank mage in the hero’s party, makes a last stand against the Demon King to save his companions. When he finally returns victorious, ten years have passed, and the world praises him as a legendary hero who died in battle. Unable to reclaim his former life, Luck conceals his identity and begins again as “Lock,” an F-rank adventurer forging a future in a world that moved on without him.

(Source: Crunchyroll)

Note: Koko wa Ore ni Makasete Saki ni Ike to Ittekara 10-nen ga Tattara Densetsu ni Natteita is streaming 3 days in advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video beginning July 3rd, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 6th, 2026.', 'Gekkou', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-03', 199748, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:31', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/199748-H2JAicBqBq3b.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 12, 37395, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_9FRdFYJOdg', '2026-09-03 15:40:31', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3090, 'Grow Up Show', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg', 'series', '7.1', 'The anime''s story is set in the late 1950s and early 1960s, during the height of Japan''s economic boom, when the circus is a major form of entertainment. Different circus troupes travel throughout Japan to perform and compete for a chance to participate in the world-renowned festival called "Circus Collection." One troupe called the "Sunflower Circus," led by its ringmaster Maria, travels around Japan to perform, despite struggling with financial difficulties. However, they meet a circus prodigy named Mizuka Tsurumaki. This is the story of a one-of-a-kind circus show of young girls with big dreams.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'A-1 Pictures', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-05', 196017, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:29', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196017-qB1xhp5PO10x.jpg', 'Adventure, Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', NULL, 9201, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PAneuhZLHzU', '2026-09-03 15:40:29', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3091, 'From Overshadowed to Overpowered: Second Reincarnation of a Talentless Sage', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208044-Pm2UhvApQFUh.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'The great sage Ephtal dies in despair after failing to reach the peak of magic—but 400 years later, he’s reborn with all his memories and power intact! In a world where magic has decayed and ancient spells are treated as miracles, Ephtal storms into a prestigious magic academy to reclaim the true art of sorcery. As his power shakes the world, long-forgotten legends begin to awaken!

(Source: Crunchyroll)

Note: Rakudai Kenja no Gakuin Musou: Nidome no Tensei, S-Rank Cheat Majutsushi Bouken-roku is streaming a week in advance of the TV broadcast on dAnimeStore, ABEMA, U-NEXT, and Anime Hodai beginning June 26th, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 2nd, 2026.', 'EMT Squared', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-06-26', 208044, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:26', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/208044-JtlSTlmp5SmP.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', NULL, 47700, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QOeItd-RrVs', '2026-09-03 15:40:26', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3092, 'The Exiled Heavy Knight Knows How to Game the System', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx180136-gtMTCRlOD4OE.jpg', 'series', '6.6', 'Born into a prestigious family of master swordsmen, Elymas Edvaughn’s future shatters when he awakens the so-called “defective” Heavy Knight class. Disowned and cast out, he regains memories of another life—and realizes this world mirrors a VR game he once mastered. Armed with knowledge no one else possesses, he sets out to rewrite his fate and prove the strength of the “weakest” class.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'GoHands', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-03', 180136, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:56', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 26, 57529, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uC13b3_8riU', '2026-09-03 15:40:56', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3093, 'The Frontier Lord Begins with Zero Subjects', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196218-UsdTTCrwpDIN.jpg', 'series', '6.7', 'The war is over, and hero Dias is finally rewarded with land of his own—only to discover it''s a barren frontier with no people, no villages, and no sign of civilization. With nothing but endless grassland ahead of him, Dias sets out to build a domain from the ground up. But after meeting Alna, a mysterious girl with a blue horn, his lonely frontier is about to spring to life. 

(Source: Crunchyroll)

Note: Ryoumin 0-Nin Start no Henkyou Ryoushu-sama is streaming a week advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video beginning July 3rd, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 10th, 2026.', 'animation studio42', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-03', 196218, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:53', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196218-lX0y9T76KQkC.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 12, 29668, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5JpTU6wj_-g', '2026-09-03 15:40:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3094, 'Magilumiere Magical Girls Inc. Season 2', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx185692-1a8huwOIx7gw.jpg', 'series', '6.4', 'The second season of Kabushiki Gaisha Magi Lumiere.', 'J.C.STAFF', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-05', 185692, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:51', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185692-FLmhWYEAA7IY.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mahou Shoujo', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 6989, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3w7_piPtkNY', '2026-09-03 15:40:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3095, 'Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha EXCEEDS Gun Blaze Vengeance', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx185875-XMvDVlIUZODx.jpg', 'series', '6.3', 'Thirty years ago, the world was nearly destroyed by the sudden appearance of unknown "invasive alien species."

Humans and these “invasive species” continue to vie for living space, and while humanity’s safety is currently barely secured, the world could be destroyed at any moment. Living in fear of death and destruction, people go about their daily lives as if trying to avert their eyes from danger and disaster.

In this world, the United Nations Hazardous Species Investigation Agency, "EXCEEDS," has begun operations to ward off crises and disasters caused by invasive species.

The story begins on the island nation of "Mizuho" in the Far East. Shina Hisase is a young invasive species extermination hunter living on a remote island. What incident will befall Shina, who wishes only to live quietly with her younger sister Setsuna, her sole remaining family member?

Note: The first episode aired with a runtime of ~48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.', 'Seven Arcs', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-05', 185875, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:48', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185875-kHVsTIJKPVRJ.jpg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Mahou Shoujo, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 9432, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4IcEbMCW-FU', '2026-09-03 15:40:48', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3096, 'KAIJU GIRL CARAMELISE', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx204466-vXMvIs4VOoQd.png', 'series', '7.5', 'Kuroe Akaishi just wants a normal high school life—but that’s impossible with a rare condition that turns her into a giant kaiju whenever her emotions spike! Things get even worse when she falls for Arata Minami, the most popular boy in class. Now every blush, heartbeat, and crush could trigger a monster transformation. Can Kuroe survive high school love before it destroys everything around her?!

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'LIDENFILMS', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-03', 204466, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:45', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/204466-cpbNGN9qHrGP.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 36628, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ECtHlHde3EQ', '2026-09-03 15:40:45', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3097, 'The Villager of Level 999', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx197715-KLFLxU24U1uL.png', 'series', '6.0', 'In Earthclear, everyone is born into a fixed role, and villagers are the weakest of all. Most never rise above Level 5—except Kouji Kagami, who is Level…999?! On a monster hunt, he meets Alice, the Demon King’s daughter, and discovers they share an impossible dream: coexistence between humans and demons. In a world destined for conflict, they charge into battle to defy fate and shatter the rules.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Brain''s Base', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-02', 197715, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:21', '2026-09-03 15:40:18', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/197715-X8YkpOGY968a.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 12, 35494, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YfWJLXcN7hI', '2026-09-03 15:40:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3098, 'Tomb Raider King', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx184356-SlFIstXUXJYP.png', 'series', '6.5', 'Chaos ensues overnight when mysterious tombs suddenly surface, filled with divine relics granting overwhelming power, triggering a global power struggle to claim them for dominion. Among the havoc, a raider, Jooheon Suh, is betrayed and left for dead until a second chance brings him back years before the relics. Fueled by fury and future knowledge, he sets out to raid each tomb before they arise.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'STUDIO EEK', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-09', 184356, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:22', '2026-09-03 15:41:10', NULL, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', NULL, 12, 31948, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6f702O_nnq8', '2026-09-03 15:41:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3099, 'Recommendations from Iwamoto-Senpai', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx206249-1AUSry416wGz.png', 'series', '5.1', 'The year 1910. Iwamoto Kodou is a young boy who has successfully carried out many curious missions under the military''s directive. His destinations lead to encounters with the strange, weaving tales of history that have yet to be told.', 'Studio DEEN', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-04', 206249, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:22', '2026-09-03 15:41:07', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/206249-gKJUJDCbMjDT.jpg', 'Action, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', NULL, 6077, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Q2OFIvOME0', '2026-09-03 15:41:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3100, 'Please Excuse My Younger Brothers', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx203490-YQXiymUiDQNA.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'The manga centers on high school student Ito Hazui. During her spring break at the end of her first year of high school, Ito''s mother remarries, and Ito moves to live with her new family, becoming Ito Narita. Upon arriving at her new house, Ito is shocked to learn she now has four younger step-brothers. Ito tries her hardest to get along with all of the new members of her family, but the eldest brother Gen is a bit cold to her. However, under his aloof facade, he occasionally shows his kindness.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Lay-duce', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-04', 203490, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:22', '2026-09-03 15:41:05', NULL, 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 24, 9154, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P927_ZvgUUg', '2026-09-03 15:41:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3101, 'Young Ladies Don''t Play Fighting Games', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx128757-Iqc6hTjEYIz4.png', 'series', '7.4', 'Mitsuki Aya has one goal at the elite Kuromi Girls’ Academy: to become a refined young lady like the school’s flawless “White Lily,” Yorue Mio. But her image of Mio shatters when Aya accidentally catches her...playing fighting games?! Turns out, the elegant Mio is actually a hardcore gamer—and she wants to duel Aya! The battle (and their friendship) begins.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'diomedéa', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-07', 128757, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:22', '2026-09-03 15:41:02', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/128757-kBnCRYXdyw58.jpg', 'Drama', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 26490, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PAsOIcot7I', '2026-09-03 15:41:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3102, 'Draw This, Then Die!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx188525-uWhw4rQcqOyF.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'First-year high school student Ai Yasumi lives on the island of Izu Oshima and loves reading manga. But after a certain turning point, she sets her sights on creating stories of her own! As she dives into the world of manga-making, Ai faces challenges, growth, and the excitement of chasing her creative dreams. Where will her creative journey take her?

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Shin-Ei Animation', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-03', 188525, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:22', '2026-09-03 15:40:59', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/188525-Vnei12N4wZsM.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 10324, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jI61NtGuxV4', '2026-09-03 15:40:59', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3103, 'Though I Am an Inept Villainess', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx188139-1qIJfWxym8FX.jpg', 'series', '7.7', 'As maidens from the Five Clans battle for the Crown Prince’s heart, jealous Keigetsu uses forbidden magic to swap bodies with the beloved Reirin. Switching places does not guarantee happiness for Keigetsu with her new body''s ill health leaving her hanging on the verge of death. Meanwhile, Reirin, now wearing the face of a scorned outcast, must answer for Keigetsu’s crimes in a dangerous trial.

The unlikely pair become increasingly entangled in each other’s lives and they will need to work together to survive after discovering the dark conspiracies brewing beneath the palace''s genial surface. To confront the deadly threats lurking in the shadows, Reirin must embrace her new identity and defy their expectations of the court''s inept villainess.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'Doga Kobo', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-12', 188139, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-03 15:41:13', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/188139-PU5JsGJiiUnR.jpg', 'Drama, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 11, 36382, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nR_vqhD2rGM', '2026-09-03 15:41:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3104, 'Koutetsujou no Kabaneri: Mumei Ranman', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx214426-tLtv1k0TADEG.jpg', 'series', '6.2', 'A PV to commemorate the release of the Koutetsujou no Kabaneri: Mumei Ranman figure as part of the anime''s 10th anniversary project.', 'WIT STUDIO', '2026', 'series', 'released', '2026-07-24', 214426, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/214426-JUMppzseTbpK.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', NULL, 1, 1515, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zt66oS2xhvE', '2026-08-29 14:45:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3105, 'The World Is Dancing', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx206521-ecJuDgjth84C.png', 'series', '7.1', 'Born into a life of acting and dance with a traveling theater troupe in 14th-century Japan, 12-year old Oniyasha has one problem—he doesn''t know what the point of any of it is. "Why must I step with the left foot here instead of the right? Why is one performance good and another, bad? Why do people dance at all?" It all seems perfectly arbitrary, until a chance encounter in a run-down shack sets him down a path to revolutionizing the art form and influencing much of Japanese culture to come. A fictionalized account of the early life of Zeami Motokiyo (Oniyasha), the founder of modern Noh theater—the world''s oldest surviving theater art—this coming-of-age artist''s journey vividly brings to life a man far ahead of his time during one of Japan''s most culturally and socially vibrant eras.

(Source: Kodansha Comics)

Note: World Is Dancing is streaming 3 days in advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video and HIDIVE beginning June 29th, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 2nd, 2026.', 'Cypic', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-06-29', 206521, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-03 15:41:21', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/206521-zCIAGsiIkh6G.jpg', 'Drama', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 13, 21072, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h2zytdkjAU8', '2026-09-03 15:41:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3106, 'Kaiju No. 8', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx153288-25FBfFJzEQ5O.jpg', 'series', '8.1', 'With the highest kaiju-emergence rates in the world, Japan is no stranger to attack by deadly monsters. Enter the Japan Defense Force, a military organization tasked with the neutralization of kaiju. Kafka Hibino, a kaiju-corpse cleanup man, has always dreamed of joining the force. But when he gets another shot at achieving his childhood dream, he undergoes an unexpected transformation. How can he fight kaiju now that he’s become one himself?!

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'Production I.G', '2024', 'series', 'released', '2024-04-13', 153288, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153288-JNsWuMPMAuJL.jpg', 'Action, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 12, 274196, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7n_mFVPeApw', '2026-08-29 14:45:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3107, 'A Livid Lady’s Guide to Getting Even: How I Crushed My Homeland with My Mighty Grimoires', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx199408-ocRWG4pRWl8f.png', 'series', '6.7', 'Elizabeth Leiston, daughter of the influential prime minister, is a picture-perfect lady on the path to becoming the future queen of the Kingdom of Haldoria. But her life takes a sudden turn for the worst when her fiancé makes a show of publicly calling off their engagement. Soon after, he throws her in jail and starts spreading nasty rumors about her. The encouragement Elizabeth receives from her loyal waiting maid, Mireille, and her inner fury are all she needs to reconsider her goals. Why should she continue devoting herself to a country that doesn’t respect her when she can trample over it instead? She will get even with those who wronged her and bring down the damned kingdom, even if it’s the last thing she does! Luckily, Elizabeth is no damsel in distress and has seven powerful magic grimoires she won’t hesitate to use. Get ready because this ruthless lady is out for blood!

(Source: J-Novel Club)', 'Studio Comet', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-06', 199408, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-03 15:41:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/199408-ouNGkjrw0ohT.jpg', 'Drama, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 21615, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yC4TghEG8q8', '2026-09-03 15:41:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3108, 'Heroine? Saint? No, I’m an All-Works Maid (And Proud of It)!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx192800-r8zlO0VY0jJP.jpg', 'series', '7.0', '“I will become the world’s most wonderful maid!” 

With her skirt fluttering in black and white, the girl shouted. Her name is Melody. A reincarnated former Japanese girl, she now pursues her dream in her new life, working as an all-purpose maid for a poor count’s family in the kingdom of Théolas. When she makes it, even cheap tea turns into a luxury brew, and a dilapidated mansion is quickly restored to new! Cleaning, serving, hunting, DIY—leave it all to her and her powerful magic. Unbeknownst to Melody, this world is actually an otome game, and she is the most powerful and invincible heroine, the saint! Yet, she remains oblivious to this fact. Romance with handsome men? Attacks by the Demon Lord? Work comes first! A fantasy of misunderstood work that unknowingly shatters destiny!

(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)

Note: Heroine? Seijo? Iie, All Works Maid desu (Ko)! is streaming a week in advance of the TV broadcast on dAnimeStore and ABEMA beginning June 24th, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 1st, 2026.', 'EMT Squared', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-06-24', 192800, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-03 15:41:24', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/192800-1EhTN0zOxQsW.jpg', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 12, 20602, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9V_HpMr3_8', '2026-09-03 15:41:24', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3109, 'Oh Boy, Was I Wrong About Her', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx169583-0ZTdBGrKNIbe.jpg', 'series', '7.0', 'Seven years after making a childhood promise to always be friends, Hayato is reunited with his formerly tomboyish pal Haruki at a city high school–only now, Haruki has transformed into the girl every guy dreams about! While Haruki’s looks may have changed, with Hayato, she’s still the same pal he remembers. Despite years apart, their promise and feelings remain and deepen into something stronger.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', 'project No.9', '2026', 'series', 'airing', '2026-07-06', 169583, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:02:23', '2026-09-03 15:41:16', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/169583-wB0yHc7e8Kjk.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 12, 37198, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UTsFnJgDJz8', '2026-09-03 15:41:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3110, 'Tropical-Rouge! Precure Petit Tobikome! Collabo♡Dance Party!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx131045-ELfl5Op2XbJH.png', 'movies', '6.4', 'A short film screened alongside <a href="https://anilist.co/anime/121026">Healin'' Good♥Precure: Yume no Machi de Kyun! Tto GoGo! Dai Henshin!!</a>.', 'Toei Animation', '2021', 'movie', 'released', '2021-03-20', 131045, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:44', '2026-09-03 16:05:51', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131045-ED1A02QBMsqJ.jpg', 'Mahou Shoujo', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 1193, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:51', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3111, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! The Movie: Pyramid of Light', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b1894-nlcjWCg67TPF.jpg', 'movies', '6.3', 'Anubis, an ancient Egyptian evil that was defeated by Yugi''s alter ego centuries ago, has returned to exact revenge. Wielding the power of the Eighth Millennium Item, Anubis is determined to destroy Yugi and take over the world.

(Source: Anime News Network)', 'Studio Gallop', '2004', 'movie', 'released', '2004-08-13', 1894, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1894-h1wdlOMVyVBT.png', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 18486, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9UP2lz0w0E', '2026-08-29 14:45:38', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3112, 'Yu☆Gi☆Oh! Duel Monsters: Battle City Special', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/5458.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'A special episode of ''Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters'' aired in between episodes 88 and 89. Mainly narrated by Anzu, the special recaps the major events of the Battle City tournament, beginning from the Pharaoh''s meeting with Ishizu, and retelling several important duels including Yugi and Seto''s tag duel, and Yugi''s duels against Jonouchi and Bakura, up to Jonouchi''s battle with Rishid on the Battle Ship. The special ends with Anzu wishing the series a happy new year.', NULL, '2002', 'series', 'released', '2002-01-01', 5458, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-03 16:05:58', NULL, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'SPECIAL', 'WINTER', 1, 6196, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:05:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3113, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Zexal', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx10015-S7qEYfWP8ibi.png', 'series', '6.3', 'The story takes place in the near future in a city called Heartland. Tsukumo Yuma is a young duelist who strives to become the Duel Monsters champion, despite being an amateur. One day, during a duel with a school bully, a mysterious spirit called Astral appears before Yuma, and helps him to win. Astral then explains to Yuma that he is searching for his lost memories, which have been transformed into 99 "Xyz Monster" cards called "Numbers" and have been scattered across the globe. The "Numbers" have the ability to possess the duelists who own them and bring out their darkest desires. In order to recover his memories, and collect the "Numbers" cards, Astral teams up with Yuma.', 'Studio Gallop', '2011', 'series', 'released', '2011-04-11', 10015, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-03 16:06:02', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10015-KPirixZnqUYI.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SPRING', 73, 20537, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:06:02', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3114, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20552-okhejNP9Sj94.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'Thanks to the Leo Corporation, headed by Reiji Akaba, new advancements to Solid Vision, the holographic system that gives life to the Duel Monsters card game, give physical mass to monsters and environments, allowing players to interact directly with them. This has given birth to challenging Action Duels, in which duelists may traverse environments to locate Action Cards to help them in a pinch. The story follows Yuya Sakaki, a second year middle school student at Miami City''s You Show Duel School, whose father disappeared three years ago when he was scheduled for an important duel. While facing off against the current Action Duel champion, Yuya awakens a new power from his pendant, known as Pendulum Summoning.', 'Studio Gallop', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-04-06', 20552, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-03 16:06:13', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20552-fSXBr5EMfkYe.jpg', 'Action, Adventure', 'TV', 'SPRING', 148, 16445, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:06:13', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3115, 'Yu-Gi-Oh!: The Dark Side of Dimensions', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21265-KN6KhEtx81wc.jpg', 'movies', '7.3', 'Set six months after the events of the original Yu-Gi-Oh! manga, Yugi Muto and his friends are in their final year of high school and are talking about what they will do in the future. Meanwhile, Seto Kaiba has commissioned an excavation to retrieve the disassembled Millennium Puzzle from the ruins of the Millennium chamber. The item had previously housed the soul of his rival, Atem, whom he hopes to revive in order to settle their score. The excavation is interrupted by a mysterious man, who faces Kaiba in a game of Duel Monsters and steals two pieces of the recovered Puzzle. What is his ulterior motive? The stakes have never been higher; the rivalries never as fierce; the risks never so great.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio Dice', '2016', 'movie', 'released', '2016-04-23', 21265, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21265-Wj2beAb8j1HT.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 20234, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nfpNbfH28pc', '2026-08-29 14:45:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3116, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx98231-mPVCPWmg3KiL.png', 'series', '6.3', 'The sixth anime series in the Yu-Gi-Oh! franchise. VRAINS is an acronym for "Virtual Reality Artificial Intelligence Network System".

In futuristic Den City, people duel using digital cards in the VR space "LINK VRAINS" managed by SOL Technology, Inc. A mysterious organization known as the Knights of Hanoi hacks into LINK VRAINS in search of a runaway AI program, Ignis. One duelist with the username "Playmaker" stands against this threat. His true identity is high school student Yuusaku Fujiki, a skilled hacker with a dark past and a grudge against Hanoi. When he becomes the first to capture Ignis, a struggle between Yuusaku, SOL Technology, and the Knights of Hanoi ensues.

(Written by Edo)', 'Studio Gallop', '2017', 'series', 'released', '2017-05-10', 98231, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-03 16:06:20', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98231-U0QEp5F5cDqW.jpg', 'Action, Mystery, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 120, 12434, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:06:20', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3117, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! SEVENS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx114072-3C6Bbv490sNj.jpg', 'series', '5.7', 'The seventh anime series in the Yu-Gi-Oh! franchise.

The series takes place in the futuristic town of Gouha and stars Yuga Oudou, a fifth-grade, elementary school student, who loves both inventions and dueling. Feeling that the current rules of the Duel Monsters card game are too stifling, Yuuga successfully manages to install a new set of rules of his own creation known as "Rush Duel", allowing for more fast-paced and frantic dueling. The series follows Yuuga and his friends as they show off the delights of Rush Duels while under the watchful eye of the Gouha Corporation that oversees the city.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Bridge', '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-04-04', 114072, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114072-skJElBIWDt69.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 92, 6036, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WTQ_PWj8zw4', '2026-08-29 14:45:44', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3118, 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Capsule Monsters', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx123074-KaVOArpjZr1B.jpg', 'series', '5.7', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Capsule Monsters is a twelve-episode mini-series commissioned, produced, and edited by 4Kids Entertainment and animated by Studio Gallop. The miniseries is officially considered to be part of the fifth season of Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters, taking place between the events of the "Grand Championship" and "Dawn of the Duel" arcs (episodes 198 and 199).

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Studio Gallop', '2006', 'series', 'released', '2006-09-09', 123074, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-03 16:06:28', NULL, 'Adventure', 'TV', 'FALL', 12, 2213, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:06:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3119, 'Yu☆Gi☆Oh! Go Rush!!', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx142842-sz1cRActqBe3.jpg', 'series', '5.2', 'After inheriting the company from their parents, siblings Yuuhi and Yuamu Oudou have started to work at the Alien Trouble Consultancy, an organization that hunts aliens. Although they have never encountered aliens before, Yuuhi is desperate to meet one as he believes that an alien has stolen his important item, called the "Earthdama".

One day, while searching for extraterrestrial creatures, Yuuhi and Yuamu find a strange spot in the forest where many trees have fallen, forming a scenery similar to a crop circle. As they venture further, they discover a mysterious spaceship and enter it out of curiosity. To their surprise, they come across Yuudias Velgear, an alien from the Velgear Star Cluster. As it turns out, Yuudias is seeking to learn about Rush Duel—a card game popular among elementary school students—as he believes that it will save his home from a long war.

With the siblings agreeing to teach Yuudias about Rush Duel, they eventually realize that their first contact with an alien may not be a random coincidence.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'Bridge', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-04-03', 142842, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:55', '2026-09-03 16:06:32', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 151, 2929, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:06:32', NULL);
