Note: Episodes 256 to 258.', 'Sparkly Key Animation', '2023', 'series', 'released', '2023-04-22', 163825, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:18:57', '2026-09-03 16:06:35', NULL, 'Action, Fantasy', 'ONA', NULL, 3, 1023, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:06:35', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3121, 'Arknights: RISE FROM EMBER', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx177175-cr5tlJIj7dEi.jpg', 'series', '7.7', '"She" was supposed to be a beacon of hope. But now her anger and hatred have turned into flames of war and are about to engulf the people.

Only Rhodes Island, a neutral organization, can stop Reunion''s rampage and the conspiracy behind it. Amiya and the others head towards Chernobog''s Core City, which is on a collision course with Lungmen. What fate awaits them there...

(Source: Official Site, translated, edited)', 'Yostar Pictures', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-07-04', 177175, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:19:00', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/177175-8obfhwGOFXuk.jpg', 'Action, Fantasy', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 10, 15043, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hxZBu_x3Byk', '2026-08-29 14:45:46', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3122, 'BanG Dream! 3rd Season', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101634-4PSQAU2bw7s3.png', 'series', '7.8', 'The third season of BanG Dream!

The girls of Poppin''Party have come a long way, but the competition coming up is the biggest yet - the BanG Dream! Girls Band challenge at the legendary Budokan! Slots to compete are limited and the usual competitors will be vying for the chance, but the band to beat is the new RAISE A SUILEN, whose founder, Chiyu, has sworn to destroy both Roselia and Poppin''Party!

Indeed, Chiyu''s main goal is to make Roselia''s lead Yukina pay for denying Chiyu a spot as a producer, and the musical prodigy has the connections and resources to push the competition up to the next level! Can Poppin''Party keep up with the increased tempo and meet challenges like producing their own music video? They''ll have to if they want to make it to the big show!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'SANZIGEN', '2020', 'series', 'released', '2020-01-23', 101634, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:19:08', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101634-hyXv3NNQ1XnL.jpg', 'Comedy, Music, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 13, 16400, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dXVz7SHu6Rs', '2026-08-29 14:46:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3123, 'BanG Dream! FILM LIVE', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx108735-eG8QTdkk1lmq.jpg', 'movies', '7.4', 'It''s here! The big concert! Kasumi Toyama, the girl who followed the trail of golden stars and heard the call of the Star Beat, and her friends/bandmates Saya, Tae, Rimi and Arisa, are now poised on the edge of stardom themselves as they prepare for a massive outdoor concert! It''s a huge venue to fill, but fortunately Poppin''Party won''t be the only band taking the stage during this major musical event. It''s a non-stop wall of J-Pop fun as Afterglow, Pastel Palettes, Roselia, and Hello, Happy World! all join the ladies of Poppin''Party, and while they''re all still competing against each other, the real winners are the lucky members of the audience!

(Source: Sentai Filmworks)', 'SANZIGEN', '2019', 'movie', 'released', '2019-09-13', 108735, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:19:08', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108735-VGhWWdsGlPjJ.jpg', 'Music', 'MOVIE', 'SUMMER', 1, 6299, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vpiLc1rFvX4', '2026-08-29 14:46:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3124, 'Argonavis AXIA', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx128344-fUZQz6M3BvNc.png', 'movies', '5.4', '"GYROAXIA" is a band composed of 5 talented members that is active mainly in Sapporo. They decided to advance to Tokyo, but due to constant conflicts, they couldn''t get along.

Meanwhile, rumors about their "disbanding" suddenly started to spread through the Internet. Amongst the confusion, each member went separate ways.

Whereas, their vocalist Nayuta Asahi starts remembering his childhood and all the time he spent with his father Koga Iryuu, who abandoned him; and tries to find out why he can''t stop making music and being part of the band....', 'SANZIGEN', '2023', 'movie', 'released', '2023-03-24', 128344, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:19:11', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Music', 'MOVIE', 'WINTER', 1, 1647, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rs094zRkVcw', '2026-08-29 14:46:08', NULL);
