 (Source: PakaTube!)', 'Scooter Films', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-04-30', 191689, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:19', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/191689-GMftQy2XmUa3.jpg', 'Comedy, Slice of Life', 'ONA', 'SPRING', 4, 3069, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zxJXquB3YiM', '2026-08-29 14:50:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3152, 'Umamusume: Cinderella Gray 2nd Cour', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg', 'series', '8.6', 'The second half of Umamusume: Cinderella Gray. 

Hailing from the humble countryside, Oguri Cap has turned the racing world on its head. Her rampage through the national race scene seemed unstoppable... until it wasn''t. Tamamo Cross, the current peak of racing, has bested the Beast and declared Oguri Cap her rival. 

But Oguri Cap can''t afford to keep her attention on Tamamo Cross alone. One by one, racers from all over the world arrive in Japan, ready to demonstrate their own prowess. Up against the best the world has to offer, our ashen racer will need to reach beyond her limits if she wants to stand a chance… Keep those eyes peeled—a Cinderella story full of twists and turns lies ahead!

(Source: It''s Anime powered by REMOW)', 'CygamesPictures', '2025', 'series', 'released', '2025-10-05', 195240, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:19', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/195240-HcuZvXcdT5aX.jpg', 'Drama, Sports', 'TV', 'FALL', 10, 27987, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MNZchQvbMa0', '2026-08-29 14:50:30', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3153, 'Fate/Grand Order Absolute Demonic Front: Babylonia', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx103275-SN0wwshS3tWA.jpg', 'series', '7.8', 'A seventh Singularity has been discovered in ancient Mesopotamia in the year 2655 B.C.

The land of Uruk, governed by the wise King Gilgamesh after he returned from his quest for immortality, was grand and prosperous until three goddesses and countless Demonic Beasts appeared. These enemies have brought Uruk to the brink of destruction. With a Rayshift—a method of traveling across both time and space—Fujimaru and Mash journey to the land of Uruk, where they encounter the fortress city of Uruk and the Absolute Demonic Front, where a terrible battle against the fearsome onslaught of the Demonic Beasts rages. There, the citizens of Uruk, who live their lives to the fullest despite facing an existential threat, continue to fight for their future. Deities and Demonic Beasts attack with terrifying force, and mankind pushes back with all its might... This is the era where humans and gods are destined to part ways.

Fujimaru and Mash, the pair who have fought through all six previous Singularities, embark on their final battle.

(Source: Aniplex of America)

Note: Based on the seventh chapter of the first arc in Fate/Grand Order, a Japanese smartphone role-playing game from TYPE-MOON’s Fate franchise.', 'CloverWorks', '2019', 'series', 'released', '2019-10-05', 103275, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:25', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/103275-9vSzr7YzbXQb.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Supernatural', 'TV', 'FALL', 21, 83579, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZE34_tkqFwU', '2026-08-29 14:50:41', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3154, 'Monogatari Series Second Season', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx17074-xMhVAZsEDH66.png', 'series', '8.8', 'Second season of the Monogatari Series, part 1/2. Contains the arcs Tsubasa Tiger, Mayoi Jiangshi, Nadeko Medusa, Shinobu Time, and Hitagi End, from the Nekomonogatari White, Kabukimonogatari, Otorimonogatari, Onimonogatari and Koimonogatari light novels, respectively.

These stories take place after the end of the summer vacation when the apparition of the bee had left and the apparition of the phoenix avoided any consequences… Now that Koyomi Araragi and the girls were entering their new school terms, they were once again about to encounter supernatural beings…but this time, they may not be so easy to deal with.

Tsubasa Hanekawa, Mayoi Hachikuji, Nadeko Sengoku, Shinobu Oshino, and finally Hitagi Senjougahara. The girls’ loneliness, their confessions, and their departures… 5 new “stories” begin now.

(Source: Aniplex)

Notes:

 Includes 3 recap episodes from the TV version (Ep. 6, 11, 16).

The recap episodes were not included in the Blu-Ray version of the anime.', 'Shaft', '2013', 'series', 'released', '2013-07-07', 17074, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:33', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/17074-4tGsvEIjba22.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Psychological, Romance, Supernatural', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 26, 169835, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-c__dc_csNo', '2026-08-29 14:50:50', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3155, 'Nisekoi', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx18897-G2Fx2ZACsXBU.jpg', 'series', '7.3', 'As a child, Raku Ichijo made a secret promise with his childhood sweetheart, keeping a pendant as a memento while his love took the key. He dreams of one day meeting his past love, but years later, reality smashes his hopes when Chitoge Kirisaki accidentally knees him in the face...

Though Raku''s a normal high schooler, his family heads the notorious yakuza gang the Shuei-Gumi faction! And he''s dragged into family affairs when he''s forced into a relationship with Chitoge, the daughter of a rival gang''s boss!

Despite their constant spats, the two somehow fool everyone with their false relationship. Raku then discovers that Chitoge has a mysterious key from her past, which she can''t remember... Plus, two other girls appear with keys as well—Kosaki Onodera and Marika Tachibana!

Caught in the midst of this love maelstrom, even more complications arise for Raku when his class decides on Romeo and Juliet as the class''s play for the school festival. Can the two false lovebirds pull off the impossible and make the play a success?

(Source: VIZ Media)', 'Shaft', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-01-11', 18897, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:36', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/18897-h3TRFmkGYLkd.jpg', 'Comedy, Romance, Slice of Life', 'TV', 'WINTER', 20, 267043, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PuB1VpKbWtE', '2026-08-29 14:50:58', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3156, 'Magia Record: Puella Magi Madoka Magica Side Story Final Season -Dawn of a Shallow Dream-', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx136080-Ex78RoY8Ltf4.jpg', 'series', '6.8', 'The desperate battle in Kamihama City continues to intensify. With Walpurgis Night changing course for Mitakihara City, all eyes shift toward Embryo Eve—an artificial being, currently dormant, that can allegedly liberate magical girls from their destinies. As the Wings of Magius grow dangerously close to executing their plan, Iroha Tamaki''s last chance to stop the organization is quickly fading. Despite the dwindling odds, lingering hope for the dawn of a better future invigorates her final endeavor, while also uncovering memories of a story tampered with by the hands of fate.

(Source: MAL Rewrite)

Note: All four episodes were broadcasted at once on April 3, 2022.', 'Shaft', '2022', 'series', 'released', '2022-04-03', 136080, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:40', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Drama, Mahou Shoujo, Psychological, Thriller', 'TV', 'SPRING', 4, 15919, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QA6mkOyLn94', '2026-08-29 14:51:07', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3157, 'Free! -Eternal Summer-', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20614-Dr962gTXZzMs.png', 'series', '7.5', 'Even though it has been a year since the Iwatobi High School Swim Club has been created, new members have yet to join the club. Now that Haruka Nanase and Makoto Tachibana are senior students, along with their younger friends Nagisa Hazuki and Rei Ryuugazaki, they have to find a way to attract new members. If not, the club will be forced to close the following year due to a lack of membership.

Meanwhile, with impending graduation, it is also time for the seniors to decide their plans for the future. Unlike their friend Rin Matsuoka, the new captain of Samezuka Academy Swim Club who is determined to fulfill his dream of being a professional swimmer, Haruka and Makoto are unsure about what career path they want to take.

Further problems arise when an old friend of Rin''s, Sousuke Yamazaki, comes to the city to study at Samezuka Academy; the recently scouted swimmer''s arrival causes tension in the relationship among him, Rin, and Haruka.

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', 'Kyoto Animation', '2014', 'series', 'released', '2014-07-03', 20614, 0, NULL, '2026-07-25 19:47:42', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20614.jpg', 'Comedy, Drama, Slice of Life, Sports', 'TV', 'SUMMER', 13, 86922, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zIFT4L-tGRI', '2026-08-29 14:51:10', NULL);
