Apo, the pet dog from the manga, will star in the anime.', 'Milky Cartoon', '2012', 'series', 'released', '2012-03-23', 20561, 0, NULL, '2026-07-26 13:05:28', '2026-09-03 16:21:14', NULL, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 1, 1274, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:21:14', NULL);
