Ranka Lee is on an interplanetary concert tour several years after the battle against the Vajra. While on tour, she visits the ruins of a temple known as the Well of Souls, a place used to communicate with the gods and the dead. Ranka approaches the ruins and finds herself pulled deep within.

(Source: Disney+)', 'Satelight', '2021', 'movie', 'released', '2021-10-08', 129549, 0, NULL, '2026-07-26 13:06:02', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi, Supernatural', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2424, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ok845OkqyVM', '2026-08-29 14:58:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3247, 'Magi: The Kingdom of Magic', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx18115-dilbAD4yGMfc.png', 'series', '8.1', 'After celebrating their victory against Al-Thamen, Aladdin and his friends depart the land of Sindria. With the end of the battle, however, comes the time for each of them to go their separate ways. Hakuryuu and Kougyoku are ordered to go back to their home country, the Kou Empire. Meanwhile Aladdin announces he needs to head for Magnostadt—a mysterious country ruled by magicians—to investigate the mysterious events occurring in this new kingdom and become more proficient in magic. For their part, encouraged by Aladdin''s words, Alibaba and Morgiana also set off in pursuit of their own goals: training and going to her homeland, respectively.

Magi: The Kingdom of Magic follows these friends as they all go about their separate adventures, each facing their own challenges. However, a new threat begins to rise as a great war looms over the horizon...

(Source: MAL Rewrite)', 'A-1 Pictures', '2013', 'series', 'released', '2013-10-07', 18115, 0, NULL, '2026-07-26 13:06:05', '2026-09-02 16:57:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/18115-Yj8RSfYwuWhp.jpg', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'TV', 'FALL', 25, 168232, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5ujX_FFmU0k', '2026-08-29 14:58:09', NULL);
