Himari, who aspires for AIPRI, dreams of making 10,000 friends!
But for the shy and anxious Himari, it might be a bit difficult...

Himari unexpectedly makes her AIPRI debut!?

She has a "secret" she can''t even tell her best friend, Mitsuki!
But it seems that Mitsuki has a "secret" of her own...

Secret-bearers Himari and Mitsuki''s AIPRI begins!!

