Originally a live event consisting of a public recitation done by Char''s voice actor with simultaneous screenings of the animes, the DVD version fades to and from the recitation and the anime.', NULL, '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-08-13', 14007, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:34', '2026-09-03 16:10:05', NULL, 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 930, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:10:05', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3349, 'Mobile Suit Gundam F91', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx88-A0p5JsI46tsX.png', 'movies', '6.3', 'U.C. 0123.  Mobile Suit Gundam F91 is Gundam creator Yoshiyuki Tomino''s attempt to launch a new Gundam saga, set thirty years after Char''s Counterattack.


The story of Gundam F91 revolves around teenage space colonist Seabook Arno, his friend Cecily Fairchild, and the efforts of the Crossbone Vanguard militia, led by Cecily''s grandfather Meitzer Ronah, to establish an aristocracy known as "Cosmo Babylonia".


In keeping with Gundam tradition, the civilian Seabook is forced by circumstance to pilot the F91 Gundam, coincidentally designed in part by his estranged mother, Dr. Monica Arno.


(Source: Wikipedia)', 'Sunrise', '1991', 'movie', 'released', '1991-03-16', 88, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:34', '2026-09-03 16:10:08', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n88-zDkApl1GIKaL.jpg', 'Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'SPRING', 1, 12146, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jk8gVQEiA_I', '2026-09-03 16:10:08', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3350, 'Mobile Suit Gundam UC: One of Seventy Two', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/20707.jpg', 'series', '5.1', 'U.C. 0095.12.03 The Neo Zeon remnants known as the Sleeves conduct a performance test on a certain new type of mobile suit in a debris sector. Having gotten wind of this intel, two warships head for the debris sector. One ship is a Earth Federation Forces warship. The other ship is an Anaheim Electronics testing ship. On board the Federation Forces battleship, a newly constructed Unicorn Gundam Unit 3 awaited its time to sortie…', 'Sunrise', '2013', 'series', 'released', '2013-08-03', 20707, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:34', '2026-09-03 16:10:12', NULL, 'Mecha', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 863, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:10:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3351, 'MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM UNICORN RE:0096', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21658-pOcvE4BrcofO.jpg', 'series', '7.5', 'U.C. 0096. Three years after Char’s rebellion, Banagher Links, a boy who lives on the manufacturing colony Industrial 7, meets a mysterious girl named Audrey Burne. She claims to seek to prevent a potential war by interfering with the transfer of “Laplace''s Box” from the Vist Foundation to a Neo Zeon remnant group known as the “Sleeves”. 

However, when a Federation squad also sent to prevent the transfer clashes with the Sleeves, the colony is plunged into battle. 

As Banager races through the flames in search of Audrey, one other fateful encounter awaits him—the Unicorn Gundam, a pale white mobile suit that''s the key to Laplace''s Box. 

What is Laplace’s Box? What are the secrets that it holds? For the first time in 100 years, light will shine on the darkest secrets of the Universal Century...

(Source: Gundam.info)', 'Sunrise', '2016', 'series', 'released', '2016-04-03', 21658, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:34', '2026-09-03 16:10:19', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21658-wYVLvek4UN1r.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'TV', 'SPRING', 22, 11041, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:10:19', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3352, 'MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM: Twilight AXIS', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx98504-eCNvVvSJK0cg.png', 'series', '4.6', 'Late U.C. 0096. The Earth Federation government, organizes the Mastema special forces team to enter and investigate part of the shattered asteroid Axis, which is drifting in the Earth Sphere. The investigative team accompanying Mehmet includes two civilians named Arlette Almage and Danton Highleg, who were formerly an engineer and a test pilot.

While investigating, they come under attack by a private milita.  As the fighting escalates, Arlette, following a secret agenda of her own, makes her way to the wreckage of the Sazabi that lies abandoned on the surface of Axis...

(Source: Gundam.Info, edited)', 'Sunrise', '2017', 'series', 'released', '2017-06-23', 98504, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:35', '2026-09-03 16:10:28', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98504-apTjiGL3s9T1.jpg', 'Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'ONA', 'SUMMER', 6, 4782, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:10:28', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3353, 'Mobile Suit Gundam Narrative', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx101554-wSg5tvmASqEy.jpg', 'movies', '6.1', 'U.C. 0097. The year the Laplace''s Box was opened. Despite the revelation of the original charter for the Universal Century, which acknowledges the existence of Newtypes and their rights, the world remains largely unchanged.

After the destruction of the Neo Zeon remnant force known as the Sleeves, the event that has come to be known as the "Laplace Incident" seems to have drawn to a close. In the final battle, two Full Psycho Frame mobile suits displayed power beyond human imagination. The menace of the White Unicorn and the Black Lion were sealed away from public consciousness, and were consigned to be forgotten by history.

But now sightings of the RX-0 Unicorn 03, long thought lost two years ago, are being reported. Its name is Phenex, an immortal golden bird.

(Source: Official website)', 'Sunrise', '2018', 'movie', 'released', '2018-11-30', 101554, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:35', '2026-09-03 16:10:33', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101554-tOw9HYjjh6NZ.jpg', 'Action, Drama, Mecha, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 10466, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ouRdwOaSi9g', '2026-09-03 16:10:33', NULL);
