Kurata from Bijyou feels guilty about beating the crap out of other players. Abe’s accidental injury strikes a chord, and he no longer wants to be involved with Roka’s dirty schemes.

(Source: Crunchyroll)', NULL, '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-12-22', 9124, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:41', '2026-09-03 16:14:33', NULL, 'Comedy, Sports', 'OVA', 'FALL', 1, 2533, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:14:33', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3359, 'Miyanishi Tatsuya Gekijou: Omae Umasou da na', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/9395-KLyG4csLDNOU.jpg', 'series', '5.5', 'A Tyrannosaurus called Heart was raised by a herbivorous dinosaur. As he grew up, he was scared by other dinosaurs. One day, Heart meets a baby Ankylosaurus and he names the baby "Umasou (looks delicious)". Umasou started to be attached to Heart and a strange family love develops between the two.', NULL, '2010', 'series', 'released', '2010-10-04', 9395, 0, NULL, '2026-08-09 16:57:45', '2026-09-03 16:14:36', NULL, 'Adventure', 'TV_SHORT', 'FALL', 20, 602, NULL, '2026-09-03 16:14:36', NULL);
