Macross FB7 is the 30th anniversary work of the Macross franchise.', NULL, '2012', 'movie', 'released', '2012-10-20', 15177, 0, NULL, '2026-08-29 15:02:29', '2026-09-03 15:56:51', NULL, 'Action, Mecha, Music, Romance, Sci-Fi', 'MOVIE', 'FALL', 1, 2205, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:56:51', NULL);
