Music video Coming Home to Terra hasn''t been included in the entry as it doesn''t contain any new scenes. Recap episode, also known as episode 6.5, it''s actually a fanmade picture drama, hence also not included.', NULL, '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-01-01', 5037, 0, NULL, '2026-08-29 15:02:37', '2026-09-03 15:56:57', NULL, 'Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi', 'SPECIAL', NULL, 3, 734, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:56:57', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3456, 'ef: a tale of memories. - prologue', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/6361.jpg', 'series', '6.5', 'The prologue for ef - a tale of memories, released on a separate DVD two months before the premiere of the TV series.', 'Shaft', '2007', 'series', 'released', '2007-08-24', 6361, 0, NULL, '2026-08-29 15:02:40', '2026-09-03 15:57:00', NULL, 'Drama, Music', 'SPECIAL', 'SUMMER', 1, 8123, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:57:00', NULL);
