Volume 2 also features two episodes, one starts with the second part of Seigaku''s visit to Osaka, and an episode on Kirihara''s start at Rikkai in his first year.', NULL, '2009', 'series', 'released', '2009-05-26', 5751, 0, NULL, '2026-08-29 15:03:07', '2026-09-03 15:57:14', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5751-K8LMEAqQ4I0A.jpg', 'Comedy, Sports', 'OVA', 'SPRING', 4, 3274, NULL, '2026-09-03 15:57:14', NULL);
INSERT INTO `animes` (`id`, `name`, `src`, `category`, `rating`, `description`, `studio`, `year`, `type`, `status`, `releaseDate`, `anilistId`, `homeFeatured`, `homeOrder`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `bannerImage`, `genres`, `format`, `season`, `episodes`, `popularity`, `trailer`, `lastSuccessfulRefreshAt`, `relationsCheckedAt`) VALUES (3462, 'Tennis no Ouji-sama OVA: Zenkoku Taikai-hen Final Chibi Character Flash Animation', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b10276-clTBoiKDXRm0.png', 'series', '5.9', 'These chibi character flash animation specials were released with the Fan Disc "The Time Comes Around Remix".

